{"ID":"20240423082909-k37mv7v","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"1f4ac","id":"20240423082909-k37mv7v","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240423082909-k37mv7v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240423082909-ywqd5i2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240423082909-ywqd5i2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240423082909-ywqd5i2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"仲景心法","type":"doc","updated":"20240828171619"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240828171608-cjnp911","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cjnp911","updated":"20240828171608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪海厦仲景心法传讲"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-caqvfyl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-caqvfyl","updated":"20240828171608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一讲：经方剂量的把握，癌症治疗的时机 2009 年 12 月 03 日南宁"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0txctcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0txctcc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一、刘力宏欢迎词"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7do7exl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7do7exl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们也是真正很荣幸的能够请到倪师，可以说是想了很久，那么今天，原来是什么时候啊，原来是，没有成行，那时候肯定是我有什么地方做的不好，或者是倪师没有能来，那么这次终究如愿以偿。那么大家能够在这里，今天这个宝地能够亲临这个倪师的教诲，这是一个非常不容易，那么就非常希望大家珍惜这次机会。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4mshy4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4mshy4h","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么倪师的情况大家都如雷贯耳，我就不介绍，只是说，从跟倪师这几次的接触，我的感受是倪师是有一种父母心，一种老婆心。就是对后学的切切之心呐，你可以感受的很深。就是生怕他的学生，生怕后学者不能明白中国的文化，中国的医学，都希望他们超过他自己，那这样的一种风范，那我在扶阳论坛里面，大家可能也看了，这样的一种风范，那确确实实是一种大医风范。这个也是我们各位确确实实值得庆幸的是我们有这个福报能够亲临教诲。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-232hui5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-232hui5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以呢希望这次大家真实的利用好这次机会，各位一定是要先做一个放下。就是放下我们现有的心中一切的成见，一切之前的东西把他放下来，一心一意的来聆听倪师的教诲， 这样呢我们才能受用，对的起倪师。倪师真的现在特别忙，所以本来这次之后就要，本来约好要到阳朔去，要到贵林去，那都没有办法成行，那都没有办法，七号就要返回，所以时间非常紧。但是这么紧都能抽出一点时间来教各位，那是对各位的厚爱。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zer0wj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zer0wj9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以如果我们怎么去回报倪师，应该就是我们要学好。所以这几天非常关键。那所以围绕做好这一点，我们一定要保持教室的安静。所有的人，把手机一律关掉。在下面录音的不要录，我们统一来录。因为倪师还想稍微有点自由，不希望到哪个地方都被人追，这些东西都挂到网上了，他就没有自由了，我们要体谅，好吧。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9mip1k5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9mip1k5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们现在就欢迎我们的倪师。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4hdoc8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4hdoc8s","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-iwfhxba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-iwfhxba","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二、经方的剂量、治疗时机"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mwny0uz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mwny0uz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪海厦：第一次来到贵所，看到同学的面相都很好，我们中医都稍微会看一点点相嘛，我常常用望诊来看病，大家的相真的是很好，看到你们都那么年轻，都有兴趣学中医，没有把传统医学放弃掉，真的是难能可贵的。所以我本人很荣幸来到贵所，会及我所能来教大家。同时你们可以提问，你们可以先提些问题，然后我用这个问题延伸到经方里面去，来让大家更了解经方，一起学术探讨。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ut47q42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ut47q42","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"请问倪师如何学习经方，经方的剂量是否需要通过学习易经以后才能更好的掌握，癌症急下存阴的时机很重要，那我们怎么样来判断这个时机，有没有可能我们去创造时机？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-v9636mi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-v9636mi","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"至于经方的剂量问题，你们不要担心，不用研究到易经那么深。这个剂量呢，一个是要看病人的体格大小，还有一个是看你使用的时机，同时要对药性本身非常的了解，才会知道怎么使用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7vwpnoi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7vwpnoi","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我举个例子给大家听，我们现在把经方分成阴阳两个部分，按照《内经》和《神农本草经》区分，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"辛甘发散的为阳，酸苦涌泄的为阴药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有了这个观念后，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"经方第一方桂枝汤里，白芍酸苦涌泄是阴药，桂枝辛甘发散为阳药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，把阴阳分开以后，剂量就很好计算了。桂枝汤里有桂枝、白芍、炙甘草、大枣、生姜，然后经方里百分之六十以上都是从桂枝汤延伸而来的，所以你能够了解桂枝汤，你就能运用伤寒论百分之六十的处方，能运用的非常娴熟。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-k1v90iy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-k1v90iy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今天利用这个机会跟大家报告，桂枝汤我们怎样子去看它。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝是阳，芍药是阴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果按照现代医学来看的话，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把桂枝当成动脉，把白芍当成静脉，因为人身体动脉与静脉是等长的，所以桂枝芍药也是等量的。比如你用桂枝三钱、白芍三钱，光是这两味药去煮，静脉动脉的流速会非常的快，跑的太快心脏会受不了，所以要加炙甘草，甘草甘味性缓，炙过变苦味入心保护心脏不要跳的太快"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。像我常常会遇到病人说晚上抽筋，肝主筋嘛，肝苦急的时候就会抽筋，我们黄帝内经就提及"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"急食甘以缓之，也可以买路边榨的甘蔗汁来喝，抽筋就去掉了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以炙甘草它能够缓，让病人不会动悸的那么厉害。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生姜色黄入胃，能够补充因桂枝发汗后导致的胃中津液不足"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大枣色红，里面是黄色的，也能够补足肠胃的津液"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-e73w0hc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-e73w0hc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以桂枝汤不加生姜大枣炙甘草，病人吃了会动悸，心跳会很快，流完汗以后肠胃里津液干枯了，就吃不下东西。加了这三味药，就能在流汗的同时把肠胃的津液补足回来，这就是桂枝汤的方意。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rsfvlr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rsfvlr9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240423111426-xi7a1mr.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7rlgjet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7rlgjet","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好了，现在一个小朋友来看病，妈妈说小朋友从小挑食，追着喂他吃饭都不吃，没事在那边叫肚子痛。那你眼睛一望，小孩子额头鼻头中间是青色的，我们在经方金匮里有提到，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"面色青主痛， 鼻头是胃，两眼中间是小肠，额头是大肠，面色这块区域是青色的代表是腹痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那腹部为阴，胸为阳，所以我们要去他的腹痛白芍要加倍，把白芍加倍，加到六钱，加强静脉回流速度，腹痛就去掉了，如果是胸痛就桂枝加倍。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ks0944y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ks0944y","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以经方里面，所有处方做加减的时候，只要有腹痛都用白芍。比如小柴胡汤，有腹痛的话，张仲景后面说要加白芍，为什么？就是白芍是阴药，酸收主腹，所以张仲景非常懂阴阳。白芍一加倍的话，是不是小建中汤（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"结构"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）？再加上饴糖，饴糖就是麦芽糖，甘又主缓，所以吃下去不但胃痛没了，同时肠胃蠕动起来了，就开始饿想吃东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jis3qcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jis3qcg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘淡是肠胃，酸味是肝脏，苦味是心脏，肺是辣味， 肾脏是咸味"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我讲的都是黄帝内经的东西哦，我从来没有研发什么东西，我就让大家看看我们老祖宗聪明到什么程度。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘淡是肠胃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以吃完小建中汤后，小孩子会对甘味非常喜欢，看到米面无法控制，妈妈菜还没做，饭在锅里他抓起来就吃，光是白饭都很好吃哦，说明药到了！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pmtcev3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pmtcev3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那有些太太静脉曲张，腿脚上都是静脉瘤没办法收怎么办？我们就用酸收，白芍用到一两，那用量很重怕血流太快心脏受不了怎么办？炙甘草也加到一两，就不会有问题，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"这就是剂量的问题"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-e4jv9rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-e4jv9rw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那芍药甘草汤在临床上治症的时候，一吃下去瞬间就收回来了。有位太太二十年的静脉曲张，血管就像指头那么大的蚯蚓一样排满了，所以她二十年来都不敢穿迷你裙，一吃完芍药甘草汤就重病头晕，后汉书里写"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"药不瞑眩厥疾弗瘳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，第二天直接少掉九层的静脉曲张，就快到这个程度。你如果不知道白芍的药性，不知道它收敛的功能，你就不会想到芍药甘草汤白芍剂量能加重到这个程度。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-bk0uhmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-bk0uhmu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那如果脚是冰的，就知道要加炮附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，原因是炮附子药性是热的，主要用在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"固表"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。什么叫‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"表"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"’？以身体来说的话，四肢为表，身体为里，以皮肤肌肉骨头来说的话，皮肤为表，肌肉骨头为里。所以以身体和四肢来区分阴阳的话，四肢为表，身体为里。所以我们的经络，手太阴肺经，手阳明大肠经，几乎都在四肢上，内脏在身体里面。那我们要固表的时候就用炮附子。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ebaj1m6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ebaj1m6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说如果这位太太静脉曲张，同时脚是冷的，你就按照体格炮附子用三钱，四肢的寒会被去掉。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那白芍你如果没有加重，剂量跟炮附子一样，那收敛效果就不好，就代表你剂量使用错误"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。因为真正主力的药是白芍，白芍要加重，如果一两白芍没效，加到二两、三两也没有关系，白芍本身就没有毒嘛。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不需要开很多味药在里面，经方就是药简力专"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，当你把药物简化到这种程度以后，那药物的力量会很专一。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fdptnac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fdptnac","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那老师如果说这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"静脉里面有淤血块，你这样一动它，整个血往心脏冲，堵塞在心脏血管里面，造成心脏病怎么办？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不会的，这是一个寒热的观念，诸位如果在北方，冬天整个湖面都结冰了，上面还有人溜冰呢，那南方温热的地方就不会结冰，所以冰是寒造成的，同不同意？换句话说温热的地方是没有冰块的，所以可以用热药来化掉里寒。所以不一定要开一些活血化瘀的药，炮附子本身是热性的，也可以把冰块一样的淤血块化掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-eb4h54j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-eb4h54j","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"西医人呢他没有寒热的观念，就硬使用一些活血化瘀的药比如‘koumen’，把血稀释的药，我常常在骂，它就是老鼠药，老鼠吃了以后血液就变的很稀，凝结不起来，血管容易破裂，就死掉了。那西药厂很坏啊，卖老鼠药他是一顿几美金来算，做成人吃的一颗就要好几十块美金。西医有毒，外面包一层糖衣在外面，里面是毒药，比如阿司匹林或者koumen，常吃的人手上都是淤血块，一碰它就破掉。那我们中国人是不是一叶知秋？你看手上的血管容易破掉，那脑袋里的血管是不是也容易破掉，是不是相等的？你吃这个东西，你以为在预防心脏病，实际上会造成血管破裂。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kkqpy9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kkqpy9t","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们中风有两种，一种是血栓堵在脑中间，一种是脑溢血，脑溢血死的很快，血栓还不一定马上死，所以西药会造成心脏病。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vrkj2zf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vrkj2zf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那中医有热的观念，用炮附子就能把整个生成的静脉的瘀血当场就化掉了，三味药而已，这就是经方！所以你看她腿很粗，静脉特别重，白芍剂量就二两、三两加上去，体格越大，剂量越大，如果瘦瘦小小的开一两，剂量太低起不到酸收的作用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那你脚冷不冷？我脚是冰冷的，一年四季都是，炮附子五钱！冬天才冷夏天不冷就三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"这就是我们剂量的讨论"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那炙甘草会跟着白芍走，当你牵动病人血液循环系统的时候，无论是静脉还是动脉，都会加炙甘草。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1xo4vve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1xo4vve","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举个例子，我们很有名的桂枝甘草汤，比如桂枝开五钱，炙甘草开五钱，这是经方里治疗动悸时使用的方剂。张仲景说，只要病人有心悸，加重桂枝！桂枝管动脉，我刚刚讲了，它是阳药，炙甘草能够止悸是因为它有缓和功能，还能让两种不合的药物合在一起，所以动悸的很厉害，处方桂枝和炙甘草加重，心悸就没有了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cagcjwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cagcjwm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如有个人来说，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"老师我手冷，脚是热的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，桂枝管上焦，管动脉，你就加重桂枝剂量，白芍就相对减少了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-j9wfx2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-j9wfx2p","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再举个例，老师我这个手关节风湿很痛，都痛在手关节这边。那风湿我们认为是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"风、寒、湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三痹造成的风湿，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"祛风"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢大家知道"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用桂枝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，为什么要去风？因为他有时这里痛，有时那里痛，不定性的痛，是风邪，需要去掉。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"去寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"要用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"去湿用白术"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，结果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把桂枝甘草汤加上炮附子和白术，就变成去风湿关节炎的药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，经方就是这个样子。去风去寒去湿，就是这几个重点抓住，它就可以到手上去，所以手部的关节痛，非要这四味药不可，这个我们叫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草附子汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-q7i0egm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-q7i0egm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘草附子汤拿掉炮附与白术就是桂枝甘草汤，四味药加一起就是甘草附子汤，专门治疗风寒湿三痹。那风邪是游走的，所以风湿也是游走的痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-otz1a35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-otz1a35","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那老师我是痛风，痛在脚上，有时候痛在膝盖上，有时候痛在脚趾头旁边，痛的位置都不一样，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"还是甘草附子汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那你说老师不对啊，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"痛风发起来的时候表面又热又烫，怎么还开那么热的药下去？实际上表面会热，是因为里面是寒的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。摸起来是热，实际上是阳，因为里面是寒的，所以阳进去就会往外走，反逆出来就是热的，所以他那个热是局部的热而不是高烧。我们下定义，比如说小孩子发高烧，跟发低烧不一样，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"癌症的病人常常都会低烧，低温的烧，他那个不是真正的热，是阳不入阴的一种现象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"慢慢给大家延伸到癌症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以一个处方可以从感冒谈到癌症，经方是经典之方，没有比它更好更实用了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qmi7w9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qmi7w9b","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以如果遇痛风是不定位的痛，有时左脚有时右脚，还是可以用这四味药，因为表面上热肿，一碰就痛，里面有风寒湿三痹，所以风是游走的。所以一般风湿关节炎还有痛风，用这个处方一剂下去就中了。那你还要看体格大小，来决定剂量大小。这个人体格很壮，炮附子五钱，白术五钱，桂枝五钱，炙甘草五钱。这个人体格比较小，都用三钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-iuuwjvt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-iuuwjvt","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那一般来说炙甘草剂量跟桂枝剂量等比的，桂枝三炙甘草就用三，因为炙甘草会跟着桂枝走，桂枝会牵引到心脏的悸动，等量炙甘草就不会引起悸动，同时原有的心悸也会好。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心悸的真正原因是心脏本身想供应血液到四肢末梢，可是心脏力量不够，它就会动悸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。就像引擎你猛加油它不走，声音很大，可是力量出不来。所以我们会用到桂枝来增加心脏喷射的力量，增强心脏的阳，让它辛甘发散把血液输到四肢末梢去。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vc4irr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vc4irr2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以经方里的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炙甘草汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们的心动悸、脉结代，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炙甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"会用到一两，然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生姜两片"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大枣十二枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这三味药合在一起，为什么？因为我们后面要用桂枝，桂枝辛甘发散，会发散掉肠胃津液，所以这三味要可以把津液补足，之后用桂枝麻黄不用担心发汗太过。有的病人本来每天有大便，吃了你的药以后，没有加生姜大枣，肠胃津液都没了，一个礼拜都不大号，因为大便干燥在肠子里面，被发散掉了。那病人如果心律不整，脉结代，跳跳停停，跳跳停停，就是炙甘草汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hsabgjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hsabgjz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在张仲景的观念里，无论你是什么癌症的病人，或者是一般的感冒，都没有关系，只要出现脉结代，脉跳跳停停，先则条件就是炙甘草汤，然后再做其它加减，如有咳嗽加五味子、半夏。出现脉结代就要以炙甘草为主。炙甘草汤是唯一把心脏调节回来的处方。原方是加人参，当然现在人参比较贵，用党参替代也可以，其它还有生地、当归、麻子仁、阿胶九味药。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1wc5n4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1wc5n4q","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚才谈到剂量的问题，我们有一个很有名的治疗失眠的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连阿胶汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，四味药"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连、黄芩、白芍、阿胶"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我在网络上写过，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"会治疗心脏病的医师才是真正会治癌症的人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为这位提问题的小姐姐问的很广，求知欲很强，一个问题从感冒问到癌症上去，我都告诉你们都没有关系，今天来我就是听你们摆布，尽量告诉大家我所知道的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pcc1iue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pcc1iue","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄连味苦，苦能入心，补心的就要用苦味的药，这个黄连阿胶汤看不到桂枝哦。这个黄连阿胶汤设计在...我们认为呢，这个人会失眠，是因为心中的一滴血不见了。中医讲心中永远有一滴血悬在中间，血不断进进出出但是速度很快，新的血替代旧的血，一直在更新那一滴血，那一滴血永远存在心脏的正中间。心藏神，肝藏魂，肺藏魄，我们的神就藏在那滴血里面，心中的那一滴血在，神就在，人就会安定，可以睡得很好，睡到通宵。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7o2qpfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7o2qpfz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那有一天儿子很皮，妈妈买菜回来，他躲在门背后突然出来吓妈妈一跳，妈妈被惊吓到，心中的那一滴血就不见了，或者你开车出车祸，或者走在马路上刚好有人在骂街，扔东西砸到你的头，你一惊吓，那一滴血就不见了，很多种原因都会造成那一滴血不见了，一般是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"受惊吓，由惊而发"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那血不见了以后神就不能藏了，晚上就不能睡觉，医生摸脉一看，左手心脉（寸脉）大而空，中间是空的。我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"失血、缺血的脉不就是芤脉吗，所以你摸到心脏的脉中间是不是就是空的？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我现在把诸位读到的都连贯起来，连贯以后你就会觉得中医很有意思。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-uh261or","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-uh261or","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那加了苦味的药入心以后，为什么要加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"？因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩味苦入小肠，心与小肠是表里，光补心还不行，要兼顾到小肠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以我们的葛芩连汤、黄芩汤，下利的时候用到的黄芩很多，因为入小肠。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连、黄芩两味苦味的药，能同时把心脏和小肠火都补起来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。为什么用白芍，不用桂枝？因为心脏力量不够，少了那一滴血之后，就好像汽车的引擎，引擎有两种情况会过热，一种是引擎的机油没有了会过热，另一种是水箱里面的水不够也会过热，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以过热再加桂枝下去会更热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！白芍是阴寒的药，跟机油一样，会让静脉的血自然而然的流回心脏，而不是用桂枝把动脉血打出去，逼着静脉血回到心脏，不需要。是因为心脏力量不够，需要把血抽回来而不是推出去。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5qddv91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5qddv91","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以经方里的白芍用的非常好，一味不多一味不少，阿胶冲服下去以后呢，就逼着血流回心脏，同时补缺失的那滴血。那你怎么确定这一滴血刚好补到心脏的正中间？补血药没有那么聪明啊，所以就需要一味导引的药，把这一滴血刚好补到心的中间。所以在所有的食物中寻找，哪一个食物是悬浮在中间的，最后发现鸡蛋黄永远悬浮在中间，把药煮好后，放温后再将鸡蛋黄与阿胶一起放在煮好的汤药里，太热的话打下去就是蛋花汤了嘛，就没用。吃完黄连阿胶汤，那一滴血就正好补到了心脏中间，期间鸡蛋黄起到引导的作用，所以吃下去失眠就好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-384zb7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-384zb7i","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240423150436-fqtj99g.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3e0e8zq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3e0e8zq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"什么是常人？很多医师呢都是在介绍病，我就不是，我是介绍什么叫健康。我告诉你什么叫做健康，你根据这个标准就可以知道病人病在哪里了，也知道治到什么程度就好了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你如果老师老是研究病，那病就很多啊，你就研究不完，所以你要研究健康，什么叫正常人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。中医呢，认为心跟小肠是表里，为什么是表里？心脏一直持续不断的跳动，摩擦产生很多热能，中医定义为火，火的热性是往上走的，那心上面有肺，肺法像天，像天幕，越高越冷，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺是冷"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的，因为我们呼吸与空气接触，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一个是冷，第二个借由呼吸的力量，把心火通过中间大动脉导入小肠里"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以心脏产生的人正常人应该要往下走而不是往上走。西医只知道这个动脉运血往下走，不知道还要运这个心的火，把心火导入小肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-co7pub6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-co7pub6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果心火百分之百进入小肠的话，那心与小肠之间就有同样的温度、压力、速度、时间，这四个东西就是物理，所以中医是物理医学，西医是化学医学，如果爱因斯坦活到现在，他绝对赞成中医，因为物理。物理是站着外面看里面藏什么，人体就是宇宙黑洞，中医的这些东西就是利用物理条件计算的，不用进去就可以知道里面藏着什么。所以中医是站在外面看里面藏什么的一种医学。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-e9my80p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-e9my80p","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我在扶阳论坛上讲过，战国的时候有个人叫盗跖，是小偷的祖先，那时的小偷都拜他为师。有一天他的徒弟问他：盗亦有道乎？老师说当然有啊，我们当小偷的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"站在房子外面就要知道里面藏在什么，这个人是圣"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"决定什么时候出手去偷，这个人叫智，很有智慧"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一马当先冲进去的人是勇"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"偷完之后帮断后的人是义"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"分赃很公平、均匀，为仁也"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。即使孟子也没法讲到圣和智的定义，他只能说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"先入勇也，后出义也，分均仁也"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，孟子只讲了三个，盗跖的定义还是对的。（跖之徒问于跖曰：“盗亦有道乎？”跖曰：“何适而无有道邪？”夫妄意室中之藏，圣也；入先，勇也；出后，义也；知可否，知也；分均，仁也。）所以什么是圣？圣就是站在外面看到里面藏着什么，那现在西医还跑进去看啦，全身看完了也不知道怎么回事，什么东西都不知道就说免疫系统有问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-i069f6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-i069f6t","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"言归正传，当你的心火百分之百温度进入小肠，说明肺金将火导下，这是健康的定义，当你治疗不管是感冒还是癌症，治疗到健康定义，就是完全好了，不需要做扫描、切片，不相信你就去做，做完几天后小便都是血，痛的要死，性功能可能都没有了。那老师"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你怎么知道它的温度百分之百进入小肠？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很简单，心经通过手掌，小肠管脚，当心火温度百分之百下到小肠的时候，小肠的热就会随着动脉一直到脚指头上，那手会到手指头，所以根据"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"手脚温热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就能判断。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ioi72o5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ioi72o5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺主皮毛，肺法象天，正常人一年四季头面是冷的，手脚掌是温热的，是正常，就是健康定义。那老师我手是热的，脚是冷的，那你可能呢心火只有百分之五十下来到小肠，少了百分之五十，所以你脚是冰的，另外百分之五十往上冲，所以额头是热的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1whmual","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1whmual","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个时候我们就要调整了，把你上面的肺治好。肺好像冷却液一样能冷却引擎，肺的津液要补足，让心脏的热直接进到小肠里面去，下到脚上。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那吃药吃到什么程度？到脚热头冷就可以停掉了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个定义要了解，这是常态！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-exaibym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-exaibym","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240423152648-b5whehv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-weg1vze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-weg1vze","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今天有个人，心导热到小肠的中间部分出了问题，你不管她是胰脏癌、胃癌还是肝癌，心的热本来要移转到小肠，现在有东西挡到了......我们有两种症状，一种是虚症一种是实症。这是血管（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"画图中"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），第一种血管因为寒变窄了，里面没有东西堵到，它会缩小，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"血管瘪掉就是虚，虚的痛是不定时的，现在痛等下又不痛了那就是虚。第二种是血管里有堵塞的东西，就是实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"实痛是持续的痛，所以如果是癌症的痛那就是持续的痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以当心的热无法百分之百移到小肠里，就是实症已经形成的时候，热到这边就会往回逆，也就是上面是热，下面是寒。那实加重的时候，越来越严重的时候，整个把中焦封掉了以后，就变成阴阳两隔。胸阳没有办法下来到腹部，厥逆的现象，这时病人坐在那里就不能睡觉了，因为阳要离开身体了。到了最后油灯尽枯的时候，就好像蜡烛，烧到最后突然亮一下，然后瞬间就没有了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lt4xin6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lt4xin6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以人到癌症晚期，快要死之前，就坐在那里不能躺下去，因为阳在上面快要离开了。心脏不断地产生阳，阳又一直下不去往回逆，所以上面精神很好，24 小时不用睡觉，眼睛瞪在那边，肚子下面整个是腹水，脚也肿在那边不能动，下面是阴寒的。这是阴实已经形成。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a6xppwi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a6xppwi","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们在治疗的时候知道他是阴实，你自然而言会开一些去实的药，开一些阳药来攻阴，把阴实打开来，这是我们治疗癌症的一个技巧。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9flg4ow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9flg4ow","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家有了这个概念后，癌症初期的时候你就知道了。时间，决定什么时机下手，决定时机是智。大家都知道，肝经流注的时间是夜里 1-3 点，大家学过针灸应该知道了吧，地支歌诀有没有？肺寅大卯胃辰宫，脾巳心午小未中，申膀酉肾心包戌，亥焦子胆丑肝通。丑时是开肝，那你晚上丑时的时候，这个心火下来被肝里面的东西挡到，你就会在1点至3点准时醒过来，到3点以后你才能入睡，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"同时在这个时间段会盗汗，是因为阳要入阴，结果被东西挡到，阳回逆就会盗汗，刚开始出现这种现象的时候，赶快就要下手了，这个叫做急下存阴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-68u56vx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-68u56vx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人初期还是很好的啊，给西医查还查不到肝癌哦，西医一定要等到长癌肿瘤时才能查的到，可是这个症状一、两年前就看到了，中医在两年前就可以开始动手了。等西医查到那是阴阳就要绝离，中间的阴实隔绝掉，阳不入阴，但坐不能卧就来不及了，时机已经过去！那个时候中医剩下唯一的办法就是‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"淡味渗利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"’，采用神农本草淡味渗利的阳药，像味道厚重的都是属阴。比如"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"薏仁、芡实、白果、陈皮、苍术、白术、淮山都是属于淡味渗利的药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你不会选用桂枝那么强的药，淡味也是阳药，像我们的四神汤、平胃散、胃苓汤南派的药，都可以用。可是你想想看，一般看到肝癌，你会不会想到用平胃散、胃苓汤啊？那么重的病怎么可能。可是你给病人吃吃看，一吃胃口就开，开始排尿，为什么？因为淡味渗利，然后你仔细看，这些药里没有炙甘草，为什么？因为甘草本身会蓄水。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8fi9jfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8fi9jfe","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经方里面呢，我们有两种药，甘草和地黄都会蓄水。所以甘草长在沙漠旁边，就是天地之间的药理告诉你，甘草在沙漠旁边沙漠化绝对不会拓展，是因为甘草有蓄水的能力，把水留在这里，它本身药性就是蓄水。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人水肿，腹水很大了，不能用蓄水的药，越蓄水越多，所以把甘草拿掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，水就开始排出来，所以排腹水一点都不难，所以到了最后一步，到了最后一击的时候我们并不需要很强的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qlbquvo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qlbquvo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我在淡味的药理常常会加两味药下去，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"加生附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二钱，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"加生姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，为什么不用干姜？因为要让肠胃功能恢复，生附子是回阳救逆，回阳的药是攻阴实，把阴融化开、分解开来。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ncrqsab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ncrqsab","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人如果状态很差就不能使用去实的药，不能攻了，因为病人受不了。所以你在危机之下反而要选用淡味的药，加点生附子。那一般来说，我常常用到的是实脾饮，像肝硬化腹水很大，还没有到病房，就听见病人在骂街，因为肝主怒，肝病的人脾气不好，骂人吵架，讲话声音还很大，是实症嘛，实脾饮下去水就排出来了。所以人走到门口，耳朵一听，已GAME OVER 了，处方已经开好了，这就是经方。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wqfbj91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wqfbj91","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"去水的药我们分两种，一个是实症一个虚症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"实症就是刚刚讲的，病人声音很大，精神还有，用实脾饮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那如果已经"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"奄奄一息"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没气了，你就"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用些淡味渗利的药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，像补气治湿汤之类的，在治疗肝癌末期时，吃下去水排出来......我治疗肝癌到末期的病人，结果吃了药以后水排出来，还活了三年半。肝癌初期的，还没有腹水，吃了药算到今年已经第三十年了，都没事哦，他是台北一个建设公司的老板，很有钱，到现在还在每天喝酒，让他不要喝酒，他说不喝酒人生乏味，我有你在就好了，肝癌，他那个酒拿起来是一杯这样干下去哦，现在病人非常好啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-u7etm2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-u7etm2j","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那两年前他太太说哎，那么久都没有发病哦，我们去检查一下好了，就把他推到医院去检查，差点死在医院里面（笑），检查扫描完就不能动了，开始喷血呀，光是检查就要了半条命。请问你，三十年前人家的已经告诉你肝癌了，那你现在都活的好好的，再去检查有没有必要？没有必要，你已经得到人生最坏的消息了，你再去检查又怎么样？你了解我的意思吧！可是人就是这样想不通啊，不检查怎么知道？想不通，你懂不懂我的意思。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mepz7vj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mepz7vj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我常常遇到的情况就是，比如你是脑瘤来找我们，那西医说你淋巴癌转移脑瘤，瘤很大了，不会好的，大概只能活三个月了。好，然后我们帮你治疗，到了三年你还活的好好的，头也不痛了，也可以正常睡觉了，什么都好了，还可以行房生小孩，那还有必要去检查吗？请问你检查的目的是什么？三年前已经有人告诉你一生最坏的消息，对不对？你还要去检查，结果死在检查上面，很多人就是这个样子。这是癌症。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8myiifg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8myiifg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那心脏病，心脏病实际上是很好治的，我常常在网上说到现在没有我治不好的心脏病。因为我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"必须要保证心脏和小肠的管道通畅，这样阴实就不会形成"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。心要移热到小肠，让它百分之百的通畅，你肺的功能必须很好才能通畅，肺的压力够才能百分之百引导到小肠里面，你摸一下手是热的，额头是凉的，把他赶出去，没病找病，找麻烦。如果手一摸是冷的，额头是热的，脚也是冷的，这个时候就要下手了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-f5p05s9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-f5p05s9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么心脏很好治？因为心脏是君主之官，神明出焉本身不受病，除非心脏有结构性问题"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，比如瓣膜闭锁不全或者心肌梗塞，或者动脉冠心病。心脏本来不该有这些病的哦，是绝对权力不可侵犯的。还有一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"神明出焉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那个人失神了，不管是癫痫、中邪或者言语不清、发神经病，都要去治疗他的心脏，神明嘛。同时这个人长期忧郁，大家都很开心，他一个人坐在那里不开心，心脏都有问题，这时就要开始治疗了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 那因为本来心脏神明出焉是不受病的，所以治疗起来非常的快"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以你经常听到脑瘤、肺癌、肝癌、胰脏癌、大肠癌，你就很少听到人家得到心脏癌，那死的时候是心脏病死的，没有心脏癌死的，为什么？因为心脏是火，不断的跳动像火一样热。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fwr30ay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fwr30ay","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240423164529-jbgfksa.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pv9d5p3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pv9d5p3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所有癌细胞会跟着血液流转到其他地方去，像大肠癌，绝大部分生在结尾的地方，直肠这个部分。我们不赞成开刀，因为大肠这边有个血管连到肝脏，全身就这个血管没有瓣膜，血液可以过去又回来，所以当你大肠癌开刀以后，癌细胞就沿着血管跑到肝脏里面去。所以很多人大肠癌开刀不久，一年后死在肝癌上，就因为开刀，你如果不开刀，大肠癌就是大肠癌，你开了刀它才会移转。就像乳癌的病人，生了一个肿块，乳癌就是乳癌，你不要动它，它持续扩张也就会在这个部位，大不了到骨头，大不了到淋巴系统里面。现在你把它切掉，癌细胞没地方跑了，它就到处移转，变成肝癌、肺癌、脑瘤，转移速度很快。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7ln2t35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7ln2t35","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你们仔细听哦，脑袋放空，如果有一个病人来找你治乳癌，乳癌不去治疗，当她死的时候一定还是乳癌，百分之百是乳癌对不对？结果一个乳癌的病人来找你，结果来看的时候死的时候是肝癌，谁搞成肝癌的，就是你搞成肝癌的！所以她是死在错误的医学上面，不是死在疾病上面，她病的时候你明明告诉我是乳癌啊，死的时候为什么是肝癌？你医学上就有问题！这样懂不懂我意思？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8axh1nx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8axh1nx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中医认为腑病非常好治，脏病最难治，结果你把大肠癌治成肝癌，叫我们怎么办"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"？本来是腑病，结果移转成脏病，这就不好治了。大肠癌好不好治？大肠癌本身是很好治的啊，今天就算我治不好，病人在我手上死的时候也是大肠癌啊，你也仅止于大肠癌呀！所以我在讲西医的时候，西医就不敢讲话了，他知道我懂啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-oa8bjdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-oa8bjdm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以心脏的温度能够进入小肠的话，所有周边的大肠、肝脏、膀胱通通会被照顾到，就不容易得到癌症，甚而至于癌症初期时马上就知道了，一开始就晓得了！因为我们刚刚不是讲吗，皮肤表面都是冷的，手脚是温热的是正常。那如果你的爱人一个乳房热一个乳房冷，那冷的没有问题，热的就有问题，乳房硬块的地方，外面那一块是非常的烫的，你以为外面是发炎的烫，你错了，里面是阴实，是阳不入阴，外面的烫不是发烧的热，是阳反逆。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2u8czxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2u8czxd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以癌症病人都有低烧的原因就是因为阳气不能进去，会感觉到低烧，而不是高烧。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-syhm4gx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-syhm4gx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，我们先休息一下。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hq8vwgp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hq8vwgp","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-6x84x28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6x84x28","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们继续跟大家介绍。其实伤寒金匮你随便哪个方子，你从那边切入都可以看到全貌，它是一个圆形的，从这里切入，那里切入，都可以讲回原点。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nxj91bz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nxj91bz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们再回头看这个处方，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝三钱、白术三钱、炮附子三钱、炙甘草三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是很有名的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草附子汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。在治疗痛风，一般性风湿的时候，病人晚上会抽筋，炙甘草加到五钱六钱都可以，加重，甚而至于抽筋很厉害你可以用到一两。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ygvtfj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ygvtfj6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这是风湿在手上游走，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"还有一种风湿老是在两个膝盖上，怎么处理？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一种是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"类风湿关节炎怎么处理"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"？这个部分跟大家介绍完以后，我相信以后任何风湿关节炎，到你手上一剂知，就是一剂喝下去就进步很多，经方就是这么快！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7hdb71s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7hdb71s","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草附子汤这是游走性风湿用的，那这个药一般会分散到全身去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不会那么听话。那许多人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"膝盖有风湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，膝盖痛的很厉害，现在要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"设计药力固定在两个膝盖上，要加几味药下去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，第一味使用到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，又名青龙，处方上面我常常是桂枝3，麻黄2或者一点点，真正原来的经方，麻黄比桂枝剂量多，可能麻黄五钱然后桂枝三钱。但是现代人心脏都不是很好，尤其我在美国临床，大家西药吃的很多，都会伤到心脏，心脏不好一吃麻黄心就会悸，这就是我减量的原因。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄本身入肺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，经方麻黄汤里，比如麻黄三钱，后面呢杏仁跟着用三钱，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄跟杏仁都是合在一起用，麻黄吃下去会发掉肺里的津液，杏仁色白入肺，可以把肺的津液补回来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"加上桂枝、炙甘草，就是很有名的麻黄汤，又称还魂汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。为什么我们用麻黄汤，麻黄汤又称之为返魂汤，所以我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在救逆的时候，不单单是四逆汤，生附子、干姜、炙甘草能救逆"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。麻黄是阳药，辛甘发散为阳，质非常的轻，麻黄二钱可能一大把，桂枝三钱才一点点，剂量不太一样，还魂时或者心肺衰竭时，我们常常会用到麻黄汤。生附子则是一种四逆汤症，手脚极度的冰冷我们会用到四逆汤，如果手脚不是很冷我们用麻黄汤来救逆。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0e9rv1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0e9rv1j","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘草附子汤"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"加上麻黄以后，就是宣肺，把肺的力量扩张起来，因为全身只有肺的力量能把药往下压到下肢去，所以要让甘草附子汤的力量集中在两个膝盖上面的时候会使用到麻黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。经方里，白术、炮附子、麻黄三个是等量使用的，这里麻黄会减一钱就是因为现在人心脏不太好，那桂枝我常常要加重到五钱，让心脏力量搏动起来，跳的很快同时用麻黄的力量把肺打开，硬把这个热导下去，导到膝盖位置。那白芍用到三钱、四钱，不要超过桂枝的量，因为药力导下去一定会影响到血，血就会回流到心脏，让血回流到心脏白芍不用加重，轻量白芍往回拉一点，这个血就下去了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ipdgsxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ipdgsxa","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们处方里面还会用到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"知母"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。知母能够除湿，我们在白虎汤里会用石膏、知母，石膏去热，肺里的湿我们要靠知母。因为病人是风湿在脚上，我们不要再把肺里面的湿带到脚上，会加一味知母在里面，肺主肃降嘛，主下降，肺的清气下降而不是浊气下降，所以要把肺里的湿去掉的，不然不开知母想去膝盖的湿，会把肺里的湿带到底下。这是原方的定义。那因为病人痛的很厉害，所以加一点"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"防风"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，肺的津液如果怕发散掉，要加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麦冬"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来补充肺的津液，麦冬与杏仁同样是补津液的药物。麻黄汤里加杏仁是因为怕发汗太过，麦冬也是色白入肺，把肺里津液补足，这就是去肺里的湿，同时肺里面清气下降，这个就是经方里面的桂枝芍药知母汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-y4903k5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-y4903k5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位再回头看这个桂枝芍药知母汤，它的原方来自甘草附子汤，在金匮历节篇里能看到，能解膝盖痛，那从头到尾"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"镇痛药只有一个就是防风"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以风湿痛去掉痛的原因是靠防风，如果痛是游走性的痛风，今天是左膝盖，明天是后脚跟，脚背的地方，下次发的时候又是左脚的脚背，痛风肿的很大，那你就会知道怎么使用这个处方。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9se64pg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9se64pg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最后一个介绍的就是我们的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头桂枝汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，诸位在用乌头和炮附子的时候，尽量用不要担心，这里要给四川江油附子公司做个宣传，希望江油公司的生意更好，所以我来教大家怎么使用乌头。经方里很有名的乌头桂枝汤，和桂枝汤是一样的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头一两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝三钱、白芍三钱、生姜两片、大枣十枚、炙甘草三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。桂枝汤是发散到四肢嘛，发散到肌肉，为什么加乌头？这是专门治疗"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"类风湿性关节炎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你们没有得过不知道，那个痛起来非常的痛，手都变形，尤其是手指头，像巫婆一样，整个关节变形，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个是经方里唯一能够治疗这个痛的处方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那这里乌头我们用一两，也就是37g，这个一两乌头你不要直接丢到汤里面哦，一煮吃了就死掉的。结果病人不是死在类风湿性关节炎，而是死在你的药上面，我话还没有讲完。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-li37nru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-li37nru","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240424084408-bjoj76o.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-udx2pnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-udx2pnb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个乌头呢，诸位下次有机会可以在六月份到江油看看，那个附子采收的时候，上面是茎叶，直直的茎下面一根，然后附在旁边的是一堆附子，中间直下来的这一根下面就是乌头，和附子不一样，附子就像督脉旁边的的两个肾脏，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"手关节、手掌这边类风湿一定要靠乌头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。实际上我们在江油公司测试的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乌头里面含有乌头碱，神经性的毒，比生附子里面的含量还少"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是生附子比乌头还要毒，那生附子都敢用，为啥乌头不敢用呢？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-yx34v2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-yx34v2y","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那在使用的时候不要乱用，一两乌头我们先用三碗水煮成一碗，然后把乌头渣扔掉只剩乌头汤，再用一碗乌头汤与一碗蜂蜜混在一起，溶解后再去小火慢慢炖成一碗，这个时候煮成的乌头蜜很纯，不会看到有残渣。这里一碗就是一两乌头，后面的五味药呢就六碗水煮两碗，煮完之后，用喝汤的汤匙（瓷的），取一汤匙的乌头蜜与煮成的桂枝汤搅拌在一起，融化掉喝下去。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3twdau6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3twdau6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你看，一碗乌头蜜有一两，一汤匙取起来可能只有两钱、一钱多一点点的乌头，而且乌头蜜经过蒸煮已经没有什么毒性了，就不会中毒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃了不但风湿关节痛会去掉，同时呢变形的关节也会回来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。临床上看那个手都不能握起来，吃了乌头桂枝汤以后变形的关节都会回来，效果会好到这种程度。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-bwqhnkq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-bwqhnkq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那过去呢在美国，西医研发了一种西药，叫‘歪拉斯’（音译），这个药专门用来止痛的，止类风湿性关节炎的痛，他们医生看到病人有类风湿性关节炎，就开这个给他吃，后来 2004年的时候，FDA 硬把它拉下架，因为这个药会造成心脏瓣膜闭锁不全，二、三尖瓣脱垂，造成心脏病。结果病人不是死在关节，死在心脏病。结果吃了痛还是有，它能止痛但不能完全止痛，吃了导致心脏受损，关节还是会变形，后来就下架了。那在2004年，FDA把它下架的前一年，药厂已经得到了药下架的消息了，就与律师商量，同样的处方换了个名字，叫Celebrex（西乐葆），同样的处方、同样的实验报告、同样的数据再把它换上架，结果2004年，歪拉斯下架，西乐葆再架上面，你说他坏不坏？这只是其中一个药啊，我在美国临床太了解西医了，你说我要不要骂？治不好病人的药，FDA还透露消息给西药厂说一年后要给你下架，他们完全勾结在一起！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vo9r9w0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vo9r9w0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以 FDA 的高级官员下来，都是西药厂的总经理或者厂长，看到这种利益勾结，我就敢骂！骂了又怎么样？他们真要把我弄掉很简单啊，找个神枪手一枪就把我打掉，所以我回诊所的时候穿的很简单，大家都穿一样的衣服，不要等下打到你了（笑）。我跟诸位开玩笑的，我们没有这个胆子，怎么敢讲？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"个人的生命是不重要的，我个人的生命不重要，重要的是这五千年的东西不能失传，而这个东西是真正对人类很有贡献的东西"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-08e5jeg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-08e5jeg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家看了以后，光是会一个乌头桂枝汤，你就会用大乌头煎啊！对不对？以后吃这个当归生姜羊肉汤，按照灵枢里面，灵枢里面就讲啦！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"牛肉是甘味，狗肉是酸味，羊肉是苦味，猪肉是咸味，鸡肉是辣味"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以当归生姜羊肉汤选羊肉不选牛肉？选羊肉是因为苦味入心，能够补血，那你再丢个乌头下去，就可以吃啦，乌头蒸跟附子一样，煮一个小时以上乌头碱就没有了。所以诸位可以放胆的去用生附子和乌头，但是一定要小心剂量的问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-q5o5arf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-q5o5arf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你看到这个人里寒很盛，四逆..."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vrwumd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vrwumd2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子和生附子的关系，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子专门去表虚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"什么叫表虚？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家看经方里面，张仲景说假如你误用汗剂，比如大小青龙汤、麻黄汤、桂枝汤剂量开太重了，病人吃下去以后烧是退了，结果汗流不止，停不下来，这就是表虚掉了！表虚救逆就是炮附子，同样是桂枝汤，然后加上炮附子，流汗当场就止掉了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附能够止汗，生附子专门去里寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以表虚和里寒是不一样的定义。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那什么叫里寒？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"里寒脸色比较苍白，夏天大热天手掌还是冰的，一到冬天就开始生冻疮，平时不会口渴，口渴也喜欢喝热水，晚上睡觉都是冷的，脚都盖在被子里面，这就是里寒。他没有病呐，但就是里寒，这个时候就是使用生附子的时机，可以预防他愈来愈寒。因为寒的话会让速度变慢，经方是物理医学，温度速度压力，比如血流速度会变慢，身体就会累积过多的营养或者淤血块，累积在在子宫卵巢里或者肠胃里，身体肌肉关节里都会容易累积瘀血块。或者乳房里面会造成奶水没有完全排出，慢慢累积起来，因为寒嘛，寒就会慢慢累积起来，日久就会变成实症，就会造成你的困扰。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vzf73pm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vzf73pm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那不赞成大家去吃各种维他命，所有维他命药吃下去都是寒症。你要知道这个东西不管是食物还是药物对人体有没有帮助，对病情有没有帮助，很简单，原来脚是冷的，吃完以后脚是热的就有帮助。比如你从早忙到晚都没有吃东西，天气又冷，你是又冷又饿，结果你一回家你太太炖了一碗鸡汤，喝下去全身热起来，就代表鸡汤有效，这是常识。如果吃了脚还是冷的，代表没有用。所以你不用骗病人，只要教导病人，告诉他吃了药的反应，我们就知道药对你有没有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jwfjxdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jwfjxdh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如现在病人盖了三床被子还是冷，我们一剂小青龙汤或者麻黄汤下去，被子就不用盖了，寒的现象就去掉了，代表有效！那你吃抗生素或者吃什么东西，还是在被子里就代表没有效果，马上就知道了嘛。西医厂不会跟你说它的药没有效的，根本就没有效！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zr9ltxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zr9ltxi","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以病人根本不用经过西药厂，马上立竿见影你自己就知道了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-semzwpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-semzwpb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像我刚刚讲的乌头桂枝汤，病人吃完后那个热力会透到手指头尖上去，晚上睡觉都会听到手关节嘎吱嘎吱变回来，病人都告诉我这样子啊，都听到声音，我说是不是太夸张了，病人说是真的听的到声音，他说我从来手没有那么热过，以前晚上睡觉手都在被窝里，现在放在外面，好舒服。晚上睡觉盖被子，手脚露在外面的人都是健康的。所以你如果睡觉手脚要放被窝里面，那就要赶快开始动手了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1mlozt1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1mlozt1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这种平常轻微的手脚冰凉，要用四逆汤吗？不用，那个就太超过了，不需要那么厉害，你用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归四逆汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就可以了。那你看桂枝汤，当归四逆汤还是从桂枝汤演变而来的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝三钱，白芍三钱，炙甘草三钱，大枣十枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把生姜换成了当归二钱，细辛二钱，木通三钱这三味药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一般剂量就这样。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ofhfluq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ofhfluq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你说老师"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"细辛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有毒啊，不敢用。那是你们没有深入了解，一看本草说有毒你就不敢用了，细辛我们真正用的时候是用细辛的根，细辛的根无毒，它真正有毒的马兜铃酸，是在它的茎叶上面。所以你买药告诉药商只要细辛的根，把茎叶拿掉，毒都在茎和叶上，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用根五六钱、甚至一两都没有毒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我细辛用的很多，小青龙汤、当归四逆汤里都有细辛，因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"细辛可以把里阳从里面一直运送到表面上去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为它有密密麻麻的根，它的象就是这样。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wuazep1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wuazep1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那用当归、木通呢，当归有点油脂，木通能够通利大便，而不像大黄那么峻。那你手脚比较冰冷大便不是很正常的，这时候你就加点当归、木通、细辛。当归四逆汤喝下去手脚就温热起来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tfeocjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tfeocjb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你说吃了这个药以后，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大便怎么变的五、六次一天，那你就把木通拿掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，马上就减少了。那如果说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"原来便秘吃了木通以后好多了，但是大便还是有一点点硬，那就当归多加一点，木通多加一点"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就好了，因为你知道药性，了解我的意思吧？那老师我除了手脚冰冷外，我"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腿上静脉很难看，好，加重白芍剂量到一两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就结束了嘛，是不是？经方就是这么来的，剂量加减要很熟，熟悉剂量的加减很简单，你要了解药的功能、药性是什么，这样子的话你剂量上就不会错了。那你说老师我"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"手很冷，桂枝加重嘛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，是不是？处方就是这样来的。除非你遇到这样的人，没有静脉瘤什么都好，大便有点便秘，你就用原方不用改，就要知道原方的剂量，知道每味药的药性就知道做加减了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tke8t3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tke8t3e","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归是白的，那老师它怎么补血呢？因为当归有点油脂在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不像大黄吃下去全都拉出来了，当归的油脂有润滑的功能，可以把肠子里面多余的宿便排掉，肠子里就清的很干净，这时候食物下去就百分之百能够吸收，所以它能够补血，它在里面能够增加消化的功能，很好。所以当归生姜羊肉汤我们不会用生地羊肉汤，而用当归生姜羊肉汤来补血的原因就在这里。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pv5cotl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pv5cotl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那现在大家大致了解经方什么时候用什么处方，处方剂量怎么做加减。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-54u3f3z","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-54u3f3z","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-jnmcv95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jnmcv95","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"那你们还有什么其他的问题，有没有什么疑问、疑虑的？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-u1cw6q7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-u1cw6q7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"我想还是倪师您先按照您的思路先教导一下大家。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-g5wo9dm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-g5wo9dm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"好，按照我的现在的想法来说。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9ixb2sh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9ixb2sh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们在黄帝内经里，大家有机会看下第七十五篇"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"著至教论"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"著至教论"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"里面谈到说我们要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"上知天文、下知地理、中知人事，此医道可以传世"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。可以教授、可以传世，为什么这样讲？这里我跟大家解释一下。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-uglulml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-uglulml","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般我们研究中医呢，到后来都会研究一些命理，会看一些相啊、算命、还有一些地理上的问题。那我举一个例子给大家听，大家就懂了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-isc6duo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-isc6duo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在外面的算命就是算命，中医就是中医，都分开两个部分，实际上是一个部分。比如我们算命，不管你是用子平法或者紫微斗数，或者是铁板神数等等，今天就算你算的很准，你说他59岁该死，他就真的死掉了。那也只是算命算准了，那代表这个学问没有用啊！要活到79、89岁才是算命厉害对不对？所以我们讲天、人、地。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ep8b5cl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ep8b5cl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240424103450-o32tbc4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-m34u6te","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-m34u6te","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那天命三分之一，人事三分之一，地理三分之一，通通加起来才是一。那你光是算命，这就叫天命，只有三分之一，该出车祸就死掉了。像我们研究算命的，如果你在两个礼拜以内会出事会死亡，看气色就知道了。那也许你到现在都还很健康，那你死亡可能就是意外车祸，或者是你很倒霉，刚好在马路上走，刚好13楼有个人跳楼下来，刚好撞到你身上，结果跳楼的人没死，结果跳楼的人没死，你被撞死了，这很冤枉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lwsx91n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lwsx91n","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果算命，我们知道这个人是病死的（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"天命"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），比如肝癌，如果之是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"人事"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，仅凭医学上的技术跟他抗衡，是三分之一跟三分之一在相抗，那抗不过就还是按照命走，因为少了一个地！如果可以把地的三分之一加在一起的话，人事（1/3）+地理（1/3）= 2/3 \u003e 天命（1/3）！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2jw47yn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2jw47yn","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那大家静下心来，脑袋放空，我讲个故事给你听听。在介绍这个之前，我跟大家讲，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"易经最难懂的是‘象’"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"‘数"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"’！这个象比如他在录影、拍照（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师指在场的摄影师"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），你在同时、同样的机位你去拍，绝对不会两张照片一模一样，除非倪师同个底片洗出来，同不同意？所以象是不是只有一次？只有一次机会。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7rwnhkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7rwnhkr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我现在讲个象的故事。在封神榜里姜子牙那时候还没有成名嘛，他80岁了还没有成名，他太太每天都在骂，这个你没有出息，不事生产，每天都在家里看书，你到了80岁还是我来赚钱养家。你这个男人没有用。姜太公说：老婆啊，我什么都不会，就只会算命呐，你叫我怎么办？（太太说）你会算命，那你就摆个算命摊在那边好了。姜太公说好吧！那就摆个算命摊，那他八十岁才出来，谁知道你啊！根本没有生意。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mn0gu7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mn0gu7c","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那有一天刚好有个砍柴的樵夫叫武吉，这个人从他的面前走过，他一看到武吉就拦住了他。姜子牙说你左眼青右眼红，一个月以内你一定有生杀之大限。那武吉是个粗人啊，扛着一捆柴，就说我真倒霉，一个江湖术士说我一个月内死掉，就跟姜太公翻脸了。那姜太公说，你也不要给我钱，我们立下军令状，如果一个月你没出事，你砸我摊子，从此不算命，但是你出事你要找我，只有我能救你。武吉说好，当场签字。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3hxqjwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3hxqjwg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"结果呢，到了第29天，武吉就照常扛了柴去卖，那城墙下面有个涵洞嘛，他就扛柴进去换一些米啊、菜啊什么的，结果刚好遇到文王要出巡打猎，大家都马上让开啊！结果武吉很急啊，就不小心撞到旁边一个卖菜的，撞死掉了。那个老百姓就说武吉杀人啦，武吉杀人啦，也不问前因后果。那文王刚好出来，军队就把武吉抓起来了，文王就在地上划个圈，吩咐他你就站在里面，等我回来处理，这叫画地为牢！"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tnrnouw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tnrnouw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为文王会卜卦，他不需要牢狱，牢狱还要人看管你，他就画地为牢，跑掉的话，不用审了，一旦抓到你就处死。那要抓到你很简单，起个卦就知道你跑哪去了。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ox1qrmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ox1qrmq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"武吉反正不敢动啊，等到晚上的时候，跑去找姜太公了。姜太公就吩咐他，在你家客厅挖个坑，然后把你衣服都放进去摆成个人的形状，头尾点两根白蜡烛，衣服上撒些米，然后你去睡觉，一个晚上以后就没事了。‘象’，一次。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师指着黑板上的字"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a42hgsm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a42hgsm","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结果文王军队回来，发现武吉逃走了，文王就起个课要把他逮回来，一起课，就告诉大家不用追了，这个人半夜逃走，看不清路掉进悬崖，尸体都找不到了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-djfic0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-djfic0r","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结果半年以后，文王出巡，刚好在河边遇到武吉在洗斧头，还在唱歌。文王一听这个人歌词写的真好，很有学问，就吩咐人把武吉叫过来，要问问这个是谁写的。结果武吉以为东窗事发，不打自招了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kninwu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kninwu4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"文王心想这个姜子牙真厉害，居然可以逃过我文王八卦，就请姜太公出山了。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wxif06t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wxif06t","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我这里提到象只有一次，如果我们看气色，一看到你，糟糕，什么病都没有，身体都是冷的，手脚是温热的，每天睡觉可以一觉到天亮，大便每天都有，胃口都正常，怎么样都找不到阴实的病，说明根本不可能死在病上面，这个人是意外死亡！那意外死亡的话，我们在前一天，把门板拆卸下来，放衣服放的像个人一样，头尾摆根白蜡烛，上面撒些米，晚上大限到时，牛鬼蛇神抓的时候就以为抓到你了，象出现了，这就是所谓的象只有一次。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tp8dzlu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tp8dzlu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一种，阳宅。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-z4ebk3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-z4ebk3n","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240424114121-1dsupr4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6vq4waz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6vq4waz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们有九宫八卦，易经的后天八卦是这样布列的。大家在读礼记的时候，《礼运大同篇》的时候，它说我们要世界大同，一定要人各安其位。如果人各安其位落住，才会长幼有序，父慈子孝，夫妻相敬如宾，名要归位。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4w6zavo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4w6zavo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是现在人呢，名字都有顺序了，爸爸妈妈哥哥姐姐弟弟妹妹，你确定这样子就会长幼有序吗？确定会家和万事兴吗？有的人儿子不听爸妈的话，还有儿子杀妈妈杀爸爸的，有的妹妹结婚姐姐还没结婚。所以名字有顺序，你确定一定会按照顺序来吗？为什么不能确定？就是位置没有定位。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-l48fg89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-l48fg89","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"名和位一定要一致"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！比如妹妹住在姐姐的位置，结果妹妹先结婚，姐姐还没有结婚。还有的女儿住在妈妈的位置，她没有结婚就做了妈妈或者是喜欢的对象是有婚之夫，变成恋父情结。有的儿子不住儿子位，跑到女孩子的位置上住，结果跑出来长裤子不穿，喜欢穿裙子，打莲花指，诸如此类的。那有的儿子住在爸爸之位，就变成了一家之长，形上面是儿子，神上面是爸爸，结果爸爸成了孝子，儿子说什么都是对的，儿子一大声爸爸妈妈就不敢讲话。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cqfge33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cqfge33","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样了解我的意思吧？就是家里面的问题就通通得到答案了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jj80fay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jj80fay","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"爸爸如果得到肝癌，厨房的位置正好落在乾宫，厨房的象是肉放在案板上刀子落下去，与人躺手术台刀子下去一样，所以当爸爸命上面出现59岁刚好是大限的时候，阳宅厨房的位置刚好又落到乾宫，天命+地理三分之二大于人事三分之一，住进去就死定了。如果我们通过医学救治（人事），同时再改变住的位置（地理），人事加地理等于三分之二，就得救了。那改的方法有很多，比如爸爸住在儿子的位置，天雷无妄卦，住在三儿子的位置，天山遁卦。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9dx6f5a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9dx6f5a","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果爸爸是住在二儿子的位置上，天水讼卦，然后天命里就有官司，那自然而然就会有官司出现。那同年同月同日出生的人很多，也是命上有官司，他为什么没有官司出现？就是因为他没有住在讼的位置上。就像双胞胎会发生不同的事，因为住的地方不一样。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-noszbe9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-noszbe9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那夫妻要住在乾卦位置才能相敬如宾，如果太太住在西南角（坤卦）位置，那太太就是一家之主，什么事太太说了算。如果小女儿住在西北角乾卦的位置，那整个家小女儿最大，全家都听他的，了解我的意思吧？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3v71k12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3v71k12","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你不要看这个图很简单哦，易经的易，本来就是简单嘛。可以简单到什么程度？九宫中间画一条线，南北分开，可以看到南边都是女，北边都是南，所以你往北方住，一律生儿子，往南方住，一律生女儿，就这么快！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-20gj5mg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-20gj5mg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果是医学上想生儿子，可以使用阳药，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生附子、硫磺、桂枝、麻黄，都是阳药，通通都是儿子。所以本人临床这么多年来，所有来求不孕症的，生的都是儿子！那想生女儿怎么办？想生女儿就住到南边去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。有没有道理，那么简单的动作。但是什么事都有个例外，如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"主卧房在东边，夫妻的床也靠到东边，负负得正，生出来的是女儿，这是唯一的例外"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-awqi2r3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-awqi2r3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你知道天文地理的时候，你就可以控制生男生女，可以控制生命。当有病人来，提供八字算出大限快到了，怎么办？让他把阳宅给你看看，把位置改掉，医学上的技术再帮他，这才是做到极限。可是光是这样做不得了啦，一天看两个人已经累趴了，你知道我的意思吧？所以没办法做这些动作，所以只能传，教给你们，你们以后自己去看，这个东西没有办法大众化。现在电脑有程式，所以速度会加快，否则还是很麻烦，但是我就是跟大家说，我们可以做到这一步。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zy04d76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zy04d76","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我现在五十几岁了，五十六岁，大概这里面我最老了，所以说我花了很多时间去研究中国的这个古代的东西，那真的是很好的东西，这就是我跟大家讲的天文、地理和人事，医学上的技术。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-f266wd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-f266wd1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你如果能掌握到的话，绝对可以突破天命，那突破天命，你能活到90岁100岁就已经够了，人都有天年的嘛，能安养天年就好了。所以我们中医不是说要长命千岁，而是要安阳天年，要使用正确的方法，活的有品质。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-14vlhjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-14vlhjg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如我们治疗大肠癌，你如果给西医开刀，做一个人工肛门在外面，你先生看到你都不想跟你做爱。恶心嘛，一个人工肛门在那边，对不对？好好一个肛门不去用，做个人工肛门出来，这都不是我们认为的正常人，生活品质就没有。你以为这样可以活，实际上你死的更快，以后死的时候是肝癌，对不对？那就算我们不治，死的时候还是大肠癌啊，还不会那么快死，只是肛门永远有个东西顶在那边，很难过，只此而已。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9awceyf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9awceyf","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-idmjord","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-idmjord","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当然我们经方可以治大肠癌，我们为什么说可以治疗大肠癌？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gwzpk71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gwzpk71","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这就关系到我们所谓的攻坚。神农本草经介绍攻坚药的时候，一个字，‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"咸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"’，咸能软坚对不对？咸味的药，都能够让坚硬的东西软化，就是这四个字而已，我们就可以找出非常多攻坚的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-p361hv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-p361hv6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"攻坚的药，所谓去实的药，我们先不要讲阴实，阴实要用阳药，这个部分我们待会在讲，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"先讲去实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rbf9zej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rbf9zej","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240424131344-w1gr6f7.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-uba5891","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-uba5891","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"牡蛎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这是我用的最多的。牡蛎这个药，在经方里我们常常用到桂枝龙骨牡蛎汤，大家去看牡蛎的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"张仲景使用牡蛎最多的地方是什么？盗汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！当一个人，里面有阴实的时候，阳要入阴，结果里面实挡到了，阳会反逆出来，反逆出来就是盗汗，这种阴实的盗汗是持续性的，24小时一直在盗汗，这一定是癌症。如果你是虚的盗汗，就不是持续性的。持续的肚子痛，就是癌症，偶尔痛、盗汗就不是癌症。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hw8zf5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hw8zf5t","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡蛎能止盗汗，凭什么止盗汗，就是它在攻坚！让阴实松动，阳能入阴，汗水自然减少。还有一味药"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"子，我刚刚跟大家报告过，表虚的时候流汗流太多的时候我们用炮附子。炮附子也是咸味的药，也能用来软坚，所以我们开处方的时候，常常会用到牡蛎、炮附子来软坚。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ssqical","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ssqical","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那要把里寒的现象去掉，像肺癌病人，舌苔又白又厚，跟尿毒病人一样。那炮附子可以治表虚不能治里寒，去里寒就需要用到生附子，只有生附子能够去里寒，那你可以从两钱慢慢加上去，但生附子只要蒸煮过一个小时后就无毒了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9eawq62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9eawq62","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汤药蒸煮一个小时以上有什么好处？第一个，就算你那个生药材里面有参与农药，煮过一个小时，农药都溶解在汤药里面了，第二个，我们都是喝汤，药渣是不是丢了？所以重金属统统沉淀在药渣里面，所以汤剂是最好的药！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ivagpiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ivagpiw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那为什么我跟"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"仙丰牌科学中药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我合作？全东南亚有三个药厂是，经过ISO认证的，两家是日本，一家是台湾，就是仙丰。他们老板很厉害，他们把中药蒸煮过，他用高压萃取过以后，药渣不要了，是不是农药跟重金属没有了？再经过高压蒸煮旋转，把药粉过滤出来，水分排掉，所以他的药粉绝对是没有问题的。他的药粉不是生药材弄干净以后去打粉，而是萃取出来的，所以他的药粉拿起来放到嘴巴里，一下就融化掉了，因为它是汤嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0ox8r86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0ox8r86","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像市售很多科学中药，放在桌子上你火一点，它就像香一样点着了，仙丰牌的就点不着，因为它是水啊！你这样懂不懂我的意思？他们能点着的都是用生药材去打粉，那种怎么可以吃，又有重金属又有农药。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-v6qs6fi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-v6qs6fi","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们当医生，除了要有医学的技术以外，我们药材的品质要很好，这样子。那台湾的仙丰牌被我一说，现在是科学中药的销售冠军，老板每天满头大汗的在工厂里面忙，他说我要退休都不行（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。像我们台湾很多科中的比例用量都是错的，因为是一些完全没有经方经验的中医教授配置出来的，那是错的，所以没有效。那现在整个经方我们在台湾就把它改过来了，按照我们原统...我一直在用经方嘛，所以按照我的比例在配，效果一剂就中！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rlttyuc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rlttyuc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"回到原话题，如果里面阴实的话，你就会盗汗很厉害，吃了药盗汗没有解决掉，代表没有把阴实打开。如果这个人偶尔盗汗，白天没有盗汗只有晚上盗汗，你用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝龙骨牡蛎汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，下去以后汗就止掉了，如果没有止掉，加点炮附子就会止掉了，这是用在虚症，如果用在实症的时候，你剂量就要增加，牡蛎用五钱、八钱都没有用，要一两二两这样用，牡蛎是无毒的，还补钙，西药所有的药逗比中药毒，西药那么毒的药你们都在用，中药有什么不能用的？所以放胆放手去用，不要担心。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5v56zu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5v56zu8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一些呢！像我会用到生硫磺，为什么要到生硫磺？因为我们临床上遇到个问题..."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-i895gw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-i895gw0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生硫磺味淡"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，真正的生硫磺像刚出生的小鸡的毛，淡的鲜黄的，很漂亮。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"色黄入三焦、淋巴系统"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个三焦系统在医术上写好像摸不着看不到，实际三焦系统就在脏与腑之间的油网，那个油网就是我们的三焦系统。所以肌肉之间白白的一层油膜就是三焦系统，因为它里面有油脂，所以三焦是水道，走的速度很快。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病在传导的时候，尤其是在三焦系统里面，我们就会使用到硫磺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-c0ks35n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-c0ks35n","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"奇桓之腑的病，比如说脑、女子胞、子宫卵巢、淋巴腺、乳癌，这些不属于脏腑的，称之为奇桓之腑，都会用到硫磺。这是我们临床上在用的时候，缺的这个东西，经方里面没有"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以这就是我挑石硫磺的原因。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-idcf9te","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-idcf9te","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石硫磺按照神农本草经，它是天地之间至刚至阳的药，那过去一直认为硫磺有毒，是因为道家拿硫磺提炼金液丹，长生不老药，道士就想只有我们修炼道士的人可以用，大众不能用，所以谣传硫磺有剧毒大家不要用，要用只能用我们炼制过的金液丹。实际上大家如果中了硫磺的毒，吃点鸭肉汤就解了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1r4r8b2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1r4r8b2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个鸭很奇怪，它吃硫磺都不会中毒的，所以实际上硫磺并没有什么毒，我常常有时候没事拿几颗生硫磺来吃。我都是叫诊所把拿生硫磺包到胶囊里面，因为不好吞嘛。那个泥巴、泥土怎么好吞呢？包到胶囊里面，没事丢两个到嘴巴里面吞下去，壮壮里阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-s723yr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-s723yr7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在临床上应用，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"硫磺能去治疗阴寒的病，无所不达。硫磺能到头部去，为什么？火山喷发的时候，那个岩浆喷到顶上，那个都是硫磺啊！所以要达到头顶上去，非要靠硫磺不可。所以临床上会出现我们治疗脑瘤的时候会使用生附子、生硫磺等阳药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，盗汗很严重使用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，还有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"牡蛎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这几味药。所以诸位如果没有经过我解释，看到我的处方就会觉得这个医生很奇怪，倪海厦怎么搞的，把炮附子跟生附子开在一个处方里面，这个人不会开处方，哪有这样用药的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hql030q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hql030q","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你现在知道他们两个药性是不一样的，你现在知道它没一个药性是不一样的。所以生附子跟炮附子就好像...炮附子是煮熟的土豆，生附子是生的土豆，生的土豆跟熟的土豆就是不一样嘛。你不可以说一百颗熟的土豆可以抵过一颗生的土豆，这个不相等的嘛，不是能不能抵过，两个已经是不一样的东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-eb9bknn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-eb9bknn","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那临床上剂量很重要，像我有个病人脑瘤头很大，门都进不了，所以我一副药生硫磺用到七钱，生附用到六钱，用到生硫磺六钱生附五钱时，这个病人药喝下去，舌苔都没感觉麻，手脚还是冷的，换到七钱的时候，剂量一到，手脚才开始热起来。舌头还是没有麻，因为生附经过一小时蒸煮，根本就没有毒嘛，然后他吃了大概九个月，肿瘤统统消掉了。刚开始他是找西医开刀，取出一枚三公分的脑瘤，开刀不到两个月，又长回来一个五公分的，不敢开了才来找中医，现在这个人完全好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-c1pm4sb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-c1pm4sb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这就是我治症上选用生硫磺、生附子的时机。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"光靠生附子药力没办法到达脑部去，所以我们只有生硫磺才能到达奇桓之腑脑部"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-j5nbfds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-j5nbfds","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那临床上也有些太太因为子宫癌开刀，结果开刀后移转到淋巴系统，来找我的时候两个鼠蹊部的肿瘤已经大到两个脚不能并拢。两只脚走路只能撑开走，因为两个肿瘤会摩擦，很痛。我用硫磺一剂下去，睡了一个晚上鼠蹊部的肿瘤就消掉了，完全消掉了，就是靠我们的硫磺跟牡蛎。硫磺能够去阴，把阴变阳，那个热也会透下来，牡蛎下去攻坚，一下就消掉了。效果就这么快。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jpd23uq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jpd23uq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以大家放胆的使用，你说硫磺跟生附放在一起，生附可能还比硫磺毒一点。硫磺没什么毒的，我刚刚跟大家讲，我常常拿起来当花生米吃，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7qakfih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7qakfih","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们要把阴实的症状去掉，除了要有攻坚的药以外，还要用阳药来去阴，所以阴实要打开来，一定要有技术。金匮里说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阴实者，死"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以我们如果能够把阴实的病人救回来，就突破了张仲景的局限。这里面非常关键重要的就是，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"使用阳药时，一定要固好心脏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ef13jxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ef13jxr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我这次来希望提供一些治疗心脏病、风湿病的一些方式，然后再跟大家报告下我们治疗癌症怎么处理。还有前面最简单普遍的风湿病，我相信大家用这种方法去治疗风湿会看到不一样的效果。然后我们再到下午的时候来讲心脏，等那个乳癌的专家来我们再讲乳癌，乳癌是很重要的，好不好？希望说，能够因为我们来，大家互相共同研究，同时根据你们的临床经验，能够把乳癌让它绝迹掉。如果能让乳癌绝迹，大家想想看，你们的功德是多大。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wvym2fm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wvym2fm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"判断乳癌很简单，乳癌会盗汗，比如左边乳房会比较热，那乳癌就长在左边，能睡觉还不算太坏，能睡通宵说明病还没有移转，望闻问就够了。如果用切脉来确认，一摸到有结代脉，你就要以炙甘草汤为主，再加其他药进去才会有效，因为你要解决心脏的问题，这是我们治症的技巧。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6fromtw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6fromtw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们癌症的里面，我们会加一些心脏的药，因为这个人会得到癌症，就是心脏有问题才会得到。如果心脏很好的话，百分百将热移转到小肠，手脚都是温热的，就不会得到癌症。所以预防心脏生病是我们的主题，那第一个就是要停止西药，所有西药都会伤害心脏。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-oml6ezu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-oml6ezu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们最近台湾发生一个病例，是我小姨子的一个好朋友，她的公公75岁突然过世，为什么过世呢？他公公平常身体很好，就是两个礼拜前有点感冒咳嗽，就到医院去看，结果医生说他可能有肺炎，让住院，然后打抗生素，两个礼拜就死掉了，就是伤到了心脏。我这个小姨子的朋友当媳妇在家没什么地位，不敢讲话，如果她公公吃中药出什么问题她担不起这个责任，如果她是女儿的话权利啦，硬不让她爸爸去吃西药。他们家人呢，他爸爸死掉就死掉，认为很正常，你看看糊涂到这种程度，他根本是被西药毒死的。这个人大限到了，所以会发生这种事情。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-coh73cj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-coh73cj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我有个病人也是个98岁的老先生，在美国，他这辈子都不去医院，身体很好啊。有一天他修屋顶下楼梯不小心摔倒，肩膀撞到，他家里五代同堂，所有人都让他去医院拍片检查，后来拧不过，还是去了，照个片子就在医院感染肺炎。你感染到医院的肺炎，那叫超级病毒，没有抗生素能治的，结果一个星期就死掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nq64we9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nq64we9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我说西医院就像香肠工厂有没有？活的猪进去，出来的是香肠。我常常跟大家说，天才跟白痴差多少你知道吗？就差两片树叶，我拿两片树叶放到你眼睛前面，泰山就看不到了。你看医院前面排那么多人，你就觉得这医院一定很好，你为什么不到医院后面看看，抬出去那么多人。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-o47ga58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-o47ga58","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以在美国我的诊所里面，我的病人来他们都很开心，为什么？因为每个人来都很有信心的回去。我们诊所还不用住院，我跟他们说，中医和西医不太一样，西医要把车子停下来，把车子拆开来重新再修，中医不是，中医是你一边在开我一边在修。所以你西医怎么比得过中医？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-s02fxpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-s02fxpy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"待会下午的时间，我跟大家介绍，如何在开的中间把引擎修好。引擎就是心脏，君主之官。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xs0zll6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xs0zll6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治疗心脏不难，只要诀窍抓到很快就可以好。冠心病啊、动脉血管堵塞啊，突发心脏病，在美国还有这种笑话，真实的事情......一个西医正在给病人做绕道手术，结果做到一半，自己发心脏病昏倒了，旁边护士一看，赶快打电话讲：我需要两个医生支援，第一个是救这一个医生，第二个是继续开刀（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。这就是西医闹出来的笑话。所以你如果相信西医，认为心脏病发之前没有征兆，就常常去检查，你就完了。心是君主之官，心脏病发之前怎么会没有征兆？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-68vcmqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-68vcmqj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你不了解心脏，书没有读通，所以才说心脏病发之前没有预兆，没有症候。我刚刚跟大家讲，脚冷的，代表心脏搏动力量不够了，不能使血到达脚，那心是君主之官，无事就在那边失眠，就要开始治疗了，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4rrr703","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4rrr703","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那有的人呢，失眠吃安眠药，他不去把失眠的原因治好，反而吃安眠药，吃安眠药会造成抑郁症，吃安眠药后病人越来越忧郁啊，抗抑郁的药的后遗症就是使人自杀。当然胸痛、胸闷也代表心脏有问题，你一开始就要注意了。心脏与小肠的热度、速度、压力是一致的，一息四至五至是正常，如果你心脏与小肠的速度不一致，大便就不规律，有时便秘有时下利，就说明心脏已经有问题了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以失眠、大便不规则、心口刺痛、手脚麻痹冷痛，就是要发心脏病的症候"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个时候就要开始动手了，如果刺痛的频率增加、失眠的频率增加就代表要发心脏病了，那心脏是夏天嘛，水克火，所以冬天是心脏病高发季节，这是我们讲的五运六气。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-l215po8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-l215po8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按五运六气黄历的日子，你遇到金水的日子就容易发心脏病，这样你了解我意思吧？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cq0xcfw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cq0xcfw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有望诊，看气色， 冬天脸色应该偏黑一点，但你如果面色红润，说明心脏有问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0lb889v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0lb889v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般情况下，食物到胃里消化后会交给小肠，小肠将营养交给脾脏，脾主运化，将五色营养输送给肝心脾肺肾。如青色营养给肝，红色营养给心，黄色营养留在脾，白色营养给肺，黑色营养给肾。那脾湿太盛的时候，不能运化了，结果食物就累积在这边，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肚子就肿大了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这时候要用甘淡渗利的药。脾是泥土嘛，松动泥土以后水分就能渗利下去，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以用渗利的方式把水排掉，而不用利尿的方式"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tllwkvb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tllwkvb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当你了解了五色入五脏的原理，你就知道，冬天人的脸色应该暗一点，结果这个人冬天的时候脸上出现赤色，说明脾脏不断地要将营养给心脏，但是心脏有问题不受，那心脏不受以后，只好找地方出来，就跑到脸上面，结果脸变得红红的。夏天脸色红红的就很好，时节相符，但是冬天就不行，冬天正常颜色应该暗一点。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-d8mgaca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-d8mgaca","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果你看到这个人冬天脸是红色的，印堂发黑，肾脏的营养正常应该收藏进去，结果它浮在上面，说明心脏、肾脏功能都不好，这就已经望诊出来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jwbsc97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jwbsc97","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们说中医的气，很多人说这个气摸不到看不到的，就是不认同气的存在，其实气绝对可以看到摸到的。比如你早上起来头发很油，那就是因为你有气在，气往上升所以头发油油的，如果都没有油了说明气就不够了。那病人死之前你看头发会蓬起来，脸上皮肤也会蓬起来，代表气没有了，整个干枯掉了，你一看就知道大限到了。所以你如果到加护病房，那个快死的，头发跟脸都蓬起来的，都是要走人的。已经没有光了，身上有油光，就是讲的气色。你看他鼻子、额头上油油的都不会有问题，都是身体很好的，那看到脸上暗暗黑黑的没有光、没有反光就有问题。就像尿毒的黑人，黑黑的就没有反光的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-bggg95t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-bggg95t","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240424182414-v2wrxrg.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-x1jsnjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-x1jsnjh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这里倪师讲的是外国人的眼睛，碧绿色的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）那在眼诊上面看，你看我们的眼睛，这是瞳孔（画图中）...中医认为，黑色的是肾，所以瞳孔是肾，往外一圈黄色的是脾，再外面一圈青色的是肝，眼白是肺，内眦是心脏（赤色）。所以我们在观气的时候，手电筒拿起来，瞳孔一照就会缩小，说明肾脏阳气很够，因为光是阳、肾是阴嘛，一接触到光它就会收缩。肾脏功能没有了就不会收缩，没有阳气了。当你把眼睛用青赤黄白黑分开来的时候，就可以帮助诸位做很多的诊断。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9matx8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9matx8l","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不管什么肤色颜色的人，瞳孔全是黑色，外一圈黄色，再外一圈是青色，有的是蓝色的，有的是绿的，然后是白的，清清楚楚呈现在我面前。所以老天爷安排我到美国是有原因的，赶快把这个知识带回来。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-umvugc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-umvugc5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那眼睛的结构是这样子，我们是不是土克水？所以瞳孔之所以能够压缩在中间，就是因为外面有一层很好的土，把它控制住，所以瞳孔会集中到一个点，我们眼睛就会有视力。那有土你要防止水土流失啊，所以要在外圈种一圈树林，木能克土，就要让树把土局限在里面，那树要长的好就需要很好的空气在周围，那木要疏，木要疏开才能更好呼吸空气，才能长的好，所以肺白包到肝木，金克木。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-k6g24pr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-k6g24pr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当你知道这个以后，还很好玩哎，脾脏这个区块占三分之一，肝脏的区块占三分之二，这是正常人的比例。脾脏肿大了以后整个脾的区块就扩张了，肝区就变的很小；那如果肝的纹路不见了或者肝区有圆纹在里面，这种就是肝外面有长东西，像脂肪肝，不需要 X 光照射就能知道。当肝区木纹没有了，被白块一块一块的占领时，白是金，金克到木，一看我们就知道肝脏里面有肿瘤了就这么快哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xzlx6t3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xzlx6t3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们看两个瞳孔，左瞳孔对应左肾，右瞳孔对应右肾，如果你用手电筒去照，哪个瞳孔对光没反应了就是哪个肾功能没有了，马上就知道了，不需要去西医化验。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zlfwgii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zlfwgii","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有眼白的地方出现浑浊，甚而至于出现黑块、青块，这种都是就是肺癌，一看就知道了。你再问诊确认，病人肺很痛，盗汗，上面很热下面很冷，第三椎有压痛，说明阳不能入阴，就已经告诉你是肺癌了，不需要做切片，已经就能确诊。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kigh87g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kigh87g","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果夜里 3 点至 5 点不能入睡，那是肺一个区域有肿瘤，如果肿瘤长满在里面，那是24小时都不能睡觉了。所以按照症状，我们可以来判断他疾病的深浅如何。那吃了你的药痛还是加重，盗汗更严重，代表药没有效啊！这样了解我的意思吧？那没有效的时候你要赶快想办法改变处方，如何让它有效，如何把阴实打开来，这都是你要做的工作。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gkq1qv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gkq1qv3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以经方里面，分了很多类型的处方，比如阳明的热我们就要用白虎汤，便秘是大承气汤。便秘时我们怎么判断他到底是承气汤症，还是大柴胡汤症，还是大黄附子细辛汤症，热实便秘，寒实便秘，诸如此类的，这都是我们要考虑的地方。比如说这个肺癌的病人燥渴的很厉害，想喝最冰的水，这时候就是白虎汤做加减，对不对？比如大便便秘很严重，有时候7天、10天都不大便，小便是黄浊的，我们知道是肠子里面很热，问他也没有发屁，说明干燥的大便堵在大肠里面，气都通不过去，就是大承气汤症！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mootpp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mootpp7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果大便是堵在小肠里，大肠是空的，气就会很多，病人就会不断的排气，就是小承气汤。这就是以是否排气来判断大小承气汤症的时机。那芒硝呢，大肠癌的时候一定要使用到芒硝，芒硝色白味咸，咸能软坚，所以尤其是大肠癌病人，肛门口一直感觉被东西顶着，肿瘤很大，这个时候大便排不出来，就要使用芒硝。10-15 克芒硝一剂下去，病人就会排很多水出来，肿瘤里面的水一化掉以后肿瘤就开始消，肿瘤会涨在那边是因为肿瘤里面水很多，芒硝把水排掉，肿瘤就会缩小，肿瘤缩小不代表肿瘤不在，肿瘤还在，但是环境被改变了，没有水肿瘤就不能生存，自然而然就死掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-q5azpjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-q5azpjm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有一个70岁的老太太最清楚啊，她是我一个西医院的学生介绍来的，大肠癌，她不愿意开刀也不愿意做切片，特地从台南坐飞机来找我，我一看，大承气汤证啊！我们中医讲阳明无死症，病在阳明不会死人的哦...."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-arv4swr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-arv4swr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以伤寒论整本，我们太阳篇、少阳篇、阳明篇...你千万不要把伤寒论的太阳把它变成我们针灸里面的那个足太阳膀胱经、手太阳小肠经，阳明变成手阳明大肠经、足阳明胃经啊诸如此类的，不要这样子分！而是根据《黄帝内经》的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阳主开，阳明主阖，少阳主开阖"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以病到了阳明是合的，它本身应该不会是死症，所以阳明没有死症的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-v3hp0sy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-v3hp0sy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我问她大便好不好？她说非常不好啊，常年的便秘。那她是大承气汤症，那大黄、芒硝都不是毒药嘛，所以我枳实厚朴各用二钱，大黄四钱，芒硝是六钱，六碗煮两碗，一碗里芒硝冲三钱下去。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-48rj28n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-48rj28n","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"喝下去以后，哇，病人反馈一直在排水，她说肛门从来没有那么舒服过，吃到第三个礼拜，她来了，我问她你感觉好不好呀？她就鸡同鸭讲啊！不跟我讲她肛门的问题，还问我会不会做美容？让我袪掉她脸上的皱纹。女人哦，只要开始爱美，病就好了。她开始逛街，上街买东西，她要爱美，说明病已经好了。所以你看效果到什么程度？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-o8w9vb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-o8w9vb8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以芒硝是我们治疗大肠癌的攻坚的主力药，吃完会排便。但你有一种情形的大肠癌，本身肿瘤很大堵在大肠里，只留小小一个缝隙，结果排出来是一条细细的大便，一天要排十几次，吃了芒硝后还是细细的大便或者一天排十几次，说明肿瘤没有吃到这个药，这时就要用一些利尿剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jsewag6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jsewag6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下利不止要利小便，要开一些"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"猪苓、茯苓、白术"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等利尿剂，把小便排出来，然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下去让性燥一点，很多人吃了炮附子就便秘嘛，这里我们要想办法造成它便秘，此时芒硝、大黄下去就会攻到肿瘤上面，所以就是可以设计让这些药打到肿瘤上面去，所以经方是很好使用的哦，就看你临症上面怎么用，懂不懂得应变。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kn4lxl6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kn4lxl6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那治到什么时候？一样，就按照我刚刚讲的，身体是冷的，手脚是温热的，小便是淡黄的，胃口回来，一息四至，就知道病已经好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ss5ewzh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ss5ewzh","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-mlll9jd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mlll9jd","updated":"20240828171608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二讲：经方攻下的方法 2009 年 12 月 03 日南宁"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-292j9li","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-292j9li","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上午介绍到大肠癌，因为心脏没有那么快讲完，我们留到明天开始讲，下午我把《伤寒》、《金匮》里所有攻下的药放在一个篇幅里跟大家介绍，从食道开始了解讲到到肛门口堵到如何处理，这样的话方剂就会很清楚。那因为在伤寒金匮里面，它散落在不同的地方，那我把它放在一起给大家看。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lkqqhs8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lkqqhs8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240425081814-0ul2ws6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-t3hacvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-t3hacvu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一个呢，胃中有宿食，那老师你怎么知道它胃中有宿食？平时我们都知道胃的下方有个袋子，永远有百分之二十的食物储存在里面，也就是因为这个袋子的存在，人可以在一个礼拜不吃，每天喝水就够了，也不会死，因为这个食物还可以消化。那这个食物是每天都在更新的，持续会有新的食物取代旧的食物。如果食物停在胃的下方没有更新，那说明胃的蠕动出问题，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"主要的症状：朝食暮吐"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，吃的早餐傍晚吐出来。经方就两味药对治，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄甘草汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，大黄2甘草1，用生甘草就可以了，如果病人心脏有动悸就改成炙甘草。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄可以把宿食排掉，甘草让大黄缓一下再把胃中食物清掉，常常出现消化不好，恶心，胃中难过，吃到坏食物，食物中毒都是大黄甘草汤症，不一定非要朝食暮吐才使用。这就是大黄甘草汤，专门设计在胃的下方这里"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-522h17f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-522h17f","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240425082739-chdmob0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0cn89ef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0cn89ef","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"到了十二指肠的地方呢有东西堵到，会造成心下痞，胃下的地方会胀满，有硬块。有实证的时候代表有东西，表现为拒按，按了会更痛。如果是虚症则是喜按，会很舒服，里面没有东西代表虚症。拒按时舌苔是黄的，就知道堵在十二指肠的地方，我们会用调胃承气汤对治，大黄2甘草1芒硝1，多了一味芒硝，所以调胃承气汤是从大黄甘草汤演变而来。十二指肠堵到大黄推不动，要用芒硝来攻坚，打散掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-39698ok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-39698ok","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240425082752-iv674ox.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-w2jzvfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-w2jzvfo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从十二指肠下来，如果是小肠里面堵到，因为小肠形状是一节一节的，所以它会一节一节堵在里面。那就有两个现象会出现，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一个排便出来像羊大便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一颗一颗的像六味地黄丸，这个就是我们所谓的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"是麻子仁丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为小肠在少腹里面，少腹是脾脏在管，脾脏受到约束了我们称之为脾约，脾约就是麻子仁丸。我治疗过一个肝癌的病人，用淡味渗利的实脾饮排腹水，但是小便并没有排出来，奇怪了，糟糕，怎么办？结果病人离开之前突然跟我讲了一句话，倪大夫我忘了跟你讲十几年我的大便就像羊大便一颗一颗的。啊，麻子仁丸！我就开麻子仁丸给他，当天晚上大便还没出来，小便就开始跑了，原来肚子那么大，一个晚上小便了3000CC，整个肚子就小掉了。所以我们还是要辨证论治，那经方里面从来没有说麻子仁丸可以治疗肝癌，而是那个肝癌的病人我们用淡味渗利的药排不出来，因为他原来有麻子仁丸证，就是脾脏受到约束。所以难经里面提到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治肝先实脾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们并不是靠小建中汤来实脾，而是要靠实脾饮，这个病人是脾约，常年的湿在肚子里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kbo6gg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kbo6gg8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二个呢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，大便没有了，排不出来，排气很多，说明小肠里面整个堵到，有蠕动但是大便没有过去，造成小肠里面有很多宿便，大肠里面是空的，所以病人的表症是会排气很多。这时候我们一看，小便是黄的，因为承气汤都是热证嘛，严重的排气像机关枪一样不断的排，这个时候我们开"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小承气汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实二钱、厚朴二钱、大黄三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，六碗水煮成二碗，就清出来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8f9udo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8f9udo2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小肠一种是麻子仁丸，一种是小承气汤，两种不太一样。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wy90l7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wy90l7b","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240425090324-mi8pkl9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-16tsxod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-16tsxod","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"堵到大肠里面时，分几种情况，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一个累积在大肠头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二个堵在阑尾里"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第三个堵在右天枢上面一点"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大肠跟肝连到的地方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第四个整个大肠堵到，堵在大肠里侧面看分两种，一种堵了好几块在里面，一种是一整块堵到，只剩一个缝隙可以过去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-bcqa5qh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-bcqa5qh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们怎么区分它？那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"堵在大肠头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个地方，常常出现盲肠被切掉后。如果盲肠炎不及时处理，盲肠炎破裂后，身体组织的膜会把破裂的部分包住，包住以后病人只有这里痛，但是血液里面完全没有炎症，这是我们人体自救的一个行为。我有个病人十年这里痛，当地的西医查不出任何毛病，我一摸，大肠头破开，转为腹膜炎！可是他的炎症皮肤表面没有发烫，因为急症的时间已经过了，不能动，一动就痛，可是西医硬是说他完全没有毛病，因为验血没有问题，大便堵在里面X光照过去，可是X光只对肿瘤、结石有兴趣，对大便没有兴趣，结果痛了十年，遇到我。堵在大肠头这个地方会用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"薏苡附子败酱散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，大肠头地方会摸到硬块，就薏苡仁、炮附子、败酱草三味药。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-aal6035","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-aal6035","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"堵在阑尾上"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"面，是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄牡丹皮汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果堵在阑尾上，你怎么确定？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"急性阑尾炎会在足阳明胃经的足三里下两寸阑尾点找到压痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，用大黄牡丹皮汤，不需要开刀，那在腹部会摸到硬块。大家在触诊，摸到硬块表面是光滑圆滑的这都没有关系，可能是脂肪瘤或宿便堵到，如果表面上是粗糙的，粗硬的像石头，这都是癌肿瘤。当然只要堵在肠子里都属于阳明热，小便一定是黄的，嘴巴一定是口渴的。如果有一个病人来跟说我"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"口渴，不想喝水，渴不欲饮内有瘀，说明身体里有瘀血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以大黄牡丹皮汤里面有活血化瘀的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"丹皮、桃仁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，说明有瘀血在里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-01u8cvp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-01u8cvp","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前面有介绍到白芍，阴药酸苦涌泻，重用白芍的时候，酸收的力量很强，所以它可以把瘀血化掉。所以我们常常用芍药来活血化瘀。还有阑尾割掉后，会造成慢性阑尾炎，大肠头的地方会变大，这时候要用到薏苡附子败酱草，炮附子来收敛它，薏仁祛湿，败酱草来除宿便，帮助把宿便排出来。病人一样右下方腹部会痛，同时阑尾点会有压痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-i717403","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-i717403","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个地方就很少人知道了（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师指大肠跟肝连到的地方，图上画点的地方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），这个地方造的症状很特殊。有一天妈妈买菜回来，那儿子很皮躲在门后，突然出来吓妈妈一跳，有两个结果，第一个是心脏一滴血不见了，第二个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"妈妈本来就便秘，受到惊吓，大肠头的宿便跑上来卡在大肠与肝的管道里"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，顶到了，顶到了以后有两个结果，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一大便的浊气会顺着肝脏到心脏形成奔豚，心会跳的很快，从肚子一路往上跳，这是心脏想把浊气逼出去的一个自救动作，这个时候我们知道桂枝汤里的桂枝会加速心脏喷射的力量，再加一点肉桂下去，就是桂枝加桂汤，心脏喷射力量加强，硬把浊气逼回大肠里去，奔豚的现象就没有了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二种可能是大便堵在这里，金匮里用己椒苈黄丸对治，做成丸剂，专门治疗肠间有水气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-av6wshc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-av6wshc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正常人小肠是这样子，小肠是红肠是火，大肠是白肠是金，心脏火会移转至小肠，所以小肠非常的热，人体设计正好大肠正好把小肠包住，目的就是利用小肠的热！那西医说大肠会把宿便里面的水分吸收掉，把残渣排出去，实际上他只说了一半。实际上是中医讲的小肠火在下面烧，宿便和水在大肠里跟着蠕动，水就会气化上来，干净的水才能被身体受用，气化的水通过三焦系统回到肺里面，肺法象天，这就好像小肠的地火烧过后水气会升到天上变成云，是金生水的一个过程，这个经过气化的水是非常干净的水。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mrvihj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mrvihj5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果说你被吓到堵到这以后，大肠里的水和粪便就分开了，水会渗出肠外，在肠子之间有水。结果这个人变成肚子很大，听到水流的声音，放屁很多，晚上肚子里咕噜咕噜跟打仗一样，肠鸣的很严重，这就是肠间有水气，不在肠子里面。如果水气在肠子里面，那是因为小肠的火不够导致的。小肠火不够就无法将水气化，水跟大便就会跑到大肠，当然会造成下利呀。以此类推，就可以通过小肠火的大小来判断，下利是小肠火不够，便秘是小肠太热了，津液没有了，变成很强的大承气汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8c6xpuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8c6xpuu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个地方堵到以后会造成肠子与肠子之间有很多的水气，就要用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"己椒苈黄丸，做成丸剂药缓力专"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果是汤剂就速度太快，打不到这个地方，从大肠走掉了。吃这味药时要用一钱的芒硝汤来喝，就会把这一块打散掉，病人吃完这个药以后，先是排许多水出来，大便跟着出来，肚子就不断的消，到了晚上肚子不叫了就好了。有的时候会在这个肋间的下方隐隐作痛，大概的位置在天枢穴再往外两寸的地方，可以摸到压痛点。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-g48cq64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-g48cq64","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最后一个就是大承气汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有两个症状，一是宿便中间还可以通，拉出来是很长一条一条的，代表旁边的宿便很多，只留中间一个小缝隙可以通过。还有一种整个肠子堵到，旁边只有缝隙可以通过，结果病人上厕所排出来都是水，一压肚子，大肠那边硬邦邦的。小便又是深黄的，舌苔很厚，味道很重，这种就是因为便秘引起的下利，每天下利十几次，非要靠大承气汤不可！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"厚朴二钱，枳实二钱、大黄三钱、芒硝三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，清出来就好了，宿便没有了阴会自回，就恢复正常了。那你说老师你怎么知道他大便正常？小便颜色从深黄变成淡白、身体表面是冷的，手脚温热就可以停药了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2msws2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2msws2s","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最后介绍堵在肛门口"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，大家遇到大肠癌的话，我们用承气汤来做加减。如果肛门口出现痔疮，老师你好人做到底好了，痔疮怎么处理？那有说法是十女九痔，不是说女人容易生痔疮，而是因为现代医学造成的，现代女人生孩子都是躺到生，医生叫你像排便一样排，生小孩硬是把痔疮脱肛出来，那古代生小孩是蹲到生，容易使上劲不容易脱出痔疮。那你如果是便秘加上痔疮，很硬的燥失通过肛门时病人就会很痛苦，伤口会撕裂，反复发炎，那我们怎么处理呢？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大承气汤加当归二钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，当归有油脂在里面，有润滑的作用，然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"槐花二钱凉血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，槐花是痔疮非常好的单味的特效药。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-p7q72xz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-p7q72xz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那经方里也有一个方剂叫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归赤豆散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，又名排浓汤，用当归、槐花、赤小豆祛，放在一起把痔疮里的脓排出来，同时收敛伤口，加上大承气汤，那效果很好，吃下去瞬间痛瞬间没有了，同时收口！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jbul904","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jbul904","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以中医出神入化到什么程度？就是车子还在开就可以把你修理好，西医一定要你停下来通通分解开来才能修理，机器这样可以啊，人体这样不行。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qaiq6xa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qaiq6xa","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那有些人呢常常把痔疮与大肠炎搞混了，我们有远血和近血，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"远血排出来是黑色的，属于胃出血、胃下垂、胃癌是黄土汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"近血排出来是鲜红色，就是痔疮，当归赤豆散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kxystie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kxystie","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一个排浓汤是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"术附汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，白术和炮附子。使用的时机在哪里？就是我们糖尿病的病人脚部都硬化掉了。我们现在讲到糖尿病，现在时间很多，我跟大家讲解一个笑话："}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wjjmbw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wjjmbw1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今天我们拿两杯水，两个杯子大小完全一样，一杯倒满，一杯水只有一半，我现在各加一汤匙的糖下去融化掉后，你认为哪一杯水比较甜？我们都知道半杯水的糖分高。那西医不知道，西医是微视医学，他不会去看你水少了，他只看到你血中的糖含量高了，然后他就开始发明一些酵素来分解血中的糖，把糖燃烧掉，按照物质不灭定律，燃烧掉以后一定会有残渣，沉积在杯底下，所以分解的血糖残渣会沉积在脚和腿上。那脚上的血糖比手上要高很多，所以长年累月下来脚会硬化，一旦有伤口就不容易收口，慢慢烂掉最后就要截肢。我们台湾的蒋经国就是糖尿病打胰岛素腿脚烂掉，青光眼、白内障什么都得到，最后截肢到走掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jb97d8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jb97d8j","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当它腐烂化脓的时候，全世界只有中医可以帮你。那中医一看，就是水不够嘛，所以病人会口渴、消渴，喝一杯水就小便一杯，所以病人就不断喝水不断小便，病人喝水是一个自救的动作，怎么办呢？我们会用到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"增润津液"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的方式，像"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生地、麦冬、西洋参、天花粉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等都可以增润津液。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-13jkmrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-13jkmrl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们人很好玩，我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"人体有两种水的来源，一种是喝的水，一种是食物的水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我们喝的水进入身体后，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"喝的水会进入三焦系统，通过小便排出"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；而食物、中药中含的水呢就不会进入三焦系统，吃下去到肠胃里面消化，会进入血里面，把血里面的水分补足。所以你如果喝水下去，喝了半天，那半杯水还是补不齐的，因为进不到血里，可是你喝了中药下去，那个药渣那个水会进入血里面，把血里面的水分补足。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wsufruj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wsufruj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以西医跟中医最大的差异在哪里？西医是验血报告，胆固醇、三酸甘油脂、血脂多高啊，中医呢，人体水占百分之七十到七十五，血只占二十五到三十。那西医没有验水报告，验气报告，拿着百分之三十的验血报告来判定百分之百的身体一定是错误的，所以西医是很可怕的，我们一定要把它清掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5z0yird","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5z0yird","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不清掉的话以后将来后面...整个中国大陆后面的医疗给付几乎不得了，像美国，我在美国中医师里面我缴的税最多，全美国中医师我缴的税是顶尖的，那病人找我看病，没办法啊！我把病人赶出去还要来找我。那我们看这个里面缴税的内容，医疗给付占了很大。所以你看美国国家不仅经济要衰败下去，你说打波斯湾战争或者打伊拉克，那个根本就是小儿科，国防部库存的弹药都还没打完，那个花不了什么钱的，真正花钱是医疗给付这个大黑洞！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zfvem7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zfvem7p","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我现在很担心我们中国大陆，因为大陆上在把美国那一套拿到这边来，将来我们再不努力，我们的下一代一定步上美国的后尘。不断的西医不断地耗钱下去，你最好完蛋了！光是我讲的糖尿病，你去严格控制血糖啊！我在骂西医严格控制血糖问题更多，结果西医自己现在讲了，严格控制血糖，容易引发心脏病，有没有？还有你看我骂那个胆固醇很高...大家胆固醇很高你不要紧张，因为胆固醇高代表你没有癌症，因为我所有癌症病人进来，所有的指数都很高，就是胆固醇都很低。那你把胆固醇降下来干嘛？那你吃降胆固醇的药不就是引诱自己得到癌症吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b4g3f4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b4g3f4n","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结果我讲了半天，上上个礼拜不是出来了，就有报告说总胆固醇过低的话，你就容易得到癌症，属于癌症的倾向者，他们现在才研究出来。所以西医的理论每年都在更新，所谓更年就是把过去的错误修正而已，所以你去研究西医的医学，他会告诉你，我们这医学有百分之五十的医学是错的，最主要是这百分之五十是错在哪里还不知道，所以要更新，西医学就是这样子，这是大学的教授跟我讲的，他现在拜我为师（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-am9kz4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-am9kz4u","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们中医绝对没有错，就看我们怎样去发挥它。尤其我们在国外临床这么多年，我们做给老外看的，现在克林顿政府已经发现到了，要发扬中医，像背痛，给西医的话，什么复健科啊什么开刀花多少钱，背还是痛，还痛的要死，到头来还是吃止痛药。吃了止痛药心脏又受损，又失眠，失眠又吃抗忧郁药，抗忧郁药吃了又想自杀，结果就死掉了，都是这样恶性循环嘛。到中医手上，扎两针，药都还在煮，针下去，他病人就好了，速度快到这种程度。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-usmkkqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-usmkkqg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说医疗给付一定要...这个走错方向就完蛋了。美国现在国债很厚，就是医疗给付是无底洞。现在美国要把中医列入传统主流医学，当然这也是我们在美国二十几年的深耕，总算改变了一些人的观念。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lhuju8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lhuju8s","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当吃西药脚烂掉后，可以用术附汤排脓，出现蜂窝性组织炎有黑洞，吃术附汤同时用蔗糖或甘蔗水泡脚。你说老师他是糖尿病你还用糖？你错了，糖是最好的收口方式！所以他脚如果放到糖水里面你可以看到脓会从伤口喷出来的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"术附汤我们白芍会用到一两，为什么？加速血液循环"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果这个人瘀血块很多，加丹皮三钱，加重炮附子让温度增加，也可以活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那你也可以开些收口的药，比如"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三七三钱，三七可以收口，续断三钱，续断除了补骨脂、骨头碎裂断裂很好用以外，对收伤口也有效"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，挑一些神农本草经的特效药增强脚部排脓效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pvs640u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pvs640u","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当大肠头爆开变成腹膜炎的时候，这个时候压力释放掉就不痛了，病人以为好了，实际摸这个地方是烫的，这个时候用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归赤豆散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这里赤小豆要发芽后与当归生用捣成泥让病人吃，当成生菜沙拉吃，能把破裂的部分整个收敛起来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ke95d6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ke95d6k","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那还有一种腹膜炎，胆结石累积很多来不及处理会爆裂开，刚开始很痛，等破裂开来就不痛了，然后身体就会用膜把破裂部分包起来，防止外散。如果是西医就要开刀进去整个拿掉，中医呢..."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nl2ktnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nl2ktnj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中医"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"分阳症与阴症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有阳症的四逆，有阴症的四逆，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阴症的四逆就是四逆汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，手脚冰冷，全身的寒，舌苔是白，病人有点半昏迷状态，奄奄一息，回阳救逆用的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳症的四逆就是四逆散，就是用在现在说的状况"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。四逆散由"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡三钱、黄芩三钱、枳实三钱、炙甘草三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等量组成，症状很痛，痛的时候哇哇大叫，手脚冰冷，气血很好，他是阳症的四逆，不是阴症的四逆，他是痛到的手脚冰冷，冒冷汗出来。你不要一看到他手脚冰冷就开四逆汤，那你是把鸭吃得药开给鸡吃，开错了！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9qizkhs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9qizkhs","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"四逆散处方为什么是这样？我们这样想，胆结石就像香水瓶的头被东西堵住了，你如果西医看，西医就把头切掉，封起来再还给你，没有堵塞了。中医说切掉会更堵塞了，怎么清它？重压一下，疏通开来。那怎么个重压呢？心脏跳动除了把热移到小肠以外，心脏外的心包是通到胆的，都是奇桓之腑（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胆、心包、女子胞、脑都是奇桓之腑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），相通的，对不对？所以心脏的跳动频率会传递给胆上面，跳动一下香水头就喷射一次，所以胆汁会一阵一阵喷射到十二指肠，喷出来的速度与心脏跳动速度是相等的。那四逆散中用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡能让胆非常流畅，没有东西堵到，让胆管打开了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩能够消炎去热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实能够加强心脏力量"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炙甘草配合在一起，心脏搏动力量就会很强"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。可是你光这四味药只能把胆打开来润胆，没办法把石头排掉，所以专门要挑一些能化胆结石的药物，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"五倍子，海金纱、滑石"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，五倍子是一个蓬蓬的球就像胆，海金沙是树的茎叶，就长在树的类似于胆的位置，五倍子可以把胆打开，海金沙化掉石头，加上四逆散，就是最好治疗胆结石的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-64p6cfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-64p6cfz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那老师你怎么知道他是胆结石？很简单呐，足少阳胆经上面阳陵泉下一寸胆石穴有压痛点，可以诊断出来，耳朵里的胆点也可以判断。背后第十锥有压痛点也能判断。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-x5sj79g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-x5sj79g","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我刚才讲到，四逆汤是阴症，四逆散是阳症，四逆汤与四逆散是不能混为一谈的，散跟汤的定义不一样。那你如果说太慢了，一到你手上就胆结石就破开了，变成腹膜炎，一摸是烫的，就是当归赤豆散生用打成泥服用，这个药蛮好吃的，你们有空可以吃吃看。那你吃可能会觉得这个药有点干涩或者怎么样，可病人就觉得这个药很好吃，因为他身体需要这个药嘛，吃了以后伤口的痛和炎就会慢慢去掉，热慢慢去掉，大便恢复正常。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kvds8be","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kvds8be","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"今天讲的都是腑实，有东西堵到，还有一个大柴胡汤没有讲"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-k2qm53e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-k2qm53e","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大柴胡汤运用时机，是病人有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"恶心，往来寒热，胸胁苦满，便秘"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"恶心加便秘已经就可以开大柴胡汤了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不用其他的症状，这个症状就够了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-n7h06yw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-n7h06yw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大柴胡汤就是小柴胡汤去掉半夏加枳实、白芍、大黄，服用前放入芒硝化开服用。我们有一句话说，大柴胡汤里面如果不加大黄、芒硝就不是大柴胡汤。那四川经方家"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"唐荣川认为治肝先治大肠，第一个要保持他大便通畅，这个原则掌握到肝病就已经停止恶化了，在我临床上面就可以看到停止恶化，那治肝先治大肠主力处方就是大柴胡汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-utmphxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-utmphxd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240425130551-ag1wht6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-w2v7mvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-w2v7mvg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大柴胡汤为什么会恶心呢？恶心的原因是大肠燥矢堵到很好以后，浊气会顺着肝与大肠相连血管逆流到肝脏，金克到木，肝脏就会变大，挤压到脾胃就会感觉到恶心。那实际上肝病没有问题，胃也没有问题，可是病人会恶心，因为这个大便堵到大肠里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-otc6b05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-otc6b05","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用大柴胡汤下去通便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，里面有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白芍止腹痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们常常看到枳实，承气汤有枳实，大柴胡汤也有枳实，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实是治疗心脏病不可或缺的药，因为长的就像心脏，有左心室右心室、左心房右心房"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"还有一味药栝楼实，也有四个心房，治疗心脏结构问题时会用到枳实和栝楼实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，像瓣膜闭锁不全、二尖瓣膜闭锁不全、心脏硬化...像这些我们中医都可以查到，西医说的东西中医都可以查到。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kcyjaz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kcyjaz0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有一个NASA的工程师来找我，42岁，要让我给他治心脏病，我就先逗他，说你有没有搞错啊，怎么不去西医那边？他摆手说不能去，不能去。我说为什么不能去？他说他有两个同事，三个同事是一个team，在NASA里面都是电气工程师，一个38岁、一个40岁，他是42岁。这个38岁的两个月前过世了，过世的原因是早上起来感觉胸口强烈的刺痛，然后他自己开车去西医院跟医生说我发心脏病，那医生就说你怎么知道你发心脏病？就用EK机做检查，结果没查到心脏病，把他赶回去了。赶回去以后当天晚上痛的更厉害，痛的呼吸不过来了，又开了车子回到同样的医院，轮班急诊的还是同一个医生，这次他一进去医生一看就不对了，因为气色整个变成青紫了，呼吸呼不过来，讲话已经开始结结巴巴了。医生一看，马上把他放到EK机台上面检查，那医生看着机器说：哦，你得到了心脏病，你真的在发心脏病了。那病人就说：我告诉过你了！我发心脏病你不相信我，你还害我跑第二趟！然后就断气了，就死在了EK机台上。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-37kseyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-37kseyy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这就证明这个EK机必须要你发心脏病的时候才查到，那这个机器可以用吗？可以信吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qfej4gr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qfej4gr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后呢，他说我来找你的原因是，在不到一个月，我团队40岁的那个同事也遭遇了同样的事情，他也死在那个同样的医院，也死在EK机台上，还没有开刀，就光检查，死因是一样的，你说我怎么敢相信EK机呢？所以我来找你。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kyndemt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kyndemt","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我就问，睡觉好不好？不好。我说你是两个月以前就开始失眠还是同事死掉才开始失眠？同事死掉以后才开始失眠。他吓到了嘛。手脚热不热？很温热，大便好不好？大便每天都有，那你没有心脏病，已经讲完了，很肯定的告诉你没有心脏病。所以他只是吓到了，对不对？那你不能以一个失眠来判断。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cmbjtvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cmbjtvm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中医是根据四个征兆就能判断是否要发心脏病，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一睡眠不好，第二手脚冰冷麻刺，第三胸口闷，刺痛，第四大便不规律"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。心脏是君主之官，本身是不受病的，除非有外来的因素介入。所以你如果饮食不好、习惯上不好才会造成心脏问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2jbtxp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2jbtxp7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中医为什么不赞成吃西药？因为西药是化学酵素，吃到身体里面会释放出水来，那你吃阿司匹林、抗生素或者感冒药，都会释放水出来。那越吃你的血管壁会变的越薄，越来越干燥，越来越硬，所以什么冠心病、血管硬化都是吃西药造成的，因为水不够了嘛。我宁可你多吃一些水果，因为水果都是食物类的水，它会进入我们身体把不足地方的水补足，所以这是中西药不一样的地方。还有呢，你如果只吃厚味的食物，营养进入血分，会增加血管的负担，所以要多吃蔬菜淡味的食物，任何东西都不可以太过，太过与不及都不好，五色五味要均衡搭配。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4dndprb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4dndprb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们为什么说味精不能吃，因为吃完口会很渴，他会把身体里的水排掉。味精不是很好的东西，像能够生津止渴的，都是很好的东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zmdq7vf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zmdq7vf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们回头看历史，很好玩..."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-17b1cz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-17b1cz6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"东南海沿海一带呢，浙江福建都喜欢吃醋，酸入肝胆，所以沿海一带的人很少人得到胆结石，但是他们吃的海盐，所以得到肾结石的人很多。到青藏高原一带，那里的人吃青盐，不爱吃醋，得到的都是胆结石，不会得到肾结石，他们吃辣的厚味的比较多。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以我们从历史上可以找到青盐是可以排肾结石的，所以金匮里面有茯苓戎盐汤可以排肾结石，戎就讲的是西戎，就讲的是青康藏嘛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那你如果会做生意，你就可以把青海的青盐拿到东南沿海一带去卖，不容易得到肾结石，把东海一带的醋拿到青海来卖，大家不会得到胆结石，这是一个功德。那如果说你说这是倪海厦推荐的，那我也没法找你，那一定更赚钱，人家会相信我，因为是我说的嘛。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师地位很高，现在淘宝中药相关也确如倪师所说"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-u5pk6cl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-u5pk6cl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"多吃醋可以预防胆结石，青盐可以预防肾结石"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以诸位从饮食上就可以知道，如何预防得到肾结石、胆结石。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5mt1o9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5mt1o9o","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以常吃海盐的话，最好改吃青盐，尽量吃青海的盐，青海的盐多到什么程度呢？整条公路是用盐巴做的，就是盐巴本来就在那边，他就挖过去把它整平就好了，去过那边都知道那里盐味很重。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-drp7opv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-drp7opv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我认为说，要当个好医生就是我们把他病治好的同时，还要告诉病人病是怎么来的，让他以后不要犯同样的毛病，同样的病不会再来，这就是好医生嘛。当然上工治未病那是一定的阶段，你不可能说我们13亿人，每个人都听我的话，还没开始治病就开始调理，那已经有病的人怎么办？所以当个好医生已病未病都要治。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"预防胆结石要多吃米醋，不要吃工业醋，酿出来的黑醋最好，这都是我的一些经验上跟大家报告的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-v8wrh6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-v8wrh6b","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"来，现在给你们提问题。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gx2yeuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gx2yeuy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生问"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"妇科的胎位不正或者脐带绕颈有什么办法，或者是产后有一种羊水栓塞死的很快怎么办？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5e61ja1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5e61ja1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"这些都是可以事前做到防范的。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-78fhz92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-78fhz92","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们以针灸的穴道来说，足太阳膀胱经的井穴"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"至阴穴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"专门调整胎位不正，针刺后自己会转正回来，就不会有脐带绕颈现象。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rst7sku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rst7sku","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般来说，如果出现里面有问题，我们在外面都可以诊断的到。比如说妇人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"怀孕以后脚肿起来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，代表水道系统不是很通畅，那我们要让水道系统通畅，金匮的方剂"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"葵子茯苓散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"都是很好排水的药。一般来说我们产妇呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"怀孕 1-10 月的前五个月要养妈妈，后五个月是养胎儿，前五个月用当归散，后五个月是白术散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，里面有牡蛎来补胎儿的骨头，保证胎儿不会太大，补骨头不补肌肉。这都是我们事前预防的动作，所以你刚刚提的问题很好，造成这个问题的原因是因为你在怀孕期间没有保养的很好，这就叫上工治未病。一开始怀孕就开始吃中药，比如怀孕中间吃吃四物汤补补血，产后可以吃吃八珍汤气血双补，可是在怀孕期间不能吃补气的药太多，胎儿会太大，一般来说都是可以事前弥补的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mn2rx3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mn2rx3s","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"硫磺是用煎剂嘛？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0q76y8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0q76y8v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用煎剂，硫磺是用棉布包起来与其他药一起煮，与石膏煮法是一样的，要包煎在一起，不然就成硫磺泥汤过滤不出来。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cqa63ak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cqa63ak","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们常常会石膏和硫磺绑在一起丢进去煮。你说老师又石膏又硫磺，你这有问题，石膏大寒硫磺大热，两个药药怎么放一起煮？我们明天介绍乳癌的时候，跟大家介绍为什么需要用到这样子。包括我们的牡蛎，牡蛎我们是打碎了再去煎，因为煮的比较透，容易吸收。石膏量大分几包一起煮。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pzay846","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pzay846","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"还有没有什么其他的问题？都可以提问，没有关系。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nxjyftj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nxjyftj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"没有哦。那补充一下，那个我们有两个时段，大家在使用经方时要非常的注意。一个是中午，一个是半夜。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果是外感风寒的表症，桂枝汤症、麻黄汤症、葛根汤症，今天吃完药，到了第二天中午胃口大开，代表胃气恢复，病就会好。所以我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当一个医师一定要知道什么是正常"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-52v95ag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-52v95ag","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如这个人上午吃完大青龙，到了当天中午已经开始饿了，就知道病人已经好了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"表症吃了药以后，最迟第二天中午胃口会开，病就好了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那我们用这一条做标杆，今天这个病人得到表症是伤寒，怕冷、口渴、咳嗽、吐黄痰、胃口没有、无汗、全身关节痛，在我们看是大青龙汤，你们一般开出去是连翘散、玉屏风散、防风通圣散都没有关系，病人吃下去，如果吃完第二天中午没有胃气恢复，代表药不对。这样了解我意思吧？不用说什么吃一礼拜了，第二天就晓得了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0mutm3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0mutm3f","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以药有没有效，第二天中午就知晓了，瞒不过身体的标杆。所以在美国人家都叫我倪一贴，就是讲这个感冒，我只开一副药，先开给你吃，明天中午不管是小孩还是老人，明天中午你肚子胃口没有开再来找我吃第二帖，开一副药就好了。结果第二天人都不见了，打电话去问，已经开始跑去玩了。速度快到这种程度，就一贴药。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-amcjb46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-amcjb46","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在的H1N1，现在国家药典出来的药方我告诉大家，那个清热解毒的药达不到这个效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fd93v0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fd93v0t","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是外感风寒的表症。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7a4frvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7a4frvy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夜胃气恢复"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢。病人深更半夜醒过来饿得要死，想吃东西。我们治疗内科重症的时候，比如胃癌、肝癌、胰脏癌、肺癌、肾癌、尿毒等等，不管他什么病，吃了药晚上深更半夜想吃东西，这就代表你的药就到了，用这个做标准。为什么是这样子？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hip5d5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hip5d5m","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 172px;","style":"width: 162px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240425145508-76tre9z.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 162px;\" parent-style=\"width: 172px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-50gdmw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-50gdmw9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为半夜12点到2点是一阳生，所以阳初生的时候是在半夜。早上6点到12点是太阳，也就是阳最盛的时候。阴实很重的时候，阳不能入阴，阴挡到阳就会反逆回来， 所以就通宵不能睡觉，这是阴阳反逆的现象。甚而至于病人眼睛一直在那边瞪着，眨都不能眨，为什么？因为那个阳气一直反逆出来，阳气快要离开身体了嘛，快要死了，到后来的话病人24小时都不能睡觉，眼睛都不能眨。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-99gxgu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-99gxgu9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那当你把阴实打开来的时候，阳气升出来了，能入阴了，一入阴发现里面有病对不对？赶快要叫你起来多吃点食物，多给我一点阳，你就会醒过来找东西吃。你想想看一个肝癌或者胃癌的病人原本没有胃口，结果吃了你的药以后开始有胃口了，是什么意思？病人好转了嘛，所以半夜胃气恢复了的时候，代表病情在好转的中间。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5hzkua7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5hzkua7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们治疗肝癌、肝硬化啊时候，常常会遇到病人半夜肚子饿起来找东西吃的情况。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ln51pbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ln51pbu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这都是伤寒金匮里面提到的东西，这就是我们临床上来判断中药是否有效的方法，要做到一剂知二剂已。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-evntz9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-evntz9x","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在美国很多病人来，吃完我们的大青龙或者小青龙汤，都跟我说我这辈子感冒没好那么快！大家不要小看这伤寒，伤寒呢，详细的部分我打算到我们的大会比如人多的时候，我们来专门讲感冒，大家不要小看感冒，感冒是非常不好区分。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5qvu5xo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5qvu5xo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那严重到什么程度？我们有一个女病人，42岁，来的时候说失眠，两个月不能睡觉。 我说那你失眠的情形怎么样，她就跟我讲，我全身骨节酸痛，怕冷怕的要死，口不渴，舌苔白的，没办法睡觉，西药安眠药都没用。结果呢，她说我现在把车子、房子都卖掉，墓地也买好了，葬礼都准备好了，棺材都买好了，我遗言都写好了，我死的话把我丢到里面去，教堂都约好了。我一看，失眠。摸她的脉，脉浮数，是小青龙汤症，小青龙汤证就是表寒里寒嘛。然后我就"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄细辛五味子半夏芍药干姜桂枝炙甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rhx4aec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rhx4aec","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃完后，病人一个礼拜以后来找我，她说吃完你的药以后第二天中午胃口大开，吃了很多的汉堡，然后当天晚上就睡着了。我一看当时的处方麻黄开了三钱，一般来说如果麻黄吃下去不对症的话，麻黄就让你通宵都不能睡觉，好像吃到什么毒品一样。那这个人不能睡觉反而吃了麻黄能睡着，所以中医要辩证论治，有这个证就是使用药的时机，善用麻黄也能治疗失眠，小青龙汤没有麻黄就不叫小青龙。小青龙跟大青龙的青龙讲的就是麻黄嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5haf0tu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5haf0tu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果表面是寒的，里面是热的，舌苔黄，嘴巴燥渴，热的烦躁，没有胃口，就是大青龙汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-w9orgnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-w9orgnb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以如果我们把经方简化，诊断叫做‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"表寒里寒，处方小青龙汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"’，如果是‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"表寒里热，就是大青龙汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"’，就变的很简单，这样就能统一我们的语言。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-g5bdy6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-g5bdy6a","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大青龙汤的时候症状有表面是寒的，全身骨节酸痛，恶寒，但是又口渴，喜欢冷饮，咳嗽黄痰都代表里面是热的，所以表寒里热就是大青龙汤，表寒里寒就小青龙，就结束了。所以中医我们需要把它简化，用这种简单名词来下处方，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四逆阴症是四逆汤，四逆阳症是四逆散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你就讲完了嘛，你就会开了，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jkfioin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jkfioin","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以中医到后来我们需要统一下语言，这个语言能够统一的话，你那个诊断一写出来我就知道，我们大家都会共同使用同样的处方，这时候我们大家就在同一个领域里面悠游。像我们以后沟通，你讲一句话我就知道了，不然的话你要听病人讲，真的听不完。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vw0phcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vw0phcr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们要把很繁杂的数据，用阴阳表里虚实寒热表达出来。像癌症会用阴阳诊断的方式，持续盗汗是阳不入阴，偶尔盗汗是虚症，用到龙骨牡蛎就可以了。当吃完你的药还有盗汗，代表你得药没有用，当吃完你的药盗汗开始减少，就是你的药到了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ejk2hqy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ejk2hqy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以就是因为我们这个阴阳诊断的方式，解读病人解读的很精准，这个时候我们处方...糟糕，生附子三钱、四钱、五钱都不中，病人还在寒，阴实没有打开来，那怎么办？这时候我们要找比生附更强的药，就是石硫磺啊！然后再去研究石硫磺，发现鸭子吃石硫磺没有中毒，所以如果吃石硫磺，你就叫病人买只烧鸭、烤鸭在那边，肉吃了，骨头留下来煲汤放在冰箱备用，万一说你吃了人不舒服，就拿那个鸭汤喝下去解毒，当时是这样，最开始我用石硫磺是这样，因为不敢呐。可是你实在找不到比生附子更强的阳药了嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-i4tvcsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-i4tvcsh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后来用多了，什么毒，根本没有毒。病人就鸭汤很好喝了，但是都是事后喝的，他们觉得可惜把它喝掉了，并不是因为有吃石硫磺中毒。你知道我意思吧？所以说根本就没有毒，所以说是那几个道士啊，想着说只要我长命千岁就好了，你们不能吃，然后他就说石硫磺有大毒，你们不能吃，实际上石硫磺毒性很少，几乎都没什么毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hubbtl3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hubbtl3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们以后出去玩或者是怎么样，带些石硫磺的胶囊放到身上，没事吃几个壮阳。阳气会很旺，像我们到北方去那个零下10度啊，我就穿件短衣服一件外套就出去了。就是吃了石硫磺嘛，阳气很盛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-03ukt7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-03ukt7e","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那在我们黄帝内经有灵枢跟素问，那我在讲人纪的时候，我讲的素问，没有讲灵枢，因为灵枢部分大部分讲的是针灸，我在讲人纪里面讲针灸讲了很多，所以就把那个灵枢讲进去了。灵枢里面就提到，我们有热性的体制跟寒性的体质，热性体质伤口恢复的很快，寒性体质就很慢，"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ar2q2vq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ar2q2vq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以如果说你实在没有办法做到阴阳非常平衡的那个状态，那在这种条件下，宁可热一些，也不能寒一些，宁可阳过一点，也不要不及。所以我们可以吃点壮阳的药，所以石硫磺大家不要担心，真的，我都是平常没事就丢几颗硫磺胶囊吃的，补补阳气，不要怕没有毒的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ys3ibkb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ys3ibkb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果你哪天必须要到寒冷的北方去，带硫磺在身上，没事丢几颗吃吃。北方那个地寒的时候它是会从下面透上来到脚骨头里面去啊！吃几颗硫磺，麻黄把它退下去，身上跟火山爆发一样。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b2rkhho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b2rkhho","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，今天讲到这里，非常感谢唐教授、刘教授。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-adwnqq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-adwnqq8","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-81c75a6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-81c75a6","updated":"20240828171608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三讲：癌症的治疗方法 2009 年 12 月 04 日南宁"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-k6wgxbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-k6wgxbd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们昨天一再提到能治癌症的就一定能治疗心脏病，预留了一些伏笔，给大家做个总结，让你深深的了解为什么我们会讲，把心脏治好才是真正能治好癌症的医生，这是西医都不了解的。就算你现在暂时的查你没有癌细胞，随时会来，所以没有什么很好的预防的动作。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tx05qw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tx05qw7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我今天就利用这个机会给大家做个简单的报告，让大家了解到我们经方的看法，我们中医的阴阳家...你可以称我为阴阳家，因为阴阳表里虚实寒热八纲辨证，我最常用的就是阴阳诊断法。那今天又要谈一些阴阳方面的诊断法，让大家了解到心脏为什么那么重要。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ur0607d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ur0607d","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先给大家一个基本概念，所谓阴和阳，如果你不详细解释，不讲的很白话的话，那大家只会对阴阳有很笼统、模糊的概念，今天我们就给阴阳下一个定义。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"手掌是阴侧，手背是阳侧"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，眼睛能够看得到的都是阴，手是阴，手能握拳，说明手里头有力量，我们知道有力量存在，但不知道力量多少，那个力量我们称之为阳，所以阳是看不到的，但是存在。也就是阴和阳的结合，它才会有生命。否则你光看我的手，但是没有力量在里面，这是一只死的手，这就是阴和阳。中医说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阴中要有阳，阳中要有阴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，很简单，阴中要有阳就是你手掌（阴侧）摸上去是热的，就是阳，手背（阳侧）摸上去是冷的，就是阴。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wxeflby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wxeflby","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们检查病人的手，上下一摸，手掌是热的，手背是凉的，这叫做正常。这样一摸，这个人的手掌手指内侧是冷的，代表他阳不足，阳不足有多少，一个指腹，阴和阳怎么会摸不到呢？这个时候就要开始下手，上工治未病。这样了解我的意思吧？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hqdvv1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hqdvv1t","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同样的，如果今天是遇到乳癌、红斑性狼疮的病人，手一摸就看完了，明白我说的意思吧？如果指头还是冷的，说明还没好，继续吃药，这是第一个诊断。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-86yifxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-86yifxg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二个诊断握手掌，摸额头。正常人额头是冷得，手脚是温热的，所以你去摸他，他额头是热的，手是冷得，还没好，为什么？因为易经说天圆地方，头是圆的，脚是方的，天上是冷的啊，所以治疗到额头是冷否、手脚是温热的是正常。原因是什么？原因在这里..."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-i5odl0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-i5odl0v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240425170545-nxwt14g.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-j9kfggq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-j9kfggq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心和肺是火和金相克的关系，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在学中医的时候，不要只看到相生是好的，相克都不好，那你就错了，所谓相克就是必须要有它存在，才能有制衡"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。自然界之间，生态平衡一定要有制衡，如果你把这个区域的老虎都杀掉了，鹿就会到处繁殖把树破坏掉，因为它要摩擦鹿角，刮它的角嘛，树就会体无完肤，所以老虎狮子吃掉鹿，能取得生态的平衡，人体也是这样的道理。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lyvw96d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lyvw96d","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那心是赤色的，肺是白色的，手太阴肺经，心经都在手上，所以心脏比较少比较小，肺脏比较多比较大，所以手掌是一点点的红，大多是白色的，所以你手拿出来是粉红色的，是正常。如果说今天你肺萎缩掉了，心脏肥大了，手掌会更红一些，红多白少，以此类推，这就是制衡。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9d57ohv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9d57ohv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以心脏一直不断搏动、摩擦生热，这个热如果没东西制衡它，一定过热，所以我们把汽车引擎比喻成心脏，机油就是人身上的血液，水箱就是肺，没有水箱引擎就会过热，过热就不能跑，要保持恒温的状态下，引擎才有力量。这个恒温，西医定义是 97-98 华氏度是正常，可是西医只知道后面，不知道前面，他只知道正常温度是多少，不知道体温怎么来的。中医知道体温是怎么来的，当体温下降的时候，就知道心脏的力量不够了，那我们有些处方专门是刺激心脏的，喝下去心脏马上就跳起来，或者找一个他很怕的人，一看到她，一吓他心脏马上就跳起来了，或者针下去扎到心募的巨阙穴，公孙、内关啊，我们有很多种方法让心脏跳起来。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nhqu3cj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nhqu3cj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"救急时不用计较方法，以救活为唯一目的。那你们唐院长他很会观察人，他第一次看到我，跟我谈几句话以后，他就知道我是什么样的人。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-m0i7eox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-m0i7eox","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们作战有两种，一种是很讲究章法，习惯排兵布阵，即使战败，阵要摆的漂亮。那我呢，不管什么排兵布阵，打胜仗是唯一目标，我可以用打啊、咬啊什么方法，反正我就是要赢，我就是这样子的人。我不管布阵，因为病人人命千金，至于会不会被人质疑，人家会告我，家属会怨我，我都不顾了，赢为第一！病人会感受到我这种劲，所以就算病人救不回来，也不会有人告我，因为他知道我尽全力在帮他。许多病人认同我，这点很重要。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mz3dvky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mz3dvky","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以有这个恒温的出现，是因为火跟金的关系。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ld9jxjw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ld9jxjw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你如果引擎过热，肺的津液就没了。过去有些医家用犀角降温，现在不行，不单单是现在野生动物保护法，我大陆收的唯一徒弟孙宏能拿到犀角，因为他是管贵重药材的。但是这个东西我们不需要用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"经方用石膏，色白入肺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，引擎温度太高了，是因为肺里津液不够了，所以嘴唇干裂、口渴、燥渴，一剂石膏下去烧就退了，当然不单单是石膏，我们有辩证的方式，配合其它的药使用。我们有石膏的处方像白虎汤、麻杏甘石汤、大小青龙汤，越婢汤都有石膏，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"越婢汤甚而至于病人盗汗、已经在流汗了，还用麻黄跟石膏配在一起"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，甚而至于身上的水肿，积水，越婢汤加白术就排的很快，还有很多的处方可以治疗水饮，我只是简单举个例子。后面会介绍很好的处方给大家，但是通通都在经方里，我跟大家报告过，没有一样是我发明的，只是我把古文解释给大家听而已，我只是做这个工作，所以我们上古的医生是非常的优秀的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-j387bua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-j387bua","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上古医师到中古的时候，中古医师像张仲景，除了这个孙思邈以后就没有名医了。为什么讲这个话，并不是说后人不如他，而是是医学到此为止，已经很完美了，不需要再去研发了，他的意思在这里。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jbsb0nj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jbsb0nj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但你们大陆盗版很凶，所以说我这次从台湾带了《黄帝外经》，外经大陆没有啊， 可是源发是在天津图书馆，是大陆天津中医药大学教授整理完以后，不先在大陆发行，怕被盗版，先在海外发行赚点钱再说，结果只能在海外买的到，大陆买不到。这次带一本给刘教授，很可惜我讲完人纪后才发现的黄帝外经，这部分呢外经都有提到，但是还是没有我们讲的那么详细，所以我这里要讲详细一点。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hm52ik0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hm52ik0","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-gf84nwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gf84nwg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们要知道什么是正常，正常手掌拿出来是粉红色的。有一天肝脏，木生火，我讲的都是阴阳五行啊你们都知道的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"很干燥的木头才能生火"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，潮湿的有虫的就不行，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝脏是解毒的，它把血里的毒素通通清掉以后，把很好品质的血提供给心脏，叫木生火"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那你知道了一个理论，其他可以以此类推，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治肝先实脾，因为木克土"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，理论都是可以推理的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vr8byj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vr8byj7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果有一天肝脏里面长了东西，被挡到了，不管是肝癌、肝硬化，有长东西称之为实，没有东西为虚。我常常在网络上在写，我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"宁可虚不可实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那肝里长东西了，容量变得只有以前的一半，可是大量的血照常源源不断在晚上运送回肝脏，那肝脏有一半被敌人占领了，原来的血是10的量进入心脏，现在是50的量进入心脏，大量进入心脏，红色的量就会增加，那肺的白色还是那么多，所以当你的手掌越来越红的时候，代表肝脏在持续恶化中。同样的，不需要 X 光照射，把手掌拿起来一看就知道，吃中药前是暗红色，越吃慢慢变成粉红色，就是阴实在慢慢退，都不需要开口问病人，不需要问睡眠好不好，眼睛一望就知道了。望不是看你的脸漂不漂亮，是看色，可以看看手、皮肤，大概就知道了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-aeyiqqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-aeyiqqf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那肝脏红色都没了，手变成苍白色，血色都没了，代表极度的贫血，已经不能造血，光看就看出来了。就算你去西医检验也还是贫血，没有必要。所以西医还没检查完，我们已经中医开始看完开好处方开始煮药了，速度会快到这种程度。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cmnhxzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cmnhxzt","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚刚说的是颜色，那在温度上面来说，因为肺是寒，肺法像天，常态肺是冷的，心是热的。所以额头是凉的，手掌是温热的，摸摸手、额头检查就已经结束了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nshfkd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nshfkd4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那他是前面手指头冷和手指一节冷是不一样的，如果是前面手指头冷，我们根据他的体格桂枝可能用到五钱，炙甘草五钱，如果只是为了让他手指头热起来，这两味药就够了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝甘草汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。但是我们要让他额头温度下降，他额头之所以是热的，是因为心脏跳动力量不够，没有热力，这时候要会使用到生附子。为什么要用到生附子？这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生附子里面有乌头碱，如果你不会用直接生吃，就会中乌头碱的毒，心脏麻痹就停掉了。反过来说，生附子药力可直达心脏，毒性也会直达心脏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们必须要用这个毒。那西医用毛地黄，大家知道毛地黄多毒吗，西医都是毒药，他用毛地黄用的多爽啊，我们用生附子大家怕的要死，不用怕。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-l4snsqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-l4snsqq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或许也是天命哦，江油那边刚从泥土里面挖出来的附子，我们称之为泥附子，我也姓倪，天生的一对，所以我天生会用生附子嚯，那么凑巧。这个生附子不管剂量开多少，只要过火蒸煮、煎煮过一个小时以上，乌头碱就没有了，根本就没有毒了。我们说是用生附子，但谁跟你说生吃啊！这个生附子一定是蒸煮过的，不能生吃，这个生附子力量就大了，一下去心脏就跳起来，手就热起来了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这是上焦部分的阴阳诊断方法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-l1loqhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-l1loqhm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中医呢，认为女人的奶水就是月经，内经里面有：二七而天癸至，任脉通，太冲脉盛，月事以时下，故有子。所以中医观念月经等于奶水，这个观念一定要打通。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-k77lx60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-k77lx60","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实际上过去你们没有注意到，很多医书、医家或者道家的书都提到过月经等于奶水，可是我们没有认为它很重要，忽略了它，其实这个相当重要。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"奶水之所以成为月经，月事以时下，靠的就是心脏和肺的功能，如果心和肺有问题，就不会以时下"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有的人会月经提前或延后，如果胸腔上焦过热，月经是提前的，如果是过寒的，月经是延后的，只有在恒温的状态下，月经是正常的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-67udyov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-67udyov","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240426112313-2safa6l.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-f5iihxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-f5iihxg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我画个图说明，心脏在这边到小肠，每个月月经在来之前一周，都会涨奶，涨到一个礼拜以后不能涨了，奶水就开始往下走了。即使你是未婚的女孩子，没有生过小孩，胸部为什么会胀，那是因为奶水在里面，可是你没有授精是纯阴之体，没有阳在里面，所以你乳腺头并没有打开来，当然如果太多了它也会分泌出来。那你没有受孕，这个奶水就会顺着冲脉往下走，所以从你月经第一天开始，胸部压力，涨奶现象就开始减轻，一直减轻到月经停掉，胸部的压力就完全没有了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-f0vp8zl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-f0vp8zl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果你是女孩子你仔细体会我讲的东西，你就知道奶水就是月经，这是相通的。我们从几个地方可以得到证明，西洋的医学说，因为你的卵没有授精，依附在子宫壁上排出来就是月经，所以月经是这样来的。那我请问你，许多太太结扎，没有卵到子宫里，就不会受孕呀，那怎么每个月还有月经呢，西医讲的是不是很矛盾？这是第一个。第二个，太太生完小孩以后，坐月子喂奶，期间八个月十个月给小孩喂奶，你问太太每个月有没有月经，十之八九是没有月经的，有的人有月经，那是因为吃的很补啊，绝大多数没有月经，因为奶水被小孩子喝光了，所以喂母乳期间太太是没有月经的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rvzcdy4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rvzcdy4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等到决定断奶的那一天开始，大约有两个礼拜，一个周期左右，胸部痛的要死，西医就打退奶针，希望把奶退掉，等月经来压力才算慢慢减轻。那这段时间往往很痛苦，常常退奶不成功，乳腺会发炎呐，乳头很痛呐，胸罩带上去都不舒服，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"实际上在这个阶段就是我们预防乳岩最好的阶段，不要去打退奶针"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我开个处方给你们，在《神方医录》里，就说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四物汤加炒麦芽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能治退奶，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归三钱、川穹三钱、熟地三钱、白芍三钱，如果有腹痛，白芍可以加到六钱七钱，白芍专门止腹痛，炒麦芽加重五钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3mbdgpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3mbdgpm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当太太决定不要喂奶了，有两个选择，一个打退奶针，一个吃中药四物汤加炒麦芽。这个处方因为中医知道月经是奶水来的，所以可以把奶水百分之百的消导到子宫，不留任何的残乳，变成月经排出去。那西医不知道啊，就直接给你打退奶针，效果不好，还会留残乳在胸腔里。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乳癌的成因就是有残乳停留在乳腺里面，日积月累以后钙化，变成硬块"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那停太久了以后质会变，等于是坏死的食物，当这个不正常的营养停留胸部太久，旁边的细胞就会帮你消化掉，消化掉以后一个变两个，两个变四个，四个变八个，细胞的突变就是癌症。所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"癌症的起因都是过多的营养，我在前面一再跟大家说宁可虚不可实，绝对不可以太过"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我们平时吃的食物营养已经够了，不要听西医说的要吃多种维他命，什么ABCDE不要吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-av2nntt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-av2nntt","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们台北有一个老先生，也是我小姨子的一个朋友的公公，他一个月要花 20 几万台币买营养剂啊！他迷信到这种程度，新的营养剂下来他就去买，现在得到肝癌了，跑到台大医院检查出来肝癌，刚开始是7公分，不治疗还好，一治疗化疗、变成14公分多，他还要给西医治疗。连西医都给他说，你这个肝癌是吃营养剂综合维他命太多造成的肝癌，他还要吃，那没办法他就是找死啊，这种人也不必骂了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1dquz33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1dquz33","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你要讲反话，他才会警惕。恭喜你，快死了，你花钱把自己买死掉，花了很多钱买自己一条命，恭喜你恭喜你。你苦口婆心劝不会听的，医师跟他都讲了都没有用，回家照吃你看，那种药都有成瘾性，好像不吃又不行。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ks9cewv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ks9cewv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那四物汤加炒麦芽是能够消残乳很好的一个处方，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四物汤把血补足"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，血一增加流量就增加，像引擎增加很多机油，润滑度会强起来，生命力就会强起来，这五味药就会把残乳排掉。所以任何女孩子，不管是生过小孩要断奶，还是没生小孩胸部有硬块，在硬块来前一个礼拜，胸部不是会涨嘛，不要去动它，赶快吃四物汤加炒麦芽。为什么我不赞成做切片？我一直不赞成做切片，骂你没有用，我根本已经要挟威胁你了，只要你做切片我就不治疗你！实际上做切片我还是会治疗，因为你不做切片的话，一个乳腺不管累积多少奶水，就算乳腺变形，里面钙化了，管道还是一条线，里面是通畅的。但是你一做切片一根针刺过去的时候，会伤到很多乳腺，伤口结疤以后，管道可能就封闭掉了，也有的管道形同袋状封闭掉，连同很多残余的乳汁在里面，后遗症会很多，会有结缔组织产生然后把这个伤口包起来，结果吃了我们的药以后，旁边的硬块都软了，就是切片的地方还很硬，还在痛，那请问你切片你要干吗？哦，我要确定我是否是乳癌。那请问那你确定了乳癌你又会怎么样？这是第一个。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ggpeykc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ggpeykc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二个，在中医的阴阳诊断里，我会慢慢告诉你，大概有三分之一的乳癌，根本就不需要治疗，什么都不要做，做切片根本就是害人的！所以现在美国也承认了，前几个月承认啦。可是在十几年前我就看到了。根据中医阴阳诊断来看，只要阴阳气机是流畅的，这种病都不会致命。所以她乳房有硬块，我一摸她的手是温热的，额头是凉的，不要去理她不会死。如果是 40 岁的太太，这个硬块 100 年也不会害到你，140 岁的老太太你还在乎它吗，你这样了解我意思吧，不会害你嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ixevofp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ixevofp","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可是中国大陆西医我不知道，台湾西医不管有害无害，所有乳癌病人到了台湾，全部开刀切掉，然后还说我们有三分之一的治愈率，其实那三分之一的治愈率根本就是那一种乳癌是不致命，他说成是他们治愈的，变成他们的功劳，你说要不要脸？坏透了！我告诉你。我敢说这句话，就是我比你会治病，我敢威胁你，你用这种惨无人道的方式对待病人，我就要找你麻烦。所以台湾西医看到我转头就跑，真的转头就跑，不敢跟我辩论啊，吓死了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b7alemj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b7alemj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长庚医院很大对不对，长庚医院院长跟我就很熟，他们医院里面的医生得到腹腔的肿瘤，肚子里面长了个肉瘤，西医一看说只能活三个月。找谁才能治？倪海厦。谁可以找到？院长。然后就拜托院长找到我，可是当时我正在武汉旅游在火车站接到电话，我说现在在写地纪啦，没时间，回到再说。那医生就硬是等我回台湾，医生是整形外科医师，太太是牙医，你看医院的医生有病都找我看，病人要找医生看，那我是医生里面的医生，你敢不听我的？所以长庚医院医生看见我马上立正，我吃定你，懂不懂我的意思？你们以后也要做到这样子，我们中医一定要团结，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大家要相信我，虽然我不常在你们身边，但是我心跟你们在一起，我们一定要赢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。讲到那些草菅人命的事，我都火啦，因为人命值千金呐，你家里没有出过这个事情你不知道啊，一旦发生在你身上，你就知道我在讲什么。我为什么气成那个样子，我看了很多嘛，我当然破口大骂，骂了你你又怎么样。美国西医没人敢骂我啊，因为他老婆乳癌怎么办，吓死他了，是不是吓死他了？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-czk64cn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-czk64cn","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乳癌第一个成因是多余的奶水停留在胸部里面太久"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，没有按照月经的每个月的时间，正常顺着冲脉、任脉下来到达子宫里面排出来，日积月累造成乳癌的，这是成因之一。你知道成因的话，及时把里面的残乳排掉，是不是可以预防乳癌，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dpedlga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dpedlga","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二个，你说老师，我口袋空空没有钱，那你就买几副四物汤加炒麦芽，几幅药大概也就5块钱人民币就可以解决。口袋里没有钱，那怎么办呢？没有关系，心脏在管这个嘛，所以你保持心情开朗，心主喜，不要忧郁嘛，不要口袋里只有一万块就想买一部买不起的车子，你过多的欲望只会让自己不开心，是你自己让自己不开心，那你可以找些和尚念经，打坐啊，让自己不要有什么欲望，物欲，诸如此类的，你要找很多方法疏解你的压力，让自己保持随喜。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-crccbj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-crccbj4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像我就很开心呐，我把西医骂了我还很开心，因为我骂不是骂他的人，是骂他的医术啊！怎么那么烂呢，对不对？可以不这样做的嘛，这样知道我的意思了吧？所以以后你们乳癌不要讲这个处方，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个处方是最初期预防乳癌的处方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你就跑到医院检查，哎哟有硬块，那西医说帮你做切片，那医生请问你，做完切片后你可不可以确定是乳癌是致命的还是不致命的？西医说太太你在说些什么，我没有听懂，懂不懂我的意思？因为他们没有把致命的和不致命的分开来，在美国是分开来的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b4gklry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b4gklry","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美国癌症中心都知道我，都疑问我治过的肝癌病人怎么还没死啊，早该死了还没死，所以对我都很尊重，但是我不做人身攻击，我不会骂你这个人，我是骂你的理论，讲的话都是有问题的。那我们小平同志说了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"实践是检验真理的唯一标准"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不相信我就做给你看，一起治看谁厉害，他就不敢来了逃走了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-d7bsnmv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-d7bsnmv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以要保持开心对心脏好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7a4y0q6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7a4y0q6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有就是经方的应用，我们看经方如果治感冒，中医认为“百病风之始”，感冒开始我们就要下手了，不能吃抗生素来治疗感冒。诸位都是学医的，尤其是研究过西医的都知道，他们说感冒是滤过性病毒引起的，抗生素只能杀部分的细菌，不能杀全部的细菌，更不要说抗生素根本就杀不死滤过性病毒，绝对杀不死的，你问全世界的医生结果都一样。那你开抗生素给他要干嘛，明明没有用，你为什么还要开？病人来总是要拿点药嘛，我就给他一点吃，pia的一巴掌打过去我告诉你，我就是这样的人，人命千金懂不懂？我不看病则已，看就当成比我命还重要仔细的看，生怕我自己弄错，我是这样的人。所以很多病人他很了解我，可以感受到我这种关心他的气势，所以被我骂了还是介绍病人来找我，他只相信我，他们不相信他们的医生。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-emxhyjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-emxhyjo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你一定要会很多经方的，那比如我们讲去风，去风的话经方家会用到桂枝，包括温病吴鞠通“温病条辩”第一个也用的是桂枝。我们用桂枝汤是为什么？因为桂枝辛甘发散是阳药，所以用桂枝汤去风，那换句话说，防风、独活，羌活这些怎么能够去风呢，荆芥不能够去风啊！你说我不敢用桂枝，我们用防风来取代它，对不起！桂枝就是桂枝，无法被取代，因为它辛甘发散，是阳药。我们讲的中医最好的东西就是阴阳，所以去风非要靠桂枝不可，这个风不单单是表受到风寒，风湿关节炎到处游走的痛，都是属于风，都会用到桂枝。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-iq0r9cd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-iq0r9cd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们经方不去选择独活，羌活，防风、荆芥这些，原因就在这里。同时桂树你去看，那个枝到处散，是不是就像我们四肢血管、全身血脉一样？完全是一样！桂枝你拿起来仔细看是红色的，入血分，是阳药，那还有什么取代的？你把独活，羌活，防风、荆芥拿起来看看是不是红色的，是不是长的像血脉，咬咬它是不是辛甘的？没有的，只有桂枝是，这就是用桂枝的原因。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mqtzhnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mqtzhnt","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等礼拜天我再跟大家讲感冒。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-21ly789","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-21ly789","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"言归正传，当我们确定心脏在管奶水的时候，心脏就很重要了。你不能说全中国的妇女刚好都要退奶，正好都用到四物汤加炒麦芽，哪那么凑巧啊！有的太太来已经有硬块了怎么办？所以我们必须要分几个阶段来治疗。慢慢大家更深入了解后就知道，我非常不赞成“少奶奶”，以前的少奶奶是妾，现在是少了奶奶，少了胸部嘛，我们台湾叫做“少奶奶”俱乐部，就是女人乳房被切掉后成立的组织，通通是没有乳房的女人。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0gmlc0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0gmlc0l","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我心里想好可怜呐，这时我太太抓住我，还好我在旁边。我太太有我在，她什么都不怕。很开心，每天很开心。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1ose1iq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1ose1iq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240426133917-xmblfb5.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-slzm31c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-slzm31c","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那当你发现硬块的时候，我们看正面，从喉咙下来到肚脐这边是所谓的任脉，通过乳头下来的这条经是足阳明胃经，而大多数的乳癌的硬块是生在乳头的下方，也有的生在乳房的内侧。在没有做任何切片，没有做任何动作之前，我们医师可以触诊，千万不要听西医说很多乳癌初期摸都摸不到，那等你摸到的时候就已经长的很大了，大家不要听他讲的，他的目的就是希望你去做挤压，做超声波扫描，做穿刺，才会讲这样的话，这是胡说八道！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3e5ppxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3e5ppxy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我现在告诉你案例，我在网络上就写啦，台大医院是台湾顶级西医院，就跟你们北京协和医院一样，这个协和医院不要惹我，惹我一样的骂，他们都是有西医的顶尖人士在里面，自己是台大医院做亲子鉴定的医生博士，他太太是护理长，每年都要做体检，可是她一直发现自己胸部有一个硬块，查都查不到，她觉得硬块有问题，等做完挤压体检又没有乳癌，她就不相信台大的检查，自己跑到隔壁的和信医院去检查，结果是乳癌三期。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ph53fuk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ph53fuk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你再怎么检查也不能把整个乳房照进去，只能照到一部分，还是有一部分照不到。你今天把这个乳房切掉，也不可能都整个切掉，还是有很多组织是相连的。那如果你不切它，乳癌就是乳癌，就长在这边成长嘛，你切了以后它没有地方呆了，它就要找另外的地方待，找到肺里面、找到肝里面去。那本来乳癌是生在肋骨的外面，是在阳的位置，怎么会不好治呢？病在阳治起来会非常简单。结果你把阳的一侧切掉了，癌细胞就跑到脏里面。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝内经、难经都讲了嘛，病入阴脏则死"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-u48ezvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-u48ezvi","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那谁把你这个病搞到阴脏去的？就是开刀手术啊！西医把你害的，本来很好治的，一开完刀，无治，你就不要再来找我了！开完刀可不可以治？其实还是可以治，但是治起来非常的难，治愈率不高，大概最多只能延长她的寿命而已。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-y5jkoxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-y5jkoxv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那请问你在阳侧的时候为什么不找我来治呢，一定等到人家把你变成阴病才来找我治？所以西医的诊断根本就是矛盾的，病人初诊的时候是乳癌，治到最后死在移转肝癌、肺癌上面，请问你是谁搞出来的？西医搞出来的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4ry6kc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4ry6kc8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"给中医治疗，中医就算把你治死了你也还是死在乳癌。就算我不治，乳癌放到那里烂也能活 14 年，诸位要多看古书，古书上记载很多乳癌真实案例，然后统计平均起来，乳癌不治疗平均能活 14 年。过去许多人住在深山里，一辈子也没有接触中医啊，日出而作，日落而息，帝力于我何有哉，皇帝的力量管不到我，我就过自己的生活。那他这个也没有医生，太太得了乳癌，十几年才死掉。在美国还有个太太得到乳癌活了 38 年，也没死啊！结果现在西医动刀，就说五年的成活率是多少，三年的存活率是多少，他为什么讲成活率？是因为他没治好病，意思就是只有五年成活率，你只能活无年，那你不治疗都能活十年以上，治疗才能活无年，你要选择哪一个？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2oq100w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2oq100w","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昨天跟大家介绍过，阳明分为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明经热和阳明腑热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两种，阳明的腑热昨天跟大家介绍过了，我们从胃、十二指肠、小肠一直到大肠、盲肠都介绍过了。阳明腑热就是阳明的腑实症，我们用承气汤清它。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"现在谈到的就是阳明经热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，足阳明胃经的经热，从上面头下来，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"头维、下关、侠车，承泣、四白"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一路下来到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乳中、乳根"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。阳明经的经热去热的方法就是用石膏，就是白虎汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9k9v0ag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9k9v0ag","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"回头我们再看石膏的时候，石膏色白入肺。如果把中药分阴阳，你跑到药房看颜色白的都是阳，颜色黑的都是阴，阴阳图画的很清楚，白的是阳，黑色部分是阴，眼睛看过去石膏是阳，熟地黑黑的是阴。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果你把石膏定义为阳药，你就敢大剂的用了，你把石膏定义为寒凉的药，就不敢大剂的用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这样了解我的意思吧？如果你把石膏定义成寒凉的药，你开出来的石膏就不像白老虎啊！四钱、五钱、八钱那个开出来都是白老鼠、白猫，什么叫白老虎？大剂的开！所以我开始下手石膏的时候，起价四两，37.5 乘以 4 是我的起价，第一剂四两，还在热不行，第二剂六两八两十两每次二两就加上去了，那是不是大老虎，白老虎？这叫白老虎啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-usc3pyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-usc3pyw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所谓"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"金石类的药，石头类的药都是重镇，镇压的功能"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b42bozw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b42bozw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上看，小姐左胸的胸部硬块非常的硬，我们旁边学生很多啊！你说小姐你胸罩拿下来我们看一看，不好意思嘛，对吧？中医是很人道的哦，绝对不会把你扒光啊！我就问她，请问你乳头是凹下去的还是凸出来的？她说乳头是凹下去的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a2xcnj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a2xcnj3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那乳头这个地方常态是阳，有阳才会凸出来，有阳才有力量啊，手没有力量，凹下去就是阳绝了，阳气下陷。所以如果乳房有硬块，乳头还挺在那边，就不是很严重，如果乳头凹下去的话已经很严重了，因为阳气已经下陷了，这样理解我意思不？还有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳气形于表，阴气行于内"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，阳中要有阴，所以你摸在乳房表面应该是冰凉的，懂不懂我意思？这个要有点常识。你自己在外面，手放在冰水里，你的手很冰，这时你摸乳房，哎老师我的乳房是烫的，这个人就是白目嘛。如果乳房是烫的，不用摸，你自己就感觉到乳房是烫的，懂不懂我的意思？或者自己感觉乳房是凉的，自己就感觉得到。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lq9gmvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lq9gmvl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那在开处方的时候，比如说是经热，经热开白虎汤，开"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"石膏四两去热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"知母五钱除湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炙甘草三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"粳米一小把，没有粳米就用糯米"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有粳米最好，没有就用一些甜米，糯米黏米都可以，二钱三钱就够了，不要放五两煮成了稀饭，这是增加胃的津液。所以如果这个乳癌小姐很胖，你问她喜欢喝热的还是凉水，她说我想喝冰的，这是乳癌初期的时候，没有动过都是阳明热症，非常的口渴，想喝冰水。还有问病人千万要小心，你问她小姐你喜欢喝什么，她说我喝温的，然后统统问完，她突然告诉你，我是逼我自己喝温的，其实我心里很想喝冰的。那这个病人很糊涂，你要告诉我你心里想喝什么，不能告诉我你逼自己喝什么。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-o8tf74x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-o8tf74x","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有的病人说我知道喝热的比较好，所以我就喝热的，实际我想喝冰的。所以我们中医问诊，要问原来的症状，你喜欢喝冰的，就告诉我你想喝冰的，你隐瞒我会有什么好处呢？害还是害到你。所以当你看到这种癌症，一派热症，病人会告诉你都是热症，如果今天我不告诉你是白虎汤症，你绝对想不到开白虎汤！可是你今天听病人陈诉时，她会告诉你我非常的燥热，晚上睡觉也很热，白天口渴非常想喝大量的冰水，越冰的越好，讲的全是白虎汤症。这时候你下手的时候，请你派白老虎出去，千万不要开白猫、白老鼠，你如果剂量不够的时候，下去时你以为无效，你就会改变处方了，实际是你剂量超过四两以上才是大老虎啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lolhy63","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lolhy63","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个病人从头到尾西医没有动过，硬块差不多有六公分到七公分大，非常的大，坚硬的像钢铁一样。白虎汤下去，一个礼拜以后来找我，她跟我说吃到第三天晚上，第四天清晨时，忽然感觉到硬块被打散掉一样，马上当场变棉花，变成棉花啊！我心里想糟糕，这个白虎四两不够啊，应该到六两，剂量足够时，快的话，应该一天、二天或者第一碗喝完就散掉了，快到这种程度！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nq2z325","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nq2z325","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那她还是很高兴，倪医师真厉害，整个散开来没有硬块了，好开心啊！然后我说你乳头凸出来没有？她说凸出来啦，当然凸出来了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"说明石膏是阳药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师粉笔敲了敲黑板上的阳字"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。阳气就到了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-j19sh40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-j19sh40","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胸为阳，腹为阴，所以女人的胸为阳，女人胸部排出来的奶水是不是白色的？初奶是黄色的，但是后来是不是白色的？然后这个奶水要断奶时，用四物汤加炒麦芽慢慢把奶水逼到子宫里，排出来是红色的，红色是阴嘛，所以女人胸为阳，腹为阴。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0cbfnvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0cbfnvk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白色是阳，就是告诉你，大家放胆的使用石膏。石膏大寒，在本草里面写的寒，它是无毒的，既然无毒的大剂使用怕什么？但是你如果寒受到束缚，大寒的药，你就不敢大剂量的用。当你把这个当阳药，能够壮阳耶，所以女孩子吃了石膏乳头会挺起来。正常女孩子每天早上起来的时候，胸部比较敏感，乳头会挺起来。男人每天早上起来阳举，所以那个得道的和尚 100 多岁了，每天早上起来一柱擎天，还是童子之身，阳很旺。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a1mt9sn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a1mt9sn","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你男人如果说吃错了，我吃石膏，结果吃了阳就不举了，因为太凉了！女人胸部为阳，男人腹部为阳，所以男人精子排出来是白色的，女人奶水排出来是白色的。任何东西生产过来都会产生残渣，比如营养能量经过身体生化过程后产生精子，产生残渣会顺着任脉一直往上到嘴巴旁边，变成胡须，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以胡须是男人的月经，男人不应该讲月经，是日经"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，而这个管道也是心脏在管。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2k7coz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2k7coz0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那男人没有奶水，所以男人得到乳癌的机会不多，现代才会偶尔有一两个男人得到乳癌，为什么？因为喝牛奶嘛。牛奶里都有荷尔蒙，在美国我常常跟太太们说，你的牛奶我不敢喝，喝了一段时间我会变成 D 杯，回家的时候我太太会对我说你是女人，我们两个离婚。喝牛奶会变成D杯，为什么？因为女性荷尔蒙很多， FDA 居然同意拿女性荷尔蒙喂食乳牛，这样会增产爆棚奶水会很多，那你拿牛奶喝，你确定是牛奶还是女性荷尔蒙？所以喝了胸部会变大，男人得乳癌就是这样来的，因为吃了太多女性荷尔蒙。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-yy5wdts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-yy5wdts","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"世界上哪一个中医和西医敢说女性荷尔蒙可以吃的？大家都知道女性荷尔蒙吃了要小心，很容易的乳癌，为什么？因为吃下去奶水会增加。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tdvdd00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tdvdd00","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"西医只知道女性荷尔蒙容易刺激女孩子得到乳癌，他们不知道是女性荷尔蒙导致奶水增加，残乳留在乳房里太久，才会造成乳癌的。所以先生的工作也很重要，因为先生与太太之间的抚爱，我们是医生嘛，这样讲没有关系，夫妻抚爱的时候，有阴阳的交流刺激，抚摸的时候乳房的肿块会化掉，因为太太就很开心呐，会亢奋嘛，奶水就会化掉。为什么讲这个？我们有个太太得了那么大一个肿块，像乒乓球那么大，乳癌第二期，那么大一个长在这地方，先生居然不知道她太太得乳癌，然后问她太太已经一年多了，回头我就把先生臭骂一顿，你懂不懂我意思？不用把衣服拉起来，站在我旁边都能闻到那个臭味。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6nyo7yu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6nyo7yu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那乳癌臭到，我跟你讲，余臭绕梁三天，相比之下什么臭袜子臭什么的当场就闻不到了。那个乳癌病人在你这个诊所离开后，那个臭味在房间里呆个三天哦，你们没有接触过，他就知道我在讲什么（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师指了指某人，可能是同诊的医师"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）......臭的要死，没有一个人可以在房间待住，大家都往外逃，像腐烂的尸体那种味道。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-uxwa3fz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-uxwa3fz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当然我们不需要到那个阶段。所以在最初期的时候，病人出现硬块，不管你是良性还是恶性的，处方是相同的。第一个病人就会知道，原来坚硬如石的硬块消除了。第二个，原来感觉这个乳房非常的热，另一个感觉非常的凉，现在热的温度下降了，这些是告诉你一个指标，病人在进步中间。那等到两边温度完全一样，也不热了，两边乳头也挺起来，恢复原状了，再手掌和额头一摸，手掌是温热的，额头是凉的，就让病人回家，因为你好了。为什么？因为阴阳平衡了，肺跟心之间，金与火关系达到平衡，这就是常态正常。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6dlfsui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6dlfsui","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果说把乳房切掉，切掉以后做化疗，化疗只会让癌细胞扩散的更快，加速癌细胞的扩散，现在美国已经得到证实了。结果呢，跑到肺里面去，跑到肝里面去，那你说老师中医怎么知道移转到肺癌、肝癌？很简单...其实知道也没有用，知道还是要我来动手。常常病人开了刀化疗后找我，我就问她你晚上一点到三点可不可以睡？他说就是这两个小时不能睡，我说已经移转肝癌了，就告诉她。她说你不要吓我哦。什么好吓，我现在很肯定的告诉你，你用录音机录下来，我再讲一次，你已经移转肝癌了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4qqyhw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4qqyhw0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么？因为晚上一点到三点是丑时，肝经气血流注的时间。如果是三点到五点醒来，是肺，就知道移转到肺了。那如果是一点到五点失眠，移转肝肺了嘛，这样知道我意思吧？那病人乳癌开完刀，做了32次的化疗，终于把癌细胞逼到肝脏上面去，再来找我，蠢成这样子。痛嘛痛的要死，我可以告诉你，乳癌切除的痛，止痛药都不能止痛，要打吗啡，打完又so what？你认为你有生活品质吗？你没有生活品质，那个乳癌开完刀你怎么带胸罩？两个大伤口，不断地冒脓出来，很恶心，拉开衣服来，我是鼻子被臭的头昏了，热血又冲到脑门上被气到了，血冲脑门，我每次气成这样子，因为看的很多嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-y3kepi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-y3kepi5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说我常常讲，你让我先动手，让中医先动手，没有好你再考虑西医开刀化疗好了。可是我可以告诉你，如果一开始你就中医动手，从此天下妇女就得救了，因为没有人会死于乳癌，不用讲别的，光就刚才告诉你的石膏，白虎汤的应用就够了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5pxyv8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5pxyv8e","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-ej8i41y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ej8i41y","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那还有一种情形呢，还有第二种处方出现。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-id82f2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-id82f2d","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"硬块不在阳明经上面，在肾经上或心经、心包经上"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们怎么处理？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-37jut4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-37jut4d","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阳明经是很大的一条经，但是如果不在阳明经上，在阳明经旁边的其他经上怎么处理？我们就有一个乳癌的方子出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lcog9gt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lcog9gt","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们中医用牡蛎，牡蛎呢是咸能软坚，所以在治疗肿瘤上，我用的牡蛎非常多。诸位你们都是学中医的嘛，我有没有去发明啊？没有，不是我发明的，本草经里面本来就写啦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"咸味的药能软坚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那你如果开牡蛎五钱，止止盗汗可以，我们有桂枝龙骨牡蛎汤，惊发的盗汗，惊悸的盗汗可以用到。如果是火邪，你们家里面从火场里面跑出来受到惊吓，我就在马路旁边蹲着在煮那个桂枝去芍加蜀漆牡蛎龙骨救逆汤，受火惊发时用的处方。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"牡蛎五钱最多只是止止盗汗，所以我开的时候是一两，大剂的二两都会用到"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，光是牡蛎只是攻坚，我们要达到乳癌的部位，希望药多待在乳房的地方，常常加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓦楞子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，江浙人都知道"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓦楞子就是血蛤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，血蛤的壳长得就像乳房。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-x8uqvuw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-x8uqvuw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那老师蜜蜂房也像乳房，我们能不能用蜜蜂房？对不起，蜜蜂房它不能用，为什么？因为它是生乳，我们治乳癌是在退乳，而蜜蜂房在生乳啊！如果太太在母乳期间奶水不够，你拿蜜蜂房去煮药看看，一吃就奶水很多，小孩子都快噎死了，奶太多了！我在想办法去残乳，你在生乳，刚好反的，怎么可以用蜜蜂房呢，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8b4qtwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8b4qtwf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那老师你怎么知道蜜蜂房会生乳？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很简单啊，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"蜜蜂房是甘味的甜的，甜是脾土，土会生金"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这是大家读过耳熟能详的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那金是白色的，所以我们真正奶水的来源是来自肺，是脾土运化过食物以后变成肺的营养"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。好了，你现在吃了甘味的东西下去，当然生金了，我不用吃这个药，想就知道它会生奶水了嘛，为什么？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为中医以‘意’和‘象’来论药性"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，西药呢是分析化学成分，中医不是，是以它的形象，就像昨天报告的海金沙长在茎叶旁边，像不像胆的位置？所以用海金沙来消胆结石，就是这个原因，中药就是取它的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"意象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-yxhe3k5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-yxhe3k5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中医很有意思，到自然界去，如果你哪天你迷路在山里面，如果你是中医的话，被饿死或病死你真的很丢人。因为你应该会认得药，这个可以吃，那个可以吃，至少可以这样救一下。所以大家多到中国大陆 400 多个种药的地方看看，看看生药长什么样子。那我会加一些瓦楞子下去，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓦楞子五钱，加到八钱都没有关系"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这些甲壳类的药都是无毒的，你什么时候听人家说吃血蛤，喝瓦楞子汤、牡蛎汤死掉的？你看老外钙片的成分，它就写着牡蛎。那你说老师我把钙片打散煮起来，那个不行，精炼过的钙不行，不但身体不能吸收，吃下去会累积在肾脏里面，变成肾结石。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qntdp1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qntdp1b","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哪天你人生乏味想得到肾结石，你就吃钙片，保证没多久就得到肾结石。但是你吃中药的牡蛎汤就不会得到肾结石，钙是到处都有的，天然钙可以，绝对不能做成钙片来吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vyuqy41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vyuqy41","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓦楞子五钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是一个，那由于它在胸部的地方，在心包，三焦、淋巴系统，这个部分都属于三焦淋巴系统，所以会用到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为病人舌苔常常都是热症，脉是速的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，病人如果不口渴，我们在用半夏的时候，要问病人渴不渴，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不渴都可以用半夏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，半夏能利水。一般来说我们都用生半夏，大家看见生半夏，不要说啊老师，这个生半夏在药典上说有大毒，不能用。你听我讲个故事，讲了你就敢用了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0c9m19c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0c9m19c","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过去这个生半夏叫做婆婆药，为什么叫做婆婆药呢？就是婆婆很唠叨，恶婆婆每天都在骂媳妇，媳妇没办法做菜时就放一些生半夏，生半夏色白没有味道，也不辣，丢在菜里面煮，婆婆一吃下去喉咙就没有声音了，变成哑婆婆了，就听不到婆婆的骂声了，媳妇的耳朵就很清净，就叫婆婆药，所以生半夏吃下去会没有声音。解生半夏的毒很简单，拿一片生姜放在嘴巴里一含，生姜还没吞下去，生姜汁一到喉咙，声音就回来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-29i1aet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-29i1aet","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以生半夏唯一的坏处就是你忘了加生姜或干姜在汤剂里面的时候呢，就会失声，发不出声音，只此而已，不会毒死的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-324vxs2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-324vxs2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果我们不会用生半夏，按照本草里面说，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生半夏能去至高之水，人体上最高的部位就是脑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，当你用生半夏下去的时候，我给大家报告，中医认为人有血有水，西医只认为有血，所以西医从来没有验水报告，只有验血报告。我们身体有百分之七十是水，如果开始我们就用生半夏，把水利下来，头部正常的水是气化的，我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"人身上能够受用的水都是热气，热水，气化的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以你嘴巴吐出来的都是热气。有时候吃凤梨吃太快吃太多。结果眼睛里面冒出两个气泡出来，那都是气呀。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-u8momk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-u8momk0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果我们把不必要的水先排掉，这个生半夏如果遇到陈水在身体里面，它统统可以把它排掉。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不单单可以预防脑积水，最主要是有脑瘤的时候可以预防脑积水，或者脑积水有了我们用生半夏把它排掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"还有一个作用就是当脑部没有过多的水在里面，乳癌细胞不会移转到脑瘤去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"许多太太乳癌移转脑瘤就是因为有水在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那我们就可以做预防动作。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-aq1smhf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-aq1smhf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个半夏不单单可以去掉去至高的水，身体里多余的水它也可以去掉。那为什么说半夏能够止呕，恶心呕吐的时候，我们用半夏，因为半夏能够把水排掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fuv1yxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fuv1yxo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们很有名的妇科里面的药，妇人在怀孕期间呕吐不止，还有人每天抱着马桶吐，吐翻了，没有办法离开马桶，不断地要吐，看见马桶也想吐，不看马桶也想吐，所以只好抱着马桶吐得更多。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zq0f4iz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zq0f4iz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个病人她来找我，当时有两个病人，一个是美国人，一个是中国人，美国人怀孕七个月，中国人怀孕六个月，中国人要找中医看，美国人说我不相信中医我找西医看，结果西医一看，就说哪有那么厉害的呕吐啊，在病人呕吐的状态下，还插胃管下去，然后进进出出一个多小时找不出原因，结果不小心把脾脏弄破，结果流产了。那中国太太来找我，倪医师你要救我，我呕吐的不得了。那经方里有一个方子，只有三味药，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"人参、半夏、干姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（干姜人参半夏丸），诸位在金匮妇科里就有，干的生姜， 半夏就是生半夏。吃完第一天恶心就去掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1q5roc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1q5roc7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你如果说你用制半夏或者法半夏，你要知道现在...孙鸿他是搞药的，他最清楚，现在的法半夏制半夏都是蒸煮过很久很久的，因为他们认为有毒，就煮了很久，弄的半夏根本已经没有了药性，就只剩一颗白白的豆子而已，一点半夏的功能都没有。所以我们用到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生半夏一定会用到干姜，来解半夏的毒。止呕是靠生半夏，干姜是解它的毒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，吐的津液太多了，肠胃津液丧失很多，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"人参的目的是把肠胃的津液补回去而已"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这样吃东西下去不会因为没有津液干燥在肠胃里面，不会造成这种现象。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9zjur13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9zjur13","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个如果不加人参，吃到嘴巴里面就好像完全没有口水，是干的，嘴巴怎么吞？就是这个意思，要加人参，把吐掉的津液补回去。所以吐伤了，在经方里面，人参的定义并不是延年益寿，长命百岁，而是肠胃津液不足，我们要用人参补回去。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wri8mpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wri8mpb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当我们加了这个药以后，生半夏三钱，不用担心，后面加生姜，生姜与干姜的取舍，就看肺的寒热，如果肺家是寒的，像肺寒常常我们是甘草干姜汤。如果是乳癌的话一般来讲都是肺热，所以会用到生姜二片，不会用到干姜。我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"临床上常常会用到川穹，为什么？因为川穹活血化瘀，奶水就是血，是相同的东西"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以奶水从胸部一路下达到子宫的时候，子宫这一段上面不能有堵住的地方，所以活血化瘀也要用，保持它通道的顺畅，保持奶水百分之百的下来。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jpvihmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jpvihmk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个乳癌处方我们还会用到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"防己、茯苓，治各种炎症的时候，切记，当我们用药物在攻坚的时候，攻它的坚，攻它的血分，因为有水产生，所以一定要把排水的开在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我们说奶就是血，其中还有水，千万不能忘了还有水，如果水停在身体里面太久，癌细胞会再回来。中医的观念与自然界的定律是相通的，没有水就没有任何生物可以生存，所以水是万物生长的源头。也代表说健康的身体需要水，癌细胞肿瘤也需要水。但是人健康的水是热水，我没有鼓励你们每个人都开始喝热水啊，这跟你喝水的寒热没有关系，而是你身体里面是寒的喝下去就是寒的，里面是热的喝下去的水就会气化，给你喝的是什么水没有关系，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"身体里一定要有热把水气化，才是我们身体所受用的水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那身体里有寒水停留在身体里面，这个水对病毒，对癌细胞，对滤过性病毒来说是最好的游泳池，它就会成长，会生存。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wvc09eg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wvc09eg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我常常用一个观念跟老外讲，你花钱盖了一个世界上最漂亮的游泳池，你用播音告诉邻居家的小孩子说，没有我的同意不能随便翻过围墙，到我的游泳池里游泳，绝对不可以，来我就开枪把你打死你，这太过分了，真的会把小孩子打死，这是西医哦。中医认为，游泳池漂亮没关系，他们来是为了水，你如果把水清掉，没有环境他也不会来，你把水拿掉就好了，就不会再来了，这就是水的观念。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-61gipdj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-61gipdj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当我们攻坚排水的药物，为什么用防己？防己能入三焦、淋巴系统，然后茯苓利尿，把水利出来清掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那如果你开这个处方，正好这个病人月经来了，好，处方不要动，处方里面加四物汤加炒麦芽，这样就会加减吗？这时就要看你加减，所以我只能给大家一个大原则。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那如果你遇到这个太太，伤口已经破掉了，很臭，可以加一些伤科的药，乳香二钱，没药二钱，川膝二钱，当伤科的病来治症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"续断来收敛它的伤口"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。同时呢，破裂的伤口，诸位一望，一看很湿很黄，黏哒哒的流脓血，我们可以放一些外敷的药，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩、黄连去热，知母，白术打粉祛湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这四味药外敷。中药方剂是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"丸散膏丹"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，除了可以煮汤药以外，我们可以马上开个处方来外敷，外敷的理论很简单呐，祛湿去热配在一起，你说老师我只有黄连、白术这两味药，这两味照样可以用，外敷在伤口上面，能够收敛它的伤口。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-r2redct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-r2redct","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你如果只开清热解毒的药，你没有开祛湿的在里面，湿的环境在那边，它的炎症一直会再回来，就等于游泳池的水没有清干净，小孩子一直在回来。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-toevanr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-toevanr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那我们心脏呢，在管这个奶水变成月经"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。当我们下了定义以后，就能在临床上发现很多问题，如果这个心脏有问题奶水某部分往左边倾，奶水就会累积在左边的乳房里面，如果心脏有问题往右一边倾，她奶水就不会停留在乳房里面，第一种可能是奶水直接逆流进入心脏，这个奶水本来应该顺着任脉，冲脉直下达子宫变成月经，结果心脏某部分有问题，奶水逆流跑到心脏里面来。心脏本来是赤色的，只有肝脏可以交付营养给我，现在突然有外来营养进来了，这个营养不应该在我身体里面，现在跑到我心脏里面来，临床上看就是红斑性狼疮SLE。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-yce5vv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-yce5vv0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病名叫什么都无所谓了，关键是要把病治好，西医把病名起的很漂亮，屁病也没治好，骂你又怎样？不然你找我挑战啊！他只知道这是后天免疫系统不全（immunodeficiency免疫缺陷），就是变相告诉你我不知道。你不知道怎么来的，那你就让知道的人动手啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-le861fd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-le861fd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在临床上看病人的奶水进入心脏，我举个例子给你听，我们有个病人呢，44岁，黑人，黑人虽然乳房是黑的，但奶水还是白的。如果你看见奶水是黑的，你就不要学中医了，你可以回家了，怎么这么差呢。这个黑人呢 44 岁，你看这个案例，一个案例就够了，这个有一天他来找我看病的时候是 52 岁，她被西医判断为 SLE 红斑性狼疮。我就问她是什么时候开始的，八年前开始。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mnkz3r7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mnkz3r7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我说发生什么事啊？患者：那一天我先生突然跟我讲，太太我不再爱你，我外面有女人了，所以我们离婚好了。听完这个话，她说我三天，我门都不开，家里面什么都不想吃，我妈妈电话打来我通通不接，三天待在家里面就躺床上什么都不做，从那一天开始到现在月经没有来过，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"伤到心了，心脏受伤对不对"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"？月经没来了三个月以后我全身关节很痛，跑去西医检查，一查说我有红斑性狼疮，那西医不管你是什么，发生什么事情，反正现在是红斑性狼疮，西医也没什么治疗，就吃类固醇嘛。能拖多久拖多久，那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃这个类固醇，大家也知道月亮脸水牛肩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那何止水牛肩，她来找我的时候是 300 多磅，肿成这样子。这个病人呢，我问你口渴不渴？非常的渴。脚是热的冷的？脚是冰的。小便什么颜色？小便是白的，那你睡觉的时候是不是感觉上半身是热的，下面是冷的？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ii056bt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ii056bt","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240428081900-avb9ly8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-c4kpdh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-c4kpdh6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哎，你怎么知道，我被子只能盖到肚子，下半身要盖很多被子，盖还是冷的，上半身热的要死，冬天再冷的不能盖被子。是不是上热下寒，对不对？月经没了八年，她现在 52 岁，当没有月经了，可是从 40 岁开始，发生了一些事情以后就没有月经了，所以她是不是月经逆流？在诊断上面，背后第五椎，这是我们两个肩胛骨，就是肩胛骨，前面画的是圆的，这个是后面，这个都看不清楚，也不用当医生了太差了（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师指上一次画的图，人体的正面图，这次画的是侧面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。肩胛骨下面，我们画一条线，跟督脉脊椎骨交界的地方，我们称为第七椎，那在我们这压，第一椎是大椎，往下压第五椎的地方，第五椎的地方有压痛点，这个第五椎旁外开一寸半是心俞。孙思邈的阿是穴，大家千万不要误解啊，阿是穴并不是说你背痛屁股痛哪里痛，啊啊啊是是是，然后哪里痛就扎哪里，他很多地方痛，你给他扎2、30 针，结果屁股好像刺猬一样，结果扎完起来屁股还是痛，这是不对的针灸方法。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-obggve5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-obggve5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们的阿是穴，我讲给你听，第一你在检查诊断上面的阿是穴，按到第五椎很痛，找到第五椎压痛点后以后，你跟病人说，你记得这种感觉，不要忘掉。然后每一个礼拜我帮你按一次，吃完我的药如果更痛，代表没有效，我给你换一个处方再来一个礼拜，如果再来一个礼拜吃完了还是不行，算了你也不用来找我了，赶快另请高明，我也不要耽误你的时间，赶快走。如果每个礼拜病人来你都压他，压到后来每一椎都一样不痛了，代表心脏功能恢复，不用来找我了。如果他是 34 岁得到病，42 岁来找我，那还有月经嘛，我就会说你月经来了正常了就好了，懂不懂？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hlbllzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hlbllzk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那 52 岁来找我，更年期过了，怎么办呢？对不对？也没有月经了。上面非常的燥热，当时开的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"石膏四两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这是下寒嘛，下寒都是里寒，体格那么大我们用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子五钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。在经方里面，我们使用炮附子的时候一定配伍的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，使用生附子的时候配伍的是干姜，就是秤不离砣，砣不离秤。那石膏呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"配合知母"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是上热下寒，那你处方就出现一个大寒的药，一个大热的药，这两个怎么会在一起？这是你认为的，如果把石膏当成是色白是阳药，炮附子你切开来附子打开来看，就像水梨一样里面是白的，都是阳药，这是第一个。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-m7msib4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-m7msib4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二个，石膏它的性是寒的，病人是上热下寒，那我们吃了石膏，希望病人药吃下去以后，这个石膏停在上面。炮附子在下焦去寒，石膏在上面去热。你说药有那么听话嘛？直接热服病人会吐掉，我们会跟病人说没关系啊！你这个汤要煮完以后呢，你等它冷掉了时候再喝，因为你上面热，冷的时候一喝，冷的一下去欺骗过上焦，不然你上面太热了，附子太热一下去热碰热一定会吐掉。冷服欺骗过上焦，等到药到胃里，一到胃里面，上焦就发现附子你不应该在这里面，这时来不及了，附子已经走下焦去寒了，石膏回来去上焦的热。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7li2wty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7li2wty","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以一剂下去，病人吃了一个礼拜。她说吃完你的药，我都不好意思了，因为奶水不断的出来，她说过分到什么程度，我一挤就会喷到墙壁上去，八年的奶水！她吃完这个药很奇怪，我的关节都不痛了，所以这个奶水不单单到心脏，还顺着血脉影响到全身关节都痛，红斑性狼疮就是关节痛。我心里想糟糕，我处方还没有开祛风湿关节的药，她痛就已经好了一大半，所以风湿那种关节痛，是她的副症不是她的主症。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-u88r2qp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-u88r2qp","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当你把主要的敌人歼灭了以后，附庸的敌人就没有什么作用了。所以她当时这个燥渴，我们加一些"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归二钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"失眠黄连二钱，黄芩三钱，白芍五钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，黄连阿胶汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阿胶三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，每一包一钱，分三次冲服，一般来说我就让病人九碗水煮成三碗。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dqeq067","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dqeq067","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么让九碗水煮三碗？我们在国外还发生什么情形，那个老外太太回家，先生没跟着太太来看病，太太回家以后把汤药煮完了，就把汤倒 了，把药渣吃了，后来找我，我问吃的怎样，她说很难吃，我心里想汤药很难吃，当然难吃啊对不对？我说那你感觉如何？好像没怎么变，我看下处方感觉不可能啊，对不对，我问你是怎么吃的，她就给我讲了，我说你要喝汤啊！她说原来我先生讲的是对的，当时先生跟我说医师一定是让我喝汤，不可能让我吃药渣，我还骂我先生说，你没去你怎么知道。真的是什么人都有。所以我用生附子很小心的啊，逼着她煮一个小时以上，我就不会说开个药三碗水煮成一碗，火大一点20 分钟半小时就煮完了，对不对？六碗水煮两碗，搞不好50多分钟煮完，九碗煮三碗，一个多小时，为了我的安全，也为了病人的安全，所以我开的剂量都比较多一点。我用生附的话，刚开始的时候都是二钱投石问路，二钱的生附九碗煮三碗，一碗还不到一钱，还不到 3.75 克是不是很少？而且煮一个小时怎么会出事？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-x8i344w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-x8i344w","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃下去舌头还没有麻，寒还有，那第二次就三钱四钱就上去了，那我会用了六钱七钱那么多，是从二钱三钱开始上去的，那是同一个人呐，而不是说一开始这个人来就七钱就丢下去，我也没那么大胆，还是要小心。这就是我让她九碗煮三碗的原因。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-iidv7sx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-iidv7sx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们利用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白勺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，黄连阿胶汤有白芍对不对？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白芍配合当归三钱，川穹三钱，熟地三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这就是四物汤，然后再加炒麦芽。因为她从44岁以后停经，胸腔一定还有奶水，那我开这个处方，除了把她的奶水排出来以外，最主要还要预防她会得了乳癌，所以乳癌和红斑性狼疮是息息相关的。那这个处方其它的症状你们可以做加减了，老师她那个便秘严重，一个礼拜一次，大黄三钱，那你如果是300磅就大黄五钱对不对？如果是你岳母大黄八钱，我很坏哦，其实我对岳母很好，我是故意让你记得，像生半夏忘了加生姜，这是我们的处方教学的技巧，加减你就会了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jm98b30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jm98b30","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那病人如果说：倪海厦我长期的腹痛，白芍加倍，对不对？那像我红斑性狼疮，但我腿上静脉瘤很难看，顺便给我治好可不可以？当然可以啊！白芍到一两，剂量一直增加，里面的剂量就看你当时的病人需要，病人的情形来做决定，这是第一种。然后这个案例可以看到奶水，她跟我讲的时候我旁边学生很多，那黑人很好玩，她就跟我开玩笑，她说你要不要看看我奶水可以射多远？她八年没有奶水哦，她衣服拉起来都是湿的，她说你看我衣服都湿了，你看吃了药以后效果多好，所以奶水绝对是月经，而且这个病是因为奶水逆流造成的。而奶水又居于女人胸部，胸部又离心脏最近，所以是得到红斑性狼疮的都是女人，原因就在这里。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-udkmhul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-udkmhul","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那第六椎呢我们叫做灵台穴，第六椎外开一寸半是督俞，临床上，当我们发现到病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第五椎有压痛的时候是红斑性狼疮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第六椎督俞有压痛的时候是血癌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"换句话说女人的奶水没有百分之百到子宫里面去，停留在胸部太久是乳癌。如果奶水倒流进入心脏，是红斑性狼疮。如果奶水倒流是从心脏下方直接到督脉的第六椎进去，就是血癌的成因"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zyn8wiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zyn8wiz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男人为什么会得到血癌？男人的精子排出来以后，附带产生的残渣要顺着任脉一路上去到嘴巴变成胡子，所以男人每天要刮胡子。这个是心脏在控制，心脏力量有问题的时候，这个残渣就没有办法到嘴巴上变成胡子，而是从心脏的下方进入第六椎，这就是男人得到血癌的原因。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小孩子5、6 岁的血癌呢，是来自小儿麻痹的疫苗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，小儿麻痹的疫苗现在所有的数据来看，西医会说中医没有数据，西医最有数据。我告诉你其实是西医隐藏的数据都不说，实际上数据都都在州政府里面，滨州从开始实施打小儿麻痹疫苗到现在，每年小儿麻痹得病的人数持续在增加，从十年前的十七人增加到现在的二百五十几人，也就是说从实际上的数据来看，小儿麻痹根本就没有办法预防小孩子得到小儿麻痹。所有的小孩子五岁到六岁得了脑瘤，得了血癌，就是来自对小儿麻痹疫苗的过敏。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nfcqqc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nfcqqc6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"血癌用生附子的速度20240428_092233"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/血癌用生附子的速度20240428_092233-20240428092301-wyt4716.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4qp965f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4qp965f","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小孩子得到血癌，我们用小建中汤加生附子，就可以治好它"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。成人的血癌我们必须要用到生附子，不用生附子的处方的时候，白血球的下降是这样子下来的，一加生附子下去，砰砰就下来了。西医看到病人好的这么快，他以为病人吃了什么仙丹呢。我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"会用到生附子就是病人出现四逆症，手脚冰冷，舌头是白的，这就是四逆证"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们会用到生附子。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生附子在使用的时候，记得一定配合干姜在用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，同时呢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"像脉微细，脉非常细小，手脚冰冷，这些都是四逆汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那像这种病，我就用的很多。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-uqh09ox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-uqh09ox","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我曾经碰到一个男的，他是乳癌，就是喝牛奶太多了，喝牛奶太多得了乳癌。然后开完刀以后移转，变成淋巴癌同时又变成血癌。淋巴癌就是奶水进入淋巴系统，男人的精子残渣进入淋巴系统造成淋巴癌。所以有七种癌症处方是非常雷同的，因为病的来源都是一样。西医不知道病源，你不知道没关系。当我们中医讲病源的时候，你如果是科学家，什么叫科学？科学就是假设、然后经过验证，然后再看结果。所以富兰克林是科学家，他假设有电存在，他再去验证，他在这个暴风雨雷电的时候放风筝嘛，邻居说这个小孩子神经病，你看现在在打雷闪电他竟然在放风筝，结果他验证的确有电存在，所以没有富兰克林我们没有灯啊，他是科学家，他的这个行为就叫做科学。所以科学是不存在的，它只是一个公式（假设→验证→结果），而你西医是个科技，什么都要仪器，那你今天你不知道病因，你假设中医是对的，去验证看看，然后看看结果，谁治好病谁就是对的，这叫做科学，科学证据，这样了解我意思吧？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-e9k04ke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-e9k04ke","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你西医说中医不科学，你西医是科学，那你根本不懂什么叫科学。我假设你西医是对的，验证的结果每一个都死掉了，血癌治疗没有一个活的，对不对？那你为什么不假设我是对的？你说你是对的，我也假设你是对的，你也应该假设我是对的去验证。那经过我的理论治疗后，男性成人吃了我的药以后就开始每天刮胡子，那有一天病人告诉我，老师我以前都每天都刮胡子，最近都不用刮胡子，你懂不懂我意思？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ou8cuj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ou8cuj2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"西医的话就说啊，你可能男性荷尔蒙比较低一点，我给你吃一点男性荷尔蒙，哪那么简单呢？这个中医和西医的差异很大。所以说你们要先假设我们是对的，要跟西医这样讲。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ehm5l99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ehm5l99","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以西医每次碰到我，他就无话可说。那当你在督俞找到压痛点，我们知道是血癌。在临床上，刚刚我讲的那个60岁的先生呢，他血癌是乳癌移转，我就当着学生面，我说你这个男人得到乳癌就是个大笑话，历史大笑话，因为我非要这样讲，他才会断掉奶。这个人从小到大60年来就没有断过奶，所以我就跟他说，这个是大笑话，笑死人了，全中国人都会笑你，他就低下头从此不敢喝牛奶了 。如果好好跟他说千万不要喝牛奶，这个不好对身体有害，他还是照喝。我说你在闹大笑话，大家都在笑你，男人竟然得到乳癌，懂不懂我意思？就是在吃女性荷尔蒙嘛，就我刚刚回头一句话，你问世界上所有的西医女性荷尔蒙的副作用是什么，就是乳癌嘛。所以当你遇到第六椎开始痛的时候，这个也是归到心脏在管，所以你要把心脏力量的加强。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b8oiki9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b8oiki9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如说这个病人来，说倪先生我常年手脚冰冷，大便有点便秘，每天有排不净感觉，你一摸脉微细，当归四逆汤症，你就可以从当归四逆汤症开始加减进去。我刚刚讲到的那个60岁老先生，他那个乳癌、血癌手脚是温热的，脉都是洪大的，完全没有一点寒相，我就故意试看看，第一个礼拜我不丢生附，结果白血球数值没怎么动。第二个礼拜呢，一丢生附下去，白血球从60掉到38，砰砰就下来了，生附子才用了两钱，这个体格很大，而且手脚是温热的，牛奶吃太多了嘛，太燥热，他是太过，过尤不及，太过太营养了，什么维他命他都吃。被我臭骂了，我说你从现在开始，只准吃中国菜，您这个体格这么胖，你到国外看看，美国餐厅里都是胖子，在中国餐厅都是瘦子，我们这里找不到胖子代表我们食物是对的，不用去马路上吃，那边都是胖子在那里吃的东西都是不能吃的，可乐啊什么汉堡都不能吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cpej87q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cpej87q","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那他这个病例呢，就是没有四逆汤症，那我生附子丢二钱下去数值就下来了。下次他再把我惹毛，丢三钱下去，他常常故意挑我，治好了还说：看起来可能是吃中药的结果。什么叫做可能是吃中药的结果？什么叫做maybe？是absolutely（绝对的）！我学生就讲：好爽，老师骂的好爽。我用中文跟我学生说：钱可以不赚，中国人的节气一定要有。明明中药是好的，他还在讲西药，就臭骂他，我骂了他他还是要找我，因为他知道全世界只有我能救他，连他的西医看了验血报告，都跳起来跟他说，你继续吃中药不要停，因为你的报告的结果比做化验都要好，没有任何医生可以做到，继续吃倪海厦的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a93ovs8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a93ovs8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，我们休息一下！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7danrha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7danrha","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们继续刚刚前面讲的，当我们遇到血癌病人的时候，我一再跟大家提醒，血癌、乳癌、红斑性狼疮跟我们的心脏很有关系，所以有几大症状要注意，第一个失眠，第二个手脚冷，第三个心痛胸痛，第四个大便不规则，大便有时候便秘，有时候下利，不是很规则的现象。我们眼睛看到的是血癌，但手上动作要把它变成心脏去解决，血癌就好了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小孩子的血癌快到两个礼拜就好了，成人的血癌有时候快到一个月就好了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。西医治疗血癌除了换骨髓以外，你以为换骨髓很好，你就换啊！换完我再治疗就差很多了，还有就是做化疗，想要把白血球杀掉，可是你不知道病因，白血球会持续的增加，白血球为什么会长这么快？因为督脉里面，我们的骨髓，我们的奇桓之腑收到不应该收到的营养，所以它才会快速的成长。一个东西长起来一定要有营养，这花开起来一定有营养，没有营养花怎么开，对不对？所以督脉得到不正常的营养，就是月经的奶水逆流到督脉去，还有男人精子的残渣，逆流到督脉里面去，这就是男人还有女子都会得到血癌的原因。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6565sud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6565sud","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们以第六椎为主，当你以第六椎为主，在病人初诊的时候有压痛，你就让病人记得这种压痛感，每个礼拜来复诊就重复压的动作，压到哪天每一椎痛都一样就结束了，你就好了。同样的，每个礼拜来压，越压越痛越压越痛就代表没有好。光是这个诊断的方式，西医就瞒不了你。好啊，你去做骨髓移植，做之前我压一下，做完后我压一下还是痛，过两个礼拜再压更痛，就根本没有好。那你做化疗，可以呀，你做啊，做完一次我压压看，还是痛啊！更痛，越压越痛。因为你无论怎么样的治疗方式，最大的治不好的症结所在，就是你不知道血癌怎么来的，你不知道血癌怎么来，你如何防堵它，怎么去治愈他，不可能治愈的，就算是现在短暂时间好了，一段时间又来了，因为环境并没有改变，病的因你没有去掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1jymboe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1jymboe","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我非常反对感冒吃抗生素啊，有疼痛啊用针灸就好了，为什么要吃止痛药？这些动作都会伤到心脏，那你说失眠很简单，我们就开安眠药，你错了，你以为安眠药下去有效，安眠药下去了，形睡了神没有睡，所以起来梦游啊！吃了安眠药的后遗症就是梦游啊。我们在美国还看见梦游开车的，吃了两颗Ambien（安必恩），美国失眠用的最多就是安必恩，吃了两颗之后在高速公路上开车，警察就看到车在飘啊，警车就过去把他拦下来，拦下来后就发现病人还在睡觉，就是梦游啊！查他出门前吃了两颗安眠药，那个多可怕啊。光是一个失眠的问题，你以为吃安眠药就解决了，你把医学当做那么简单的动作在处理，害死人！既然你这个医学是害人的，那我为什么不攻击你？当然要攻击你，因为失眠是可以治疗的，可以治愈好，那你要把失眠治好，真的是把失眠治好才行。我们有栀子豉汤，酸枣仁汤，我们有心烦不得眠的酸枣仁汤，心血不足的黄连阿胶汤，非常多的可以治疗失眠的药，绝对不要去吃安眠药。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b8e5ovv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b8e5ovv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果吃了药还是睡不着，你可能是阳气过剩，年轻嘛阳气过剩，你可以看点书啊，看看我们的黄帝内经呢，伤寒金匮啊，多看看嘛，看得比我熟更好，对不对？那打坐啊都可以，那有时候晚上睡觉的时候很多人都是会心态影响，暗示自己会失眠睡不好，开始就有这个压力了，让自己睡不好。然后告诉自己好爽啊，睡不好我太多时间，晚上没人吵我可以多看点书，你把它当成享受以后慢慢慢慢就好了，非常多的方式，但是一定要去注意它。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qylxb11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qylxb11","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同样的我们可以从这个症状反过来，病人不管是血癌，还是红斑性狼疮，他来的时候，我们就可以问这个，吃了你的药倪医师我非常好睡。第二个吃了你的药以后，以前手脚冷的现在都变热了。第三个，原来胸闷痛的现象都去掉了。第四个，原来不规则的大便，现在每天很规则，早上起来就跑去上厕所。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3xopj6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3xopj6v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一个就是诸位一定要会的，这个才能真正根本治疗他的病，就是心脏结构性的问题，心脏结构出现问题。心脏本身是君主之官，本来不受病的，那为什么现在会有二尖瓣、三尖瓣闭锁不全，为什么会有这些问题？就是吃西药吃太多，吃止痛药造成的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-78k97on","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-78k97on","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我现在举一个例子，比如说我们现在拿个杯子，那个塑料盒上面有个盖子，这个盖子跟它吻合，所以盖的很牢的对不对？那如果环境没有改变，你盖100年还是可以盖得住的， 因为环境没有改变。有一天呢，下面的心脏的那个盒子受到压力挤压变成椭圆形了，盖子还是一样的形状，结果盖上去对不上。西医没有看到心脏下面有压力，有很多湿停在心包心脏中间，那你盖子不合啊，那你瓣膜闭锁不全，他就给你拿掉一个，换一个猪瓣膜换了上去，那你变成猪心不讲，结果你碰到我，我不晓得你换过心，把你治就好了，心脏下面周围回来了，瓣膜又不合了，那你说你找西医把原来瓣膜还我，他说对不起，手术不可逆的，你说你是不是很可怜，那是猪的心嘛，所以开完刀不要找我治，那你找别人去。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-s57oq9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-s57oq9v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你说我们怎么知道他这个瓣膜闭锁不全？肩痛，因为心脏的血第一个冲上来，那你瓣膜不全的话，你血冲上来的量不一样，量很大，那时候你在高空飞行或者坐长途坐车回来以后，肩膀会非常酸痛，第一个就想下车找人按摩，按摩肩膀很舒服，这时候心脏就已经有问题了。那个血的进出量不是很正常，睡眠品质就不会很好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-owv6lgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-owv6lgy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那基于这种条件之下，我们就回头看看我们的经方，在胸痹并脉症里面，我们有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓜蒌实，枳实，薤白"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有动悸的时候加桂枝、炙甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。在经方里面，只要有心动悸的现象都要重用桂枝，我一再跟大家讲"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"辛甘发散为阳，动悸是心阳不足"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这时候我们要用桂枝加强它心喷出去的力量。桂枝跟生附子的差异在哪里？临床上面看得很清楚，心脏挤压，喷射那个血出去的时候力量不够，就要靠桂枝，像手冷，手指头冷，但脚是热的，就要重用桂枝，所以我们的桂枝加桂汤来治疗奔豚。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-c0y88ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-c0y88ez","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昨天跟大家介绍阳明的腑实，大肠的沼气顺着血液回到心脏，那这个宿便的沼气要侵到心脏，心脏就加强喷射的力量，想把浊气逼出去就一直在顶它，两者互相抗衡就形成动悸，这个时候要加桂，加重桂枝下去，你没有肉桂，把桂枝加重一点也可以啊！所以说桂枝汤里桂枝三钱白芍三钱，没有肉桂老师我桂枝加到八钱，可以啊，一样，可以取代肉桂，因为是同一个药药性嘛。有时候我们要加重白芍，所以有小建中汤，我们的腹痛，没有胃口，就是这样来的，所以随时要加减。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fz3o5cs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fz3o5cs","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那为什么要这三个药（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓜蒌实，枳实，薤白"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），这个栝蒌实长得极像心脏瓣膜，心脏的心室，心房心室，这个栝蒌实很大一个，颜色是白的，枳实很小一个，颜色是咖啡色，小桔子一样，一片片的小桔子。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这两个药要用在同一个地方，一个是阴一个是阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，阴我讲过，看的到都是阴，看不到的就是阳，所以心室的修补、瓣膜的修补，要靠这个枳实，所以枳实是很重要，为什么？颜色是深的，深色的是阴，要去修补它的内脏，内脏有问题，结构有问题的时候，我们就要用颜色比较深的药。心脏的气，心脏的活力要靠栝蒌实。所以说我们在枳实用的时候，很多地方大承气、小承气，我们会用到枳实，大柴胡汤用到枳实，就是加强他心脏的力量。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vupqsmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vupqsmo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那心脏的心气不足，我们要用栝蒌实，栝蒌实颜色比较白是阳，这个时候并不需要用到生附子，生附子是心脏力量快没了，生附子下去强心脏力量，摩擦会生热，所以手脚逆冷，手冷到手肘，脚冷到膝盖的时候用生附子。那你说老师还没有冷上大腿，错了，那已经到极限了，那不得了啊，到大腿就完了，那个已经买单了哦。到膝盖是极限。所以冷上来赶快给他生附子，那个生附力量很大，那个病人气都没了，一点汤药都到嘴巴里顺着下去，心脏就开始跳，心热就回来了，新的阳一回来血马上就冲到四肢上去，所以心脏摩擦力不够的时候，要靠生附子，心脏喷射力量不够的时候我们要靠桂枝。这两个是不一样的东西，不一样的东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mimi1rh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mimi1rh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这三味药组成是非常有名的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗胸痞，心痛彻背，背痛彻心"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的药。我们有经方里面有两个地方在治疗心痛彻背，背痛彻心，一个是乌头赤石脂丸，这个在金匮里面治疗心痛彻背，背痛彻心。这个（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓜蒌实，枳实，薤白"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）也是治疗心痛彻背，背痛彻心，这两个不一样。这个心痛彻背，背痛彻心（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师指瓜蒌实，枳实，薤白"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），病人会感觉到真的是前胸痛在后面，后面痛到前面，是整块的痛，区块比较大。这个痛不是（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师指乌头赤石脂丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），像箭一样射过去，射到你心脏里面去，尖锐的直接穿到后面去，过一下就没有了，过一下你身体姿势一改变，又从后面射回来，你说谁射我，这就是乌头赤石脂丸症。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4hzg0ol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4hzg0ol","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们研究乌头赤石脂丸的时候就发现一个问题了，这个古人没有纸张，竹简刻上去比较麻烦嘛，所以字尽量写得少，但现在我们有纸有电脑打字很多都无所谓，所以张仲景那个时候字写得很少，对不对？那可能交给他的徒弟，那徒弟抱着竹简出门，门槛很高嘛，这个门槛很高不好，徒弟走过门口一摔倒，整个竹简散开来，糟糕怕师傅骂，在整理的时候弄错了，应该是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乌梅赤石脂丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你们看原方的时候，是乌头跟附子用在同一个方子了，这个不需要的，我们生附和炮附子已经用到同一个方子里，那么强了，乌头跟炮附子没有必要用到同一个方，应该是乌梅，因为乌梅是酸味的药，酸收，能够让血收回到心脏里面去，回来的速度很快。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ww4rkjw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ww4rkjw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个心痛彻背，背痛彻心是我们有横膈膜，有纵隔膜，这个痰饮在纵膈膜上面，所以它只会在中间的地方移动，所以说痰饮一动的时候，刷的像是一条线这样穿过去，刺痛一下，有时从后面射过来，这个痰饮一定要靠乌梅。结果我们把原方改成乌梅做成丸剂的时候，一剂知二剂已，吃下去痛就去掉了。再吃第二剂就好了。可是吃乌头赤石脂丸的话就没有这个效果，原方是乌梅，我们改过来。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ao3amqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ao3amqu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那心气的心痛彻背，背痛彻心，我刚才介绍过是整块的痛，痛起来很难过，锥心痛痛到后面去，那你用栝蒌实把心气打通，枳实调整他心脏的结构，就不会有瓣膜闭锁不全，这个非要靠枳实不可，为什么要用薤白？把薤白拿起来闻居然是大蒜的味道，颜色是白的，那这个色白入肺，辛辣的入肺，所以我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗心脏一定要同时去治肺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治肝先实脾，治心要去实肺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，依此类推，所以这个处方非常的好用，几乎是一剂知二剂已。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qkv2202","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qkv2202","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那老师你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"怎么知道瓣膜闭锁不全好了呢？第一个，长途旅行以后，肩膀不用按摩了，第二个睡眠的品质非常好，第三个手脚都不冷，温热回来了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"就已经结束了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以有非常多的资料，证据，身上出现的症状可以证明病人在恢复中。所以当你知道如何治疗心脏，一般处方我们的剂量呢，栝蒌实五钱，枳实三钱，薤白三钱。当我们使用这个处方的时候，病人遇到是红斑性狼疮，你就加一些治上热下寒的石膏、知母。如果她没有上热下寒，只是关节痛的很厉害，你一发现他没有手脚冰冷，就是关节痛的很厉害，因为每个人来看病的时期不一样，这个时候你可以用我们昨天讲的桂枝芍药知母汤，关节痛嘛，手脚关节痛，或者甘草附子汤中加减，把这个痛去掉，你就治疗就好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zq6ctqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zq6ctqj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那大夫啊，我已经很长一段时间月经都不顺，怎么吃了你的药以后胸部很胀，你就对她笑一笑太好了，涨几天了，涨三天了，再吃，满七天她月经开始来，月经来的时候你就可以换处方了，你就跟病人说，你月经来的时候再来找我，我给你另外一个处方吃，懂不懂？所以你同样处方你可以加四物汤加炒麦芽，把奶水排下去。治疗方法，几乎跟乳癌是相同的，但是红斑性狼疮也好，血癌呢也是这样治疗，一样的方式。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b6rqz25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b6rqz25","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说我们每一个方剂要了解它应用以外，每一个药的药性要了解，药物的加减上面，剂量上面你就不会出错。所以常常会出现今天开了 5 个人都是桂枝汤，第一个是桂枝加桂汤，桂枝用到六钱，白芍三钱。第二个是桂枝三钱，白芍六钱。第三个桂枝可能二钱，白芍是八钱，每个人都不一样，结果看的都是桂枝汤，剂量都不一样，这样子它的药力药物会达到身体不同的地方，我们就取得不同的效果在里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rkclifz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rkclifz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有如果这个病人月经不顺，甚至于停经了，月经没有了不代表你没有奶水哦，更年期到了，下焦枯萎了，因为50岁了，我们男人也比较差了。像我 50 岁以后我记得很清楚，一直到现在，我从以前年轻的时候一餐可以吃三碗饭啊，到现在一餐一碗饭一点点就撑了，饭量吃不过年轻的时候。所以你们赶快学去哦，这个时日不多了，赶快好好学，把经验要学去。那当这个月经停了，子宫萎缩了，没有月经了，胸部还是有奶水，你还是要把心脏固得很好。所以如果您的太太您的爱人将来更年期到了，请先生要更疼爱太太，她在这时候情绪会不好，因为她会反复的，这会高兴下一会就会骂你，情绪变化很快，你要多容忍啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-925qo0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-925qo0t","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我遇到这种情形呢，我就会找个角落躲起来，那不能出去，出去更坏，结果回来更坏，找个角落躲起来，不要看到就好了，容忍一下就过去，不要刺激太太，更年期情绪不稳嘛。那这个时候你可以用这个温经汤，年五十用温经汤的加减，经方里本来就有了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qpf2rnl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qpf2rnl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们常常讲一句话，女人没有月经了以后，我宁可你下利也不可以便秘。因为没有月经了，里面奶水没地方排了，但是肺跟大肠是不是相表里？所以奶水是来自肺，这时候大肠一点定要比较通，所以你平常，50岁停经之前，每天有一次大便的话。停经以后希望你每天有两次大便，绝对不可以便秘，这样奶水有地方宣泄掉。如果你是便秘然后又很气，孩子让你忧郁，孙子让你忧郁或怎么样，忧伤肺，这个时候病人会出现第三椎痛，第三椎出现压痛，然后半夜三点到五点没有办法入眠。这就是妇女一辈子不抽烟，结果到老年以后得了肺癌的原因。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6ra4o8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6ra4o8x","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"西医呢根本不知道这个，就说这个是抽油烟机造成的，她没有抽烟就说抽油烟机造成的肺癌，你一直在胡说八道，你不讲我还不怪你，讲了我更要骂你。先生我在美国临床20几年，美国人做菜不需要抽油烟机的，根本不用炒的，他烤的话就到外面去烤，室内都是都做生菜沙拉烤面包，哪有什么油烟呢？美国太太得了肺癌非常多，六七十岁得了肺癌，死在肺癌，一辈子不抽烟得了肺癌死的人很多，什么抽油烟机，你在骗谁嘛？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-de62phk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-de62phk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更年期以后，奶水还在生长，结果便秘造成奶水逆流到肺里面去，这就是原因。诊断在第三椎，如果你压第三椎压痛，病人会哇，第三椎外开一寸半是肺俞，同时三点到五点是寅时，肺开寅时，肺气流注的时间是三点到五点。那当中年以后的太太没有月经了以后，开始每天晚上三点钟起来，五点钟以后才能入睡，我们就可以预测，您将来一年以后一定会得到肺癌，现在就开始动手，上工治未病。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pdj3ujn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pdj3ujn","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般来说，等到西医查到肺癌的时候，太太来找你的时候，说倪医师帮帮我，我现在被西医检测到肺癌，你就可以问他，太太您过去一年的时候，晚上三点到五点可不可以睡？不能睡，你怎么知道，你好厉害啊！你怎么知道我不能睡觉？从三点到五点不能入睡，就已经知道了。那太太背过来一压第三椎，很痛，然后你说记得这个痛感，我帮你治疗以后每个礼拜帮你按。每个礼拜回来，你越按越痛，就代表你恶化了，恶化了还要找我，怎么那么笨呢？赶快换个医生。所以自己也可以知道，医生也可以知道病情是进步了还是退步了，马上就可以知道，瞒不过身体啊。好，那你要给西药厂来说，说你进步还是退步，你会被他骗，他绝对不跟你讲实话，最会骗人就是西药厂，没有一句话是实话。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6xbb0u3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6xbb0u3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这时开始动手，肺癌的话我们，治肺一定去平肝，因为金会克木，是我们治肝先要实脾，治肺先要疏肝。所以肺癌的处方我们的开法一般是这样子，我们还是会需要这个（栝蒌实、枳实、薤白），因为根本来源于心脏。我最常用的治肝的药，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡三钱，黄芩二钱，郁金五钱，龙胆草三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，用于疏肝。黄帝内经里提到木要疏，要把树木剪一剪，不然长的太茂密，那个蔓藤类根茎类的那种植物把树包满了，树不能呼吸就死掉了，所以木要疏。这个时候呢，我们要把像疏肝的药开在里面，就是肝气要疏哦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝里面的血要攻它的时候，讲明白点，就是我们治疗肝硬化肝癌的时候，我会用到两味药茜草，跟炙鳖甲"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。茜草这个药是出自黄帝内经，它也叫做鹿衔草，鹿含在嘴巴上面的鹿衔草。茜草是活血化瘀攻坚的药，茜草攻坚的力量，包括妇科、肚子痛，女人月经有淤血块在子宫里面，茜草下去痛就去掉了，那你如果茜草配合白芍那痛就去的很快。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-y01pezz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-y01pezz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你说老师如果茜草我再配合炮附子呢？那你就学到经方了，因为寒才会累积淤血在里面。你用白芍跟茜草只是活血化瘀，会临时的止痛，永远要让这个痛不回来，你非得要靠炮附子，为什么？因为它能热起来，热起来以后就好像广西这边的河水流得很好，现在北方的河水已经结冰了，为什么会结冰、会有淤血块？就是寒造成。所以炮附子下去，从此不会有淤血块在腹腔里面，所以要真正的根治你要加炮附子。所以如果你知道我是要赚钱，看这个小姐人又美又有钱，想每个月都看到她，我就不要开炮附子，就开白芍跟茜草。她就说倪海厦你真厉害，每个月来月经吃你的药就不痛了，可是不吃你的药就会痛，所以每个月都要来，又可以赚钱又可以看她。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1rmt148","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1rmt148","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种人坏啊！我们炮附子一下去从此不用看到了。我常常跟我病人说，你每个月都在看我代表我不是好医生，我把你治好，常常来拜访我，你作为好朋友来拜访我，才是好医生。这是疏肝的六味药，那在疏肝的时候不需要这两味药（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茜草、炙鳖甲"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），我们不会觉得是肝癌，四味药就够了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7x0lumv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7x0lumv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治肺的时候，我们先要治肝，原因在哪里？就是你治肺的药还没开，你光是开疏肝的药一开的时候，肺就已经停止恶化了，就好像我们治肝的时候，还没有开入肝的药，我先开始实脾，实脾的话我们开实脾饮啊，开一些淡味渗利的药，你不要开小建中汤。当你把脾脏保护住以后，肝就已经不会恶化，什么叫不会恶化？定义就是现在你没死啊，你到我面前，我再帮你治疗，现在你肝病到这种程度，那你再吃我开的实脾饮啊，淡味渗利的药，你肝并没有恶化，那现在没死，十年后还是这样，二十年、一百年后还是这个样子，这就是没有死啊，这就是定义。人会死就是现在开始到你手上的时候，病还在继续恶化就死掉了，这样了解我意思吧？那现在还活着来看你啊，代表现在这个程度他还不会死。对不对？那你还要去做什么检查？现在都知道啦，马上就可以知道，这样子知道我意思吧？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dh2yn6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dh2yn6o","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最近内湖有一个...我的一个学生是出家人，她是中医学的博士，她在内湖三军总医院，我们台湾有个三军总医院在内湖，他们有个计划就是专门做肺癌的标靶药物，她就是这个委员会的委员，专门监督。她就说老师我跟你讲一件事，这个肺癌的标靶药物易瑞沙什么的，我们的病人吃了一年以后全部死掉，只有唯一一个人存活下来，为什么那个人活了？因为那个人服用两三次后受不了了，副作用太大，恶心呕吐啊，后来经过评估他不适合就把他踢出去了，结果他活下来，其他统统死掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-z2vq8bp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-z2vq8bp","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个数据告诉你们，病人不是死在肺癌，是死在药物上面。所以西医如果把真实的数据拿出来，就通通证明他的药是害人的，病人是死在西药上面。所以我消息很多，各行各业各个角落都有我的眼线在里面。老师我告诉你，她是对的，然后她讲完就很兴奋的又跑回去了，然后她是个小尼姑，很可爱哦（笑）。这些我都会写入地纪啊，因为地纪我把它写的像武侠小说，像诸位啊我都会写进去哦，你小心点哦，刘教授都写进去，你到时一看，这是他。那广西南宁，以前叫雍州，谁被流放在这里南蛮之地诸如此类的，我都写上去。所以，你们帮我倒茶的时候都要小心哦，这个样子我都记起来，写的时候这个比较好玩，大家都会看的很开心，在开开心心的看地纪的时候，天文地理医学统统写进去，这就是地纪。把整个阴阳术数，就像我昨天讲的阳宅，统统写进去，那五运六气里面，那我们算节气的时候，24个节气对不对？春分啊夏至啊，这个被我写成武功的招数，这一招叫做夏至，所以这一招施展起来了时候，会有什么感觉，那就是夏至的节气，这样了解我的意思吧？所以后代我们不要去看什么黄历啊，就看地纪，哦，这一招就是夏至，这一招就是夏至，我们不要创造什么飞龙在天啊、亢龙有悔啊，不需要。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pt9gch8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pt9gch8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在处方时候，当我们处方这四味药（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡黄芩郁金龙胆草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），那我们开入肺的，在难经里面，他说他以治肝为主， 治肝的时候我们要泻南补北，这是难经里面的原文泻南补北，所以肝脏在这边的时候，它的南方是心火，北方是肾脏，所以治疗肝脏我们要泻南方的心火，补北方的肾水，这就是治肝的原则。然后他后面就不写了，后面写依次类推，因为竹简嘛，不好刻字，就以此类推就结束了。那我们现在要治肺，泻南补北是不是泻肾补脾？脾是甘味的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-i5f5u80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-i5f5u80","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在看黄芪，黄芪本身颜色就是黄的，它补气，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白术、茯苓祛湿，脾主湿，身上的湿，我们茯苓白术两个加在一起可以健胃整脾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，意思就在这里，所以靠白术茯苓把湿排到小便外面，把小便排出来，还有炙甘草，像这些药，你自然而然就开出来了啊，这是补脾补北，泻南泻肾，我们要把小便利出来，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"泽泻三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"， 茯苓有了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"猪苓三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那我们再泻肾的同时呢，我们可以稍微加补骨脂三钱。那病人血癌血不够，我们补点"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"熟地三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一些滋补他的药，同时泻的药要增加。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gptlaxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gptlaxi","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240428153540-rmislso.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fgqcjdi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fgqcjdi","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们在泻肾的时候一定要注意顺便查查病人的脚踝裸，脚踝裸呢，我画个就是右脚的内侧，右足内侧，这边是踝裸的关节，后面这么穴道我们叫做太溪，对不对？大家都耳熟能详，这个太溪穴，画个肾在这边，你手在这边按，或是拿着不是很尖的探针，太尖戳他每个地方都会痛啊，就拿个平头的探针按他，就会找到压痛点，这个地方有压痛点，就知道她有肾结石。因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你要泻肾的时候，要确定肾脏里面没有任何东西阻碍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们可以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"滑石三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，猪苓汤的时候把滑石、阿胶拿出来，泽泻茯苓猪苓，滑石为什么要加阿胶？因为滑石能把石头打散掉，然后让石头排出来，但是打散的石头表面上非常的锋利会把尿道割破，所以小便出来会很痛，会带血，而阿胶下去可以把血止住同时把伤口收复，所以滑石跟阿胶放在一起，排出来的石头不但细碎，而且排出来不会见血，中医是不是很厉害？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"泽泻、茯苓、猪苓放在一起的时候，大量的水从胸腔上下来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一般来说肚脐以下的积水，我们就排水就用猪苓，肚脐到中隔的地方用茯苓，上焦的地方一直到下焦我们用泽泻。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a6t8sy2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a6t8sy2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以这三味药（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"泽泻、茯苓、猪苓"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）处方我们会放在一起用，这些加在一起后（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"泽泻、猪苓、补骨脂、熟地、滑石"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），我们跟泻南补北的药（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩、白术、茯苓、炙甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）加在一起，还有疏肝的药（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡、黄芩、郁金、龙胆草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"就是最好的治疗肺癌的药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ls37ge4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ls37ge4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果产生阴阳相隔的时候，到你手上病人已经开始肺痛，非常痛，然后上面是热的，下面还会是寒。肺开始有痛的时候，我们要加紫参，金匮里面的紫参汤，是紫参、甘草两味药，最主要的就是这个紫参。紫参大陆不容易找到，我到亳州去，好不容易找到了，也是运气好，我到亳州药市去。我就想找这个紫参呐，市面上一直没有紫参，结果药市一楼进去看，到处都是紫河车，到处是蜈蚣啊，你们去过亳州就知道我在讲什么，我都把它写进地纪里面，让你一看就知道我去过。结果找了半天找不到，就在门口吃了一碗面，那边好多药商啊，肚子饿我就吃了一碗面，吃完之后就去2楼看看，走到2楼去看到都开始收摊了。竟然一两点就开始收摊了，我以为他五六点才收摊，一两点就要收摊很快哦，我都来不及看，我就到处问就问，结果问到角落里一个男的。我问他你有没有紫参，他说有啊我都有啊，我知道紫参，我拿给你看，等一下。然后他就把那个塑料袋打开来，然后自己挖，挖了半天拿了个塑料袋出来，他那个塑料袋是泥巴灰的塑料袋，倒出来给我看，紫色的，切成一片一片的。我说那你电话给我，到时有需要我要找你进货，他说你要多少都可以拿给你，然后他电话我就抄下来了。然后我就把紫参带回旅馆去，洗干净泡水里面，热水一泡就变成紫色的，有点粘稠稠的，我就知道就是紫参，正品紫参。后来我就跟他买了很多。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zughdcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zughdcz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在台北、台湾、美国的时候，用到肺癌的病人身上效果非常好，一剂下去肺痛的现象就没有了。那个痛是阴实挡到了的痛，阴实挡到了后那个阴阳要分离，整个把阴实打开来，这就是紫参！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-oiefjgc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-oiefjgc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那由于我是川油公司的顾问嘛，我就把药商的电话给孙鸿，那以后你们跟他买，或者你们自己要，我给刘老师。说来那个人还骗我，我说你这个产地在哪里，他说甘肃来的，他想我跑到甘肃去找，其实我后来查出来是江苏来的。一东一西嘛，他说你到甘肃去买，意思就是跟他买嘛，不然你怎么办对不对？好，这是正紫参。那紫参汤的原方已经掉了，经方里掉了很多，藜芦甘草汤、杏子汤也掉了，紫参汤原方没了，我们只要用这紫参就好了，配合到其它方子里面，这就是治疗肺癌的处方。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-llwwbbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-llwwbbo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那老师"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你怎么知道他好了？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很简单嘛，第一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"晚上一觉到天亮，三点到五点可以睡觉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，第二个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺不痛了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，第三个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第三堆压痛没了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，对不对？因为你诊断正确啊！你当然可以马上判断出来他到底是进步还是退步。那你说老师，我要去吃肺癌的标靶药物，我要去试试，医生跟我说要吃一年才知道有没有效。那医生骗人，吃一个礼拜就知道，知道我意思不？吃一个礼拜就知道啦，为什么要吃一年？他就把你抓到了嘛。你只要看他每个礼拜第三椎压了痛不痛，还是痛或者越来越痛代表根本没有效，还要什么吃一年，一年就死掉了，意思就是吃到你死。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wp5zbmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wp5zbmf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"医院里面很坏啊，进去不管你三七二十一直接给你注射点滴就怕你跑掉嘛，因为你跑不掉，大不了拿着点滴瓶从病床跑去厕所去上个厕所，回来又在那边。这个方法把病人抓在里面，医院病人很多嘛，来个病人我们都要把他抓住，所以每个人都上点滴，然后医生再慢慢去看，看他这个人的时候，他就说医生我已经上了三天的点滴了，他就是不让你跑。上点滴又怎么样？又不是特效药，这个都不对的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-w6etabc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-w6etabc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说，当阴实出现的时候，病人出现寒热的现象，那个热并不是发高烧，而是低烧。上面是阳不入阴的现象，阳在上面结果上面很热，下面非常冷，中间是分隔掉的，这种现象。盗汗的现象严重，阳不入阴嘛，阳就是阳气，就是水气，结果水气都往外散，病人盗汗的现象就会严重，这都是阳不入阴的症状。所以癌症的病人几乎百分之百，不管是什么癌症，都会有盗汗的现象。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-c5g5qad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-c5g5qad","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那有一天很不幸，给西医开刀，本来在阳明经乳中穴位置有乳癌，然后开掉了，那西医没有经络的概念，乳头下方是直接络到肝脏去的，那你开掉以后，乳癌没地方跑了，就顺着肝的经络跑到肝脏，变成肝癌。反过来，奶水如果逆流跑到肝脏里面去，或者男人的精子的残渣进入肝脏，过多的毒素累积在肝脏里面，这些都是造成肝癌的原因。所以我们中医治肝先治大肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kfkjhp4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kfkjhp4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清朝末年民国初年的时候，四川出了一个唐荣川，这个人是经方大师，非常厉害，他就提到治肝必治大肠，说治肝一定要治大肠，要保持大便的通畅。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-aixfun8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-aixfun8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240429112606-ji1v07j.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rbf08qs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rbf08qs","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝脏是这样子，我简单的画一下，大肠在下面，当你治得不让大肠便秘，让大便通畅的时候。肝部的压力就会减轻，血液就有疏散的地方，压力会减少。所以你治肝...我们刚刚了解了，我们治肝先要实脾，我前面跟大家讲，当你一实脾的时候，肝病、肝癌就不会恶化。临床上面看，病人呢在吃我们的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡、黄芩、郁金、龙胆草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的时候，他B肝的指标都下来的很快，但是如果肝病毒很强的时候，这些指数都很好，但在里面病毒活跃很强，像这种一样，病人会睡觉睡不好，晚上一点到三点失眠，这个时候我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"加了茜草，加了炙鳖甲"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下去以后，指标就降的非常的低，几乎侦测不到，等于没有病毒了。所以刚刚讲的六味药（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡、黄芩、郁金、龙胆草、茜草、炙鳖甲"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），不单单是可以治疗肝癌的主力处方，肝硬化的主力处方，甚而至于是肝炎的主力处方也会用得到。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-t2vjify","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-t2vjify","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那病人有发黄的现象，且发黄现象很厉害的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们有两种黄，阳黄和阴黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳黄的时候茵陈蒿汤，茵陈、栀子、大黄三味药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。为什么要加大黄？就是治肝要治大肠，绝对要保持大便的通畅，不可以有便秘，便秘会让肝病恶化的很快，尤其是肝癌恶化的很快，所以黄的时候我们用茵陈栀子大黄汤。阳黄是鲜黄，病人有点便秘，所以茵陈栀子大黄三味药一下去，茵陈可以用三钱、栀子三钱、大黄的话你岳母八钱，你太太两钱、三钱这样子，六碗水煮成二碗，把黄也退了，大便也出来了。那你岳母大黄用到八钱，你岳母就在厕所拉的很厉害，黄也退了病也好了，她只会抱怨吃了你的药怎么上厕所那么多，那你心里这样想嘴巴不要说：这样你就安静了呀！你在厕所，没人跟你讲话，然后你就没有办法唠叨。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-38nm48y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-38nm48y","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我最怕人家唠叨啊，这就是治肝先治大肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-08ftror","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-08ftror","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你四味药加进去以后，那要实脾，我常常叫病人在肝癌刚察觉的时候，肚子还没有开始腹水，晚上一点到三点都不能睡，盗汗烦躁燥热，我们就知道是肝癌了。脉数且脉是压到骨头边的附骨脉，还有第九椎有压痛点，耳朵里面的肝点有压痛，手掌拿起来颜色是深红的，这些都代表已经有肝癌了，肝家阴实的症状。当你有实证出现的时候，晚上一点到三点是一定不能睡的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝脏是血脏，我们在攻坚的时候，都是用活血化瘀的药去攻他"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，像我们的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茜草，炙鳖甲"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，为什么选用炙鳖甲？因为鳖可以沉到很深的泥沼池塘里面，能潜到很深的地方躲起来，那肝脏又在最深的地方，我们就用炙的鳖甲，让它能够下达到肝脏最深的地方去。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pk77xw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pk77xw6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常常在临床上面，当我加了茜草、炙鳖甲这些药以后，病人常常就跟我讲，好好睡，睡得很好，品质好很多。然后有时候半夜会醒来，起来干嘛？饿了想吃东西，因为半夜胃气会恢复。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们在治疗脏病的时候，肝心脾肺肾是半夜胃气会恢复"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗表证的时候，太阳伤寒太阳中风太阳温病，表证的时候是中午时胃气会恢复"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以他晚上的时候胃气会恢复，这些都代表他往好的方向发展。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-o8i0y2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-o8i0y2l","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"遇到病人还没有开始有腹水的时候"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我一般在开了治肝的药以后，这是急下存阴，赶快要下手，然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"平常三餐让他吃四神汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，叫他去煮"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"薏仁白果芡实莲子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这些都不好煮烂，要有些常识，你要在水里泡几个小时，白果最干的可能要泡个两三天，泡完再去煮，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝主筋嘛，甘苦急，急食甘以缓之，可以加点蔗糖下去，那就当成莲子汤来喝啊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，平常就喝，平常在喝这个的时候就是在实脾。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-e0f5ndh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-e0f5ndh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你如果遇到肝癌的病人，还没有腹水，你开始这样的动作以后，病人根本就不会腹水，从头到尾都不会腹水。那你会不会去讨论说，老师这个有没有毒？那你不是要被骂死了，街上的四神汤都不能卖了，这个四川人第一个跟你呛啊，白果在四川产的很多啊！都江堰旁边都是白果，那不是翻脸了，卖白果卖薏仁的卖莲子的也跟你翻脸了，对不对，你会引起公愤。懂不懂我意思？那你是白目哎，这个还有毒，谁都可以吃的，不要问甘淡味的，对不对？这个是干粮类的嘛，怎么会不能吃呢，这叫做淡味渗利，在你吃的时候木绝对不会去克土，因为土是松的，那个水顺着土渗下去，绝对上面不会积水，所以实脾的定义在这里，当你掌握到实脾的定义，已经立于不败之地了。这时候开始动手，病人你看元气很好，气血体力还不错，大量的攻！为什么？我们芡实啊我开大剂的，那个炙鳖甲开大剂的，反正你也吃不死啊，你吃鳖甲也不会变成鳖，对不对？无所谓，它也不会像红花、桃仁那么伤血，对不对，它活血化瘀嘛，活血并不会伤血，就是让血活动，有淤血要清出来，这就是活血化瘀药在治疗肝癌时的应用。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qpo3fui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qpo3fui","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个病人来找你，说：医生啊，我被西医诊断肝癌了。那你这样跟病人说，你看我的逻辑：先生，你的病西医已经告诉你是肝癌了，你也不用回去检查了，为什么？因为你这一生不会有比这更坏的消息。已经知道最坏的的消息，你为什么还要再去检查？不要再去检查了，就开始吃我的药，什么都不要想。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-m1yz9rt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-m1yz9rt","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结果一年以后，我那个病人去检查，医生都吓一跳，你怎么还在？还摸他，以为是鬼，真的假的？还以为自己幻觉。病人说当时医生真的是这样摸我，看他一脸吓到的表情，因为以为这个病人死掉了嘛，就是不死！那就是我刚才跟你讲的，他今天来找我们的时候，的确是被诊断肝癌没有问题，但是现在你这种肝癌的程度，你还能活到嘛对不对？如果我能保持不变，那这样子我就赢了嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-llhdzp0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-llhdzp0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你这一辈子可能到后来是车祸死掉，对不对？还有人横死的嘛。结果你不是死于肝癌，是车祸死掉的，所以说这个我们要给病人信心，就像我讲的，你已经知道你肝癌了，你还要再回去检查干嘛？你说倪海厦，我吃了一段时间你的药以后， 第九椎也不痛了，每天晚上可以一觉到天亮，手原来是暗红色现在变成粉红色，肝区也不痛了，也不盗汗了，精神都很好，那我回去再检查一下。你不就是笨蛋嘛，你回去还要检查什么？我不需要你证明我好不好，到什么程度，你再检查再切片只会更坏，这样了解我意思吧，不需要，我也不需要西医的检验报告来证明我倪海厦是对的，不需要。为了证明我是对的，让你再一次的受到伤害，我认为不必要，因为真的很伤身体，你们没有做过检查不知道，做了就知道多伤身体。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-glt9bn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-glt9bn0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同样的问题"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"，如果奶水逆流，顺着三焦淋巴系统，就是顺着我们中医的三焦系统进入奇桓之腑，跑到脑部去，变成脑瘤我们怎么处理"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"？脑瘤的病人呢，小孩子得了脑瘤，五六岁的小孩子，男孩子或女孩子得了脑瘤，就是小儿麻痹疫苗造成的！然后你问他，跟小孩子讲话是童蒙，易经的蒙卦，他们叫童蒙，童蒙是最好。小孩子你问他，你额头热的冷的？热的，结束了。你要是问成年人的脑瘤，头是热的还是冷的，他手还要去摸，他已经着相了，小孩子直接说是热的就结束了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-n5irbgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-n5irbgz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"头应该是冷的，天上应该是冷，头是热的，热就是阳不入阴。头部是诸阳之会，诸位读过针灸的都知道，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"手三阳、足三阳统统络在头上"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阴经手太阴肺经，足太阴脾经，足厥阴肝经，手少阴心经，手厥阴心包经，六条阴经都只到喉咙，到脖子为止"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。头是六条阳经的交汇，所以过去皇帝说斩下你的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"六阳魁首"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有没有？把你的头砍掉。因为头只有阳经到没有阴经到，所以你冬天再冷棉被可以只盖到脖子这边来，头还是在外面？为什么，因为他没有阴经呐。但是，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳中要带有阴才是正常，所以头虽然不怕冷是阳经，但是摸上去应该是冷的，叫做阳中要带有阴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果病人头痛，痛是持续的痛，同时热，热也是持续的热，这个就代表里面有实，中医用阴阳表里虚实寒热来证明，代表里面有实。当这个实越来越严重的时候，可能会影响到病人的视力，可能影响病人的听力，可能影响到病人一侧的躯干，类似中风的症状一样不能动，都会造成这种情形，我们知道病人是有脑瘤现象出现。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-deejq5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-deejq5q","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病在奇桓之腑，我们在处理脑瘤的时候，给我们处理淋巴癌的时候，我们处理的方向是一致的。第一个，我们会用到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"牡蛎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，大剂的牡蛎用来攻坚的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一两半"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。病人有盗汗的现象，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"加龙骨"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，还有呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"盗汗严重的话加重炮附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，具体剂量看病人体格大小。再来"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生半夏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个时候一开始要下生半夏，目的是把脑部的水排出来，你不能等到病人脑积水脑袋已经很大了再去排，那就太慢了，积水排不下去人就走掉了，开始就要排！但是必须要使用生半夏，更抱歉的是生半夏你必须跟我们中国药材集团买，讲了半天还是孙工，你要跟他买。外面你买来的都是制半夏、法半夏，都是炙过的，要全生的一定要在孙鸿那里买。所以你们最好对他好一点（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），不然你要生半夏他给你送来制半夏，不会啦，我是故意逗你们的，但是他一定会给你们最好的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9qbp5r6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9qbp5r6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们要有最好的医学技术以外，一定要有最好的药配合，否则你技术再好也没有用，因为药物不对。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wrl9yim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wrl9yim","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果手脚逆冷，四肢冰冷，我们会用到生附"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，用到生附的话，就会出现"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"干姜，用到炮附子的话就会用到生姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以一个处方里面，你会看到我们处方生姜两片，干姜二钱，生附子三钱，炮附子五钱，生附子和炮附子就会出现在一个处方里。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃下去以后，病人如果盗汗的现象还有，没有办法止住，手脚还是冰冷，这个时候我们会用到生硫磺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生硫磺是在临床上，我们用在脑瘤、淋巴癌使用到最多的地方，石硫磺是天地之间至阳至刚的药，也就是说没有比它更强的。那生硫磺颜色是淡黄色的，所以跟我们三焦淋巴系统油网是一样的淡黄色，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以石硫磺一下去，会顺着全身的三焦系统走，走遍奇桓之腑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nuykamz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nuykamz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以当我们用生附子的时候，我们可能没有办法药力达到脑部去，可以到淋巴结，但是没有办法达到脑部去，有生硫磺在里面的话，力量就会达到脑部去。所以处方就出现"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生硫磺、生半夏、生附子、炮附子、干姜、生姜、炙甘草、龙骨、牡蛎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我这样讲完你一定吓死了，但是病人吃下去好爽啊，倪先生我从来没有感觉这么好。原来呢，一个礼拜前找你的时候，半身瘫痪了，现在这个礼拜吃完药以后，我可以下床走路了，已经不用扶拐杖、不用坐轮椅了，代表什么？代表你脑瘤在缩了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qtby5cf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qtby5cf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看到我用的都是天下至毒的药，所以你可以叫我毒王，可是我不是西毒，西毒那个是坏蛋。我们都有解吗，我们生附子用干姜，就是可以解附子的毒，用炮附子有生姜在里面。那蒸煮过一个小时以上这两个药就没有毒了，生硫磺本来就 没有什么毒，是被混蛋的道士渲染的，懂不懂？那个道士只要我长命百岁，长命千岁，你们都不要长命，你们长命干嘛， 我要长命才能代表我有道行啊，所以硫磺有毒你们都不能用，硫磺必须要经过我们的特殊的炼丹的方式才能吃。听到他这么说从此你们就不敢用，你懂不懂我意思？以讹传讹下来的。就好像我讲 的生半夏，原来最早的生半夏就是婆婆药，懂不懂，可是吃了只是声音就没有，以讹传讹下来大家就说生半夏有毒。就好像我们的克林顿不是强盗，克林顿是强盗，你把它加一个‘不’或者拿掉一个‘不’，结果完全不一样嘛。一字之差，就几千年以讹传讹传坏了，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-yas3g84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-yas3g84","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当我们这个处方开出来以后，强到什么程度？一个太太子宫卵巢癌症，开刀拿掉，结果癌细胞还是扩散了，扩散后鼠蹊部的淋巴结长了拳头那么大的硬块，在这里生硫磺是主力，她手脚冰冷，就这个处方吃下去，第二天早上起来，两个肿块就没有了，速度快到这种程度，你化疗也做不到，我们经方可以做到。那经方也有力量不够的地方，就好像经方里面没有看到用生硫磺，因为现代的病生附子已经不够了，所以还是要有使用生硫磺的地方。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3aa9db0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3aa9db0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在大家会了，如果看到一个病人，老师她是乳癌，切了以后又往淋巴走，这边淋巴都是硬块在里面，变成淋巴癌了。前面讲过啦，那个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"牡蛎既可以治疗乳癌，又可以治疗淋巴癌，因为它是相通的，所以牡蛎就要加重"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，是不是加重？那如果汗出不来，病人有积水，我们要把水要排掉，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治癌就是攻坚的同时又要排水，防己、茯苓下去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，防己茯苓下去还是有些水在里面，水在里面的话，你可以查到，为什么？因为它里面有水声，有一些积水，或者是小便不是很顺利，或者在盗汗。那我们在攻坚的时候，会留下来的残余的东西都是水，所以才会有积水，如果用防己茯苓还排不出来，我们就用硫磺，硫磺也可以排水。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hnlseic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hnlseic","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们水肿很厉害的时候，硫磺可以排出来。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"过去在用硫磺的时候是治五金的毒，五金，金银铜铁锡的毒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是喝了含铁质太多的水，结果身上累积铁砂在膀胱里面，躺下去的时候可以小便，站起来不能小便，因为站起来的时候铁砂跑到旁边，把输尿管堵到了，所以只能躺下小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4wx6e1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4wx6e1a","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你说奇怪医生，为什么我只能躺着小便？人啊很好玩，小便不出来，他会想尽办法小便，他会找出各种不同的姿势，摇头啊或者什么样，想尽办法排啊，结果他发现只能躺在那里小便，我们就知道他很多金属累积的膀胱里面。因为水质不好，那我们用生硫磺一下去金属就化掉了，所以硫磺可以化五金的毒，让小便顺利的排出来，这就是我们过去的硫磺使用。那临床上面，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"硫磺我常常开到的都是三钱，最高开到七钱治疗脑瘤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为病人有280磅，将近七尺，所以我硫磺一付药开到七钱啊！然后生附子六钱。但这个病人不是一开始就用到七钱，开始是二钱、三钱、四钱、五钱这样加上去的，最后用到七钱，大的剂量用到这种程度哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-r76hyi9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-r76hyi9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子跟生附子还有生硫磺最大的差异"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，扶阳论坛上面我就跟大家介绍过的，炮附子固阳，比如我现在有病了，阳就损失了50%了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果我们持续的吃炮附子，只能固住50%，没有办法将失去的50%要回来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那所以他们在使用炮附子时候就发现到，炮附子用50克、100克，哎呀这个阳还是没回来，100克下去阳还是没回来，再加100克、200克、300、400 克就这样来的，越用越多，那你方向错了。你如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子维持个五钱八钱都可以了，生附子三钱下去阳就回头了，生附子下去阳还没有回头，就用生硫磺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果生硫磺下去阳不能回来，那这个人也就差不多了，没有救了，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ukm5ptm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ukm5ptm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"要把阴实打开来，一定要靠纯阳的药，跟去实的药混在一起使用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以乳癌的话，我常常就会用到刚才跟大家讲的瓦楞子、牡蛎啊这类东西。大家现在了解了，为什么我不赞成开刀包括切片，因为切片打进去以后会造成很多的瘀块在里面，那个时候已经演变成密闭的空间在里面，没有通路了，没有通路药就到不了那边，那你怎么办，你懂不懂我意思？做完切片你又怎么样，难道你告诉我，老师我好爽啊，好开心啊，今天我被查出来是乳癌，她哪有那么白痴的，对不对？你不知道是不是还比较开心一点，吃我的药不管恶性、良性硬块消掉就好了嘛。如果你开的处方开的剂量是对的，消的真是很快，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-u8u3xj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-u8u3xj1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们今天到这里，谢谢大家。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rl4sj80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rl4sj80","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-d2czh27","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-d2czh27","updated":"20240828171608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第四讲：阴阳辨证法 2009 年 12 月 5 日南宁"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hnolqsg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hnolqsg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们昨天开始介绍一些重病，今天我先把昨天没有详细解释的部分，给大家再做个补充说明。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-l5kh7lh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-l5kh7lh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们以乳癌为主，我们在美国临床看得最清楚，美国就是维他命国，也是牛奶大国。那乳癌的病人很多，我就问她乳房有硬块，多久以前摸到的？她说大概半年前，那你之前的时候，中医认为百病风之始，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-n90n51r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-n90n51r","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"百病皆来自风，就是感冒，你问她你感冒的时候怎么处理的，她说我吃维他命C啊！维他命C跟我们桂枝汤比起来一点学问都没有。那平常呢？她平常就喝牛奶，所以她们感冒生病的时候，吃的维他命C，当然也有吃抗生素，维他命不能解决的就吃抗生素。乳癌（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师点了点黑板"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。那这个状况发生不只是一个，维他命C本身是会刺激到女孩子、太太们的，我讲的是维他命C的片剂，并不是你吃橘子啊，吃这种天然的维他命C。抗生素、止痛药呢，都会造成心脏的受损，这些诸多的原因加在一起，再加上人都有喜怒忧思悲恐..."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ur76f7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ur76f7f","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们中医认为说，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一个是外因一个是内感"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这两个原因。其他的病比如这个毒蛇猛兽和虫蛇咬伤啊我们不要去谈，光是内外，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"外就是风，内就是喜怒忧思悲恐"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那在这种条件之下（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"外因"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），心脏的力量受到影响，所以说她没有办法把胸部乳房里面的奶水经过冲任二脉百分百导引到腹腔去，这就是这个奶水累积在乳房里面真正的成因。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1ql1mzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1ql1mzo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昨天我跟大家讲四物汤加炒麦芽，你每次月经来的时候如果胸部有压力，两边的压力是平均的，那你自己就可以做自己最好的医生，然后月经开始来的以后，胸部的压力就慢慢减少，等到月经停的时候，胸部压力完全没有。这种状况就是告诉你，您是非常正常的，绝对没有任何乳癌的细胞。再初期，就算手摸不到只有扫描能扫到，你都可以感觉的到，甚而至于扫描都扫不到，你都可以感觉的到。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-p6o2oi4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-p6o2oi4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果说，你在月经来之前感觉左边胸部比较胀，右边就是一般人胀，然后左边有一个地方特别难过有痛的感觉，在这个时候，你就开处方四物汤加炒麦芽，一下就把它整个清掉了！那如果全中国的妇女都能够这样子做，从此乳癌就断根了，就没有了。这就是病之始，这是上工治未病。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2x1opty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2x1opty","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那到我们手上往往是病人拖累到乳癌持续的蔓延，持续的恶化，才到我们手上，我们也必须要有中工的本事，当然也要有下工的本事。已经恶化了怎么办？我们想办法，就算救不回来，我们也可以延展他的生命。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-o2cy8l4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-o2cy8l4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那还有一个我为什么非常不赞成切片开刀？因为有做过专业做乳癌的医师，他一定会了解到，如果乳癌没有开过刀，没有做过任何东西，就让它自然地恶化，这个病人从头到尾没被动过，即使很烂很臭啊，我跟大家讲过，都臭到那个诊所三天的味道还在那里，可是你问她痛不痛？不痛，完全不痛。可是你给她开刀做化疗，你问她痛不痛？非常痛啊，为什么痛？ 伤口痛，刀的伤口痛。如果是自然破裂开来的，她不会痛的。太太还有在我面前展示出来的，那个整个都已经剥落下来的，她还拿出来给我看，因为她不介意啊，给你看没有关系，因为反正很丑，谁看了都会 倒胃口，胸部整个烂掉了。当时我们学生十几个在场啊，她说没关系我给你看，衣服拉开来，她把肉拉开来给你们看，里面的脓化出来，她都不会痛啊！她说你看这样了我都不痛啊，大家看没关系，哇，臭的不行，全部学生统统往外跑，因为臭到不行。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-s5hvg7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-s5hvg7w","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我讲这个案例就是形容给大家听，没有治疗就算烂，也不会痛。光是这个痛，而光是这个痛，就让一个乳癌病人生活品质非常的不好，那痛你就吃止痛药。你以为止痛药可以止痛，那只是你以为，它是把痛减轻，但痛还是在里面，到后来要注射吗啡。可是你越是使用止痛剂，你的心脏就越受损，本来就是你心脏受损才得到乳癌，结果治疗上面再让你心脏更受损，一定更恶化。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3ddnxwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3ddnxwr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当我们按照中医的理论，我们知道这个奶水等于月经的时候，当你这个定义出现了，我们就可以知道病人的病情在治疗中间是持续的恶化，还是持续的进步"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果病人没有开刀，病人就没有痛，所以我们根本不需要用到止痛药。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"由于是心脏在管这个奶水变月经，所以第一个，我们就会问她睡眠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，病人从吃你的药开始，本来睡眠品质不好，现在开始睡眠品质好转，对不对，就已经知道药对了。本来月经少很多，甚至于更年期以后，超过50岁以后，他没有月经了，本来就是便秘，吃了你的药以后，我宁可这个病人下利，也不可以便秘，因为至少有地方宣泄这个奶水，这些都是可以告诉我们病人进展的情形如何。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mvqfv4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mvqfv4y","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那阴阳的辨证法，在这里可以用得到。就像昨天跟大家讲的，手一摸，手掌是热的，手背额头是凉的，病人都是在进步。如果方便的话你摸胸部也可以，不方便也没关系，你叫病人自己告诉你，乳癌的部位摸上去一定是烫的，病人会告诉你非常的烫。如果她说这边是凉凉的，那这边根本没有乳癌。她那个烫并不是发烧，而是阳不入阴，因为阴实了嘛，结到这里一个硬块，阳气没有办法进去，就往外走。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-yy5sp9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-yy5sp9b","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我前几天一再跟大家讲阴阳的概念，身体外面是阳，因为正常人阳中要有阴才叫做正常。阴阳一定要互相结合在一起，现在阴结实了，阳中没有阴，阳要进去进不去，反逆出来，所以感觉到是烫的感觉，热的感觉。所以病人会说这里是烫的，可是她没有发烧，所以这并不是真正发高烧的现象，是属于一种低烧的现象，这是阳不足阴的现象。那阳不入阴的时候，吃你的药，越吃乳癌的位置越热，代表阴实没有打开来，代表药物没有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2upeu4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2upeu4m","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看的时候，你一看病人是这个样子，比如你原来处方是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生附子三钱，牡蛎用到一两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生附子要加上心脏的力量，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"干姜用二钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炙甘草用五钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啊等等...这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"牡蛎用一两，病人阴实打不开来的，因为乳房还有我们的脑，还有女子胞，我们的骨髓，通通是属于奇桓之腑，这个时候我们可以加入生硫磺加重三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这就是我们的处方的加减，这个包起来去煮。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"牡蛎可以开到二两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，重剂的攻坚药开下去，把乳房的硬块打掉以后，同时要把水排出来，这个时候我们加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"防己、茯苓"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就要利用这些药把水排出来，这样里面就不会再烂掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-l0qpns8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-l0qpns8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那吃这个药下去以后，病人热退一点，说明药到了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"效不更方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们在处理重症的时候，当你有效果出现的话，就不要去改变处方，这就是我们使用剂量的问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ybthfvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ybthfvx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大剂量去攻的时候，一定是病人很有元气的时候，病人还可以站起来跟你握手，还可以两个人讲话寒暄，是不是攻的时机？病人躺着奄奄一息，你攻的时候就要小心了，这就是可以攻的时机。奄奄一息了你攻可能来不及了，你要先采取守势。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cn842l1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cn842l1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中医采守势的方式呢，在病人重症的时候，我们采守势把他脾胃打开来，我们可以用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"附子理中汤，小建中汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之类的药。把先天肾脏顾好，加些强肾的药，后天之本是脾，所以脾胃要强好。你把胃口打开，即便病人很严重了，可是胃口特别好，还是照样吃东西啊，那证明还不会死，那你就等他的机会，一直在旁边慢慢等，看她吃了东西体力也很好......当然是叫他吃东西，不可能叫他吃维他命C啊，多吃橘子、辣椒都没关系，你就正常的饮食，把"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所有的奶制品统统断掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。一定要断奶哦，这个奶制品包含了起司，披萨都不能吃，喝牛奶更不要讲了，牛奶糖什么都不能吃，你以为吃到牛奶，吃到其实是女性荷尔蒙，不要吃。喝豆浆之类的都没有关系，豆浆你要加蔗糖，白糖都不能用，因为白糖你吃起来味道是甜的，实际是酸的。因为那个人工的砂糖它的体积分子非常小，你吃到嘴巴里以后，嘴巴里面牙齿之间有很多的滤过性病毒，那个滤过性病毒或者细菌的嘴巴也很小，把白糖分子吃进去以后，它排出来的代谢物质是酸的，所以除了牙齿会变成牙周病以外，还造成胃酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-h1w18k2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-h1w18k2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那蔗糖很好，我们昨天去凉美镇一路上好多甘蔗，蔗糖体积大滤过性病毒嘴巴小吃不进去，所以蔗糖是碱性，吃到甜的是碱性的。那你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃了碱性的食物到身体里面的话，在碱性的环境里面，是找不到任何的滤过性病毒的，找不到的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以你吃蔗糖等于是防癌顾你的健康，所以你牙齿痛的时候，你一定吃了人工的砂糖，一吃下去牙齿就痛，同样的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你吃蔗糖下去牙齿痛就慢慢去掉，比止痛药还好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，为什么？因为它是碱性的，吃完以后嘴巴里面是碱的环境，完全没有病毒啊，细菌都被碱杀掉了。所以不要吃抗生素，光是蔗糖就可以杀掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mfp704w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mfp704w","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就像前天跟大家讲的，我们在治疗蜂窝性组织炎，他的脚趾头破个洞，这个糖尿病的病人脚破个洞还在流脓，指头都黑了蔓延到骨头上，西医说要截肢。如果他是敌人你就让他截肢了，赶快去截肢，因为敌人嘛。如果是你的亲朋好友，你自己的亲人，不要截肢，赶快拿蔗糖泡水脚泡到里面去，为什么？纯碱！同时"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"蔗糖可以把里面的脓给吸出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那我们前面介绍的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子，白术排浓汤，重用白芍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那如果还有痛我们可以加些活血化瘀的药，像川穹丹皮桃仁都没有关系，这个时候有大的伤口我们可以一下子把它收口，骨头里面的脓都可以排的出来，为什么需要截肢呢？需要截肢是你不知道怎么治疗。那你以为截肢就好了，你错了，本来就是一个小伤口才会烂掉，你截肢是不是更大的伤口在后面？截完肢那个伤口怎么收口咧，所以截肢完以后，一段时间又要截肢截截截截，没地方截了就再见。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-t0ju2jz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-t0ju2jz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为了挽救这些人的生命，他们无知嘛，他们只相信西医，我一定要去截肢，医生跟我说要截肢，我就要去截肢，为了挽救这一群笨蛋，就跟他们说截肢太好了，我都是叫我的敌人去做截肢的，对不对？太好了赶快去赶快去，他就说嗯，我要考虑一下。这样讲他反而会考虑一下，你跟他们好言相劝，跟他说其实没必要截肢，截了肢没有用，截完肢以后伤口更大，你原来小伤口现在截肢伤口更大，想就知道你不会好嘛，对不对？他不听你的。那如果说太好了赶快去截肢，他一听就觉得有问题，这个就是人性。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ybtr8u6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ybtr8u6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个没有办法，你只好这样做啦。所以你现在知道我在网络上为什么骂，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hd5vmn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hd5vmn6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我为什么说乳癌你做切片我就不看，你吓到她了，那倪海厦不看我，我切片就不看我，那我先给倪海厦看一下再说。对！你没有切片来看我，可能一个礼拜两个礼拜或者月经来之后全部都好了，月经来之前你乳房可能还有硬块。我也不需要你去表扬我说倪海厦好厉害或者怎么样，我无所谓良性恶性肿瘤，处方是一样的，在你月经前吃的话，月经来以后开始慢慢排，应用那个window开的那个时间（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"经期的时间窗口"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），利用这个时机，在月经来的三天到五天之内把那个奶水全部打下来，就没了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hwnwupr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hwnwupr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以有的人来我这边看两个礼拜才会好，为什么？因为两个礼拜以后刚好月经来了。有的人一个礼拜好，为什么？刚好一个礼拜月经来。你知道我意思吧？那有的人要拖一个月，因为她刚好月经完了才来找我，window过啦，你知道的我意思吧？我讲window是因为习惯，我们在NASA那边，那个把太空舟打到太空去，一定要等 window open，一旦Windows open now（窗口打开了），然后我们就会开始倒数，因为我们那边刚好转到那个角度上面，大气层还有地心引力的压力会最小，地心引力最小，这个时候发射太空舟使用的燃料是最节省的，这叫窗户打开来嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wlv8dov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wlv8dov","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们人也有 window，女孩子月经来的时候就是 window，那个老师她更年期了没有月经了怎么办？没有关系肛门就是你的 window，懂不懂我意思？所以我宁可你们女孩子下利也不可以便秘，好不好？当然下利可能是大肠炎啊，下边一直便血，我们有桃花汤，赤石脂禹粮石那种药一下子把它收起来，都是很好治的，我们能治便秘当然也能够治下痢。你比如说老师她便秘你会治，下利你不会治，所以经方本身是一个非常完整的一个系统。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tzp8xhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tzp8xhm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以后面的医生呢，这个上古的医生，比如说这个岐伯黄帝啊，邵师啊很多春秋战国时代的名医，那是上古有好的医生。中古呢，好比是唐朝的孙思邈，张仲景等等。后代就没有名医了，为什么后代不会再出大医？因为以前到了汉唐的时候一切已经完备了，你不需要再去研发了，所以后代绝对有人比他们聪明，但你不需要去研发，因为它已经是perfect（完美的），所以大家去研读经典，经典医学是非常的重要。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-92axzy6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-92axzy6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我非常赞同贵所研究经典中医，以后这个一定是世界医学的主流，在我有生之年我非要完成它不可"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！当然要有大家的助力哦，所以有这个机会我来跟大家宣扬这个经典，所以你们对你们拿到手上的经典医学一定要有信心，当你了解非常透彻以后，这个非常的有效率以后，你心里会想还好我是中国人，因为看得懂中文，老外你再怎么学，只看得懂那种白话文嘛，古文还是看不懂啊，你就有幸身为中国人，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1tc3fag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1tc3fag","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那还有红斑性狼疮，我们处理这个红斑性狼疮一样啊！心本身是赤色，对不对？按照我们昨天的理论，青色入肝脏，红色入心脏，黄色入脾脏，白色入肺脏，黑色入肾脏，那你心脏有问题了，奶水逆流跑到心脏，为什么我们知道奶水逆流进心脏？很简单嘛，这个红色的颜色本来是属于心脏的营养，现在奶水进去了。奶水你不应该是在心脏里面，你怎么会跑进来？结果心脏里面有一部分区块被奶水占据了，这时候脾脏...脾主运化，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"诸位我跟大家讲的没有一样是我编出来的哦，大家都回头看黄帝内经，以后你看黄帝内经会觉得很有意思，哎，这个倪海厦都讲过了，对不对？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-i467ntr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-i467ntr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脾主运化，所以脾脏把食物消化掉吸收掉以后，脾脏就把它区分成五种颜色的营养，中医用颜色来区分很聪明啊！西医是用维他命ABCDE，这个西医讲这个是有目的的，因为它可以制造出来卖。我们不需要，我们营养脾脏吸收了食物以后分成青赤黄白黑，红色的呢一定要进入心脏，黑色的要进入肾脏，那你心脏肾脏衰竭了，肾脏功能没有了，黑色给肾脏不受，黑色就跑到脸上、身上，所以医院里洗肾的病人跑出来跟黑人一样，脸是黑的，眼睛一看到就知道是尿毒的病人。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-s7k1tba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-s7k1tba","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个红色的营养应该进入心脏，进去一看哎呀奶水在里面，没地方待了，红色的就要往外走，跑到脸上面长的就像狼疮，脸上红红一块块的，像狼的脸一样，红斑性狼疮，手上身上都是红的，那个红不是皮肤病啊！那个红色心脏的营养应该要待在心脏里面，结果被奶水占据所以往外走，所以当你把心脏奶水一调整时候，所有的斑痛都去掉了，瞬间就会去掉，隔夜就去掉一大半。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fiqiyhn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fiqiyhn","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个我在临床上唯一的障碍就是碰到红斑性狼疮的病人是黑人，我真的没有办法，我看还是黑啊，他说我就是红啊，就没有办法看到，其他都没有障碍，这是我唯一的障碍。真的是这个很累，你们以后看见黑人就知道，看红斑性狼疮的黑人病人你就知道我很痛苦啊，我这样看了半天还是黑的，它就是看不到一点红，她说我脸很红啊！你知道我的意思吧！这个很麻烦。这个肤色我实在是...这个黄帝内经当时也没想到，所以他们当时没有想到黑人怎么看对不对？我实在是没办法，这部分是我的盲点。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gz1cge1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gz1cge1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240429165826-ays284l.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-872di9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-872di9i","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那同样的，因为我们知道我们下的定义，临床上看病人是第五椎压痛，那看病人吃了你的药红斑性狼疮有没有好转，很简单啊！你好不好睡觉，心脏第一个就管睡眠嘛，因为心神明出焉。神明嘛，要出焉，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"神和明是两件事，心藏神代表能够安神、定神能睡眠，明呢中虚为明，易经里面中虚为离卦☲"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，为什么是中虚为明？这是一个蜡烛，火在上面燃烧，大家看火的中心是空的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么中虚为明呢？因为你把你心里面放空，把所有的东西统统都放空"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，诸位把自己放空为一个空杯子，我来负责倒最好的水给你，你心里很多障碍很多东西在里面，你没有把自己放空，你不够明，我倒了水就都溢出来了，好不好？所以要中虚为明。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"也就是说当心脏功能恢复以后你会非常的能够明辨是非，非常的明确地知道你要做什么"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，非常的明确你要给家人提供一些意见啊，这就是明。聪明有聪明但不见得很明，真正的很明的人呢都是中虚。所谓中虚就是我不管倪海厦是对与错，西医对与错，我第一个不能否定倪海厦，我要假设倪海厦是对的，假设经典医学是对的，假设黄帝内经是对的，假设针灸，假设金匮伤寒都是对的，这才中虚嘛！如果还没学什么都不懂，就说不对，就说这个是错误的东西，你根本没有学过，你怎么知道是错误的东西？这种人就不够明，所以大家要中虚为明。那你治疗这个病人呢，她红斑性狼疮恢复了，你看她明不明，还是不明！懂不懂我意思？他们还是糊里糊涂，走错路啊！怎么样子。这个先生在这边，就问你是谁啊跑到我家里干嘛，这个就是那个记忆还没有恢复，这种都是不明，神还没有回来，代表还没有恢复。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xr25d7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xr25d7r","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们从很多地方所谓的望闻问就可以得到答案，大家念过黄帝内经就知道，我们讲的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"望、闻、问"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"神、圣、工"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"巧匠是切脉，切而知之谓之巧，巧匠是不能治病的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以我们望闻问的时候，靠听、靠看，周围到处都是我们的资料，对我来说，所有的病人进来的一举一动，眼神一个动作，手一个动作，通通都是我的资料，都可以给我很多的讯息，都在把身体的信息症状传达给我。有的时候病人讲一句话出来，说我这个心悸了厉害，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"他告诉我心悸的很厉害，意思就等同于告诉我倪海厦多给我点桂枝，炙甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我肚脐脐下动悸的很厉害，倪海厦多给我一点茯苓甘草汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这样了解我的意思吧？所以病人在讲的时候，我脑子里面处方已经在形成了，他一直在讲，我中虚嘛。比如说我们要看个病人，我们不要心里设定这个病人怎么样，要心里面是空的，我来听他讲，甚至这个病人跟我说，倪海厦我得到了肝癌，我得到了尿毒，我都不听，我现在心里面是空的，你告诉我你小便状况如何？大便情形如何？睡眠情形如何？我是空虚的在这边，才能够把他的资料吸收进来，我才知道他需要什么药，这个是我目前给大家一个建议，以后你们也会遇到这种情形。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ivtzm79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ivtzm79","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那有的病人呢，他命中注定他这个病不会好，他碰到我们讲了半天讲一大堆都不是重点，一句话都讲不到重点。他一直讲他的医师告诉我怎么样，我说你不要讲你的医生了，告诉我你感觉怎么样，他还在说我的医生说我这是怎么了还在那边讲，第三次我就火大了，我说你告诉我你怎么样！病人吓到了。我说你讲了半天，你来我诊所以前病好了没有？没好。你病没好，过去看了那么多的医生，结果你的病没有好，你把这些错误的信息灌到我脑海里面，然后我告诉你同样的答案，这是你今天要的吗？你也不会好。今天以前没有好，你还在糊涂！今天以后开始做你自己，告诉我你大便怎么样？病人说：我怎么从来没想过这个问题。对啊！你就从来没有好过。病人就开始改变了想法，哦~终于知道要陈述自己。你是你自己最好的医生嘛，你告诉我大便不好便秘，那我就要问你有没有放屁啊，小便是什么颜色啊，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0ewmojn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0ewmojn","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"便秘分两症，一个是我那天跟大家报告的腑实，一个是少阴的寒实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以光治疗个便秘就很特殊。我们在少阴症的时候，有一症呢，我们叫做寒实。什么叫寒实，病人一样便秘，可能一个礼拜、十天才一次，你问他小便什么颜色？清白，小便是很清白的。你说奇怪了，不是黄色的嘛？黄色是阳明症，阳明是热症，所以小便是浓浊黄浊的。如果小便清，那你七天十天不大便，请问你难不难过？我没有感觉难过啊，我什么都不会痛，不会感觉难过，不感觉痛苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-83cqtg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-83cqtg0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那阳明热呢，是燥热，病人会非常的痛苦，肚子痛，大便也排不出来，人情绪会变的非常焦躁、焦虑，这是大承气汤症。严重到他会焦躁到那个大便的浊气冲到脑门去以后，会发狂奔走，登高，跑到很高的地方去那边唱歌，这是大承气汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wvuav9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wvuav9v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我有一次在平遥古城，就是到山西平遥古城，我在里面晃啊，边看边走。旁边一个男的上衣脱掉了，只穿一个夹克绑在腰上面，一路自言自语，在那边走，眼睛瞪得直直的从我旁边走过去，大承气汤症，可他不知道我是谁，我也不能说先生你要吃大承气汤，那你是神经病，他已经神经病了还跟我打，对不对？所以说有时候很难，有时候不能漏相，我不能让人家认识我，对不对？望，看就知道，可是呢要想救他，如果平遥那边没有人敢用大承气汤，他就不会好。可是他还这么年轻，天气还蛮凉的，他就是燥热嘛，所以衣服都脱掉了。古人在形容大承气汤证，说登高弃衣而行，衣服一拖就跑，跑到高的地方还在唱歌，高歌一曲，就是大承气汤症，燥热到这种程度。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6p8txgh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6p8txgh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少阴寒实呢，他不会感觉到难过，他七天时间不大便还感觉很好啊，从来都不觉得痛啊，他还心平气和的。所以我们原来少阴的主力的处方是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄附子细辛汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"转变而来，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄，炮附子，细辛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最后我们把麻黄去掉，改成大黄附子细辛汤，大黄三钱，炮附子用两钱，细辛用两钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那你如果说不知道这个寒实，就是便秘你还开大承气汤给他，这个处方不对嘛。处方不对，病人吃下去也会跑厕所啊，但是跑的很难过，肚子痛啊，绞痛啊什么都来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xtlluly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xtlluly","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你如果说是少阴寒实，小便清的，便秘并不会造成困扰，你用大黄附子细辛汤进去以后，我告诉你这个病人会跟你讲，我这辈子大便都没这么好过，whole life，从来也没这么舒服过。这种情况我常常碰到啊！那些老外很胖，看起来有湿热，舌苔伸出来是白的，少阴症嘛寒的，一摸脉，人那么大脉那么细小，又是便秘，小便是淡的，开完处方给他，我们开处方应该要做到一个阶段就是，开完处方你就知道病人会怎么样，还没有吃你就知道他有效，因为这有寒实嘛，很明确！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ecqd4ls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ecqd4ls","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那开完处方我就跟他说，你去上厕所坐在那边，你会讲一句话：真好啊！因为没有人在那边嘛，真好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dvj907k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dvj907k","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那为什么要靠附子加热？因为少阴寒实肠子没有蠕动，大便会堵在里面慢慢累积起来，他没有感觉所以不会痛。如果是阳明燥实，肠子还在蠕动，就是大肠太干，没有津液在里面，蠕动不过去当然会产生痛，拉开来的时候，就是宿便跟肠子在摩擦的时候，就会很痛。所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为这个少阴寒实没有蠕动，我们要用热的药下去，要靠附子和细辛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，细辛在伤寒论里面除了小青龙汤里有细辛的话，我们少阴症里面我们也用到细辛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"细辛可以把里面的寒运输到表面上来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以细辛像根一样，像我们当归四逆汤里面我们有细辛，就是细辛能够进入小肠，细辛像很多根嘛，好像整个小肠一样在下部，所以我们有细辛下去以后，肠子里就开始这个分开来了。冰溶解掉就靠炮附子。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-uykq0xk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-uykq0xk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以药一下去，因为他已经十天不大便了嘛，所以大黄你开三钱，如果是七天不大便你开两钱，如果是15天不大便请你开六钱，懂不懂我意思？那如果是你岳母，终身不想看到她，你就开大黄好了，附子细辛不要开，她从此不会来找你看病。了解我意思吧？因为肠子蠕动没有回来，有个东西硬把大便推出去，治病就好像脱肛一样很难过，结果你岳母就在想我生女儿的时候就脱肛一次，就是西医搞出来的，结果呢现在女儿嫁给你这个女婿，你又让我脱肛第二次，我从此不要看见你，因为你忘了加附子细辛，这样不好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5r77z5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5r77z5y","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你如果是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大承气汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们都知道"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"厚朴二钱，枳实二钱，大黄三钱，芒硝二钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，芒硝是不煮的，这三味是下锅去煮六碗水煮二碗水的时候，各冲一钱芒硝下去，这是我们一般的剂量。那为什么要这样子开处方呢？因为大家去看厚朴，厚朴长得是这样子，长得像字母C一样。那都是树皮啊，拔下来的，你们要是想看厚朴田就找我们孙鸿，这个厚朴是宽肠的。那枳实呢，枳实长这个样，好像橘子小橘子一样一片一片的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实也是肠，但枳实管心脏，所以它只是管小肠，所以厚朴是管大肠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那为什么要管这个？因为厚朴下去以后，大肠会刺激大肠产生黏液产生津液，枳实会直接刺激小肠产生津液，津液就很快的补回来，很快地补回来以后呢，因为本来就在蠕动，你不需要刺激蠕动的药，这时候大黄在药物来说是去实的药物。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"芒硝呢是我们所谓的攻坚的药物"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"去实是大黄在推"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那这个宿便很硬啊，有时候诸位想象不到，球大的像我们拳头一个，打网球的球那么大，硬邦邦的像石头啊，就像我昨天跟大家讲丢到墙上会弹回来，掉到马桶里还有咕噜咕噜咕噜声音，这时候攻坚要靠芒硝，芒硝一下去马上出来像薯片一样，切成一片片的，因为芒硝是攻坚的，所以这四味药下去，当然会中啊，一味不多一味不少。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-16rwlyc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-16rwlyc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们所谓经典之方，就是我们用药物是药简力专。所以我们一味不多一味不少下去就中。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-eqcbldr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-eqcbldr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240430082746-nq438lx.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gx9up1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gx9up1c","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那还有一种情形呢，那老师啊，我们这个大便堵在这个里面的，有个堵成那么大一块，只有水可以通过，有的堵成中间这一小道排过去，所以大便如鞭，或者是下利排水出来，都是大承气汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a1elkzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a1elkzq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一种情形呢，病人元气没有，哎呦奄奄一息了，大便非常干燥，一块块在堵着肛门口，很干燥啊！那没有办法了，肛门又痛啊，又没有力量，老年人岁数大了八九十岁没有力气排啊！那老师大承气汤下去他受不了，他可能跑厕所都来不及跑，大承气一下去，他就从这边一路大便到厕所去，因为太快了，那这种年老气衰的情形怎么办？张仲景说没有关系，我们用猪胆汁，所以伤寒论里面就会出猪胆汁导法，用消导的方法。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-aiqzn14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-aiqzn14","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过去按照张仲景说法，把猪胆汁抽到竹筒里面去，竹筒头做小做圆滑，用猪肉或者什么东西润滑一下，那时候哪有凡士林什么东西，放点油脂润滑一下，捅过肛门里面去，然后把猪胆汁注射进去，胆汁进去以后猪胆汁导法出来。那老师"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"猪胆汁找不到怎么办？没关系，用蜜煎导法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，用蜂蜜去熬，熬过以后做成锥状， 就好像我们的甘油定一样，塞到肛门里面去，塞进去然后就能慢慢把它导出来。这都是消导方法，我们中医过去几千年来，我们发掘了很多东西呢，要把大便导不出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rb03fgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rb03fgr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你说老师大便有那么重要吗？我跟你讲会死人的，导不出来会死人的。所以承气汤症常常说，大承气汤用了不成，病人没有恢复的话，这些都是死症，会造成手足燥痨之类的。很多的癌症到末期的时候看起来就像大承气汤症，有的时候是纯大承气汤症，并没有癌症。那你要不要知道有没有癌症很简单，用阴阳的诊断法，所以说，有阴阳的诊断，一般的疾病是逃不出我们的眼睛，所以诸位这样对望诊就有大概的了解。那光是少阴寒实跟阳明热，你这样想，你就知道脉是怎样，这个少阴寒实的脉一定是微微细细的嘛，对不对？小小没有力，这个呢（阳明脉）又大又强又硬，洪大而且有力，才会造成阳明的腑热。同样的，寒实出现的时候，舌苔一定是比较白，比较厚。阳明热出现的舌苔一定是黄又厚又干，这样子。那颜色越黄到后来变成黑的，就热到极限变成黑了，白到极限也是黑，但是它是舌头上面津液非常的润泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-p8em3i6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-p8em3i6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240430083801-iw7xl8p.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-m6q3jak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-m6q3jak","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那人体呢在这里给大家一个概念，我们画个阴阳图，因为它是旋转，旋转的过程中随便怎么摆都是一样，人体阴阳是这样循环的。以阴阳来说，阳到了极致会开始生阴，阴呢到了极致会生阳，同样的，内经里面说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"热极生寒，寒极生热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个听起来都很悬，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳极生阴，阴极生阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我相信大家都耳熟能详这个话，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"怎么解释？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我解释给你听。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-v1eceq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-v1eceq7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"阳极生阴病例20240430_084735"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/阳极生阴病例20240430_084735-20240430084809-fpr5xf8.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 267px;","style":"width: 257px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240430085248-ezkpg33.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 257px;\" parent-style=\"width: 267px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ms723wk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ms723wk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我有个病人300多磅，女的啊！走进来是这样子，因为太大了，肉和屁股那么大，坐在椅子上，一张椅子太小，她大概屁股只坐了三分之一不到，三分之二露在外面，那么胖。来找我干嘛？患者说自己太胖了，要减肥。我说那你把牛奶通通停了不要吃，你喝牛奶越喝长得越牛一样。这是一个人啊（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"画图中..."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），肚子是那么大，背后， 腿那么粗对不对，你把它弯下来，手臂在这边，这是不是像头牛？人会这个形状就是喝牛奶，所以你喝牛奶喝越多就长这样子，我不用去劝人家说你不要去喝牛奶，我画个图她从此进就拜拜，从此就不喝了。因为趴过来就是牛嘛，就差两个角而已，那我们找孙鸿拿两个羚羊角放上去。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"回到与患者对话"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）牛奶不能喝了，起司什么的所有奶制品都不能吃了，然后问你口渴不渴？渴啊！热不热？热坏了！病人跟我形容，我热到冬天外面是冰天雪地河里面都结冰了，把冰打碎我人跳到水里去，我还可以听到像那个炙热的铁放到水里面呲~呲的声音，你看，病人就给我这样形容的。我说这好，很简单嘛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白虎汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我就没有多问，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"实际上我错了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vdc9yxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vdc9yxs","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开了白虎汤，看她口渴喝冰水热成这个样子，大剂的白虎一出手就是八两一付药，我想八两一付药九碗煮三碗，这一碗药白虎大概有二到三两，不到三两，一碗药啊！然后给她吃一个礼拜吃了，我想热一定会退掉。一个礼拜回来，我说你怎么样？她说我更热了！我口渴？ 我本来吃冰的还不用很多，现在要把冰块放到嘴巴里面嚼才行。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5ydz4al","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5ydz4al","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我心里想糟糕，这石膏的量给她吃下去都石沉大海，（那就）十二两！！一包啊，再加上其他的药像知母啊这些寒凉的药。再一个礼拜回来怎么样？患者说：倪医师我都不好意思跟你讲，我更热了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-h9yblxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-h9yblxc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我想糟糕怎么办？下手方向难道错了吗？按照所有的理论绝对是阳明热，我很少辩证错误，奇怪了。告诉我什么讯息，摸她的脉，脉很宏大，手脚呢热的，再问都是热症。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳极生阴，阴极生阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师划了划黑板上的八个字"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3oei3my","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3oei3my","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我说好，今天给你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"换药方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生附子三钱，干姜三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生附子三钱是因为她有300多磅，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炙甘草五钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。好，减肥嘛，我们把她排水一下，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"防己五钱，茯苓三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个完全是按照她状况开的，然后病人变成体力比较差，太重了嘛，骨头都伤到了，我们用一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"补骨脂"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，诸如此类的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生地"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，然后又开了补肾的药，我们一般会开些利尿剂，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"泽泻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样子，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"补肾为什么要开泽泻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"？因为前阵子跟大家讲过我们的中医呢，传统医学是汽车还在开的中间，高速开的时候帮你修理好，所以中医是艺术。肾脏24小时不断地在工作，你在补肾他还在工作，等于是一边工作一边吃东西，你补不到的。所以张仲景在六味地黄丸，用熟地生地的时候一定会用到泽泻，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"六味地黄丸是三补三泻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在里面。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用淮山我们会用一些茯苓，用山茱萸我们会用一些丹皮，山茱萸是补肝的，同时丹皮是清肝的，淮山能够补脾脏，同时我们茯苓把水把湿排掉，熟地大家都知道补肾的。在补肾时候，肾脏是老先生，哎老先生您先坐一下，我帮你工作，所以你要用泽泻把小便排掉，让肾脏得到暂时的喘息，这时候肾脏才补的到"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-x56z6qs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-x56z6qs","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你如果开的一票补肾的药，你没有帮肾脏开利尿剂，肾脏一边工作已经很累了，还要再吃东西更累！不消化补不到。所以常常你觉得说，哎奇怪，开补药开那么多怎么吃不到？因为你方法不对。那我就开给她了，心里面犯嘀咕，这个患者很奇怪，这个老是出招不按牌理出牌，可是我想不会错啊，因为我开了那么多热药下去对不对，她热没有到极限嘛？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xzjclmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xzjclmu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"热极生寒20240430_093507"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/热极生寒20240430_093507-20240430093527-eznk6ky.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-57a7clb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-57a7clb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以过去呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"她热我就用寒凉的药下来，再热我再用寒凉的药，她再热我再用寒凉的药，这是我过去的想法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以她一直在热。那现在的想法是她热没有关系，我让你更热，就圆的回来了，人体是圆的，太极的意思。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-s3srg4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-s3srg4u","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我就开给她啦，一个礼拜以后回来，我说你怎么样了，她就笑了，然后告诉你，她说现在是七月对不对？暑假很热，我中午站在太阳底下，三件夹克在身上我还是冷，我吓一跳啊，我给她开那么热的药，她吃下去是冷的，这就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"热极生寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。她说我这一生，从小到大没有那么舒服过，我说你冷还舒服？她说你不知道热的难过。那我就继续问她，那你吃了药感觉如何呢？她说不断地小便，所以是里寒，她是真正的里面是寒的，心脏和小肠中间是寒的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-k28p968","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-k28p968","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个人变牛图保留着，这个是用易经的象来解读的，好不好？我画完这图你从此就不敢喝牛奶了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1r94v84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1r94v84","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240430094219-7z7od9y.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fodtla0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fodtla0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心脏和小肠中间呢寒如冰，非常的寒，这是里寒。要把这个里寒融化掉，非靠生附子不可，那寒融化掉要有地方宣泄啊，寒是什么？是冰，化出来是水，所以就小便不断地下。她说说了你可能不信，我坐在那里以为小便便不完啊，怎么那么多尿呢？一直排出来，所以干脆我带一本杂志到厕所，坐下来一边小便一边看报看杂志，一直在小便，然后她开始瘦掉。我说那你还要不要喝牛奶，她说我不要做牛，因为第一天开始我就画一张图给她，从此她就不喝牛奶（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。你如果跟她讲解释了半天，告诉她喝牛奶有什么不好，她不会听的，我画张图给她就gameover了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-melcnok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-melcnok","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们为了说服人家，为了说服她，要想尽各种的手法，想尽办法去说服。所以你们看我网页哦，写出来都很奇怪，就是当时的心情怎样就都写出来，因为病人讲不听嘛，讲不听那就骂。骂我们要用很好的技巧来骂，这样子画图给她看，这是热极生寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6dahdq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6dahdq7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒极生热，我也碰过啊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！病人极度的寒，冬天夏天都一样手脚冰冷，看起来是四逆汤症，因为有恶心，开当归四逆汤下去，根本就石沉大海。好吧！那用四逆汤下去还是石沉大海，一点感觉都没有啊！我说天呐，我开的手都会发抖，生附子用到四钱五钱，到六钱我都不敢用了。算了，放弃用热药了，怎么搞的，用了五钱下去还是冷？就大剂的石膏下去，吃下去后她说倪大夫，我这辈子身体没这么热过，我把处方拿一看石膏八两，石膏是阳药，阳极生阴。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-f1au085","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-f1au085","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里面还有一个更深层的体会是什么，阴极生阳以外，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当我们要治疗阴实的病人，当我们把阳气提起来的时候，阴气会升上来，阴会自回"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这就让我领悟到伤寒论里面，当病去的时候，阴是要自回的，自己回来才能痊愈"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。比如说，嘴巴燥渴口渴，我们开个处方以后，病人说哎倪大夫吃了你的药以后，下面舌下生津，口也不渴了，津液都回来了。就像我们的大承气汤，原来大肠里面干燥，下去以后津液会回头，津液慢慢回来，他大便都正常了，所以大承气汤不是吃一辈子，让你小便变成淡黄就正常了，然后津液就回来了。那吃完大承气汤以后，你说老师我以前哦不但大便便秘还嘴巴都很干燥啊，随时要喝冰开水啊，热的要死，舌头都干的，早上起来后嘴巴都干苦的，那现在大便好了，舌头嘴巴里面津液口水很多，都不会口苦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这是津液回来了，阳极生阴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，当你阳气回来后阴会自己回，所以阴自回呢是代表痊愈，所以阴一定要自回，这个是代表正常痊愈了，这是身体自己恢复的一种表证。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0x9u4f1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0x9u4f1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果说你没有了解到，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳到了极限回到正常以后阴会回头，你不断地在补阴滋阴就不行了，阴我们不要去滋它，我们让它自己回头才行，这就是阳极生阴的另外一个解释"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ke3l5d3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ke3l5d3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们用阳药用了很多，原因就在这里面。临床上看的时候就是这样子，病人吃完恢复的时候，以前口渴的现象也没有了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-atnwpr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-atnwpr9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人口渴很燥渴，看起来我们要用滋阴的药，结果病人是大承气汤便秘的很严重，小便出来浊黄，屁也不放一个，有时跟我讲话常常神不在，为什么？因为沼气、浊气上升了，大承气汤一下去以后，他口渴燥渴全部回到正常，也不燥渴了，精神也恢复了，神智也恢复了，这就是临床上我们对阴自回的一种定义。那临床上，以后你们按照我们经典医学来处方的时候，你会看到很多这种"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阴会自回"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现象。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cxhu1la","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cxhu1la","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人有的时候会说，哎呀你看我皮肤非常不好，倪大夫你帮我把便秘治好，皮肤现在真好啊，现在更润泽啊怎么样子，那个黑人跟我讲，我看还是黑皮肤，我看不出来皮肤变的很好。我们中国人可以看得出来，黑人还说我皮肤从来没有那么好过，你看多好，那我也很高兴，你认为好就好了，我是看不到。可是呢！她就是阴自回的现象，皮肤都会受到润泽，所以你不用去开一些真正对皮肤好的药，或者怎么样，当然女孩子可以涂些面膜，做面膜啊晚上做点保湿啊什么的，这是我太太教我的我都不懂。她每次跟我讲，我就听了这样子，不听她又觉得我不关心她，所以我就要听啊对不对？那这种外面的无所谓，我讲的是从你皮肤层里面润出来的那种滋润出来的光泽，因为身体恢复到健康的时候，那种光泽的样子我们可以看到，这就是临床上看到的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4as14ei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4as14ei","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那还有像我们在治疗血癌的时候，血癌小孩子很简单，小孩子你不会看到胡子，也不会看月经嘛，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-huvssl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-huvssl4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是成人就看到了，像男人的胡须，就是我们讲的男人生化精子以后产生的残渣，从我们的任脉一路上来到我们口角绕一圈，成了我们的胡须。当这个残渣没有办法直接到口角，从任脉的地方反逆进入督脉，就造成男人的血癌。那在临床上诊断，我们在第六椎可以找到压痛点，那很少听到男人会得到红斑性狼疮，大部分都是女人，因为奶水离心脏最近，你的精子离心脏还远，她奶水离心脏最近，所以一般都是女孩子得到红斑性狼疮，就是因为女孩子有月经有奶水的关系。那很多未婚女孩子也会得到红斑性狼疮，因为你未婚照样会排奶水啊，只是不见地从胸部这边出来，但是乳房还是会沉淀奶水。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9wettm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9wettm7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那临床上的时候，我们在使用它的时候，因为我们也知道奶水是心脏在管，那我们强心也是用生附啊！那后来的诊断呢，你说老师怎么知道他好了？就是每天就开始刮胡子了，对不对？因为你知道呀，太监他有阴部，但是它的阴囊切掉了，有没有太监是把阴部切掉的？不会那么白目的，只是把阴囊切掉，留个小便的地方。那西医认为说，这个是睾丸在制造男人的精，好，没有关系我假设你是对的，我们所有的医书上记载，太监他还是有精，但挺不起来，精量不大。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"太监是因为这个切掉，精量变少了，所以残渣就没有了，所以太监就没有胡须"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有没有道理？反过来换一句话说，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为你有睾丸你就有胡须，切掉睾丸胡须就没有了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dcsl9vh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dcsl9vh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 228px;","style":"width: 218px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240430103555-oon2kpy.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 218px;\" parent-style=\"width: 228px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-drqs8bc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-drqs8bc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你如果不相信我们试试看下，没有关系，也可以试验一下就可以知道了。所以我们从这个地方也可以得到验证，这个睾丸不是真正的生精的场所，真正男人生精的场所是在（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"画图中..."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）...前面是膀胱，后面是小肠，小肠和膀胱中间呢有一个间隙，中医观念里认为这个叫做精宫。那这个精宫是紧连到小肠的火上面，膀胱是水，这个精宫就是在水火之间得到交融的状态下产生的精子。那这个现象人死掉以后就看不到了，因为人死掉小肠火就没了，精子就不会生，只看到一堆浓稠的血在里面，看不到精子。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ipdi9t2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ipdi9t2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们知道男人的精的前身是一些血，就在这个精宫。经过小肠的蒸化气化过以后，再跑到睾丸里面，才成为真正的精子。西医只看到后面没有看到前面，在这个过程中间，当我们把纯阳的东西交给睾丸以后，残渣就会从这边进入任脉，一直到我们的口角生成胡子。所以小肠是火膀胱水在这边，这两个中间交融的时候，就产生了精，所以有的男人脚是冷的，小肠的温度不够，结果这个血并没有百分之百化成为精，结果排精的时候就会看见血，西医说可能里面发炎了，你错了！精的前身是血，是太寒了，并不能完全化生成精，所以你会看到里面有血，结果把他抓去吃抗生素，抗生素不行打类固醇，你就乱搞！给我一看脚冷还是热的？冷的。好，开处方把小肠热回来就好了，行房时精子就看不到血了。就是因为他们西医没有我们那么了解人体的生理过程，这就是为什么我们马上就可以得到解释，这样就知道了为什么啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-l42y0ii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-l42y0ii","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240430103618-xrv93pv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-v0lgap8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-v0lgap8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那有的女孩子胸部的奶水下达到子宫来的时候，女人小肠，子宫，膀胱在这边，子宫卵巢也在这个地方，当这个奶水下来的以后，到了子宫卵巢里面，小肠的火蒸化以后，这个跑出来就是红色的，赤色的就是月经。当你的小肠温度下来不够的时候，结果跑出来的月经是粉红色，月经颜色太淡了，因为奶水的颜色还有一点点在里面，所以白的和红的在一起就变成了粉红色。那有的人小肠里面温度太热太高，里面有燥湿便秘，大便没有完全好，阳明症，这时候太热月经排出来是黑色的，或成块状的瘀血块，诸如此类的，那就可以依次推理了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-boq7v11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-boq7v11","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们在研究中医的时候，熟读黄帝内经，对我们身上水的气化过程一定要非常的了解，就可以做得非常的好，将来就可以称为一代的名医。我已经老了，我也不是什么一代名医，我只是小中医，但我希望大家都能够成为一代名医。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-beo874d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-beo874d","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"西医跟大家讲的都是血，所以验血报告，验血什么的指标，我不跟大家谈血，我谈“水”和“气”这两个东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-h9rfi00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-h9rfi00","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们休息一下，等我把气讲完以后，我们就可以开始带病人进来，好不好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5iwn1wq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5iwn1wq","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-qdg00d2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qdg00d2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们人身上的这个水的气化过程非常重要，今天我给大家一个概念，这个概念呢，就可以解决很多过去没有办法解决的问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ss5uila","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ss5uila","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先，饮水，你水喝下去到了胃里面，结果被胃热气化掉了，所以你喝的水会在身体里气化掉了，一气化掉以后，马上进入我们的淋巴系统，也就是我们所谓的三焦系统，然后就走我们的奇桓之腑。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-uuibcgh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-uuibcgh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 245px;","style":"width: 235px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240430110837-kgobvzb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 235px;\" parent-style=\"width: 245px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 289px;","style":"width: 279px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240430111433-n7op4pi.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 279px;\" parent-style=\"width: 289px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-k1zdukw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-k1zdukw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其次，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"食物里面的水，我们称之为阴水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"饮水是阳水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个阴水会进入到我们身体里面，我们以这个来做标准给大家看...当我们吃了五谷杂粮，喝了排骨汤，任何的食物，汤类都是食物。进到胃里面以后就消化掉之后到了小肠，那小肠里面有很大的火，这个小肠的热度跟心脏是相等的，因为有温度在里面，所以可以把食物消化掉，然后残渣漕泊跟水、食物、粪便在大肠里面走，大肠里面很多水，因为水是在小肠的上方，在小肠周围，所以大肠里面的水把小肠包住，这个小肠火就在烧水，这个水就进行第一次的气化。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大肠里面的水的气化，会经过三焦系统回到肺里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一次气化"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），更清的水呢就到我们的舌头下方，因为在心脏周围，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"舌为心表"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，舌头下面的金津玉液是我们嘴巴里面有唾液的来源。这个水到了肺里面去以后，除了生津以外，就从肺里面下降，金生水，当这个水进入肾脏以后，就是金生水。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小肠又靠近肾，所以小肠的火又做第二次的气化，把肾脏水再气化一下"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二次气化"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），这个水气化了以后顺着我们的命门火顺着督脉一直到我们的脑部去，这个气化过以后，比较脏的水从输尿管再进到我们的膀胱里，到了膀胱里面以后，我们人体精密到什么程度？到了这里还不放过水，为什么？认为还有干净的水在膀胱里面，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"膀胱跟小肠贴在一起，膀胱的水再气化"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第三次气化"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），干净的水从膀胱气化出去生木，这叫做水生木，当水生木的以后，膀胱里面的浊水这个时候人体才放掉，就是你的小便。你看这个水经过我们人体那么多的气化过程以后，才把浊水排掉，你说这人体精不精密？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9h7bt3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9h7bt3k","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当你有这个概念以后，有一天一个环节出问题了，肾脏功能突然消失了，肾脏功能衰竭了，消失的原因可能是你吃的很强烈的抗生素，或者是吃到中毒，临时性的肾衰竭，或者是长期的吃西药直到后来肾衰竭，吃降血糖的药直到后来肾衰竭，或者是怎么样，导致肾功能没有了，这个环节就出现问题（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"二次气化"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），大家现在知道这个水气化的过程，就可以依此类推。肺金每天每个小时不断地把水交给肾，肾现在说对不起我不收了，你不收肺不管啊，肺管你收不收我继续做我的工作，因为肺功能还是好的，不断地把水交给肾，这个水就停留在肾的上方这边，越来越多，所以肾衰竭的人呢没有便意，没有想到我要去小便，没有感觉。那个时候就觉得肚子很胀，没有小便也排不出来，这个时候水就慢慢累积上来到胃在这里，把胃包住了，那胃本身在蠕动，突然很多水堵在这面，病人的胃就不能蠕动啊，食物就吃不下去，开始恶心呕吐，所以肾衰竭第一个症状就是强烈的恶心，吃东西下去就吐。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-30v4aui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-30v4aui","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240430111841-hw3hh6d.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wd4u740","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wd4u740","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当我们的水，跑到心的下方，肺的下方，横膈膜的地方以后，中医讲是隔间有水，当水侵犯到这个位置上来以后，这个位置跟我们的......如果我现在画一个天平，这个是天平呢两边是等量的，所以很平衡，那有一天呢天平动了，实际上是基座在动，天平就晃动。西医一看，这个是鸣眩，头会强烈的昏眩是因为你中耳不平衡，这不是胡说八道吗。你把这个图放上去，天平呢这样子放到这里的时候...这时候我们画个人在这边（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"画图中..."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），这是上焦，如果说我们把天平的基座放到这边来，天平在这里，那你的基座一动，上面就会失去平衡。所以中医在治疗鸣眩的时候，我们是把中隔的水去掉。因为什么？因为这个水呢不应该是水，应该是气，气就是你吐出来有蒸汽有热力，如果你是冷水在这边，这个冷水稍微一动，身体一晃你就开始头晕。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2eqkvb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2eqkvb4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同样的肾脏上面水积太多，应该影响到胃，水又跑到中隔的时候，就会产生强烈的鸣眩，所以在这个阶段的时候，我们经方里面使用的是五苓散。五苓散呢，桂枝，白术，茯苓，猪苓，泽泻，把这水排掉，排掉以后鸣眩就好了。诸位看我们在排水的时候，你有没有看到炙甘草？没有，因为炙甘草会蓄水，你在排水的时候，你再开炙甘草下去会蓄水，所以经典医学里面，我们炙甘草不是说每个药都要加炙甘草，尤其是排水的时候我们不加。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zptgon1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zptgon1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肾脏上方的水不受，我们要让肾脏受水，这个就要靠真武汤，真武汤就是这样来的，就是为了这个设计来的，所以真武汤里面呢，我们加了炮附子，白芍，其他的药跟五苓散是重复的。如果你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把五苓散加上炮附子、白芍，再加生姜这三味药下去以后，等于是真武汤和五苓散的复方，就同时兼顾到肋下方的的隔间，同时兼顾到肾上方的水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以当病人进来的时候，在急诊室一看，哇头昏恶心呕吐，再看他气色黑的，手脚冰冷，再一看，眼睛瞳孔用手电筒看看瞳孔没有动，知道他是肾脏衰竭造成的。这个处方一下去，马上开始小便出来了，小便便意也出来了，头也不昏了，恶心也没有了，可以吃东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-64pesd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-64pesd5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以有时候我常常觉得，我好像应该待在急诊室里面，一看就知道啥病。那有的跑进来，她没有呕吐，她就是头昏，五苓散症，气色都很好，讲话还很大声，还是骂人，小便还有便意，那就绝对不是肾衰竭，肾衰竭的人小便没有便意。所以我们只要问会不会小便？不想小便，小便不出来，这种都是肾脏衰竭的症状。我"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-z77ozj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-z77ozj8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚刚为什么跟大家介绍这个气化的过程？就是可以根据这个推理推出来我们处方怎么用，这是一种。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8nub9sk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8nub9sk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一种呢，不是肾是肺出现问题，这个小肠跟大肠把水气化过以后，水到肺里面去，那肺里面这个水冷掉了，没有办下来，就停在肺里面。我们从大肠的水到肺里面的时候，是水气，水气就是热气，你不相信是热的很简单，你到镜子前面哈一口气，是蒸汽，代表我们身上水气是正常的热气。水气到了肺里面以后，就会是热气就好像天上的云一样，下雨下来就好像金生水，那你如果跑到天上，肺里面的温度不够，那你就没有办法变成云，就还是水在里面，停在里面下不来，就会乌云密布但是没有见水。这种情况就有两种症状出现。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5scud4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5scud4t","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一种"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果肺积水停在两肋的地方，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人给你陈述的症状，我两肋痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有水在肺里面的时候，病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"没有办法平躺，一定要坐在那边，他才能够呼吸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一平躺下的那个水就淹上来，就要咳嗽，强烈的咳嗽就要坐起来，这个时候就是我们的十枣汤症。我们利用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘遂，芫花，大戟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三味药，芫花是花类，甘遂是茎类，所以比例上的时候我们就要小心，甘遂2，芫花1，大戟 2，芫花的1就好像都是棉花，甘遂的1就好像是铁，了解我意思不？因为芫花一大把，就芫花1，其它的甘遂大戟是2，这样比例就差不多，这个加起来差不多是一钱的量。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"也就是说这个三个药加起来，按照比例加起来是 3.75 克"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那如果体形比较肥大，常年喝牛奶的，5克！懂不懂我意思？体格很大嘛，那就甘遂二克最好啦，大戟二克，芫花一克。我讲的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这种药粉专门装在胶囊里面吃，那用红枣去煮汤喝下去，清晨六点钟喝下去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，为什么是清晨六点钟呢？因为是开大肠的时间，所以他一喝下去，又吐又泻，大便排水，把水排掉了。那排掉以后，按照我们的做法，排了以后肺的功能会回来，因为大肠里面累积的水，大肠本来水要上升到肺里面去，也受到影响，当我们要把肺里面的水清掉以后，这个肺水会顺着三焦系统进入大肠。所以病人吃了十枣汤以后，上吐下泄，下泄一定是拉肚子，差不多六次，我都记得差不多六次，吐六次拉六次，吐和拉是同时发生的，所以最好安排一个厕所是坐在这边，面前刚好是那个水槽，吐泻物都有地方装，从头到尾三个小时吐六次，吐到十点啊十一点就没有了，就好了。那用这种方式来吐的话，病人积水不会回头，就好啦。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-57dct0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-57dct0v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你说我不要吃芫花，甘遂，大戟，我要抽水，好吧！那你抽吧，我只叫我敌人抽水，抽了以后水又回来，结果还是要喝我们的十枣汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hdnejev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hdnejev","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二种"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢，心脏。饮水以后停在心下，造成心下痞，中间这一块，我们叫做"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘遂半夏汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这里要用生半夏。甘遂在经方里面有三个地方用到，这是两个地方。还有一个妇科里面，子宫里面积水，妇人鼓胀，鼓胀并不是肚子整个胀，而是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"只有少腹，中极关元这一带"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，硬邦邦的一块，摸上去以为是肿瘤，实际上不是肿瘤，是水积在子宫里面，病人伴到的症状一定是便秘，便秘是跟着来的，那这种妇人呢，就算了你结婚60年好了，你还是不会生小孩。无论你结婚多久都不会生小孩，当然你计划生育不要生小孩，那你就不要治疗啊，就不会生小孩。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lsb2g9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lsb2g9z","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们有病人呢，结婚六年没有生小孩，进来一看是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄甘遂汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"症。大黄甘遂汤一下去以后病人吃的头昏，鸣眩，跑去上厕所大便都排出来，只要一剂就好了，吃完后第二个月就怀孕了，就好啦。这是我们用到甘遂最强的三个地方，我们会用到甘遂。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3287hwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3287hwe","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脑积水用甘遂都排不出来，肝癌、肝硬化用甘遂都排不出来，因为你用错药了。所以你只要用对药，甘遂、芫花、大戟都是可以用的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0n9klye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0n9klye","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脑瘤的时候，我们在排脑积水的时候，我们用的是大剂量的生半夏，所以我们在开处方的时候，就会把生半夏开在里面。所以我们在治病的时候要上工治未病，为什么要上工治未病？我们现在遇到这个病人一开始就预防，知道他会这样子，我们就开始预防一些动作，他就更不会积水了。就像昨天介绍肝癌去水处理的时候，我们会先去预防它，给病人吃一些淡味渗利的药，植物，预防他有腹水的现象。这样我们治脑瘤的话，开始我们就要一些预防动作，他就不会脑积水。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-i63mtc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-i63mtc5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那咱们传统中医有一句话："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"男怕脚肿，女怕头肿。为什么？因为男人的下半身是阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果脚肿起来，脚是人身上最远的，脚肿起来，是阳要绝的迹象，快要走了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"女人头肿，女人上半身是阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，头肿起来也是阳要绝了，就是要失去全部元阳，这是我们后面会看到的现象，就是水汽。所以水气非常的重要，所以我们为什么要用固阳补阳的药，在行阳的时候，让阳气回头？当你阳气回头了以后，到了四肢末梢到了头顶，女人要到了头顶，回头了以后，内脏功能就慢慢就回来了，所以阴自回。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ebyfpde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ebyfpde","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们在经方上面，我们很注重水，所以遇到这种情形的时候，我们下手都不手软的，不能手软。就好像甘遂半夏汤跟十枣汤，我们很清楚知道十枣汤是两个肋间的痛，甘遂半夏汤是心下的痛，所以我们病人同样是肺积水呀，我是但坐不能卧，不能躺平，躺下就咳嗽，呼吸气短，呼气呼不过来，我一定要坐到......那太太你那里痛？心下痛，甘遂半夏汤，已经讲完了，已经跑去开处方了。那如果两肋痛，十枣汤，就已经开完了。诸位就可以依照这一种的辩证的方式，就可以把水排掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1peoucc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1peoucc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗重症癌症的时候，我们要注意水跟食物"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个癌症、炎症、任何的病毒，它本身需要水，但它需要的是冷水，我们把冷水去掉，把它改成热水，它环境改变了癌细胞就不能生存，所以我们不需要去研究一个东西专门去杀癌细胞。你脑筋要去想，这个癌细胞能够在病人身体里存到，它一定比病人强，它才能在里面存活嘛，要不然它怎么活到？它存活的同时要长大要茁壮，它必须要把它的环境，改变成适应它才能够生存的环境，所以它最终要把你干掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9l985id","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9l985id","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"西方医学去杀癌细胞，你要发明一种化学药物的东西去杀癌细胞，你要知道癌细胞比人体还强，所以它在里面，那你要杀死癌细胞之前是不是要把人先干掉？所以这个病人真的死掉的时候，根本就是死在开刀死在放疗的上面。那如果我们中医治疗癌症大肠癌，你就死在大肠癌。给你西医治疗大肠癌治疗一段时间，死的是肝癌，肺癌，很多人直肠癌移转肺癌死掉的，就是因为他们不了解水。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-afh4mrc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-afh4mrc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"要把没用的冷水排掉，把身上的水全部气化掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二个呢，食物的营养供给"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，癌细胞也需要营养啊！所以癌细胞需要的营养要阻绝掉，最坏的营养就是我一再在网络上写的综合维他命，是最坏的营养，各种维他命都不要吃，什么钙片都是骗人的，所以这些都不要吃。营养要阻绝掉，食物要尽量吃天然的，越天然的越好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pyhk94j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pyhk94j","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这两个要是能够做到，癌细胞既没有水喝又没食物吃，这就是我们治癌最终的一个法则。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kwim2lm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kwim2lm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以所谓的水就是阳，所谓的食物你看得到就是阴，气你看不到但是你知道它存在，所以这个阴阳要兼顾到，这样的话治病起来就比较顺手。但不是说癌症每个都可以好，而是看他到什么阶段，有的到很末期才到我们手上，甚而至于到我们手上之前，很多内脏的功能都被破坏掉了，这就会产生一个更棘手的，更难处理的一种状况。所以说癌症本来就已经很复杂了，再加上前医之过，前面医师的过失，然后到我们手上，我们要处理两个问题，一个是病本身的恶化，一个是前医师犯下的过失，造成病人的身体的伤害。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6vza1ev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6vza1ev","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病还没好，已经移转了，结果前面医师用的药还造成病人更加伤害，你这个时候叫我们怎么来做？这个我们最难处理的时候。这事我要跟大家讲，就是说你们以后当医生一定要跟病人说清楚，让我们中医先动手，所以我在网络上常常说，女人的第一次先给我嘛，为什么？那个乳癌为什么不先给我呢，我帮你治疗，你不要第一次献给西医。献给西医，西医一看太好了，啪切掉。献给我，我告诉你我都不用看你的乳房，听就知道了，开处方多人道啊！我都不需要碰你，这样了解我意思不？我就故意这样骂，这是有原因的，好不好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qji9y7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qji9y7l","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们现在有个病人，在这里住院，让大家看看临床上我们怎么处理。理论上已经讲了很多了嘛，实际上来看看。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6obg6x7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6obg6x7","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-d9i041d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-d9i041d","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘丽红"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：女，52岁，文凤华。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-q03xpur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-q03xpur","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：文小姐，您放心，虽然我们同学那么多，机密。你放心不会传到外面去，不会闹得全世界都知道，你那个住院的原因是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-v6xmw4c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-v6xmw4c","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：检查我是肺癌，然后转移到脑部去。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-apjr5ta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-apjr5ta","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力宏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：你把你一开始的情况，简单的讲一下。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8gwj9fa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8gwj9fa","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：开始的时候是今年六月份，六月份的时候我不是胃不好吗，就在柳州人民医院做胃镜检查，检查完息肉切除了以后，又拍 X 光片嘛，切息肉的时候拍那个片子，上面就有一点点阴影。后来我问医生，医生说没什么，就是气管炎，就不管它了。后来我住院两天以后我就咳嗽，气紧，我就去找医生，医生说没什么啊！然后我就算了，就出院了。出院以后我就总觉得咳嗽气紧，我就去他们那找专家看，也是人民医院，他看了片子说，你这片子没什么啊，小毛病。他就给我开了抗过敏的药吃，吃了也不好，他说我是小毛病嘛。我也就不在意了。后来还是不舒服，就到我们小医院看。小医院看吧，就打青霉素啊，打过一个礼拜，他当肺炎给我治，拍个片子他说肺炎，然后治了又没治好，然后就又给我打了两个礼拜左氧沙星啊。然后不见好我就到中医院，柳州市中医院去看，那个毛主任说你这个片子六月份都有问题了，你赶快再拍个片子，他一看还是当肺炎给我治。治了一个礼拜他就又拍一个 CT，他又说给我抗痨..."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-itrmeoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-itrmeoo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（打断）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺痨（TB），就是肺结核，抗痨，就是肺结核。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-338k2o6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-338k2o6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"抗了痨又要打吊针、吃药，抗了二十天，然后出来以后又吃药，抗肺痨的药吃了一个月。出院当中，半个月我就检查一次，拍个 X 光片，原来是伞状的嘛，后来拍片以后他说吸收了，他说继续接着吃，我就吃了半个月。半个月以后拍了CT，又去检查，就已经整个成那个块状的了，他又喊我住院，说给我做穿刺，中医院。后来我就上人医院 检查去了，然后住院穿刺检查..."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-k7e7koy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-k7e7koy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后说你是肺癌，过程就是这样子的？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jp86otz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jp86otz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对，肺癌以后又给我做全身检查嘛，因为我头有症状嘛，麻嘛。身体右边从上到下都是麻的。在那抗涝的时候打了一个礼拜利福平、链霉素等，手指就开始麻了。在抗痨之前就大脚指麻，后来再过了一个多月，右侧头开始麻。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gzjtyq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gzjtyq5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，你现在心情先放轻松，好不好？我们中医除了看病，还可以看相。你现在两个眼睛"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"红丝灌睛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，红的血丝灌到眼睛上面，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这是心情极度的沮丧，很忧郁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你不要担心，担心也没用，担心了半天这个跟病没有关系，中医认为说，忧能伤肺，当你忧郁的时候会伤肺，那你肺有问题的话，再忧郁更伤肺。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-svqduuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-svqduuj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我问你几个问题，那基本上你先了解，不管我能帮你多少，我们既然接手，就会全力帮你治，好不好。你晚上睡觉好不好睡？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-su0mrf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-su0mrf3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我睡觉好睡。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-t9694i6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-t9694i6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那三点到五点钟都可以睡。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9u5xkj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9u5xkj1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三点到五点有时候，有点不舒服，这里边有点辣辣辣的感觉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cd05zpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cd05zpz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺里面感觉辣辣的，像擀蒜，大蒜一样，然后醒来醒过来？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-q123bn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-q123bn5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"醒来马上就能睡着。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dz1ilun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dz1ilun","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以不一定说三点到五点钟不能睡，好，那你晚上有没有盗汗呢？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7auhxzh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7auhxzh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"晚上不盗汗，现在。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zrggzjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zrggzjh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在不盗汗，以前有盗汗吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hrklr8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hrklr8x","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以前在治病前，我住院的时候盗汗。现在不盗汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pmgia0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pmgia0s","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你自己住在家里面或住在医院里面的时候，晚上睡觉的时候觉得身体是冷还是热？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zr3fhz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zr3fhz0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身体蛮热的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tf4058t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tf4058t","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身体蛮热的，那手脚呢？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2x6172b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2x6172b","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手脚也蛮热的，我比他们都热。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cgziqfa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cgziqfa","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你胸口痛吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-15gngqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-15gngqr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胸口有时有点痛，偶尔有点痛，有时又不痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2213rb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2213rb7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有时又不痛。你不用担心，你没有什么很坏的现象出现，好不好。头除了麻以外，头会痛吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8kcovpc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8kcovpc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"头偶尔有点痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ef26wjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ef26wjx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你觉得头里面是热的还是冷的？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-06rqsnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-06rqsnu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是麻木的，就觉得掐上去不是我的一样。手臂内侧也是麻木的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-h1tgh1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-h1tgh1t","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你大便好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5q5sd56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5q5sd56","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便还可以，每天都有，有两次。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-duilumo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-duilumo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便什么颜色？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-74e04u2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-74e04u2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便吃药的时候有点黄，平时还可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-f19wufw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-f19wufw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你有没有吃什么维他命的东西，多种维他命，维他命 ABCDE？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1t0dkkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1t0dkkv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"都没有吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-os5klo4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-os5klo4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你听她的症状就知道，我还不用看，光是听，西医从开始误诊一直到现在，很多的症状是被西医弄出来的。那你现在绝对不要再给西医治疗了，是你决定了吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4zxlcz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4zxlcz2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以人民医院给我直接转到那个医科大，我没去，我直接就这边来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5jwu0i2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5jwu0i2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么不去？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-htagbux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-htagbux","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为我不想让西医治了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-12hsz6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-12hsz6b","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样子哦，因为从头到尾他们都错嘛，对不对？你很聪明，从错误上学乖。你不用担心，你不严重，我可以告诉你，以你现在的症状，刚才我问你，以你跟我回答这些症状，你现在的病，不足以致命，要不了你的命，这是一个。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wuhitpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wuhitpk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二个，如果从现在开始我们动手，就维持这样子，今天就算没有好，就维持这样子，100年你还是这样，你现在都活着好好的坐在这边，代表你不会死。你一直没有恶化，你就坐在这边，你现在好好的活到嘛，代表你不会死，好不好？你气色也还不错，像我们冬天稍微气色暗点，还是对的，好不好。就是我看你眼睛，就知道你想太多了，压力太大，自己给自己压力太大，好不好？不会啦！你不用担心，你舌头我看看......你们看她舌头，比较黄、比较厚、比较干，对不对？上面是热，那你口渴吗？（开始摸病人手掌手背，摸额头）"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-q99q0ke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-q99q0ke","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口也不渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nh74hqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nh74hqf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口不渴。胃口好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-r536npo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-r536npo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口还可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-g63hhqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-g63hhqt","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"知道得到肺癌之前，胃口还算很好，知道以后胃口就比较差了，是不是？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-786z0zz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-786z0zz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"差一点。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1h2qx00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1h2qx00","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"问诊-阳退阴进20240430_133943"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/问诊-阳退阴进20240430_133943-20240430134017-8wgkjky.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ih2lt6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ih2lt6r","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我帮你开个处方给你吃的话，你吃的胃口很好的话，就尽量吃，好不好？你们等下可以摸她的手，她的手掌的热可以透到手掌这个地方（倪师指热透达到了指背）。就阴中有阳，阳中要有阴，阳这个部分呢它退后，阴里面的阳跑到这边来，所以阳在退阴在前，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳气在往后退，这个一摸就可以摸到"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。摸这个背面，像我们昨天摸一个同学，坐在这边擦黑板那个，一摸手都是冷的，以后怎么当医生？（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红摸病人手，热从手掌到手背指上"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）我们要让热跑到手指头边，跑到这个边界，这边是凉的（手背），这里是热的（手掌），她就好了，这是第一个。第二个你摸她的手跟额头，两个温度做比较，手掌跟额头的温度作比较，他额头是热的，比手还热，对不对？就代表阳是往外散的，阴在里面阳在上面，阴阳我们要让它交接起来的话，她的阳气入阴的话，他就好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wu9qsd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wu9qsd2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你不用再回去检查，你知道为什么不用回去检查，因为人家已经告诉你，你这个肺癌切掉，然后还要移转到脑部去，您这一生呢，从来没有那么坏的消息，也没有比这个更坏的消息了。那请问你，现在已经告诉你这样，你还要再回去检查干嘛，了解我意思吧？那你刚刚讲的很清楚，我有症状，我这边麻（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师摸右脑袋"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），手脚这边也麻，那你如果吃了我的药这边也不麻了，手脚的大拇指也不麻了，是不是代表你好转了，对不对，你这样了解我意思吧？那偶尔这个胸痛也没了，是不是代表你也好了？那你一觉到天亮，对不对，原来是晚上常常会醒过来，现在不醒了，一觉到天亮就代表你好了，所以很多的症状都可以表示，可以证明你好了，这样了解我意思吧？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b5f8ejl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b5f8ejl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后喜能胜忧，火刑金，火来克金，忧能伤肺，要喜能胜忧，所以你一定要很开心，所以你要做的一件事情，就是你要开心。其他的就交给我们来做，我讲你要开心，不到几秒钟讲完，你很难，了解我意思吧？所以你一定要把自己放掉，你要告诉你自己，又怎么样呢，我要开心的过日子，每天都要过。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-p74a661","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-p74a661","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我告诉你，有一对夫妻，这是真实的故事，2004 年的时候，发布在我们的报纸上面。英国在伦敦有一对夫妻，他们去做体检，那个医生一查，哎呀太太你来太慢了，你乳癌已经末期了，已经移到肺和脑，你大概只能活一年，你也不用做什么化疗，你赶快回家多吃一点好吃的。再一查先生，先生你也不要太高兴，这个你不会续弦的，因为你这个动脉血管堵塞了，大概四根，做绕道手术都来不及了。这两个夫妻就想想，回家，两个人就商量这怎么办呢，对不对？商量到最好，就说这样子好了，既然我们是这样子，那我们就什么都不做，我们不要任何治疗，他就把伦敦的公寓卖掉，大概卖了 25 万英镑，然后拿这个钱去环游世界。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-c2kwsbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-c2kwsbc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他们列了50件事情写在纸上，他说我生前要把这50件事情完成，第一件事情我要环游世界，夫妻俩就买了那个伊丽莎白全世界最大邮轮的船票，就在到处去玩啊！游玩，这半年中间呢，他们游玩全世界，而且每天晚上跳舞，听歌啊，然后夫妻两个从来没有开心过，就好像回到当年结婚前谈恋爱的时候。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5i7dnr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5i7dnr6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后呢，到了当地...接下来就看当地的风土民情，到非洲啊，什么他们都去看，然后半年以后，夫妻两个人就回到英国。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-inijapz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-inijapz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后他们说我们第二件事准备开始，我们先去看看医生检查。结果医生一看，说太太你没有乳癌了，再一看先生你动脉血管都通了，这是真人真事哦。结果糟糕，夫妻两个钱花光了，我们人啊很痛苦，钱赚了很多，生前没有花完，这很痛苦，还有就是钱花完了，人还活着也很痛苦。所以你要乐活，乐活好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9x3psvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9x3psvr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当你放开来，你不怕死，wo what！我不管！我们就赢了，我们就已经赢一半！我们的药可以治你的身体上的病，但是没有办法治疗你的心理，这一定要你去克服它，好不好？你相信我，你这个状况现在不严重，现在问题是讨厌在哪里，根据你刚刚讲的病史，这个前面的西医的医院，他们是按照西医那一套。我不见得说医师是错的，而是西医那一套本身就不对，他把你抓进去乱枪打鸟，先是肺炎就给你一票青霉素啊，什么那种药，然后他又说TB肺结核...你们知道肺结核的药有多强？在医院里临床医师知道，很多人吃抗TB的药，一个月肝衰竭了，肝功能没了，就换肝了。那你运气还好，你了解我意思吧？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-188s1mx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-188s1mx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我吃了不到两个月。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xd46qeq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xd46qeq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你还是抗，抗了半天还没好。我认为你根本就不是肺癌，硬是被搞出来的肺癌。好可怜哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-j5s77o1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-j5s77o1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们每个人都有癌细胞，你如果说肺癌，我看过肺癌的很多，看过肺癌非常多，有的太太一辈子不抽烟，真冤枉啊，她得到肺癌。那在得到肺癌之前一年，每天晚上三点钟起来五点钟才能睡，这是从纽约来的一个电脑软件专家，他才51岁，正要退休了，就得到肺癌。那他当然的很不甘心啊，那我来治疗他。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wcn1iir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wcn1iir","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你就不要去想那么多啊！你原来根本就不是肺癌，是硬在医院里面被搞成肺癌来的，所以你的肺癌是made by human（人为的）。你原来不应该有这个病，那就算它移转到脑部也没有关系，你按照我的话做，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-urcrik0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-urcrik0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就吃中药嘛，我们中药很简单啊，我开给你的药，你叫你先生叫小孩子都可以喝，没有肺癌的人都可以喝！如果西医治疗化疗呢？来来来，你来做化疗，你先生没有肺癌也做做化疗好了，那个医生就说，你正常人怎么可以做化疗，这个化疗很毒会死人的。那健康的正常人做了化疗会死，那你是不健康的人，你身体没有健康人那么强壮那你是死定了嘛。知道我的意思吧？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hg7mdz1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hg7mdz1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我的药没有肺癌的人也可以吃，好不好？我会帮你开处方，虽然我后天就回台湾了，没有关系，只要刘老师跟我说，你的红丝灌睛没有了，我就知道你回来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-717ca2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-717ca2i","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你们看她眼睛，这叫做红丝灌睛，眼球中间两边眼白部分有红的血丝透过来。红丝灌睛这个象，过去在监狱里面要被推出去斩首的人，就可以看到红丝灌睛。所以你不用怕，你没有罪你不会死，真的不会死，你这样子绝对不会死，那你这样一直忧郁下去，就真的死掉了。你死的原因呢，一是死在忧郁上面。第二个是前医之过，好不好？现在我帮你处方还是比较难一点，为什么？因为我还同时要把你的身上毒排掉。你要吃我的药，要吃到身体头面都感觉是冷的，只有手掌脚掌是温热的。你现在感觉头是冷的还是热的？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9xis0p0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9xis0p0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"热的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nzx7otb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nzx7otb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对，吃我的药，如果越吃越热就不要吃了，这是倪海厦骗我，如果说吃了头冷掉了，手脚温热就代表药对了。一直吃，吃到红丝没有了，同时每天睡觉可以一觉到天亮，三餐正常吃，精神体力很好，每天看看舌苔也变淡白了，早上看看眼睛的红丝没了，就好了，不要想那么多。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cmyxy3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cmyxy3b","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们治病，除了病理上、生理上的，心理上一定要帮病人去克服它，她这个反应很正常，对不对？所以常常人家跑到西医那里去检查，台大还有一个警察，我父亲台北的一个同事，他们在这个公家单位当公务员，科长级以上，就检察官以上每年都要体检。有一次他跑到医院去体检，一查报告说可能是肺癌，他从那一天开始，什么都吃不下，什么都不对，不到两个礼拜整个头发都变白了，结果呢，一个月以后医院通知他，对不起我们误判，您没有肺癌，他一听到从此又高兴回来，可是脸上的皱纹，白头发从此都没有回来过。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-oad5pe8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-oad5pe8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（摸着病人的脉）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你对我来说，你真的不像肺癌，就算你做过切片，你不是真正的肺。那个手我看看（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"两只手一起摸脉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。我们摸脉的时候，女人的左手脉是血脉，右手脉是气脉，女人的血要大于气是正常，男人的右手脉要大于左手脉，这叫正常。寸脉是阳脉，尺脉是阴脉，所以阴阳一定要协调，那阳脉中要有阴，所以你摸到阳脉的时候要比较小一点点，阴脉要有阳，所以摸到阴脉要比较大一点点，这是正常。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-x2g04gs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-x2g04gs","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你摸脉要知道阴阳，这样子就很简单。你不要说太素28脉，频湖脉决，背了半天，出来还是弄不清楚没有用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以写得好的书呢，一定是越简单越好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那个什么频湖28脉弄了白天，你把它统统弄清楚，回来摸脉还是摸不清楚，没有用，那个书写的不好，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"写得好的书，大家都能够看得懂"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wb9tndr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wb9tndr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你真的很好，就不要担心，你想太多了，真的很好。我们有附骨脉，这个附骨脉就是肺里面长东西的话能摸到，我们摸她的脉，按到骨边的时候脉还在那边还在跳，里面就是长东西了。虽然西医他找到什么阴影，找到个白点去切片说你有肺癌，可是它一点成长的迹象都没有，好不好？你很聪明啊！你是柳州来的嘛？（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对，找的刘博士），你前面就在柳州做的检查吗？（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就在柳州），柳州产棺木的，怎么可以在那里做检查（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），要到我们南宁来。柳州棺木是不是很有名？我虽然没去过柳州，我们没有吃过猪肉也看过猪走路嘛，我们读地理历史也读过，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vvz5f06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vvz5f06","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那个柳州不好，有到柳州玩玩就好了，不用去检查了，难怪那边产棺木。你的脉很速，稍微速一点。我们的脉如果说以脉象来说，比如说一息五至是正常，超过六至七至就比较危险，到了八至以上九至十至就随时会有突发的危险。你的脉差不多在五至到六至的中间，那睡觉偶尔不好，是你小题大作了，好不好？所以这段时间你去柳州可以，但是不要再去那边检查了，脑筋很清楚，要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"悟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，错一次两次，第三次还在错就真该死了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-p7krogo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-p7krogo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你口渴吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wumwui2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wumwui2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-bndq62l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-bndq62l","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果你渴了，想喝热水还是喝冰的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-s5iggqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-s5iggqf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"喝热的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-227tadn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-227tadn","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想喝热的，不是逼自己喝热的哦？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nqt76vh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nqt76vh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有时候，反正以前的时候，有时候喝冰的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3p8axnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3p8axnz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想喝冰的，现在呢？要告诉我想喝的哦，不要说我不敢喝，我常常问人家口渴，病人就说我喝热的，等我离开的时候，病人就说医生我是逼自己喝热的，我知道喝凉的不好，我是逼自己喝热的，实际上我很想喝冷的，我要知道实际上..."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-yvwxbn4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-yvwxbn4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实际上我也想喝冷的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6e50vld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6e50vld","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对对对，我要知道这个就好了。好吧！你不要告诉我你逼自己喝什么，喝冷的喝热的都没有关系，但是你一定要告诉我你的感觉，我才可以帮助到你，你想喝冷的冰的？ 病人：冰的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lxiui5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lxiui5m","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更好，阳明无死症。舌头是黄、燥，口渴想喝冰的，一派白虎汤症，对不对？阳明没有死症嘛，这样了解我意思吧？我看过很多肺癌的，有时才看过一个礼拜，病人就走掉了，为什么？因为到我面前快要死掉了，那我怎么办？你的症状都不像要出事的，好不好，来这边就是对的，我开个处方你吃吃看，吃完以后你说哎，很奇怪，本来想喝冰的喝冷的，现在都不想喝了，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ctc6cqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ctc6cqp","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-yk2n302","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-yk2n302","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们使用白虎汤，除了是寒凉的药以外，白虎汤是阳药，好不好，这个攻坚的，可以用的，对不对。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vr7e70h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vr7e70h","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力宏："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你那个压，应该是第几椎？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fxvxzlp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fxvxzlp","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三椎，对，您坐这边来，我们两个换个位子好给同学们看，好不好？你这样侧坐，面对黑斑，这两个肩胛骨在这边，这两个肩胛骨之间心中画一条线，不要真的拿黑笔画一条线哦，那么白目啊。那这条线经过的是第七椎，从大椎到第三椎，大概这个位置上（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大椎到第三椎的中点"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），我们先不要去碰它，第五椎大概在这里。现在我用指头来按，你感觉哪个地方最痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5mb13nj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5mb13nj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就那个地方（第三锥）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wnbcbve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wnbcbve","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里哦。你说奇怪倪海厦你怎么知道这里痛，老是按这个地方。这里都不痛，就这个地方痛？（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是）。记得哦，吃我的药，每个礼拜，我们都会有人帮你按这里，那你就告诉我们那个医生，你是痛是增加了还是减少了，是不是这里（第三椎），这里不会对不对？（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是）。看到没有，是第三椎痛，肺俞。那吃我的药，哪一天我们再按这里都一样，你不会觉得这点特别痛，按的都一样的时候，同样的力量按，他痛都没有，就是好了。那吃我的药，反过来越吃越痛就不要吃了，好不好？我们当一个医生，绝对没有医生敢说百分之百可以治病，但是医生一定要诚实，我不能帮你我就收手，懂不懂我的意思？我们不能帮就赶快收了，把机会让给别的医生，不要耽误病人的病情，对不对，好不好？我们不能让病人浪费钱，浪费时间，这是基本上的一个道德，好不好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-34eeb4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-34eeb4f","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240430152952-m738etp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qodccmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qodccmx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你们有手电筒没有，可以看诊，肺里面有白浊，有黑点，浊点都是......"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"石膏四两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"去热，舌苔厚、黄，你们看不到她的舌苔等下可以过来看看，她"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"舌苔是比较厚，厚是代表里面湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，知母是去湿的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"她舌苔中间有点黄，黄是来自心脏，心里面压力大啊，所以我们加点黄连一钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，她心里不好，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩二钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，太太受到惊吓，然后呢，白虎汤里面有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炙甘草三钱，粳米二三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就够了，增加点肠胃的津液。然后呢，我们加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们昨天去的一个地方叫做扬美古镇，扬美古镇里面有个人做豆豉做的很好，我们加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"豆豉二钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"给你吃吃好不好，你看我们这个中药多好啊！你有没有听说吃豆豉死掉的，只听过卖豆豉的赚钱哦，所以中药好不好？很好！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5hpaazf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5hpaazf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个处方呢九碗水煮成三碗。那后面要加减了，张仲景处方里比如桂枝汤如果出现什么症状，就加什么加什么，现在大家都会了。如果她出现咳嗽，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"咳嗽加五味子三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果出现"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白痰，痰比较多加半夏三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果出现黄痰，吐的黄痰比较多，我们加杏仁三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，诸如此类的。如果病人吃了这个药，口渴仍有，可以再加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"天花粉三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺痛严重，加紫参三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果痛会更严重，可以加到五钱都没有关系，这就是我们的加减。那病人她这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"头麻，上面的基本处方加一味药，葛根加六钱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ex1ihz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ex1ihz0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝汤加葛根本来是我们明天晚上讲的，桂枝汤加葛根呢，我们用桂枝汤去表风，病人口歪眼斜，歪过去了就加葛根。葛根这个树很好玩，这个本草呢，它在树上是攀攀爬爬，像蔓藤一样爬到树顶，我们用它的根，葛根强到可以把底下的津液输送到最顶端的地方，但是你用三钱二钱没有用，你重用六钱八钱一两的时候，那个面部中风的现象就突就去掉，麻就退掉了。那你看面部中风呢，你要去用什么拉脸做脸啊，脸部做美容啊拉皮啊或者做什么，还是吃桂枝汤加葛根你自己决定。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们不要管里面的内症是什么，麻就是葛根，就去掉了，好不好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"？这个顺便跟大家讲。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fo0un4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fo0un4o","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们会用到葛根汤，就是桂枝汤加葛根再加麻黄，就是葛根汤。太阳篇我们有三证，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阳中风就是桂枝汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阳伤寒是麻黄汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"太阳温病是葛根汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以经方里面呢，也有谈到温病，只是大家以为这个经方里面没有讲过这个温病，所以就说南方呢没有伤寒，南方都是湿热带，所以我们都不会用经方。你错了，经方里面有讲到温病，第三条讲的葛根汤就是太阳温病。所以葛根汤适用在小孩子很皮，每天跑啊每天运动流汗，在流大汗的状态之下，得到的感冒，所以不是讲环境的温热，而是说病人的身体正在温热正在流大汗的状态下得到感冒，这就是温病，而不是指环境湿热造成的感冒叫做温病。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zr01szb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zr01szb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"明天晚上我们在大会的时候，我们再讲这个感冒，那听起来感冒又是一套。讲了半天，这几天我在这边讲的就是那薄薄的一本伤寒杂病论，通通包含了，这就是上古之医。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2acr2lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2acr2lf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好不好，你今天开心了吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wdqxmgx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wdqxmgx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开心了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ubtkhln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ubtkhln","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开心了很多，我知道你会开心很多，一定要开心，你开心真的赢了，我们都会赢，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zk3r6t2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zk3r6t2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好吧，这就是给大家的建议。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7xs3lcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7xs3lcb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"OK，给你建议吃了看看怎么样，到时候给我们讲，好不好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-z8d8wn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-z8d8wn1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2pk6ciq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2pk6ciq","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-7q6fezl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7q6fezl","updated":"20240828171608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第五讲：心脏病治疗 2009 年 12 月 6 日南宁"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-s3xcl2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-s3xcl2k","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我跟大家报告一下，昨天那个，像我们在诊断的时候，我们的阴阳诊断的方式，我们常常在内经或者在各地读到不管是阴阳家写的，阴阳气这样...“天地有正气，杂然赋流形”，阴阳气要流行，气机要流转，你怎么知道他气机很流转？里面没有阴实任何东西的堵塞住。就是我前面跟大家讲的，并不是我们就摸脉摸什么，像我手这样一摸，主要是手掌，就是你看他，他手上是冰的你看（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师摸学生的手示范"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"手掌正常是阴嘛，阴中要有阳，所以你摸到手掌是热的。手背是阳，阳中要有阴，所以摸到阳侧应该是凉的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以阴阳最平衡的时候，你一摸，手掌是热的，手背是凉的，这个手指边缘就是阴阳交界的地方，我们在针灸里面说是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"赤白肉际"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这是第一个。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ycw7fip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ycw7fip","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二个，摸他手掌的时候，另一只手去摸他的额头，手掌温的，额头凉的，这个人就已经是正常的。所以如果你小孩子要上学，突然说妈妈今天我身体不舒服，你打电话给老师说我生病了，我不想去学校。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"妈妈口吻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）儿子你过来，一摸假的，混蛋！你赶快去上课。儿子还纳闷你怎么知道我骗你，我们从很多地方可以知道，望也可以知道，这种就是阴阳诊断方式。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2qj6v9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2qj6v9q","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那像昨天的太太，她是被西医诊断肺癌，当你摸她的手掌，她的热从手掌传导到手背这个地方来，这个就是阴中的阳出来了，正常情况阴中的阳要躲在阴里面，结果阴中的阳往外走，摸她额头时是烫的，对不对？因为她阴阳要分开来了，一部分阴里的阳已经出来了，这个时候我们用药物下去的时候，怎么知道有没有效？就是检查的时候一摸手掌，手掌慢慢开始热起来，手背越界的阳热开始慢慢退，慢慢往指尖退，手背慢慢开始凉起来，额头由烫的变成温的，代表病人进步了，马上就知道了，这样摸两下只要几秒钟。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-voo71rr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-voo71rr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你想想看，你要到医院每次还要重新检查，再做个CT再做个什么，哪用那么麻烦？病人没事每天在那里做CT，结果死的时候，是辐射线造成血癌死掉的，那个照太多也会得到病，那个不好，对不对？大家也研究西医，也知道不好。所以我们用摸的，大概就可以知道。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xam3589","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xam3589","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但这个同学呢，这个摸上去手掌是冷的，这个冷呢，还不单单是手掌冷，他是从手背一路冷到手掌来，这个是阴寒的体质，人在广西南宁，身体还在东北，你这样了解我意思不？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ah3ex1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ah3ex1p","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过去有温病家说南方无伤寒，因为南方湿热，所以湿热的地方就不会有伤寒。不是的，这个跟环境湿热没有关系，这个病是从里面发出来的症状，它就是寒。好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-oddy8w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-oddy8w4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"手掌颜色对比20240506_125020"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/手掌颜色对比20240506_125020-20240506125048-dx9tgah.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"翻掌颜色对比20240506_125213"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/翻掌颜色对比20240506_125213-20240506125240-neafldr.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2zpjm2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2zpjm2o","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那寒的时候，你看他手指颜色，他的手好像被那个黄瓜腌过以后的颜色，你看这个手的气色，把手翻过来，看到没有？我一再跟大家讲过，手掌的颜色是粉红色的，粉红色的来源是一点点的红色跟很多的白。对不对？那你光是望，这位同学已经要找我们看了，就是现在开始动手，把环境改变掉了，这叫上工治未病， 对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-p07vmzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-p07vmzb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240506125400-l39r89d.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0xg6oos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0xg6oos","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以心脏呢是一点点的赤色，然后肺很大。如果哪一个同学跑出来，说老师根据我的研究，肺比心脏小，心脏比肺大，那你就是白目，你不用来了，西医都把你赶出去，不要说我把你赶出去的。所以肺是白色的是多，大一点点，心是赤色的，少一点点，所以是粉红色，手掌上的颜色就是粉红色。那你看看这位同学手掌颜色是什么？是淡粉红色，是不是白的比较多，红的比较少？所以他心火不足，心阳不足，对不对。肺中有寒很盛，所以他白很多，白的更多红的更少，就变成这种颜色， 那手指头就冷的、冰的，就是这样来的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8lkov08","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8lkov08","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那他还好，我常常临床的时候，我的学生进来我要来摸摸手。你这个手太冷不行，暂时你不要说是我的学生，等我把你的手弄好的时候，你再去说你是我的学生。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gw9c6ug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gw9c6ug","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其中有个小女孩子呢，加州蓝湾中药大学的，她手盗汗的很严重，那个手这样一握拳你就可以看见汗水滴下来，从小到大就是这样子啊，那你说怎么办？我一摸她的手，我只摸了几秒，但是过了两分钟以后，我的手里面开始冷，冷到我骨头里面，我说你这个是天山派寒冰掌的掌门人，我非把你毁掉不可。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"就开始让她吃生附"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，吃了两个月的生附，第一个礼拜吃完手汗就没有了，可手还是冰的。结果我就不管她啦，她说我们不要打扰老师，我自己吃，她吃了两个月我都不知道哦，然后两个月回来手完全温热的，汗通通没了，她生理期什么都恢复正常，这就是上工治未病，马上就可以诊断出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fiodezo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fiodezo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以这是阴阳的诊断方式，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师又握回台下同学的手"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）那他这个是因为心阳不足，心一直在不断地跳动，虽然他人还活在这里，心不断跳动，但阳不足的时候没有办法把肺气往下压，压到小肠去，所以说他心热往上走，往上走的时候所以上面是烫的，就会出现这种上热下寒的现象。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-uw4unse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-uw4unse","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那一般我们出现上热下寒的现象，我们会用石膏和炮附子煮在一起，如果病人上面热，燥渴，很想喝冰的，然后脚是冰冷的，你说这个病人是不是神经病？脚又是冰的，身体又是冷的，居然想喝冷的。这个人不要看，这个人是找我们医生的麻烦，是矛盾的（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"调侃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。其实不矛盾，他真的是这样子。他上面的确是热，下面的确是寒，有这种情形。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pkem9z3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pkem9z3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有一种人是纯粹是里寒的，我不口渴，完全不口渴，也不想喝冰的，有时候我一天常常忘了喝水。如果我是国防部的部长，我就专门挑这种人，不要治疗，把他放到沙漠去，因为这种人不需要水的补给，他不会渴死。他在那边大太阳晒，他都很好啊，不用喝水，所以我们派这种人到部队去，不用给他枪，他光着观察敌人，那个敌人没水就死掉了，他还在那里观察，敌人都统统死掉了，我还没死对不对？不用打仗，敌人就死掉了，不用发一枪一弹，你了解我意思吧，因为他有那种体质，我们就派这种人去沙漠，所以要会挑人。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b2bzkub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b2bzkub","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像他这种（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师指刚才的学生"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），如果他不口渴，完全不口渴，也不想喝水，这就是里寒很盛。所以我们不用去管它里面的病是什么，去里寒唯一的药就是要靠生附子。像李可老中医，像孔医生他们，他用炮附子，他就一直用炮附子，因为他知道里寒嘛。可是炮附子呢是固表阳，他如果要把里寒去掉的话，没办法去掉时他就会一直加量加加加，自然就出现炮附子要用到 100 克 200 克 300克 400 克 500 克这样子上去，因为他发现病人吃到四五百克里面还是寒的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vbebcbb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vbebcbb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其实不用这样做，炮附子我甚而至于治疗尿毒症最多也只会用到八钱，有时六钱五钱就解决了。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"重剂炮附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）改用生附子三钱，生附子的时候一定会用到干姜二钱，炙甘草五钱，这就是四逆汤。那四逆汤要把里寒去掉，他的手冷，药力要完全到达指头边，就要靠桂枝三钱，他的体格就可以开到三钱，诸如此类。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-61crext","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-61crext","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那有一些处方上面呢，我们会遇到一种情形。比如说我们治疗尿毒症、肾衰竭，肾衰竭的病人很可怜，就是血液透析嘛，然后弄到死的那天才来找中医，可不可以治疗？可以治疗。在初期的时候，刚开始的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人发病时一定会有两个症状，一个是极度的暝眩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我昨天跟大家讲过，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"还有一个是恶心呕吐得很厉害"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那极度的鸣眩跟恶心呕吐呢，产生的病因、病机是这样子..."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hwlpepm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hwlpepm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240506135155-5orawp9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lkdjr40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lkdjr40","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺是金，金应该生水，这叫做正常，所以说肺里面的津液到了肾里面以后，肾经过输尿管到膀胱把废水排出去。这个系统中肺水能够进入肾脏，而肾脏主收纳，统统可以把它接受起来，这个能够受的话，就没有问题。那有一天肾功能开始衰弱下去了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾功能开始衰弱下去的时候，并不代表肺不会供水给肾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以肺还是不断的给肾供水，那肾说对不起，门关起来不收，不收了这个水就开始累积在肾的上方，越来越多，等到多到顶到胃了以后，病人开始恶心呕吐，吃什么都吐，不吃也吐，一直恶心一直吐，你再查胃，胃好好的没有问题。这是因为肾水上来了，等到上来以后，到了横膈，肺的下方有个膈中，就是我们的横膈膜，这时横膈膜好像泡到水里面，当你的冷水进来这个横膈膜的时候，就会造成昏眩，暝眩。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ibd8b59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ibd8b59","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说我们把水分两段治疗，初期的急救的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾脏不能收纳水我们靠真武汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"横膈膜产生暝眩，诸位看伤寒论的时候，头昏暝眩的时候，我们用五苓散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，是在这个时候用五苓散。我们真的在风水、皮水，我们有五种实水，水肿的时候我们反而不会用到五苓散，用的是我们的越婢汤加白术或者是防己黄芪汤，防己茯苓汤，甚而至于是黄水我们用黄芪苦酒汤，那都不会用到五苓散。这个里面里水我们会用到五苓散。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-at7jurh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-at7jurh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五苓散跟真武汤配起来，如果你把两个处方放在一起的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝、白术、泽泻、茯苓、猪苓"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为部分药相同的，真武汤里面就会出现"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子，白芍，生姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。诸位打开伤寒论看看真武汤，我们经方里面使用炮附子的时候，配到炮附子用的一定是生姜，使用干姜的时候配到生附子，这是我们急救用的。所以病人跑到你的诊所或者急诊室里面，恶心呕吐，你看他气色黑的，就是尿毒！并不是吃坏肚子，吃坏肚子上吐下泻，那是食物中毒，大黄甘草汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5057108","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5057108","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那病人当时很奇怪，他什么都呕吐，就是吃这个汤剂不呕吐"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，下去以后小便排出来了，恶心呕吐的现象也去掉了。但是我们治肾呢，一定要治心，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"木生火，火生土，土生金，金生水，水生木"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个大家耳熟能详。大家在看难经的时候，它说治肝先实脾，然后它就不写了，就说依此类推。因为竹简嘛，刻着麻烦，让他小徒弟拿着跑出去，门槛没过去摔倒了，那竹简也散掉了，很麻烦。同样的，我们治水，治肾是不是先要治心，就依此类推了，对不对？你治肝要实脾，治肾先治心，治肺要强肝，对不对，就是以此类推。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hx2wdho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hx2wdho","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那治肾我们要强心，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"要强心就要靠什么，靠生附子，生附子用的时候诸位就要加干姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。炙甘草，所以我们有干姜附子汤，有干姜甘草汤等等。这个处方（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"五苓散+真武汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）如果是我们正要排水的时候，已经引起恶心呕吐了，这个时候我们就不要加炙甘草，你看真武汤，五苓散里面你看不到这个炙甘草的，因为炙甘草会蓄水。所以我们把水排掉以后，病人没有恶心，没有呕吐，也不会暝眩了，这个时候我们可不可以用炙甘草？可以用炙甘草，这就是随机的加减。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jzuhk7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jzuhk7n","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们在应急的时候，反而不能用炙甘草，我们用干姜跟生附。那你开这个处方，病人在吃这个药的时候，这个水绝对不会回来，因为肾已经开始受纳水了，因为炮附子的关系，那我们要治疗肾，要把心脏弄好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6oknjre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6oknjre","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么我一再反对大家吃止痛药，吃抗生素，因为你吃这些药一定伤害到心脏。不要说累积在肝脏里面，光是伤害到心脏的时候，你会面临七种癌症在后面，我那天跟大家讲了，女人的话，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乳癌、红斑性狼疮、血癌、肺癌、脑瘤、肝癌、淋巴癌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我不是跟大家报告过了。你再回头看看昨天那个病人，她刚开始查的时候是肺炎，就把她抓去照了片子，你去给她照了片子，照了半天CT也照了，也说不出来她肺癌，等到后来才查到肺癌，如果有肺癌，应该一开始就能查到了，你这样了解我意思吧？所以她开始不是肺癌，她是吃了很多的抗生素，抗生素下去还是不行啊，不行以后西医就说是肺结核，就吃抗核的药，更毒！吃的心脏都受损了，结果又说她肺癌，她是被硬搞出来的肺癌。所以到柳州买棺材可以，到柳州看西医就不行，当然最好建议你们看中医，这一定要记得。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7uew0eq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7uew0eq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个处方加起来就变成我们治疗肾脏，尿毒很好的处方（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真武汤+五苓散+生附干姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师拿起刚才那位学生的手"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）他这个手还有一点血色，尿毒病人拿起来手是苍白的，苍黑的，有一点白带点黑的，因为肾脏哦...这代表不造血了，造血功能会受到影响，所以说很多尿毒的病人都贫血。那你眼睛望过去，怎么搞的我们诊所来个黑人，那个就是尿毒的病人，因为尿毒的脸就是黑的，为什么黑的？黑色是原来的营养，看起来以为是病气，实际上以正常人为标准我们来解释，黑色的营养应该停留在肾脏里面，现在肾脏功能没有了，所以黑色的营养进不去，所以黑色的营养只好往外散。营养还在那边，物质不灭定律嘛，往外散，散到脸上都是黑的，散到身上手上通通是黑的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dzv6b20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dzv6b20","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结果我们中国人是黄种人的世界，突然跑过来一个黑人，那个就是尿毒，你知道我意思不？那黑的还没有光，那个人在农夫在田里晒得很黑，那个黑会发亮。那个黑人人种也很黑，这个我就看得出来（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"尿毒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）了。之前那个黑人跟我说脸上有红斑，我真的看不出来，但是尿毒我一看就知道！同样是黑，但是那个黑是暗暗无光，黑的发亮那个是正常。那个亮就是光鲜的，光鲜就是元气，有气在里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1m1yrgg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1m1yrgg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说当你开始治疗他以后，黑气开始慢慢退，手的颜色开始慢慢回来，阴自回。所以我们使用经方从头到尾你看不到四物汤，看不到一些八珍汤什么东西，看不到的，为什么？因为经方我们使用的原则就是，当我们把她的阳恢复了以后，阴自己就会回来，血液就自己开始制造，那如果病人血液没有办法开始制造，你没有让他造血功能回来，你一味的给它补血的药，病人也不收。就好像贫血，现在血小板太低了，我们输血小板，红血球太低了，我们输红血球，这只是暂时的，那个不是属于你的红血球，也不是你的血小板，输完24小时后你去查，统统死在肝脏里面，它就死给你看，因为它不是你制造的，你懂不懂我意思？一下全完了，然后又不行又再来（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"输血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）了，又要再来一次。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-v46k7hv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-v46k7hv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以大家看我们没有开补血的药，这个血是阴，这个时候我们开的都是阳药，阴会自动恢复的。所以当我们看到病人的手血色开始走了，病人这个精神开始好起来了，小便开始会有便意...因为肾脏功能没有了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾主二便，大便没有便意了，最明显的一个就是小便没有便意，他不晓得要小便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那你帮他治疗以后，如果病人这个小便的便意恢复，开始想小便，就代表他的病情好转，对不对？很多地方我们都可以知道。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cmohdg6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cmohdg6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有呢，心主五液，心除了主小便，心也主汗。所以尿毒的病人，肾脏有问题的时候，第一个影响到心脏，影响到火。那影响到火以后，心脏受到损害，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那老师你怎么知道心脏受到损害？你问病人啊，你有没有汗，没有汗的，我再怎么运动都没有汗，说明心脏已经受到肾脏的影响"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。当你一强心的时候，肾脏功能...我们讲白话，水有问题我们去治火，当你一实火了以后，肾脏的病就已经停止恶化。肾脏持续的恶化的时候，恶化到什么程度，你可以看心脏受损的程度，就可以知道肾脏恶化的程度，这样了解我的意思吧？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wm5ng7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wm5ng7c","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝脏会克到脾脏，治肝先实脾，所以肝病的人，我们就实他的脾脏，所以肝癌的病人我们可以从胃口好不好，就可以知道，病人病情好转还是变坏，依次类推。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6lytlub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6lytlub","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以如果尿毒病人来找你的时候，根本不会出汗，你让他跑了一公里他也不出汗，怎么运动都不会出汗，因为心脏已经受到损害。当我们的药物下去以后，病人运动走一下楼梯，哎医生我以前不会出汗，现在会出汗了！（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"说明"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）心脏的功能回来了，尿毒已经停止恶化，肾脏功能开始慢慢回头，那你就继续用原来的处方继续吃。那如果遇到病人有关节痛，这个处方（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真武汤+五苓散+生附干姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）里面加一些...已经有炮附子了，又有炙甘草了，我们有甘草附子汤，我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"加点白术，加点桂枝，桂枝祛风，变成甘草附子汤复方在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那要看他有什么问题进行加减。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-70j96da","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-70j96da","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如病人说我这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"皮肤上有点问题"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，皮肤有癣什么的，我们可以加一些去这个皮肤病的药，像"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"蝉蜕，蛇蜕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种东西，那就看病人的当时的状况，但主力的处方还是这样这些东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-806ic1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-806ic1q","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"至于昨天肺癌病人，我们并没有说这个肺癌病人，我们一定要开这个肺癌处方，任何肺癌都通用这个处方，不是的，一定要因人而异。所以你如果看到西医讲的肺癌，你听听就过去了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"问诊问病人的时候一定要放空，中虚为明，一定要放空，然后听他讲症状，然后你用症状来决定开什么样的处方给她"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。像昨天的太太她不见得三点钟会起来，她也没有说持续的痛，只是偶尔痛一下，她并不严重，最严重的是她的心，因为她已经吓到了，人会吓死的啊！要赶快把她救回来，不然的话她吓到...她走路神智无知精神恍惚对不对？走在马路上被车撞死，结果太太是死的车祸，不是死在肺癌，因为她已经神志恍惚了嘛，她人生乏味了嘛，没有希望了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zorzizw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zorzizw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那当我们治疗到心脏功能回来的时候，可以看到病人有一种现象，所以我们的内因也有，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝主怒，心主喜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对不对？你们都读过嘛，换句话说，反过来解释，当心脏功能回来后，病人就会出现喜的现象。病人以前很风趣幽默，喜欢开玩笑很调皮，得了尿毒症以后，人生乏味都不讲话，然后等到我们把心脏功能救回来之后，又开始开玩笑，开始调皮了。所以你如果先生得到尿毒，太太陪他来看病，你问他太太，你先生以前爱开玩笑，现在不爱开玩笑，她说对啊！那治疗一段时间再问她，她说我先生恢复到以前很幽默的态度，常常想逗我们，家里面气氛又恢复了，也是个证据，证明心脏功能恢复了。心脏功能没有恢复想喜也喜不起来。除非他碰到他信任的医生，他知道你是很好的医生，他很信任你，你跟他说你不会死，他就喜了，他就开始喜了，因为他相信你。所以有时候我们常常要鼓励病人，没有办法，一定要这样做，好不好？这就是我们临床上的经验。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-y4wcp4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-y4wcp4x","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来，大家有什么疑问？啊，没有嚯。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-83pwnyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-83pwnyo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师对刘力红说"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）那个刘老师，那个病人要不要带来我们看一下。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-27jc62d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-27jc62d","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-3pfd3et","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3pfd3et","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"等待间隙倪师与学生交谈中..."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vgqob72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vgqob72","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附子要切片，切片好煮，炮的也可以看得到。一般来说，切片的话可以煮透，我们中药取它的气和味，这是药的性。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rf0m1ot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rf0m1ot","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我如果说开个大黄给你，你吃它的气，不要吃它的味。这个倪海厦真怪，何谓吃它的气，不吃到它的味？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4369zy5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4369zy5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家都知道"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"味厚的入脏入血分，气的话入气分入腑，气呢轻浮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那现在我们遇到一个病人角膜炎，眼睛红红的，丢片大黄给他，大黄长的很像牛肉干呐，丢给他，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"叮嘱病人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）你把它泡水喝，不要煮，泡水喝就是喝它的药气。今天没事就当茶喝，口渴就当茶喝，里面泡的就是大黄，当然泡之前你要先洗一下，那个大黄泥巴很多，洗干净以后再去泡来喝。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wsugtwd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wsugtwd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二天早上起来会发现，哎，整个炎症就消退掉了，这就是吃它的气。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5tjjda0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5tjjda0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你如果煮它的味，结果大黄吃下去变成拉肚子，结果眼睛还是红肿在那边，这样子懂不懂我意思？我们要用水泡的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6qatfyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6qatfyn","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人进场中..."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-w6y843m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-w6y843m","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我先去洗个手..."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ryglc6y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ryglc6y","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-dqzvvm0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dqzvvm0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"案例：黄雪梅，32岁，女，手脚抖动，弯着背，走路困难。（由妈妈搀扶进来）"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6n0gk0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6n0gk0c","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"您坐（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师让病人母亲坐下"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），你是她（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）妈妈？辛苦过来哦，我们尽力，好不好？我问你的几个问题，你可以回答吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pf08dnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pf08dnm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ivjxv20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ivjxv20","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，所以你脑筋很清楚嘛。你好不好睡？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zzsno6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zzsno6e","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不好"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9wa673v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9wa673v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么个不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ytl6igs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ytl6igs","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就睡不着。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vbrf9xw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vbrf9xw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"到晚上几点钟才能睡？还是整晚上都不好睡？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wwyxbtr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wwyxbtr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是我吃西药有药效的时候，它就像正常人一样，全身都放松完了，我就可以睡，药效消失的话，如果有杂念的话，那个身体又更硬，更硬就无法入睡了。就像现在这种情况的话，我就很难入睡。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7dgc8s6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7dgc8s6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为身上在抖，无法睡？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-y6x7jme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-y6x7jme","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很硬。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2790m4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2790m4l","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很硬，全身僵硬。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jzu0g0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jzu0g0p","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力宏："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她吃了那个药以后，身体软了以后，她就能睡。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ijlret4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ijlret4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃了安眠药，吃西药，抗颤抖的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-guyi0r4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-guyi0r4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我吃的美多芭。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-yfhuqbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-yfhuqbo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃了这个药以后，全身软掉了就好睡了？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-sc2hd3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-sc2hd3j","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"嗯，吃了药就好睡了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2l0o3qt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2l0o3qt","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你全身僵硬的话，如果你没有吃这个药，晚上的时候全身僵硬，你不好睡，当时您感觉到身体是冷的还是热的？还是没有感觉？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1k3i35j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1k3i35j","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"感觉是热的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4i3vmlq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4i3vmlq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身体感觉是热的？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nifagis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nifagis","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为我抖的时候出的全身都是汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-97l81ma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-97l81ma","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对，因为你抖就是不断的运动嘛，等于是说你不想动，可是它没有办法，还是要运动，因为运动才有的汗，那你平常口渴吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xavyvjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xavyvjo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃了这个药以后口很渴的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7t7mvgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7t7mvgp","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃了西药以后口很渴？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-821bqm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-821bqm5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本身就有这个副作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dl7siy4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dl7siy4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好像吃了味精一样，吃了口就渴。这种吃了会口渴的东西是不能吃的。那你大便好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2ruc5bk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2ruc5bk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这段时间都不好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-u4whup1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-u4whup1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是便秘还是下利？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gcwlu32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gcwlu32","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有时候便秘，有时候...每次都是一粒一粒的现在。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8rcmk7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8rcmk7b","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"排出来一小颗一小颗的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9hd35n9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9hd35n9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不是一小颗...也是一粒一粒的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-deifhu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-deifhu6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"排出来一粒一粒的，那你小便什么颜色？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-83s859a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-83s859a","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便有时是白色的，有时是黄色的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nddlsof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nddlsof","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄色是深黄还是淡黄？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pqqf190","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pqqf190","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黄，还闻到那种味道。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4mamvfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4mamvfz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还闻到味道，那你自己觉得脚是热的？还是冷的？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-aox67q2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-aox67q2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃药的时候就感觉到是冷的，身体放松了以后，感觉到冷，如果不吃药像这种情况全身都是发热的，脚也出汗，手也出汗，哪里都出汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-73gh003","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-73gh003","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为她不断的动，这种不断的动，因为有热能嘛，所以产生热。那如果你口渴的话？你想喝热的还是冰的？你告诉我你想喝什么，不要跟我讲是逼自己喝什么？你说说你是很想喝热，还是很想要喝冰的，加很多冰块下去？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-341bnp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-341bnp7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我想喝冷的，但是现在说不能喝冷的，所以说我好像又喜欢喝热的这样子。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0sq46q3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0sq46q3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没有关系，我只要知道你想喝冰的就好了，因为我们需要按照这个来开处方。好不好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9l65z8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9l65z8s","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想喝冷的，有这个想法。但热的喝下去比较舒服，所以喝热的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fs27ao0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fs27ao0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"喝热的，但是心里很想喝冷的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wtqec50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wtqec50","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好像可能是有这个想法了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-c94l4n2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-c94l4n2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"手变形20240506_163148"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/手变形20240506_163148-20240506163218-eniy0eb.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 385px;","style":"width: 375px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"摸手心手背额头20240506_163624"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/摸手心手背额头20240506_163624-20240506163659-0ikylmi.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 375px;\" parent-style=\"width: 385px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-30dy3he","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-30dy3he","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（拿起病人的手）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对嘛，我就想知道你的想法。这个比较麻烦，为什么？可能拖得比较晚，你看哦，我们叫形神，中医的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"形神论"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你看那个黄帝内经。她的形已经失掉了，看到没有？变形了。但还很好，她看我的时候两个眼睛还有神，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"形不存神存，还可以动手"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。有的时候形存在那种，神无了，就没有了，就不好治了。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"摸手心手背额头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）你这个病有多久了？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1yj8t9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1yj8t9h","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"四年、五年了，但是以前没那么严重，影响生活，像这种情况的话，就是 07 年、08 年，以前的话，自理都还行（手抖的厉害）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b1kn4c3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b1kn4c3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌头伸出来我看看，伸长..."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白湿的舌苔"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，大家也看看，白湿旁边比较暗一点，看到没有？你月经好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9xamtjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9xamtjv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"月经以前还行，现在不行了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-t9urrri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-t9urrri","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在怎么个不行？是延后了还是？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-oljxxth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-oljxxth","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两天就结束了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2am09pa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2am09pa","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后多久后才来？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-d3y6uls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-d3y6uls","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个月来一次，但是每次都是两天就结束了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-d3y9yof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-d3y9yof","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"按背部"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）有没有哪一个地方最痛，按你脊椎骨哪个地方最痛，还是都一样？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-07e7ttd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-07e7ttd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好像没有最痛，最痛是脚。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-f5rurx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-f5rurx6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脚在哪里最痛？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wu4yufq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wu4yufq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我的那个左脚的拇指和那个右手是一样的，因为左脚拇指头也是像这个手一样变形了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ki5b3df","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ki5b3df","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"变形了而且抖动，是不是？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-df7egg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-df7egg9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是，你看它（左脚）都落不了地。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8s0pttr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8s0pttr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你是左脚、右手（痛）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qgxmgjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qgxmgjb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"嗯，还有晚上睡觉的时候，没有药效了就只能睡个十几分钟，然后它就硬硬酸酸痛痛的，像脱了一样。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7g66ox0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7g66ox0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以就算你吃西药，药效也是只有一段时间，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8on4arc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8on4arc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个多小时，有时候完全没有效。这段时间昨晚就没有效，前天晚上也没有效，再前天也没有效，它吃了不一定有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0fauq5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0fauq5u","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你心里不要想你的手和脚，眼睛看着我，心里看着我，不要想了你的手和脚，不要去想它你就不会抖。你一直想它就抖的越来越厉害，你就仔细回答我的问题，你晚上喜欢盖厚被子还是薄被子？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-sacojyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-sacojyj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"盖薄被子，因为厚被子重，我是觉得它重重的，有点东西放在我身上我都觉得累。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3yxp2b5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3yxp2b5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你不喜欢有东西压到，那个从发病到现在人瘦了还是胖了？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nukw2ua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nukw2ua","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瘦了，瘦了有十多斤。以前80多斤、90多斤，病了以后就瘦了，现在70多斤。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fhea0hd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fhea0hd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（跟同学解释）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她里寒，她的脉重按都没有了。她的脉形比较大，但重按又没有，它是属于一种痨嘛，痨就是说过度的劳动，现在对她来说等于她无法控制，她就一直24小时在劳动，病就这样来的。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"面向病人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）你关节会不会痛？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7gt80od","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7gt80od","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我只是左脚痛，还有我的右脚可能因为出过车祸，所以说它那个膝盖没走路都会响。这两边都会响，咔喳咔喳的这样。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-419ul94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-419ul94","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哦，不痛，但是会响。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-n5hph9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-n5hph9m","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不痛也难受，好像它要脱了那样，变成两节。我走路都走不直，是弧线你那样，所以很吃力。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9r5dj6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9r5dj6x","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（面向病人妈妈）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那个，你们家有旁边有甘蔗的田吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-w24s761","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-w24s761","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人妈妈："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没有，人家农村里有（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人妈妈应该不善表达，这里她应该是说家里没人，但农村里别人家种的有"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ctqotnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ctqotnm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你给你女儿多喝点甘蔗汁，每天晚上的时候多喝点甘蔗汁，好不好？因为她在抖，甘蔗不好直接咬，榨成汁喝，我开个处方让她吃吃看。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lytniyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lytniyf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（走上黑板授课）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用当归四逆汤和桂枝芍药知母汤的复方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝三钱，白芍三钱，炙甘草五钱，炙甘草甘能缓，甘味的东西能够缓她的抽筋"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，筋急的现象，所以说我们平常让她多喝蔗糖...我们这里用炙甘草五钱。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大枣，为什么我们会思考到大枣是十二枚？因为是甘味的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2rjrxka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2rjrxka","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们为什么会思考的用当归四逆汤，因为刚刚病人说有的时候我便秘，有时候又有，但是有时候便秘，大便不好，我们都会想到用当归四逆汤。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归二钱，木通二钱，细辛二钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这已经很轻很缓的来通她大便。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那细辛二钱我们用它的根，不用细辛的茎和叶，因为茎和叶里面有马豆玲酸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个处方下来之后，我们在这个处方里面...所以大家方剂要比较熟，就可以自己做加减。这是当归四逆汤，那当归四逆汤里面我们加入"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄两钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，病人已经在流汗了，她流汗并不算盗汗，而是她一直在不断的运动嘛，所以她24小时在一边走着一边跑，你说她累不累？当然累啊！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄你用得好可以敛汗。我们用麻黄可以止汗，用麻黄也可以发汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这里呢，我们用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄跟白术等量"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-w6t1a4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-w6t1a4w","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原方桂枝芍药知母汤，麻黄，白术，炮附子是等量的在用，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为现在病人有流汗，所以我麻黄用二钱，我们白术可以用三钱，炮附子用三钱配合炙甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，然后呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"防己五钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帮她去痛，关节的痛，脚跟大拇指那种关节的痛。还有这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"知母五钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，桂枝芍药知母汤里面就有这个。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2pa5e80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2pa5e80","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那一般来说我们会想到使用这个桂枝芍药知母汤是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脉洪大"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"时用，在脉诊里面，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脉大为痨"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以你一看她手，血脉变的很粗，她的脉变得很大，因为她痨嘛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"痨是怎么来的？就是过劳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以我们中文很有意思，这个痨呢，过度的劳，就变成病嘛（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"痨"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），这痨的来因就是这样子。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-smd37y3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-smd37y3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说有时候您工作一段时间，不断的忙碌不断的忙碌，然后突然发觉到，人怎么搞得，怎么吃都不胖，人很瘦。痨症的人大部分都很瘦，然后吃什么都不会胖，那她（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师指病人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）就是这样变瘦的，她不断的在劳嘛，不断在动。那我们用这种方式来帮他治疗。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6w085cp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6w085cp","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个病人她如果没有药的话就全身僵硬，我们有一个寒热的观点，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"热则纵，打开来，寒则缩，寒症的人是收缩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以我们中风有两种，一种中风是整个手曲起来，热症的话是伸张开了的，就好像米饭，蒸好的米饭刚打开了是热的，是整个舒张开来的，就像馒头发起来一样张开来的，冷的时候是整个缩在里面，所以寒症是缩的。所以这个病人是硬，不断地硬在那边，全身等于是收缩的现象，所以里寒还有。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qg7ispe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qg7ispe","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个处方，我们开完以后，我们应该给他加一点"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用，不要多，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"二钱就够了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个九碗煮三碗。那如果说她流汗还是流的很多，我们为防止她阴虚掉，我们可以把炮附子加重，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"处方炮附子可以加到五钱六钱七钱一两，一直确定她汗不流了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那如果病人睡觉睡不安稳，这个处方里面目前还没有治疗睡不安稳的，我们这个时候就加龙骨五钱，牡蛎五钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个龙骨牡蛎是潜阳，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"什么是潜阳？潜阳就是阳气她不断的动不断的热，我们让阳气回到身体里面，牡蛎还可以敛汗、固表"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。牡蛎的固表跟炮附子的固表稍微不同，牡蛎的固表大部分发生在惊发，受到惊吓流的盗汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-l4u2tia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-l4u2tia","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说火邪有没有？家里面失火了，从火堆里面逃出来的人，都是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡龙骨牡蛎汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这时的惊发，我们加龙骨牡蛎。那如果说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳虚的盗汗，我们就用炮附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。因为她受到惊，所以我们会出现说两种不同的处方、两种不同的止汗的剂，在一个同一个处方里面会出现。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ttg387z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ttg387z","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那止她的痉，她这个动的很厉害，抽动很厉害，我刚才讲的我们可以甜味的药先吃。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果说这个病人吃了很多的药，我们也用经方了，又吃了生附子，她都没有反应，这时候我们就要考虑到我们的百合病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。百合病就是吃什么也不对，吃这个也不好，吃那个也不好，吃什么都不好，连吃饭都不好，反正就是吃什么都不会好，都不舒服，什么都不好这就是百合，用大剂的百合跟生地黄榨汁来吃，你给她蒸熟了拿来吃都没有关系。这就是我们要把这个百合跟地黄，百合是色白的，地黄是色黑的，黑白就是所谓的阴阳，一阴一阳两个混在一起，让它阴阳大气能够转动。百合地黄汤的定义在这里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wv3o8zl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wv3o8zl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好不好，你自己先这样子吃（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"看向病人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。她的舌苔比较白比较厚，也是代表里边是寒的，所以看到她不断的动不断地热，不断的动因为她在不断地跑步嘛，像在走路在跑步一样，她是不断的走很辛苦啊！我们要让她停下来，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-sqweuuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-sqweuuv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个你也不要想太多了，好不好？你这个人也很辛苦，不要想太多了，这个吃下去心情会比较好，然后比较开朗一点，好吧？等下你带她回去。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ihpc7ve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ihpc7ve","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人离开后...."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-f0uxh9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-f0uxh9r","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（继续讲解）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"情志病，真是情志病。为什么是情志病？情志啊，我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"手抖→心在颤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，心在颤动，就是伤到心了。像我们这种人不会啊，像我们身经百战，不会被感情影响，我们身经百战对不对？都是老油条了，姜还是老的辣，我们比姜更老。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-w8sjxnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-w8sjxnc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那些年轻的小姐就容易受到感情的一些东西影响，气啊或者是不平衡啊受到影响，就会出现手抖的现象，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"手抖是来自心颤，真的是伤到心了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。可是如果是我们这种人伤到心，so what，再去交个女朋友，你知道我意思吧？那我多交几个，省的再受到伤害，这个是很皮的想法，当然不是很正确，但是至少不会出事嘛，所以有些东西要放得下。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jaw3hnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jaw3hnc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"关节里面有咯啦咯啦的声音，关节有问题的时候，我们都会考虑到使用桂枝芍药知母汤，所以我用桂枝芍药知母汤用了很多"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我们经方里面，第一个治疗痨症的处方。脉洪大，你一摸病人脉洪大，再看她手上血管都绷起来，很大一个，像手指头那么粗了的大血管，就知道是痨症。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-f79of82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-f79of82","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240506175025-6n90bmb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-soqulyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-soqulyv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"痨症真正病因在哪里？就是本来血管那么大，结果呢，我们风湿的湿跑到血管里面去了，因为她不断的劳动，汗不断地进出不断的进出，结果进到血管里面的水出不来了，慢慢累积起来，那肌肉里面的水跑到皮肤上去了，那她不断的动啊！就有很多水会不断的往肌肉里面跑，往那个血管里面跑。那肌肉里面的水跑到皮肤上面，形成表面上的汗，身体里面很多的水还是会往血管里面跑，等于是你不断的动，水会四散，慢慢累积在血管里面就会变成湿。那血管那么大，后来湿累积多了以后大了两倍，结果这一半全部是湿，这一半还是原来的血管大小，那你去验血的话她是正常，因为血并没有少啊！可它脉就会变的很大，这就是痨，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脉大为痨，浮大中空"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mqzykrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mqzykrh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"唐院长："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就像血管被泡肿了一样。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-bxt63o1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-bxt63o1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泡肿了一样，对，没错。然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们把血管里面的湿清出来，就要靠桂枝芍药知母汤，所以痨症的时候，我们也用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以你如果一个病人跑来说，医生啊！我以前体力很好，现在打高尔夫球，人家有18个洞，我打完一个洞我就累得回家睡觉睡一天，这就是痨症，稍微动一下就很累。然后怎么吃，吃一大堆，吃个半天就是不长肉，也是痨症。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-13rhuyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-13rhuyw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪师，像这个病人守方，大概守方可以守多长时间。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rh01ajo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rh01ajo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"看她吃下去的症状，当她的症状如果缓下去了，没有那么硬了，代表里面寒在融化掉。那这个关节会痛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"痛大部分都是来自寒痛，寒才会痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那她表面上是在不断的流汗，表虚掉了，那她睡眠不好，吃了我们的药，睡眠会变好。她说睡眠不好是因为她身体硬嘛，没办法睡，那现在吃了我们药以后，身体软下来...因为硬就是缩，她感觉到是硬，她不会讲，实际上就是缩，收缩。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ufklhhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ufklhhd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们用生附子下去把里寒去掉，这个热一到，关节就松开来了，松开来后身体就软掉了，软掉的话就好睡觉了。那好睡觉不会抖动的话，我们就用甘味的东西止痉，止她的抽动，然后她不会抖动，她就不会流汗了。但是我们先用药补她的汗，怕她这样持续下去人就完了，她会津液枯竭而死，因为她在不断的动嘛，我们人要运动，但是没有人要24小时运动，她等于 24 小时都在运动，身体精力不断地在耗，比如他爸爸妈妈给她 100 岁的寿命，可能她40年就完了，蜡烛就燃烧光了，这样子。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-86mv0by","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-86mv0by","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们看她的症状来加减。如果说她吃了我们的药，吃了连续一个礼拜，症状没有改变，我们就要想到变方，如果有好转我们就不要改变，让她慢慢继续吃，吃到她这个睡觉也可以睡了，身体也不硬了，这样子。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kimwt56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kimwt56","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个量上需不需要变化？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-bpa1dm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-bpa1dm5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"看她的症状，如果说吃完了以后，她的汗还是流的很厉害，抖还是没有去掉，那我们不用增加止汗的药，我们要想办法把止抖的药增加，镇痉的药增加。像我们单味的药，像"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"防风，羌活，独活"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"都可以用，为什么？这个羌活，独活的药性，你看药典里面记载的，风来的时候它不动，风吹的时候它不动，没有风的时候它自动，没有风它自己在那边动啊！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"天麻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也是这个药性，这些药都可以选用，单味的药选在里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6naxr8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6naxr8h","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以经方的好处是，经方的一个固定的成方有了，其它单味的特效药我们可以加很多进去，没有关系，这就需要时方，你们一般用的那种处方都可以用，可以丢进去没有关系。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7nsx46q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7nsx46q","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虫类的药可以用吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-k57n4xc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-k57n4xc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虫类的药看情形，虫类的药大部分用在活血化瘀，在攻坚的时候使用，像我们的抵当汤，有虻虫、水蛭，那很凶悍。 抵当汤是用在膀胱蓄血，比如我们踢足球不小心踢到膀胱的时候，整个膀胱蓄血，小便排不出来了，那不排出来要死人呐，那以前也没有什么导尿管插进去，那就用抵当汤。抵当汤下去以后，小便就排出来了，这是膀胱蓄血症用的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5n0s1t0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5n0s1t0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个病人实际上这一两年呢，附桂都有用，附子啊、桂枝啊这些都有在用。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zb8qyh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zb8qyh2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我可以建议说我们加一点处方，比如说，我刚讲的桂枝芍药知母汤里面加点麻黄，麻黄是阳药，然后麻黄又是青龙，我们有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"青龙白虎朱雀玄武"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"附子就是玄武，朱雀是红枣，十枣汤就是朱雀汤，昨天肺癌病人的白虎汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄就是青龙，这些都是阳药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wl1jskw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wl1jskw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黄用得好，会用麻黄的，像刚才病人她流汗，麻黄下去是止汗的。像有的人用生麻黄，是让他发汗，开的很好的话，他吃下去马上就发汗，所以桂枝芍药知母汤里面会用到麻黄，就代表张仲景很厉害，他善用麻黄。它的剂量不高，所以这个病人吃下去反而会敛汗，这是第一个。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-t8tsmm0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-t8tsmm0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二个，我们这个肺气要下降，肃降，我们身上所有的脏腑里面，就这一个肺它主肃降的功能，所以麻黄可以宣肺，青龙把肺一打开来以后，肺气就开始下降，药力开始往下走，全身气血往下走，就会走到膝盖，走到脚大拇指旁边。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在膝盖、关节会有声音代表里面的津液不够，脚大拇指会抽筋抽起来，是里面津液的不够了，人会比较瘦，手和关节会变形，阴已经丧失掉了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那我们用麻黄这些药把阳打开来，它津液就自己会回来，而不必说我们真的去开一些这个滋润关节的药，什么长肉的药什么的，那都不需要，它自己就会慢慢形状就会变回来。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-p676acl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-p676acl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以主方我们开好，再看其它的处方。那你如果说我们要发汗，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你把麻黄开多点，桂枝开少点，病人就发汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝开多点，麻黄开少点，同时麻黄跟炮附子同用，就不会发汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以在经方里面少阴症篇，麻黄附子细辛汤，里面有麻黄有附子，吃下去病人不会发汗，他的主症是脉微细，但欲寐，就是白天在那边想睡觉，24小时他随时想睡觉，睡又睡不饱，给他睡10个小时起来还是很累，脉很细小，我们要用麻黄附子细辛汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gh6jxim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gh6jxim","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黄附子细辛汤下去以后，三味药下去病人精神就很好，体力也很好，但是不会出汗，因为什么？因为有炮附子在里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qivj391","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qivj391","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以很多处方间隔使用的时候配在一起使用...像我们刚刚那个桂枝芍药知母汤里面就有麻黄，炮附子，那不会出汗。那她已经有汗，麻黄一下子汗就去掉了，应该是这样子，应该要出现这种现象，阳气就会回来。所以我们经方很少说开一些滋润关节的药，什么生肌、长肌肉的药很少用。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-z3ohycm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-z3ohycm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那倪老师，西药要马上停掉吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-bv6ne4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-bv6ne4h","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"西药可以减量，但是以她现在的情形的话，以前西药还有用，现在只能有一个小时药效，越来越没用了，有没有？说明身体已经有抗药性产生了，所以她现在停西药跟不停西药她都要抖，刚才她不是讲了吗。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9f5em49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9f5em49","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你如果刚开始的时候吃西药，能够让她睡个觉，这个我倒无所谓，你可以继续吃，倒无所谓。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ka6go6x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ka6go6x","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-zwirt7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zwirt7c","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"案例：中年男子，忽冷忽热九年。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mtf984k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mtf984k","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你好请坐，你好，你有什么问题？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zueg2ae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zueg2ae","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我就是发热，都九年了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-phve76x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-phve76x","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你感觉到全身发热？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vz30pyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vz30pyb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是它有时候温度高，有时温度低。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a5bl5wa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a5bl5wa","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你有没有流汗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-flvi5oo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-flvi5oo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像现在，早上有点出汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3jp1ubu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3jp1ubu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"运动出汗还是自然出汗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-d4exu2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-d4exu2f","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自然就出汗了，喝一点水，吃一点饭也出汗，就是怕热，就相当于有点像怕热一样，喝点水，早上就吃了个馒头，就有点出汗了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tgvneud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tgvneud","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怕热你为什么穿毛衣？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tjh0jua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tjh0jua","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我又怕冷。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-le2tf9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-le2tf9n","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哦~好，您讲的很有道理没关系。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"面向刘力红"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）你们听到好像觉得这个病人不是神经病吗，怎么怕热又怕冷。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mnknq3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mnknq3m","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是啊，我感觉怕热又怕冷，我穿的少，因为天气冷，我就觉得冷。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-396fvua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-396fvua","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你要穿毛衣，穿上毛衣又怕热？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-g5tkq23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-g5tkq23","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"穿上毛衣像这会儿就没事了，早上起来就怕冷，有点怕热，但是早上，可能今天早上还有点烧。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-r3zmetl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-r3zmetl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他一般都是下午烧。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-l168s1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-l168s1v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"午后潮热。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ja29rtw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ja29rtw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对，前两天就是一直是中午开始睡完觉起来，就不舒服了，浑身就开始酸痛了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-m940bx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-m940bx8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那中午睡完觉起来，浑身酸痛的时候，那个时候有没有流汗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-k7k4fp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-k7k4fp1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不流汗，下午倒不流汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1wkgy0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1wkgy0f","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关节酸痛，肌肉酸痛？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ktf4qhg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ktf4qhg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对对，但是慢慢地它体温就开始往上走了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9imk2be","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9imk2be","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"体温就开始上来了？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lfkdhzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lfkdhzx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对对，体温就开始上来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0te0kul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0te0kul","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有怕冷是吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ju9s7bq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ju9s7bq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那时候又怕冷了。对，没错，那时候就怕冷了，现在我穿得多，它也不怕冷不怕热，这会还好一些。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-bjcomq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-bjcomq0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（笑）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你跑去跟医生讲这话，医生不是当你神经病？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-p5ciqo9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-p5ciqo9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是，我有在看，人家说你看神经科去吧，我也没办法。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-p1zs4zb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-p1zs4zb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（摸脉，大笑）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哈哈，你讲的绝对是实话，没有一句假话，我很体谅你的心情。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xvqeaj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xvqeaj2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哎，很难受。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ra1p9u5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ra1p9u5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很难受对吧，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"面向同学"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）不然谁神经病要跟你讲这话，对不对？谁愿意啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4qnc7qm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4qnc7qm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们摸脉的时候，所谓伤寒表症，我们摸脉的时候，有时候会遇到浮脉，什么叫浮脉？就是你轻轻压在皮肤上面，不要重按，轻轻摸在皮肤上面，就这样轻轻摸过去，摸到的脉这叫浮脉，所以你不要重按它，轻轻摸在它的皮肤上，可以摸到浮脉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-naucaqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-naucaqj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他现在病在表，病在表的话，有时候会冷有时候会热。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有的如果是纯恶寒，恶寒体重节痛，发热，全身关节酸痛，麻黄汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那如果有汗，恶热，恶风桂枝汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7xpjvz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7xpjvz8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他说有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"的时候我有汗，有时候又是怕热，桂枝麻黄各半汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这样了解我意思吧？经方里都有，然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒比较多，热比较少桂枝二麻黄一汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。有时候"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"热比较多，寒比较少，麻黄二桂枝一汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，分的很多，有没必要分那么多？实际上没有必要。大概就可以了，哪那么龟毛，不用分的那么仔细。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-eb2tlm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-eb2tlm8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们使用麻桂的时候要注意，看他还是要用麻桂（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"指当前病人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），那如果是他忽冷忽热，我们还可以问他，你会不会恶心，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"看向病人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）恶心有没有？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-bg254b0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-bg254b0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我这两天觉得吃饭不行了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4p64wb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4p64wb2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃饭不行，但是会不会恶心？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pgla73p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pgla73p","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恶心倒没有。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-m5w5e02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-m5w5e02","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果是往来寒热，忽冷忽热，恶心，胸胁苦满，两隔苦满就是小柴胡汤症，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mbb9p0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mbb9p0x","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那他往来寒热，没有恶心，因为我们的桂枝，生姜，大枣，比如我们举个大青龙汤来说， 大青龙汤是麻杏甘石汤，麻黄，杏仁，甘草，石膏加上桂姜枣，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻杏甘石汤是治疗咳嗽的，桂姜枣是没有胃口"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以我们问病人，热咳咳出来痰是黄的，病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"表寒，肌肉关节酸痛，然后燥渴，然后病人没有胃口，大青龙汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有胃口麻杏甘石汤，没有胃口大青龙汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就差了桂枝生姜红枣。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dwntoqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dwntoqs","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，那我们刚刚讲的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄二桂枝一汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄二桂枝一汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝麻黄各半汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"里面都有桂姜枣，都可以让他胃口恢复回来。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3v4nlnl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3v4nlnl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师摸着病人脉，笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）那你得了这个怪病不折腾人吗。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pv29rh5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pv29rh5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-bzu0jcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-bzu0jcm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没事就发个烧。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xlz0hcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xlz0hcr","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对，我住院都不知道住多少回了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-apkftqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-apkftqh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你舌头让我看看......你看他的舌头，比较稍微白厚一点。你口渴吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-y2ny1ud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-y2ny1ud","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最近口渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9yyb6uj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9yyb6uj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴，口渴是想喝冰的，还是温的？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-sajc0mb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-sajc0mb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不想喝冰的，想喝温的。热的我就出汗了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2h5azwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2h5azwn","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一喝热的就出汗，所以想喝冰的。平常小便多不多？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4l3ni2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4l3ni2j","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便还算可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3yp2w2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3yp2w2e","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便可以。因为我们用桂枝二麻黄一汤或者桂枝麻黄各半汤，我们用麻桂的时候，一定要确定病人身体的津液够，津液要够。如果津液不够的话，你又要必须发汗的话，那我们就会跟病人说，你这个药先不要喝，先去吃两个梨，水梨，吃完了再喝药，把津液补足，那你大便好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6jk3p6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6jk3p6x","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便这两天不是太好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-64o3mia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-64o3mia","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么个不好，是下利还是便秘？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5ryij5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5ryij5v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是没有，有时候三天才解一次。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-luqxs0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-luqxs0v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那小便什么颜色？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pjh7xwi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pjh7xwi","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便就稍微有点发黄的那种。如果我喝水少了，老解便的话，它就慢慢变成黄了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fn2pnfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fn2pnfo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（面向学生）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那个病人口渴，我们在用汗剂之前，一定要确定病人身体能够承受，他便秘已经有了，小便黄是肠胃的津液不够。那你如果说你开的处方里面，如果肠胃津液没有把它同时补足，他一发汗，他就会说倪医师，吃了你的药，热退了什么都好了，可是我一个礼拜没有大便了，小便很黄，因为你把他汗发掉了，这个我们要预防他出现这种情况，这就是我们用汗剂的时候，唯一要顾虑的东西。所以我会问大小便，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7c4p1y9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7c4p1y9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"摸病人的手，额头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）很好，都还好，那手还凉点。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wzxijmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wzxijmm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这会还好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4gm383f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4gm383f","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位知道为什么他是中午 12 点钟以后就开始发热..."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-s8ae41f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-s8ae41f","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们先开处方给他，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄二钱，杏仁二钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，麻黄用多少钱杏仁就用多少钱，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝用重点三钱，白芍三钱，然后炙干草五钱，生姜三片，大枣 12 枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，炙甘草红枣生姜用多一点就是补充他肠胃的津液。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄，杏仁，桂枝，炙甘草，就是麻黄汤，桂枝白芍炙甘草生姜红枣就是桂枝汤。麻桂各半汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-79r6jkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-79r6jkv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"剂量上在处方的时候，因为病人有汗，津液受伤很多，所以麻黄用少一 点，桂枝用多一点。桂枝用三，白芍用三，等量的时候，一个让动脉血管加速循环，一个让静脉循环加速循环，病人就会再出一次汗，把里面的风寒的病毒去掉。麻黄杏仁等量加进去的时候，这个麻黄发出来的汗，是肺里面的汗，就是他的热的来源，高热，他体温会发烧的来源在肺上面，所以他这么多年来，风寒在身体里面，从来都没有跑掉过，一直在那个地方。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-07kztd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-07kztd0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们用麻黄发的时候，杏仁把肺发出去的津液再补充回来，这样子只会有病汗出去，正常的津液会回头，就不会有问题，这就是处方方剂的剂量，还有我们处方的定义，麻黄桂枝可以用来一起。好，这样用。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fu1xt4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fu1xt4n","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他吃下去的时候， 会全身冒微汗，这个是可以预测的，微微的汗。因为桂枝有了麻黄就会走表，一定会走表，但是微微的汗跟他现在流的汗不 一样，他现在流的汗叫病汗，全身发的微微的汗，就是过去的风寒往外走的现象。风寒祛出来以后，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炙甘草、大枣、生姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）这个可以把他的肠胃津液补足，他就不会有大便的问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1n3698n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1n3698n","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是他现在大便比如说有两三天没大便，他小便有点黄，这个时候我们可以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"稍微加一点点剂量的大黄，不能加多，大黄一钱半"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不要加太多，桂枝汤加大黄。因为在我们发汗的时候，很怕里面有燥矢，就是里面的那个糟粕、粪便宿便，产生的沼气会往上冲，那不好，病人头会昏呐，人就会感到不适。这时我们可以把沼气，顺便把它排掉。但是呢，当我们在解表的时候，就不可以下，是伤寒论的原则，当在解表的时候不可以攻下。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-oh6wxvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-oh6wxvj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如说我得了麻黄汤症，结果呢，麻黄汤是表症，在皮肤上面，肺主皮毛嘛，结果你没有开麻黄汤或小青龙汤、大青龙汤，结果你开大承气汤，一攻下，表邪就会下陷。表邪下陷到胸腔，在胸胁这个地方形成心下痞的时候，就产生了甘遂半夏汤症。那表邪如果陷到两肋，肋间有积水的话，就产生十枣汤症，就这样来的，或者以后的大陷胸汤、小陷胸汤都是误下造成的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-780g7xz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-780g7xz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那为什么伤寒论要讲这些？除了提醒医生，病人有表症的时候不可以攻里。第二个就是，有的时候病人也不晓得要攻里啊，病人也不知道，就刚好得了伤风感冒的时候胃气还在，想着肚子很饿，结果看到桌上有个坏掉便当就把它吃掉，结果坏掉的便当吃下去他就上吐下泻，有了伤寒表症又被攻下，这种不是被医生造成的误下，而是环境造成的，所以你一定要知道如何补救他的方式，这就是我们当医生要注意事情。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3373ok7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3373ok7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（面向病人）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好吧，你试试看这个药，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-i1pxsth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-i1pxsth","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在就用大黄吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hrdtwhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hrdtwhu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在就用一点点大黄，因为他已经两三天没有大便了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fxdnm8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fxdnm8f","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昨天倒是解了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-o59vqc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-o59vqc2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解的多不多？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-uezr8kl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-uezr8kl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解的还可以。昨天解了，今天没反应了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ujd2l1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ujd2l1c","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没反应。那小便是比较黄的，小便是什么颜色的黄？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ij18ymg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ij18ymg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便，如果是喝水喝多了，老解便老解便他就慢慢就变清了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vfdae86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vfdae86","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那还是用一点大黄，没关系，因为我们有解表...所以解表和攻里，桂枝汤加大黄是经方里的处方，就是万一病人有宿便在里面，还没有完全清出来，还有伤寒表症，可以两个一起用，但绝对不能用单味的攻下，比如说单用小承气汤或大承气汤，调胃承气汤都不能用（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师应该是说有伤寒表症的情况，不能单用攻下的方，用也要跟攻表的药复方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），那你在那个桂枝汤或麻黄汤里面加就可以，好不好？你吃吃看。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ll0snmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ll0snmd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，谢谢倪老师。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-t19jbjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-t19jbjc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不要客气，这个药吃下去，如果对的话，你绝对身体会醒过来。那你说我怎么知道好了？很简单，如果你现在吃，今天中午（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"见效"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），如果你下午或者晚上吃，明天中午突然胃口大开，代表中午的时候胃气恢复，你就好了，烧也退了，也可以回家了，不用住院了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xfz6f5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xfz6f5p","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后吃东西，哇，看到什么都想吃，你就好了，但是你刚刚恢复的时候不要乱吃。不要到时晚上去急诊，吃坏肚子了，到时说那倪海厦说我可以吃，你大量的吃，什么烧烤什么通通都吃进去，去大排档从头吃到尾，不行的，你就吃一点比较清淡的东西，好不好？让肠胃好消化，蛋都不要吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-17l5xat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-17l5xat","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病人（作势离去）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，谢谢您。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-24phjyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-24phjyu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，不客气，先吃吃看。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-x94fbhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-x94fbhw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你要等一下，你再给学生摸摸看你的脉。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"面向学生"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）你们摸摸他的脉，轻轻碰到皮肤就摸到了，说明病还在表。摸到皮肤就能摸到的是浮脉，浮是皮肤，皮肤主肺，他风寒还在肺里面，结果这么多年来风寒还在肺里面，没有进去（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师应该是在说病邪没有传脏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ssn3adt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ssn3adt","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我告诉大家怎么摸浮脉，就是轻轻这样子摸，有没有？摸到脉了，这就是浮脉，有浮脉就可以解表。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-62oag52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-62oag52","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果病人大渴，非常的渴，不断地要喝水，大便还便秘，解表你要小心了，因为代表津液不够嘛，那你先要补充他的津液，然后再去解表。所以遇到大渴，肺里面津液不够的时候，我就让他多吃点水梨，水梨色白入肺嘛，赶快吃点水梨然后再发汗，再麻黄汤下去，所以因时因地制宜来看。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9709h5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9709h5u","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就地取材。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mlt7u05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mlt7u05","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对，就地取材，中药就是好在能就地取材，随时找。你不能老是说，我非要找到石膏，非要找到杏仁才可以，那么笨，旁边的水梨在那里就可以用了，一定要知道就地取材。所以他这个病还好，病在里的话就摸不到脉了，如果脉沉下去了，代表病到里去了，那他的病还是表。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1s3pjfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1s3pjfb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就没有完全用桂麻各半，但是解表也有用？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ngj5am8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ngj5am8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解表会有效，就是你没有桂麻各半的话，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个麻黄汤是把肺里的风寒去掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个桂枝汤把肌肉里面的风寒去掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，但他的肌肉痛关节痛，那你如果说我们只用麻黄汤，只能把肺里的风寒去掉，关节的风寒去不掉，关节湿还会在里面，肌肉痛还会在。那是肺里的风寒造成他忽冷忽热的啊！加上他"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"觉得很冷，就要靠麻黄杏仁，觉得很热，就是桂枝白芍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-osv4nx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-osv4nx6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先这样，我们先开药，剂量的话一钱等于多少克？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-o33ykn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-o33ykn3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一钱等于3.75克，这样开那个药房恨得要死，一钱等于4克，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-g9zs6m8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-g9zs6m8","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-ovz6mn2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ovz6mn2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人离去，交谈中..."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-q09cxf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-q09cxf5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个病人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）第一次感冒发烧有六年时间，就跟我说他曾经进行过长期的抗痨，有半年时间，从抗痨的时候他的热才退下去。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1lrfck6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1lrfck6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那抗痨它只能去肺里面的风寒，肌肉风寒没有去掉，所以还会再回来，只治了一边没有治另一边。光是肺痨，TB（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺结核"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）并不难治，因为没有机会，如果有机会，我治TB给你们看，TB效果很好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a71givo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a71givo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那老师，几碗水煎成几碗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-g0na7zd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-g0na7zd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六碗水煮成二碗水。用大火煮，因为要发表嘛，不要从大火转小火，就用大火煮，所以半个小时汤成了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-f2u9hat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-f2u9hat","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪老师，那个麻黄用不用先下呢？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pi3hxfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pi3hxfz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不用不用，直接放进去煮。你们现在拿到手上的麻黄不是青龙了，是黄龙，所以我们经方要统一用。我们会把...我跟孙鸿会把药材的产地报告给你们。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-faic0xf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-faic0xf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正麻黄，拿出来青色的，青龙！那才叫麻黄。你们拿到手上的麻黄已经煮过了，变成黄龙了，所以我说你们不是真正的青龙，一定煮过，很少有青龙，因为拿不到。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4dvy57a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4dvy57a","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以拿到的是二道啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-70oft14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-70oft14","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二道，对！哈哈哈哈，绝对是黄龙，不是真正的青龙。你问他（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"孙鸿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），真的是黄龙，不是青龙，你要是真正的青龙，麻黄拿起来是青色的，碧青色非常好看。孙鸿你给大家讲一讲，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）它在产地过了霜降之后怎么样，你跟大家说。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5zpzk4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5zpzk4s","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"孙鸿："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那个麻黄是这样，一般霜降以后它的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"正品的话节比较长"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"外表是青绿色，里面的芯呢是黄色的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，它是这样子，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"表面有很麻手的感觉，有刺的感觉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"里面是棕黄的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，里面是黄色的。现在那个一到霜降以后呢，霜降以后这段时间麻黄碱的含量是比较高的，但是一过了霜降两星期以后，它就开始"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"外皮发红，由青转红"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就老师的说法就是已经"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"木生火"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"了。所以我们市面见到麻黄一般只能这样说，一个是放的时间比较久，再一个是它采收有的是在霜降以前，它的颜色还都是黄色的，时间久了，再一个是边枝末梢那些东西比较多，边角料。因为麻黄是一大根嘛，很长。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-c9jovd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-c9jovd4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它就中间的部分比较好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-un05wk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-un05wk2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"孙鸿："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对，中间部分，好的大概有一寸长，青碧青碧色。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-j88zv6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-j88zv6h","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"唐院长："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们吃的，不是麻黄头就是麻黄尾。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-y36wy41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-y36wy41","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（笑）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐院长很风趣，所以说我们要用正品，真品麻黄，所以要把药物统一。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-e9baaur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-e9baaur","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如说我们吃北芪，比如说要用黄芩、北杏仁一定要要求它是来自承德货，这样才能把药材统一起来，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"药材统一市场才会稳定"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呐。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大家同时使用的时候，这个药量药物是一样的东西，不然的话，我用有效，你用为什么没效，大家在怀疑，以为处方有问题，实际上不是，是药物问题，是药物拿的不是很正，很地道的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nv5kz86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nv5kz86","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以这个我们要去统一，要花很多时间把它统一起来，所以到时候说诊所我们就统一规格，你拿到了的就是这个批号，批给你的药就这一批，你看到是正麻黄，那就行了，不用担心使用上问题，那个效果真的是青龙的效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a26vgsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a26vgsf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黄汤，我们又叫做还魂汤。这个病人死掉了吃下去魂都回来了，叫回魂汤啊！那个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四逆汤叫做回阳救逆"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄汤有个名称叫返魂汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，从阴间回来阳间，你看麻黄重不重要？麻黄也是回阳救逆的，所以回阳救逆也会需要这个麻黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qg0dazy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qg0dazy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那麻黄汤与四逆汤的差异就是，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄汤症的时候病人会全身关节酸痛，人会抽搐挤成一团，你一摸脉，非常的硬，非常的紧绷在那边，麻黄汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！病人好像快没气了，麻黄汤一下去就解掉了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四逆汤症就是你快死掉了，摸脉也没了，麻黄汤症的脉整个刚硬"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，整个绷紧在那面，四逆汤症脉是摸不到了，太危险了，已经感觉不到呼吸，你拿棉花放在鼻孔边可能还稍微动一下，那个一摸心，心口有余温，四逆汤下去就好了。所以麻黄汤与四逆汤不太一样，但两个都是回阳救逆的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8wjg2l2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8wjg2l2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我常常跟他们说，你们要用炮附子扶阳，但用炮附子一定要会用石膏，因为两个都是阳药。所以遇到像昨天那样的肺癌病人，说我上面口渴，很燥渴，我要喝冰的，可我下面非常冰冷，小便清白，石膏跟炮附子如果用在同一个处方里才能救他，寒热用在一起都没有关系。你说一寒一热用在一起不对，不是，这是一组阴阳的药，像经方里经常用阴阳药，就好像百合，百合大家都知道是白的，那地黄是黑的，那为什么这个百合跟地黄用了一起？阴阳嘛，阴阳能够旋转人体大气。那吃什么都不到，桂枝汤也不到，麻黄汤也不到，四逆汤什么都没有效，反正吃了都没有效，那吃个饭都不舒服，那奇怪这个人在找麻烦，这就是百合病。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9xw951b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9xw951b","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"百合就是百不合嘛，就是它一百种东西给他，他就是不合，此时唯有百合可以吃，阴阳协调就好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wxpibh7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wxpibh7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生地和这个百合一起榨汁？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-l7x2e2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-l7x2e2o","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对啊，就是打汁来喝，那你觉得太干了倒点水下去，反正没有关系不是你喝（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），是病人喝。那百合病的病人很好玩，那百合很难喝对不对？病人拿起来喝，哎，真好喝，因为他身体需要这个东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lxngvv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lxngvv8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就好像我们刚刚介绍那个尿毒症病人头晕恶心，他吃什么都吐哦，我告诉你他平常最喜欢吃巧克力，那个时候你给巧克力他吃都吐，就是那个药喝下去不会吐，下去以后，他就小便来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-h612fku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-h612fku","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那给西医处理的话，大不了就是....（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"模仿西医语气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）哎呀，先生你这个尿毒指数太高了，要洗肾了，这样子。然后就开始洗肾了，然后我们再准备机器，准备给你做血液透析术，然后动脉静脉要接在一起...那我们中医呢，您稍等我煮药给你，用五苓散跟那个真武汤的复方。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lg9kmet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lg9kmet","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们以后的药，这个汤剂部分呢我们还是在用，像我台北诊所汤剂我还在用。那如果是粉剂，我们粉剂就不一样了，粉剂呢我们那个药就是...比如说我们桂枝单味药，桂枝洗干净以后用高压锅蒸煮，蒸煮开来的话，你们一般煮的汤剂煮出来可能只有百分之40~50，那我们用高压煮出来大概有 85%（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"药力"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）会从药材里面煮出来。这光是桂枝的汤就很浓了，然后桂枝残渣就不要了，那这个桂枝汤煮过以后，农药都会溶解在里面，残渣丢掉，残渣里面会有重金属，汤没有，所以汤药是最好的，所以你们用汤药是对的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qhd37yq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qhd37yq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那制成汤药以后，我们再用旋转的方式把水分去掉，变成粉出来，就是桂枝粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1q11m8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1q11m8x","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以以后我们药房里面我们开出去的粉剂和汤剂效果是一样的，唯一的差异就是复方的蒸煮，就好像我们刚刚开的这个处方给他，这个复方煮起来得到一个化合物，这个化合物不知道，单味的都知道，所以往往我们还是会需要用到汤剂。因为你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"全部放在一起煮和单味药煮完再配在一起不一样"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这付药可不可以先配好？可以先配好，就是这个药把这个处方先经过高压蒸煮过，然后抽提出来变成粉剂，这就是麻黄桂枝各半汤（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"科学中药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-idaniib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-idaniib","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个粉剂吃下去，好到什么程度？因为那个粉根本就是汤嘛，所以放到嘴巴里面就化掉了，不粘牙的。那你如果是药粉，药材你把它烘干过、干燥过洗干净后，再打成粉，那个药粉放在桌子上，火一点可以点着啊，那就是香嘛，跟上香的香那样，那种就是用生药材打的，所以你吃生药粉打粉好像在吃香。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-58v8pj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-58v8pj2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像麻黄桂枝汤这种是不是也要早晚饭前煮，还是？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1oilh8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1oilh8o","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今天晚上会讲，经方的运用从感冒开始讲，实际上真的是“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"百病风之始"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，一定要了解感冒，那今晚我们就好好的跟大家大力地讲一下，明天我就回台湾，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3dar9lp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3dar9lp","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我这次真的很荣幸，很开心过来。唐院长，刘教授那么礼贤下士，那么器重我，害我不好好讲都不行，也不想要保留，尽量要告诉大家，你看真的是，两位真的是我很佩服。昨天我也碰到你们的朱院长，也是很礼贤下士，我真的很感激。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lndixx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lndixx6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是我是希望说，我是在网络上写过，因为我在海外，可能会在美国台湾受到的教育比较多，尤其在美国我们非常注重智慧财产权，什么事情经过我们同意都没有关系，但要先给我们知道。那这个海外我抓盗版抓的很厉害，在美国没有人盗版，因为美国盗版抓的很凶，美国抓到一片 DVD 盗版，只是一片哦，罚5万块美金，然后判徒刑是5年以下有期徒刑。台湾呢，被我抓住盗版啦，第一个抓到是一个姓董的，是以前中国时报商周那个主编，结果他赔了我100万，我就跟他签和解。他盗版就赚了40万，赔了我100万，（因为）没有100万我不跟你和解啊！我就要让他得不偿失，要造成风险。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9wyxnsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9wyxnsn","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有另外一个在台湾网络上卖盗版，已经在抓他了，他还不知道，他还在卖，已经在准备抓他上游了。你们叫公安，我们叫刑警，就已经在监听他们的电话，抓这两个小头，后面还有大头嘛，要把那个里面大头抓出来，所以现在在布局已经要抓了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-i7ifmjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-i7ifmjy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们好好发行一个东西，为什么要去打官司，这不是我要的。我是要发扬中医，就变成我去告人家，不发现还好，发现我要去告他，所以这个抓完以后，台湾、美国、东南亚不会有人盗版。现在唯一就是大陆盗的很凶，在网络上放。你看好多网页有，我们律师函一去，统统去掉了，就还有一个网页还在那里，56网。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-00ymtf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-00ymtf9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们已经派律师到广州去立案了，因为这个中间手续比较多，不是我不去抓他，是手续多。大陆上立案很多要公证啊！又说我是美国公民，从美国大使馆公证，现在就到大陆这边来，再到公，然后再等人来...虽然过程很复杂，但是我们会去争取。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为为什么要保护自己的智慧财产权？这样子我们才愿意贡献我们的东西嘛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zl7yyds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zl7yyds","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我是最痛恨人家把东西藏在肚子里面不讲，就算他有本领，他藏在肚子里面不传，我是最痛恨这种人。但是他传我们要尊重他，你同不同意？这样人家才会愿意贡献他的智慧。所以美国为什么那么强大，就是一群很聪明的人到美国，把他发扬贡献起来，这样我们所有的智慧结晶都备受尊重，当你感觉到备受尊重的时候，不是钱不钱的问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hikmw49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hikmw49","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你看我网页上写啊！除非大陆盗版精绝，否则我不收徒不传授，对啊！因为你有让我不开心嘛，对不对？我们所谓开心就是一个尊重，刘老师、唐院长尊重我，那我尽其所能，他给我环境我畅所欲言，我当然尽量讲啊，为什么不讲？那我也没要各位一定要拜我为师，一定要怎样，不需要！我们大家共同互相切磋，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"我教给大家，我唯一的目的就是希望你能够...我看不到的人，结果你看到了，你把他救过来了，因为我双手能救多少人，所以我们一定会走上这条路，一定要去教，一定要去推广，由我们自己来推广"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0fpaiaj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0fpaiaj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而不是由那些不劳而获的人去做，什么是不劳而获？就是他这辈子都没有看过什么伤寒金匮，什么都不懂，就把我的东西拿去偷拷以后出来卖，这叫做不劳而获啊，你们觉得如何呢，了解我意思吧？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-d2n8j3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-d2n8j3h","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们花了那么多的心血，我从这个讲针灸的时候肥肥胖胖的，讲到伤寒的瘦瘦干干的，两年半我气血整个耗损掉，大概命都少了一半，因为全神投入进去。所有的书都是我自己打字的，到上课，投入多少心血，结果他不劳而获，你觉得他怎么样呢？所以我在网络上宣誓，只要大陆上......因为我都有网络巡查的，我的学生都是很多电脑软体硬件的工程师，他在网络上搜寻，我们有好几个巡查大队，就我的学生编组，我学生很多是电脑工程师啊！你看加州溪谷里面那个XX网站，那里面都是我的学生，电机工程博士，溪谷的电机工程博士，你说他们电脑软体厉不厉害？要搜你，你只要打倪海厦三个字，他就可以搜到了，资料统统到我手上，那个人盗版资料就到我手上，那你说我怎么处理，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0598kjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0598kjd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我就发，你只要盗，我就不教了。所以你们以后看到网站上有人盗，你就跟他说不要盗了，倪老师不会教了，你再去盗，倪老师不会把好东西留在大陆，因为是你们逼得我不把好东西留下来。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-uqzgvka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-uqzgvka","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那网站的博客是您写的吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zoy18eo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zoy18eo","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网站我有自己的网站。汉唐网站是我写的，400多万字，那统统是我自己写的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6id287l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6id287l","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那案例都是你写的吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-r3jwul5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-r3jwul5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对，我的临床案例都是我自己写的。那学生有学生的案例。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-jbbpm84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-jbbpm84","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"学生的案例都很少。我见您今天讲课内容里面也有，讲那个黑人那个，红斑狼疮也有，是你写的吗，我害怕又是人家写的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-v25l494","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-v25l494","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不是，里面统统都是我写的，我在汉唐大框里面，统统都是我写的。当初我从完全不懂电脑，到自己来编写软体，来电脑升级，从 286，386，486 一直上来，你要找我很简单，把我名字一打，整个到处都有，中医界不知道我的很少，因为我是最敢冲最敢骂。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-v7qb8kk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-v7qb8kk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人家骂我，我根本懒得去看，因为一定会有冲突的嘛，就好像你说有没有人骂毛主席，骂邓小平，有没有人骂？还是会有人骂。你不管再怎么做都有功有过，都会有人攻击你，也会有人赞赏你，这都不重要，最主要是大家的目光在那边，集中到，让我有发言的机会，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-l90otxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-l90otxm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说这个骂我的人呢，看到我都心虚，又怕我，又不敢表明他的身份。我们真正敢骂的人，要有三分三才敢上梁山嘛，我就叫倪海厦，那骂我的写个笔名谁知道你是谁啊，那个讲的话都不负责，这怎么取信于人家？你告诉我你是哪里来的，你是南京中医药大学是谁叫什么，你来讲啊！你只要讲我，我就找你挑战，出现的时候两个问题、几个问题我就知道他到那个地方，那是彻底撕破脸。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-t8za6gc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-t8za6gc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可是中医呢要团结，不要互相挑战，一定要团结！所以我是抱着团结的心态来的，所以能把最好的知识提供给大家，我们大家众志成城嘛，我今天发扬中医并不是表现我有多行，不是，完全没有这个目的，而是告诉他正确的医学观念，这样我们后代子孙才能受用嘛，我们让它传承下去。我也不能活1000岁啊！我们寿命是有限的，毕竟是人，一定要传承下去，你们学到又传给你们的子孙，这样子中医才会好起来，懂不懂我意思？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8x1fw9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8x1fw9t","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而不是说我一定要争取这个智慧财产权，然后闭关自守，然后说对不起，这就是我的宝贝我不会教你，不好，这种非常坏，我最讨厌这种人，中医就是这样败坏掉的。几千年的经验已经告诉我们会败坏掉，所以你们如果在网上看到有人盗，你们就去骂不要盗了，你们不骂我看到就会收敛很多，所谓收敛很多就是我不传了。本来要挑十个，现在只挑一个，那我为什么要那么尽心尽力去做，为什么东西被人家不劳而获？可以不劳而获啊！要经过我同意啊！可以让你不劳而获，要经过我同意，你这样懂不懂我的意思？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-h137k5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-h137k5v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以过去师傅出来要挑徒弟嘛，不然我挑的这个徒弟唯利是图，把他技术训练的很好，然后他只看有钱人病，没有钱的病不看，而且要价很高，摆出这种姿态来。我倪海厦到现在，我绝对不持技凌人，我绝对不做这种事，越可怜的我越会帮助他，不是我用技术来欺负人家，我做不到。那我怎么可能训练一个人是这样子？所以只要我同意，当我发现他真是这样好的，不要钱我都可以训练他，所以一定要我同意，这样了解我意思吧？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ro15qjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ro15qjz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你说倪海厦说我们不劳而获都可以，那你想你的去，嘴巴在我的脸上面，我不开口你们又怎么样？对呀，不开口你们就很累呀，因为我过去摸索这么多年的时间，花了那么多的精力下去，领悟的那么多的东西，那我不讲，那对不起，你也要花很多年还不见得能领悟得到。可是由我来教你的话，你不用花那么多年了，你就从我上面开始了，你是不是省了很多力？那将来你肯定比我强的啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-syd1yqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-syd1yqq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我在网络上看，如果还有人盗的话，我就会只是讲讲课怎么样，收徒我就很小心很小心，孔子说的有教无类。但是尊重智慧财产权我就会教，有教无类，就会这样做，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1ik33pd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1ik33pd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很多东西实际上是我说的，他硬要说是他说的，他把我东西拿去然后说他说的。很好啊，我就问他下面怎么讲，他就不知道了，你这样了解我的意思吧？因为是你的就是你的，你没有办法辩驳嘛，所以我们读书人就要受到尊重，就是这种的想法，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-f53e574","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-f53e574","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（掌声）"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a7gml6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a7gml6f","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好吧，我希望大家都能够了解，体谅我们这一点好不好？谢谢。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ntqncpb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ntqncpb","updated":"20240828171612"}},{"ID":"20240828171608-i2jzs7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-i2jzs7n","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"案例：黄婧汶，女，22岁，SLE，红斑性狼疮"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-00w3yt5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-00w3yt5","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"简单讲一下就好了，什么时候开始，最初开始是什么时候？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5a5g4cv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5a5g4cv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最初开始大概是三个月前，三个月前就出现手、这种关节扭痛的感觉，但是我一点意识都没有。然后当时就以为扭到手，才出现这些痛，然后后面就开始反复发烧，反复发烧，然后全身关节这些地方都疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-x9l43fm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-x9l43fm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前你感冒，过去你年轻到现在感冒的时候，你吃中药还是西药？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-s4l3l52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-s4l3l52","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我都不吃药的，很少吃药。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ugwcdsl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ugwcdsl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你三个月前的时候，在你得到这个关节痛之前，有没有得到感冒？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0j7ku2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0j7ku2a","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没有。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-u10ar4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-u10ar4t","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三个月之前的月经好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kku0sm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kku0sm8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般都是延迟的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xfrpq2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xfrpq2f","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"延迟多久？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a6ty13b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a6ty13b","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"延迟一个多星期吧。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4xtdjwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4xtdjwe","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那从三个月前开始发手关节痛啊，这个全身关节痛的时候，这三个月来的月经如何？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-brf4v7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-brf4v7u","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"都不正常，都延迟。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4oigaoh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4oigaoh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"都延迟，量多不多？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0frq6ce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0frq6ce","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"量就正常，量还正常。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hx05omj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hx05omj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，你还好，现在还没有看到红斑嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6cjhom7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6cjhom7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没有，没有出现红斑。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-bgazy52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-bgazy52","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你才22岁。你们看她命很好，运气也很好，你这个平常多数的时候，你觉得身体是冷还是热？手脚冰冷还是热的？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wquqg79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wquqg79","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手脚也是有时候发冷，有时候发热。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-v1ri59i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-v1ri59i","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡觉好不好睡？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rc3c30q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rc3c30q","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡觉不好睡。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vmf4diq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vmf4diq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么个不好睡？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0p6bwd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0p6bwd2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是觉得很杂、很乱这样子的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-imzrk5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-imzrk5n","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么讲杂乱，就是很烦躁，心情很烦躁？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zd2oa07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zd2oa07","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"嗯嗯。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1fk8803","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1fk8803","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"觉得很烦躁，就不好睡。不容易睡着这样子？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lmpdjnx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lmpdjnx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"嗯嗯。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-47gyef4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-47gyef4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那大便好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-15no7ym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-15no7ym","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便很正常。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-r5chltd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-r5chltd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，那胸口痛不痛？胸口闷不闷？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9b3fhn4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9b3fhn4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以前闷，现在就还好了。那时就挺闷的，觉得胸口很压抑。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pijp8a7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pijp8a7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三个月前感觉胸口很压抑？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-97ctfs1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-97ctfs1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很压抑，都很闷。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-44eaup8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-44eaup8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你月经来的时候，胸部会不会胀？月经来之前胸部会胀？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ty0hxlf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ty0hxlf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"会。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b6n8tud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b6n8tud","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"月经来了以后，胸部涨不涨？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-oouhr1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-oouhr1o","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"月经来了以后，就不会胀了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ccsj23l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ccsj23l","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，月经之前，胸部乳房会胀。那你把上衣脱掉，坐过来一点，椅子出来一点...我在用指头压你的脊椎骨，你感觉看看，哪一椎你最痛？大概是这个位置（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第五椎，倪师在按之前就向同学预测第五椎有压痛，手指悬空"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），病人并不知道，好，我同样的力量，你感觉哪里最痛？还是都一样？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2zav7k1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2zav7k1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里痛（第五椎）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-d7taqpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-d7taqpn","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，就这里最痛。那那个黄小姐你要记得这种痛感。吃了药以后你要感觉它还痛不痛，吃了药以后如果这个更痛，就代表药没有效，如果吃了这个药痛慢慢没有了，然后我们下次再压的时候，你这个痛都一样，就是你好了。好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pfxnsuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pfxnsuz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wms6w1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wms6w1t","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，这样就好了。是不是有一椎最痛（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红示范"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-bz6hr3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-bz6hr3w","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就这里。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-47axt91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-47axt91","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对，第五椎。那你要记得我讲的话，你原来不能睡觉，吃了我的药可以睡觉了，那如果说你原来是有觉得胸闷有压抑，现在不压抑了，原来觉得不开心，现在觉得很多事情很开心，看到什么东西都很好玩，都很开心，看到人都很开心（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这就代表药有"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"效）.....那你容不容易出汗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wwxda6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wwxda6n","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"会出汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-w9dj63j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-w9dj63j","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"盗汗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-62m8xk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-62m8xk0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呃，现在就出很多很多的汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b4vpwlv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b4vpwlv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你现在衣服可以穿回去。现在就是不动也会出汗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-n20hz1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-n20hz1i","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不是，就是睡觉的时候，反正只要一睡着就会出汗了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-d54qj6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-d54qj6f","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说你白天动反而不出汗，晚上睡觉不动反而出汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-05a0x7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-05a0x7b","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zkjx9yi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zkjx9yi","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你怎么会想到来看中医？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-iu3i9wu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-iu3i9wu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为我相信中医啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8nw1q41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8nw1q41","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（笑）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，相信中医，我们就帮你，不相信就不帮你了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-w8tan2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-w8tan2q","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者（笑）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"谢谢。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-95h64d4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-95h64d4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你舌头让我看看，你们看她舌头，白厚的，厚跟白是寒症，白色是寒症，寒的舌苔，中间有一点点黄是鲜黄，那个黄是从心脏来的。小姐长的好秀气，个子小小的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-io3dltm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-io3dltm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是个导游的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dkiyi37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dkiyi37","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"做导游，然后又相信中医，这个非把你弄好不可，好不好？不相信中医就算了。以后世界上相信中医的人会比较多，为什么？因为不相信中医我们不看，都死掉了，都死在西医手上。你不相信嘛，那就死啊！我们必须要这样做，这样的话中医才会占优势，因为相信中医的人多嘛，都活下来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wz67x1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wz67x1d","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她有点发烧。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-znbqyau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-znbqyau","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她脉比较数，小便什么颜色？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b3uftu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b3uftu4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便是黄色。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4daescp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4daescp","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄色，好，口渴不渴？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6pcaxt0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6pcaxt0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"渴"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ozfderd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ozfderd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"渴的时候想喝冰的？还是想喝热的？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-57jt8qf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-57jt8qf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想喝热的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-yquw1a6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-yquw1a6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想到热的，不是逼着自己喝热的，就是心里想喝热的？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vj39emq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vj39emq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-g6v4w2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-g6v4w2v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不是逼自己想喝热的嚯，你要告诉我你的感觉，不可以隐瞒我，不可以心里想喝冰的，结果嘴巴说我要喝热的，不是这样子的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-542b90p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-542b90p","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不是，就是想喝热的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8aeo08k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8aeo08k","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"里寒嘛，所以她脉速，重按又没有，来，这个手（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把左手脉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），放松。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-e45g9zm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-e45g9zm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我的手会抖。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-deqxuoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-deqxuoq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心嘛，你抖的原理很简单，我一会讲给你听...她脉很速，红斑性狼疮跟大家前面就讲过，奶水，正常月经来的时候会导致胸部胀，然后由心脏在管，心脏好的话就会在月经来之前把奶水全部集中在胸部乳房，那胀奶以后，等到你心脏功能正常的话，它会在该来月经的时候把奶水从胸腔导入腹部变成月经排出来，这个系统就是心脏在管。那哪一天你心脏力量不够的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个奶水没有办法百分之百下达到你的子宫卵巢里面，它在胸部就会逆流，逆流进入你心脏的话，就是红斑性狼疮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-oct7lmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-oct7lmi","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样子的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-201stbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-201stbx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进入心脏的时候，有心脏有动脉啊，所以第一个就跑到你的手指末梢，关节就会感觉很难过，那慢慢慢慢开始扩散蔓延。那如果更多的奶水进入胸部去的时候，除了它四溢到关节上以后，还不行，还有更多奶水进入心脏，这个时候红色的营养就没有办法进入心脏，就跑到脸上，就会出现红斑的现象。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-clg73vm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-clg73vm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那心脏管的就是睡眠，失眠，心脏有问题就睡不好。所以她刚开始三个月前，不是说只有昨天晚上睡不好，很早就睡不好了，对不对？（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人点头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）还有心主五液，心主汗，该运动的时候，白天要他流汗不会流汗，晚上躺在那里不动时候却在那里流汗，心主五液有没有？津液就控制不住，里寒很盛的时候，病人去想去喝热的，里热很盛的时候病人想喝冷的。所以昨天你看那个肺癌的病人，她想喝冷的，今天这位她想喝热的，所以这个刚好是寒热的对比。所以她我们会需要用到生附子，这边没有生附子哦，我们要给她寄点来，现在从台湾寄回来，因为他都给我了（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师可能指的是孙鸿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），都被我带回台湾去了，手边可能没有了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kz5hl21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kz5hl21","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我现在生附子也找得到，要找一下，去年有生附子。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-td6asvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-td6asvl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。你胃口好不好呢？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8dui0k0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8dui0k0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在好了，之前不好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-j85h9oq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-j85h9oq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为她现在在吃激素。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-w0znc1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-w0znc1q","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃激素，你吃了激素以后，胃口就会很好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5ki2hjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5ki2hjn","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不是，胃口也不好。后面是那中医给我开了点中药，开了那个四君子合剂这些，胃口就好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-iumrg2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-iumrg2l","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你原来脸就是这么圆吗？还是吃了激素以后变成这样的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8eeuahq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8eeuahq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没有，现在才这么圆，以前是瓜子脸。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-np6sesz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-np6sesz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样哦，那吃了（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"激素"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）会变月亮脸，好可怜哦，从瓜子脸变月亮脸（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），还有水牛肩，你知道到时候后面还会凸起来。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6e8ggjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6e8ggjg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还会这样子啊？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tfe5iyk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tfe5iyk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还会啊！看在你长的很漂亮，我们赶快把你治疗好，很丑就不用了，那个水牛肩月亮脸反正无所谓，人丑嘛。但是人家又瓜子脸，那么漂亮，对不对，结果你又吃成月亮脸，赶快救你，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-sxdkya3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-sxdkya3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"谢谢。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-w7yud88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-w7yud88","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，我们开个处方你吃看看，那个关节痛...我们用桂枝看她体格，她这个体格"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就够了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白芍三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，全身关节都痛...那她晚上会盗汗"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子五钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白术三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炙甘草五钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们把她这个SLE（红斑性狼疮）的病名忘掉，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"她是关节痛就甘草附子汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"全身关节游走的痛，就桂枝祛风，附子去寒，白术去湿，风寒湿三痹，痹症，关节痛就去掉了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我们会用到白芍，是因为她前面有胃口不开，后来我们前面医生开的很好，用些四君子汤啊，或者是理中汤之类的，让她的胃口就会好转一些，那我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"可以开理中汤在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那我们加"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"党参三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，开下她的胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fftaehf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fftaehf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那还有一个症状，这个病人她月经都是延后来的，延后来是寒，月经提前来是热。那她胃口不好，我们这个药下去的话，其它的药我们可以让它通通停掉没有关系，不用说吃了这个药，再去吃四君子汤别的药。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个时候胃口不好我们就把白芍加倍，白芍加到六钱，白芍加到六钱的原因呢，就是让她胃口大开，让静脉血流回心脏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，胸闷的时候我们不可以用白芍，胸闷啊，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"看向患者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）你现在胸闷不闷？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vs42yva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vs42yva","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不闷。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-avd22ht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-avd22ht","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，不闷。过去如果她胸里面很抑郁、很压抑、很闷的时候，白芍会增加胸闷，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果有胸闷的现象，我们要加枳实三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以大家在读经方的时候，只要看到有胸闷，张仲景一定用到枳实，去白芍。那她现在胸不闷，我们就可以白芍用到六钱，同样这个处方，胸不闷的话，我们把枳实拿掉，我们加饴糖，就是麦芽糖。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tnvd1gg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tnvd1gg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她现在饮食还可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-u5gjivq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-u5gjivq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以继续用，提高她的脾胃的功能，强她的肠胃的功能，因为脾主四肢主肌肉，这样关节痛就不会有了，关节四肢强起来以后奶水没办法进入四肢，奶水只好集中在胸部，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ajt343y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ajt343y","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个时候我们强她的心脏，她是因为里寒很盛，开"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生附子三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个蒸煮..."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"干姜二钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，前面已经有炙甘草了。这个生附子加强心脏摩擦的力量，她原来心脏摩擦力量不够，导致心到小肠中间温度比较冷比较低，照理说如果心火足的话，摩擦力量是很大的，所以她现在心脏摩擦虽然速度快，但是是空转，没有办法把心热移转给小肠。那这种状况身体会产生虚热，所以她有发烧的现象，是因为里面的寒，阳不能入阴嘛，就往外走。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gmehnoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gmehnoe","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们用生附子让她心阳回来的时候，热就会进入小肠，热一进入小肠，小肠开始热，开始消化东西，手脚就开始热起来。那现在病人她没有口渴...（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"看向病人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）你并没有什么口渴吧，还是有口渴？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3el60hs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3el60hs","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在有。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-aff7nj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-aff7nj3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有口渴，但喜欢喝热的。那如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有口渴的时候，我们可以加一些天花粉三钱，麦冬三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，增润津液的方式，就可以了。我觉得她现在用这个处方，效果应该会很好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-g4e1fv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-g4e1fv0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你吃下去，如果开始回到前面胸痛......当然她不能睡觉是因为奶水逆流到心脏，心脏受到不正常的营养导致，所以你不治她失眠，她失眠自己会回来。那如果吃完我们的药，这里炮附子用了五钱，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"她晚上还有盗汗，这时候我们就可以加龙骨三钱，牡蛎五钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个五钱呢，因为牡蛎我们用在攻坚、攻肿瘤的时候我们用的剂量会很大，那她没有肿瘤啊，那我们就只是敛汗镇惊，压压她的惊，让她阳能够潜进去，这个晚上盗汗的现象就会去掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-z60d2cc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-z60d2cc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"盗汗的现象去掉的话，心的功能恢复，神就回到心脏里面，她就可以睡了，就好睡了。所以她现在脉是数，脉很数很大，很速很大的原因是因为我刚才讲的，奶水进入心脏的时候，被这个心脏喷射的力量运送到四肢上面去，还有静脉输送到四肢上，所以关节会痛，所以她关节痛看起来像风湿痛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"红斑性狼疮最明显的症状就是关节痛，实际上那关节痛那个湿是来自奶水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hywcu5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hywcu5i","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说我们把她心脏一强起来后，心脏功能自然会把奶水全部逼到子宫卵巢里面来，等她吃完这个药，月经会慢慢提前，慢慢变成 28 天，她现在是延后一个礼拜。一般来说月经延后的病人，比较容易得到这种问题，因为里寒很盛嘛，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-sjatgja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-sjatgja","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你看她脸色就比较苍白，有没有，比较苍白的脸，看她手脚就知道她是里寒的症状，她跑进来那个脸就是寒嘛。像有些人的脸比较热，她的脸就比较苍白，好不好？那开始吃中药，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你的那个激素不能马上停，激素停的话，就是骑着老虎，上老虎容易下老虎很难，所以你激素要慢慢停"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。比如说你现在的剂量，你要停下来的话，分一个月停，每个礼拜去掉25%。比如说一颗药，你把它掰成4份，第一个礼拜吃四分之三，丢掉四分之一。第二个礼拜再吃一半，再丢掉一半，第三个礼拜只剩四分之一，到第四礼拜以后再停掉，一步一步下来，才不会被老虎咬。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-o6pt2go","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-o6pt2go","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果说你现在彻底不吃激素了，你一停掉，马上开始好像发心脏病一样，喘不过来气，心脏在好像要发心脏病、发气喘病一样，那送到那边急诊，一看你是把激素停太快了。只好这样子，因为你骑上老虎了，好不好？这一定要让你下来，不然瓜子脸变成月亮脸，好惨，还水牛肩，牛的肩膀有没有，后面凸起来那个农夫的犁才能挂上去嘛，那个凸起来的那一块。你本来是直的，吃了以后就肩膀凸起来，然后两个脸颊很大，以后还会更大。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-uvtpn4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-uvtpn4v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"都不用见人了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fex6671","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fex6671","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对啊！那你是导游，如果工作是坐在办公室也就罢了，但导游要每天跑出去看人，结果人家看到你脸圆圆的，好不好？就吃这个。这样应该可以了。吃完怎么样再跟我们说好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-efy8ud2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-efy8ud2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那现在医院她还要给我打针的话怎么办？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-f0q7enh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-f0q7enh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你就跟他说减量嘛，慢慢减，就跟他们商量慢慢减量好不好？你开始吃我们的药关节就不会痛了，开始睡眠就开始好转。以后感冒就吃中药，感冒就来这边看，好不好？不要再吃西药了，赚了钱也不要去买维他命吃，维他命你有吃吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-yuq4lke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-yuq4lke","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"维他命现在有吃，维生素吧。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zmviql1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zmviql1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"谁给你吃的维生素？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dkhxhef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dkhxhef","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就医生给我开的，维生素。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rm7jhoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rm7jhoe","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那个不要吃了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3w0snet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3w0snet","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不要吃了。那钙片这些可以吃吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hr9yyd3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hr9yyd3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那是给敌人吃的，你有那个竞争的导游，那个一天到晚跟你抢生意，你就把钙片都给他，送给他，过段时间就看不到他了，然后再两个礼拜后他又回来了，你说你怎么回事了啊！他说，哦，我肾结石。好不好？你就钙片不能吃了，维他命统统丢掉，好不好？我们要把你里寒去掉，你吃这些药会让身体更冷，好不好？不要吃了，维生素也不要给爸爸妈妈吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tf0ynm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tf0ynm9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不要给他们吃啊？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-85p1rqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-85p1rqj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"都不能给他们吃，要是你有一个邻居是个坏女人，又常常在骂街吵架，很凶悍的悍婆，你就送给她吃，她觉得你对她很好啊，以后又对你很好，过一段时间她不见了，住院去了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7493wux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7493wux","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪师那个炙甘草是五钱？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-67jzlcx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-67jzlcx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五钱，对，剂量要大。增加剂量的时候，因为炙甘草配合桂枝汤以外，炙甘草还要配合甘草附子汤，这样的话，一吃下去关节痛就没有了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-r1mi3jh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-r1mi3jh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"唐院长："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个炮附子和生附子同时用，是吧？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ctca3ke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ctca3ke","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同时用。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6wy3904","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6wy3904","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生姜呢？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-o3o09uh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-o3o09uh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生姜两片"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，对，这要加生姜。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mvnmvlp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mvnmvlp","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在药房称生姜要多少？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-z125vym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-z125vym","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两片。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-h45txme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-h45txme","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两片是多少，因为药房要称。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-q15ovmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-q15ovmy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大概二钱嘛，两钱差不多，应该是这样子。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个龙骨牡蛎呢，我们先不要用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们看她这个药效，如果晚上不盗汗就不要用了，如果晚上还盗汗就加进去。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"看下患者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）你才三个月很快就可以好，好不好？不要担心。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rpnya69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rpnya69","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者：它"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只是...它不是说本来就有的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-sjaaqu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-sjaaqu0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本来就不是本来就有的，你三个月以前有没有生气啊什么事情，有没有发生什么事情？比如跟男朋友吵架。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-v8fa6ot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-v8fa6ot","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那有，三个月有。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-itbuk4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-itbuk4s","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样子哦，有没有跟男朋友吵架，感情不顺或者是？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tpr9icf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tpr9icf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有，有。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-n2uc5c6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-n2uc5c6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"火大了，气死了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9ret9jj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9ret9jj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对，就反正很生气。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-y8gwwxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-y8gwwxq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你也别为他生气了，把自己身体气坏干嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dspwefq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dspwefq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对啊，我现在也觉得。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tlisu58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tlisu58","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我现在也觉得（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"模仿她的语气，笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），好聪明啊！你们看她就不会，你看前面那个就受伤会比较大，你就不会，很聪明。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4a8xmu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4a8xmu0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖用多少？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0n4fc2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0n4fc2f","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饴糖用一汤匙就好了，每次一汤匙，吃下去以后她就胃口大开，小建中汤让她胃口大开，四肢就会实起来，奶水就进入不了四肢，所以甘草附子汤把这个湿排掉，然后这个小建中汤下去的话，四肢就实起来，奶水就没有办法进去四肢，就只剩下心脏了。所以它它奶水只能进入心脏，没有办法的运送到四肢。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-bk3dllw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-bk3dllw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个也是九碗水煮成三碗水，然后每次吃加一汤匙饴糖，这样就可以了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zw3rji3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zw3rji3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三碗水是一次性喝吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-61vhidi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-61vhidi","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没有，早晚各一碗，一付药是吃一天半，两付药吃三天。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"看向患者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）你不能喝激素哦，激素不得了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-289fgho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-289fgho","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我当时想了一下，也感觉很恐怖。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rd6nu3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rd6nu3n","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你知道嚯，你很聪明啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dvnyk3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dvnyk3r","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那个脸会变大，我就觉得很恐怖。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2r8q0wg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2r8q0wg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（笑）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃了脸会变大！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7zq87hs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7zq87hs","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个药先开多少付？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-45ygran","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-45ygran","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你是做导游的，也忙嘛，给她开一个礼拜好了，"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-asuvoq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-asuvoq7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我现在不上班。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-g2zjq3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-g2zjq3v","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（看刘力红记录的药方中）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方可以，你就这样吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-eqhyb9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-eqhyb9i","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃了以后还会吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rqp2x1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rqp2x1a","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好了就不会了，就好了，以后感冒了都来这里看，不要去柳州看。你做导游的啊，柳州产棺材，怎么可以去，你去那边就死掉了，就来南宁看。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lcore8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lcore8z","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2vew190","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2vew190","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你放心吧，你会好的很快，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2yzu8qq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2yzu8qq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，谢谢您。（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"作势欲离去，由刘力红跟她交代用药事项"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-87h23c9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-87h23c9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个一定会好，会好的很快。你们可以摸一下她的脉......哎，跑掉啦？，你要给学生摸摸脉呀（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"患者回来了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），给他们摸摸脉好不好？你们看她脉很速。一息七至八至，心脏为什么跳的那么快？这是一个自己要救自己的动作，心脏受敌嘛，就赶快要跳快点，脉就跳的很速，那也代表说她会有一点发烧。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gkevs19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gkevs19","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉会比较速，那你光用退烧的药下去，没有用，因为她的烧是一种假烧，是心脏加速产生的烧。因为这个人很厉害，比如说，你现在拿一根橡皮筋把手指头绑起来，然后把它藏在口袋里面，几分钟，一两分钟就够了，你再去量血压，高的吓人，医生说哎呀你有高血压，他不知道这个橡皮筋绑到了。绑到了就是要让我们的血压高，血喷射的力量才能到我们这个指头的末梢，去挽救他，不然的话就因为失血就死掉了，就坏死掉了。所以这是人体自救的一个动作，对不对？（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师指着患者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）她的脉就很速。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-82m8n8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-82m8n8r","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把完脉，病人离去..."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-kj18ixx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-kj18ixx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，好可爱，那么小，好可怜。她想的很开，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"模仿患者语气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）我就是不理他（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"患者男朋友"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），想通了。所以临床上你看的时候，以为是脉速，那你说老师这个速不是热症吗？你问他想喝热的冷的，我想喝热的，你就辨症不出来了。那她舌头是白的，脉速的话，那舌头是黄的，我们才会用清热解毒的药，对不对？那一看舌头是白的，脉症不合，你怎么用？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-w83pd59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-w83pd59","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你看她脉那么速，我们会用到生附子，因为她一直以来，她都是月经延后。所以开始月经延后以后，十几岁的时候我们就开始动手了，她是等发病了才开始下手。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-h2e8249","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-h2e8249","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个年轻的女孩子，在座的很多是医生，所以你想想看，22岁开始吃激素，请问你能维持多久？吃了激素到了后来髋关节都烂掉，髋关节烂掉然后换个人工关节，对不对？把膝盖关节都换成人工的，她人生好吗，对不对？本来很漂亮的瓜子脸，现在是月亮脸，不想是圆脸都不行，硬变成圆脸，对啊，那怎么能吃，对不对？那不能什么病都会用类固醇的东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-46pepo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-46pepo0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个药是饭前还是饭后吃？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-m8ezkuw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-m8ezkuw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚饭前吃，这个她一定会好。那个经方像这种药，她如果说只出现在膝关节痛，我们就会用桂枝芍药知母汤，让肺气下降到膝关节去。那她是手关节开始痛，那这里就会用甘草附子汤，痛的时候会移转，有没有？移转，跑来跑去。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qz16i1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qz16i1x","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们不用看她的病名，说你这病是SLE，那实际上我们看到是风寒湿三痹嘛。诸位看看金匮里面的风寒湿，那个风痹并脉症里面的，这个处方就是甘草附子汤。吃完就很快啊，吃两碗，明天早上起来痛就去掉。这个方里面没有麻黄嘛，你如果说晚上吃饭前吃第一碗，睡觉前再吃一碗，今天晚上就很好睡了，她已经不痛了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-n1zfpxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-n1zfpxj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"听你这么一讲，我就想到我们在临床上，很多女同志月经一乱了，膝关节就痛了，那就用刚刚你说的桂枝芍药知母汤吗？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-l9xhmm2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-l9xhmm2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对对对，非常好用。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-op5j1lt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-op5j1lt","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那未必说是类风湿啊？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-t8h0w3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-t8h0w3e","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对对对。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rvepmbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rvepmbk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是更年期来了，它月经推后一两个月，膝关节就开始痛了，我们西医就告诉你，退行性关节病了，你更年期了，这时候叫你补钙了.....然后你说吃钙片肾结石就来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8mtlhfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8mtlhfi","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（笑）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2heiclg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2heiclg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很多人她关节痛的时候，她吃六粒钙，她确确实实可以缓解她的关节痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gjh5wqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gjh5wqq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那个吃下去，那个缓解是暂时的，真正的那个钙身体吸收的可能就一小部分，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"其余的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）真的是停留在肾脏里面，吃了半天就肾结石。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ubugpcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ubugpcf","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很多的妇女更年期以后，月经停掉了，我一再跟大家讲，月经停掉了，并不代表说你没有奶水，月经停掉只是子宫卵巢萎缩掉了，到了49岁天葵竭的时候，竭就是子宫卵巢萎缩掉了，但是病人还是在产生奶水啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-v70emta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-v70emta","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这时奶水唯一的方式就是通过大便来排掉，那如果你处理不好，再受到一些心情上的打击，或者什么事情发生，月经没啦奶水进入肺，肺癌啊。奶水为什么会这样子，会运作不好，就是心脏会有问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-sfv61fv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-sfv61fv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那心脏出问题，心是君主之官，本身根本就不受病的，它受病的话是吃了西药，像我们昨天那个肺癌的病人，刚开始吃太多的抗生素，结果抗生素吃了病人还有问题，还是不断的咳嗽，就说肺还有问题，就吃抗肺结核的药，抗肺结核的药多毒啊！吃下去心脏受损得更厉害，到头来奶水排不出来，停在肺里面，就成肺癌啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dw6w4ow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dw6w4ow","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪医师问一下，她（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"刚才的患者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）现在还有一个情况，她刚刚补充的是说，西医的检查就是肝和肺都受损，所以现在呢，西医还上了抗痨的药，这些药还要不要吃？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-n0xyvxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-n0xyvxy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不要吃了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-p8odq7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-p8odq7k","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她红斑性狼疮，就是这个病，它系统性的已经影响到肝和肺。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a0olrnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a0olrnu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝和肺受损的话，如果说在吃抗痨肺痨的药，我们那个TB的药，很多人吃到后来就是肝脏衰竭，结果换肝，停掉它，统统停掉不会有事的，"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a5ss0y4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a5ss0y4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那除了激素慢慢停掉以外，到时候我叫她转院过来这边。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-au4ohdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-au4ohdc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"要转过来哦，那小姐一定会相信我们的嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-nrh2niz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-nrh2niz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"唐院长："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她这个病是多器官损坏型？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xnfoajw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xnfoajw","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对呀，她的肝肾损伤，肺损伤的病根是因为红斑性狼疮，那你把红斑性狼疮治好了，她损伤的原因去掉了，她阴会自回嘛，内脏功能会自己恢复。她还年轻，那么年轻啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-w4yro9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-w4yro9k","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪老师，我想请问下，就是看那个金匮要略觉得东一句西一句的，好像很难看，不知道有没有什么好的学习方法？介绍一些书啊，还有就是关于相法..."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7y1k551","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7y1k551","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有啊，当然有啊！就要看人纪呀，我讲的就是人纪啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-iwgv5iy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-iwgv5iy","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那怎么能买到你的人纪这本书？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pir51wh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pir51wh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人纪大陆我没有卖就是因为盗版，"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-fzzxvf4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-fzzxvf4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不要一口吃个大胖子，变成像她一样？（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"调侃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7ms28az","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7ms28az","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我没敢吃的太胖。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-081tzs8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-081tzs8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"问很现实的临床问题好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-sawbdv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-sawbdv7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个病人就是，下一步怎么处理？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0vhy9tk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0vhy9tk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她吃完这个药以后，她关节痛应该什么都好了，就只剩下睡眠，就是失眠，那她失眠的话，我们刚才的方里面再加龙骨牡蛎。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1qsqnvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1qsqnvl","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那她当前或比较长的时间，都是守这个方？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6abrgub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6abrgub","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"都守这个方，那这个病人好了以后呢，那就吃一些调经的药，比如说我们开一些这个，像这个生附子下去以后月经就正常了，正常以后就是感冒发烧，比如说感冒的时候要吃中药，晚上我们就讲如何治疗感冒？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wmhlbxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wmhlbxg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那月经中间得到感冒就是小柴胡汤，病人我们只要提醒他，你得到感冒就来找我们治，看是桂枝汤症就开桂枝汤，麻黄汤症就开麻黄汤，小青龙汤症就开小青龙汤，就这样子。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-whypg5a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-whypg5a","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样就再不会发了，绝对不会发了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-pcxirx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-pcxirx3","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就现在就是守方，守到关节疼痛完全没有了，消失了？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-m8x0qh8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-m8x0qh8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对，这个关节疼痛吃完大概一付两付药就好了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"好了以后，不能把药停掉，一定要看她晚上睡眠如何"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心脏的第一个功能就是睡眠，第二个那就是盗汗，心主五液"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"嘛。正常的流汗是晚上睡觉不会盗汗，平常运动才会流汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4cquiml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4cquiml","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后还有就是情绪上的喜怒忧思，心主喜，她很不开心吗，抑郁压抑嘛，她是这个意思嘛，就好像有东西压在那，她很不开心，抑郁。那人如果变的开心，睡觉睡得很好，盗汗没有了，这个时候就可以开始停药了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-eblm7db","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-eblm7db","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后以后告诉她月经来的时候，只要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"感冒，好，我们也分两种，一种是专门月经来的时候吃的，一种是没有月经来的时候，看你的症状来开的，走上这条路从此这病就不犯了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-v42zpbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-v42zpbi","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那还有就是感情上的打击，就我跟大家讲的，40几岁，一下先生就说我不爱你了，要离婚，就发红斑性狼疮，月经当场就断掉了！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ld23dt1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ld23dt1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那她这个，比如说她用了这样。后续月经来的时候，需不需要加四物炒麦芽？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xoujhf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xoujhf9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"看她的胸部，她如果说...病人你就问她，不用检查了，就是看她胸部的症状，她如果说，我两边胸部的压力是一样的，形状也差不多，就没有关系，就不要紧。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-38gbzuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-38gbzuu","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果她说，我左边胸部胀，右边胸部也胀，但右边胸部胀的比较大，同时里面有点隐隐作痛，形状看起来好像有一点硬块的感觉，形状有点不一样，这个时候就需要了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-1i0hqz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-1i0hqz0","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平常的胀，两边是同样的压力胀，月经停了压力就没有，代表里面完全没有东西，病人自己的感觉最准！所以开始我跟大家报告，那个台大医院护理长，每年都按照西医的方式体检，他先生是医学博士啊，结果太太每年去体检，乳腺被人家挤压了半天，乳癌第三期还是没查到，所以病人的感觉是最正确的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-duxmp30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-duxmp30","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们要灌输太太小姐们正确的月经的观念，然后还有就是我们检查她背后第五椎压痛没了，对，第五椎压痛没有就好了，最清楚！那个连哑巴都可以看，要是碰到个哑巴，问她睡眠如何？啊啊啊，我也听不懂，有没有流汗？啊啊啊，那会不会写字？不会写字，文盲，那怎么办？第五椎一压，看她那个表情，啊，是这里！阿是。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-lhaqkly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-lhaqkly","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以第五椎压痛是很明确的，吃完这个药一个礼拜你再去压她，她就没有什么痛了，很快，因为她才三个月。可是我刚才讲，我们赶快去救，不然的话她这个吃激素能吃多久？这个如果给西医搞，活过40岁都很难我告诉你。对啊，那个关节都要换掉了，眼睛也会受到伤害，可能还吃一些止痛药，因为关节痛嘛，就吃一些止痛药。这小姐好命啊，运气很好相很好，很清秀，她眉毛眉宇之间很开，眉宇之间很开就相很好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-aw7f7n6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-aw7f7n6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"唐院长："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她臀部太小。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-wg9sbur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-wg9sbur","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪海厦："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那臀部太小过去就是说不会生儿子，以前婆婆挑媳妇的时候，媳妇进来先看屁股，这个屁股很大，这个翘能生儿子，用这种方式来挑。唐院长这个常识非常丰富（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-h7ui0yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-h7ui0yh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"唐院长："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我是看了一下背影。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9wjxbwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9wjxbwh","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"看背影（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-27f51z9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-27f51z9","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"唐院长"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）他比较喜欢观察人。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qq4r6q2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qq4r6q2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"唐院长："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我看一个小姐比较漂亮的时候，我一定要看看她的背影，因为我喜欢那种又聪明又漂亮的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-49xyqwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-49xyqwq","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你们同学就是这样子啊，又漂亮又聪明，相都很好，看相真是很好。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qk69km6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qk69km6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个病人就是，一个是关节疼痛消失，睡眠好转了，消失了..."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4htymjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4htymjd","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师(补充)："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第五椎压痛没有了，情绪会喜，会很开心，进来后笑笑笑很开心，这样子。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vok8agk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vok8agk","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那个时候就已经好了，就可以停药了？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-blzvp69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-blzvp69","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"已经好了，对，你让她可以停药，你不要停药没关系，你让她给西医再化验看看，那指数都没了，没有红斑性狼疮了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-84hv6cx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-84hv6cx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个过程需要多长时间？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-adz6ett","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-adz6ett","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她的情形我想大概一个月以内就好了，我治疗最严重的就是那个网络上写的黑人，她是八年的红斑性狼疮，吃了八年的激素，结果我治疗她是从头到尾是55天，就好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8bgrcme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8bgrcme","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当然可能跟节气也有关系，因为刚好那55天，我从春末治到夏中，刚好夏天是心脏，心是罔时嘛，所以那个很清楚是7月4号美国独立纪念日的时候。对呀，正好是它相克的时间，还好在南方，如果我们现在是在东北或者是在北方内蒙啊、承德这一带的话，就没有那么快，因为节气不对嘛。节气现在是肾脏主收藏的时候，这个是肾脏的节气，肾和心是相克的，所以冬天是最容易发心脏病的时候。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-k9hc7nv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-k9hc7nv","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那最后我跟大家讲一个...我们李主任在外科待那么久就知道，你发心脏病的时候，要发病的时候，那个EK机才查到你有心脏病，可是当你给病人讲完他有心脏病的时候，病人就死在台子上面了，就来不及救。还有很多自己是医生，那个心脏血管开刀的医生，他在开刀开到一半的时候，医生在帮病人做绕道手术啊！开到一半的时候医生昏倒，为什么？因为医生的血管堵塞了，结果护士就要打电话找两个医生，一个医生继续开刀，一个医生把这个医生救回来。所以西医一直在说，心脏病要发的时候，猝死没有预兆，没有征兆，所以你们要小心啊什么什么的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-r7id58b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-r7id58b","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你错了，有预兆，不但有预兆而且还可以预防，所以我们希望中医能突破西医的障碍，以后发现心脏病猝死的都是西医，中医都没有心脏病猝死，好不好？我教你们，你们不要教出去这一招。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vwmgkf1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vwmgkf1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心脏病要发的时候，第一个就是失眠，大概失眠半年以上，没有原因的失眠，心情很好也睡眠，心情不好也失眠，没有事情也失眠，有事情也失眠，它是没有原因的失眠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-xjswcps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-xjswcps","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二个就是心口刺痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-koay7d8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-koay7d8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第三个手脚刺痛麻木"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-83b9xl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-83b9xl7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第四个就是大便不规则"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-h31qh7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-h31qh7r","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出现这种情形的时候，诸位这样想，我们一个水管，比如说一个空的吸管，血管里面有一节被泥巴堵塞住了，请问您如何把这个泥巴拿出来？如果这一节是圆形的没有出口，你如何把这个泥巴打散掉？光是这一节吸管里有泥巴，你要清出来的话，你是不是敲一敲它就出来了，同不同意，有没有人反对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2gacok7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2gacok7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同意，那问题是如何敲它？我们心脏里面动脉血管很多在上面，有很多大动脉血管，要如何运动到它？人体的设计，当初设计的肋骨就是维护到心脏，心是君主之官，旁边有很多护卫，它本身不受病，又防止外来的撞击，所以心脏不受病。现在心脏病里面如果有问题。你如何把那个血管里面的堵塞的东西，无所谓它所谓的血脂肪或者是胆固醇怎么样子，好，如何把它撞开来？尤其是紧急的时候，你走路上突然心脏很痛，喘不过气来，这个时候如何瞬间把它打通掉？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-7v2z7ca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-7v2z7ca","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你没有办法依靠别人啊，只有依靠自己，是不是？西医就是不知道这个，所以很多西医自己心脏病猝死。我们台北市有很有名的医院叫做荣民总医院，荣民总医院急诊室的主任呢，他有一天走在路上叫计程车，突然发心脏病躺下去了，躺下去他赶快喊旁边路人，说我、我、我、我教你如何急救我，好，如何做CPU，当场教路人就帮他做啊！还好他是急救科的主任，他也懂啊，旁边路人也愿意帮他，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cphrmxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cphrmxm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"意思就是告诉你他还是发病了，很多临床上的病人就是，心脏病发的时候很痛很难过，到医院检查还没有造成立即性的危险，在EK机的照射下他还是正常，他一定等到你发病的时候，才说你发心脏病，病人就躺在EK机上说，我告诉你我发心脏病了你不相信，现在你相信了！这是他最后的遗言。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ffjklnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ffjklnj","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来我们看看这边的状况（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师找用于示范的墙面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），这块墙比较硬，这个是空了，你一撞啪就垮掉了，这里就是有结构，要找个硬的墙。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-4qitmr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-4qitmr1","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"第五、六、七锥20240508_135121"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/第五、六、七锥20240508_135121-20240508135144-5gu53b9.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-c0u8a7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-c0u8a7r","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们背后这边第五椎、第六椎、第七椎在这个地方，我们怎么样把血管里面堵塞的东西打开来？我们中国功夫过去有个动作叫撞墙，就是他平常就在这练功夫，没事的时候就在这边练撞墙。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-13w5t6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-13w5t6s","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你没事在练撞墙的时候，结果有一天你遇到一个个子很大的，他比你大，300 磅，他看你瘦小把你抓起来往墙上一丢，他想你就受伤了嘛，结果他不晓得你每天在练哪，他以为你受伤了就回头，在他放松警戒心的时候，你一击他的天突穴，我们喉间有十二重楼有没有？十二重楼整个打烂掉，他再壮也没有办法在这个部位练到肌肉，一打整个食道就碎掉了，碎掉你还跟我打什么架？就慢慢断气走掉了。这就是我们制敌以小博大之法。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-peseojc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-peseojc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那结果这个动作呢，在我们现在来看的话，就是能够预防心脏病，那我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在撞的时候，我们有五声"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝是‘嘘’"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，肝开窍于眼睛，肝在逼毒，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心是‘呵’"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们叫呵心火，那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾是‘呼’"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾脏是‘吹’，肺是‘呬’"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"si第四声"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三焦是‘吸’"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们用不同的声音，来把内脏的浊物，脏东西逼出去，所以心脏我们要发呵。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-chetbl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-chetbl4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那心脏开窍在舌头，要发出‘呵’的声音，我教你们你们要躲在家里面练，不要跑到马路上练，等下练的人家会觉得你是神经病，怎么没事去撞墙，还要发很奇怪的声音，打电话叫精神病车子来（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rgst7k2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rgst7k2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看那个背后，一脚前一脚后，不用完全靠着墙壁，撞的时候，刚开始练的时候慢慢的撞，不要用后脑去撞哦（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。明天早上报纸出来的时候，上面写着有一个小姐突然在墙壁边昏倒，我就知道你是撞墙了，撞到后脑就脑震荡，那个白目，这不负这个责嚯（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"笑"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-a3pe85u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-a3pe85u","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"撞墙120240508_140320"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/撞墙120240508_140320-20240508140353-5o1w94y.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-9mnye3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-9mnye3j","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚开始练的时候是这样子，‘呵’、‘呵’，撞到那一刹那吐气，当你习惯以后就不是这样子呵了。刚刚认识牛刀小试，让你知道我们怎么做，真的撞的时候，你刚开始一定要记得我的话，先习惯，然后正式开始哦...."}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-6zui426","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-6zui426","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"撞墙220240508_140600"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/撞墙220240508_140600-20240508140634-4m7doq0.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-mo8fdd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-mo8fdd6","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呵呵呵呵，你想想看，这么大的力量，砰一下血管里面的脏东西全部打开来了，动脉不会硬化的，能活化。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qgpteh4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qgpteh4","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在最大的问题，你问所有的心脏科的急救大夫，他会给你讲，如果我的手能够伸到你的胸腔里面，帮你直接做心脏按摩的话，心脏就跳起来了。可是问题是怎么样子下去？所以就切开了，急救啊什么的，不用，撞墙就好了，看到没有？所有的路边的墙都可以用，哪怕没有墙，树也可以撞嘛，你懂不懂我意思？那你非要撞这个墙，拼死要回来找这个墙，那是死在路上的，笨死的！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-5ki86x8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-5ki86x8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘力红（调侃）：这个"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"墙是倪老师加持过的。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-qsa06ta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-qsa06ta","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师（大笑）："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加持过，哈哈哈哈。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dfzd77d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dfzd77d","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以因为力量很大，这个是空心墙，我们撞两下就垮掉了，那这个是有钢筋在里面的，所以声音不一样，先用手掌拍拍墙，这个不行里面空空的嘛，那个就是实心的，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-3brq6ve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-3brq6ve","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你找个实心的墙去撞，然后没事就在那边撞墙，这辈子你就跟心脏病说再见，就光这个撞墙的动作。那你觉得动作很奇怪，对不对？所以你不要在外面乱撞，人家在那边在跳土风舞，很优美的姿势，这边怎么跑来一个那么丑的人在撞墙，还发这么难听的声音。那平常就练，记得我的话，心为君主之官。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-hu13qon","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-hu13qon","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有这个寒热的观念，阴极生阳，阳极生阴，热极生寒，寒极生热。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心和肺的关系是这样的，心脏有问题的人要保冷，肺有问题的人，肺不好的人要保温"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以治疗肺病肺癌的状况，我们要求病人多加一件衣服，把身体尽量保暖一点，心脏有问题的时候，我们要少穿一件衣服，尽量要保冷，晚上睡觉前的时候，用冷水去冲你的脚。如果病人发心脏病，那个你还在煮四逆汤，你不可能马上随身带着四逆汤，对不对？就好像我跟大家说豆芽先发好放在冰箱里面，你这个四逆汤不可能随身带到，那你还要去煮啊，那你在蒸煮的过程中间，用冷水就喷病人的脚，冰水去喷，直接用水管去一直喷他的脚，你喷他的脚的话，他心脏就会受到刺激，所以心脏要保冷的时候，你一刺激脚末梢的时候，心脏就发觉那边比较冷，就开始跳起来，要运送热能过来。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-cs9xrqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-cs9xrqg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以一喷冷水，心脏砰砰就跳起来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-d1txyc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-d1txyc7","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这就是寒热的一个观念，你今天晚上可以回家自己试看看，天气再冷都没关系，拿冰水去冲脚。冰水一冲脚的时候，刚开始很冰啊，不要管继续冲，一分钟以后开始慢慢热，到二分钟三分钟后开始热啊，哎，奇怪，刚刚我是开热水吗？你一摸水还是冰的，你就知道我讲的对不对了。冰水能够让脚趾头尖都能够热起来，你看看心脏热不热，因为脚趾头间的热是来自心脏的，这样讲你就知道了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tjoc5dg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tjoc5dg","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我刚刚一再重复，你如果弄反了，就在保养上面、身体上面病人不知道（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺保温，心保冷"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），病情恢复会比较慢。好像昨天那个太太，我们要叫她保暖一点，让她多穿点衣服，这样就会比较好，这是我们阳极生阴，阳极生阴的一个观念。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gbkuwih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gbkuwih","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一些平常养生的动作要知道，那我们经常看她们跳舞，跳舞的时候，她们的那个小姐跳的姿势都很美好，运动的观念是对的，但是你如果做错运动，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个运动跟劳动的差异在那里？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你做不好就是劳动，那既然是你不知道运动，你做劳动，那你干脆就做点劳动赚点钱就算了，对不对？就跟这边申请，每天清晨扫地一个月你给我多少钱，这样也好，因为你做的是劳动。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"劳动和运动的差异，一个是直线，一个是旋转"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就像我们易经的易，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"易除了简易以外，还有就是变易"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。劳动呢是直线的，所以你看那个农夫耕地啊，都是直线的动作，木工敲榔头都是直线的，你有没有看到木工敲榔头在那里旋转？都是直线的运动，所以挖地都是直线的，对不对？直线的动作称之为劳动。旋转的动作称之为运动。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rhpryqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rhpryqm","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"劳动与运动20240508_144628"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/劳动与运动20240508_144628-20240508144718-d6cn9w5.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"拔刀动作20240508_144751"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/拔刀动作20240508_144751-20240508144823-lypaqvl.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"扭转身体20240508_145009"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/扭转身体20240508_145009-20240508145032-4l4fzpj.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-2aykj55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-2aykj55","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚才运动看到我手没有？所以易筋经的旋转，包括我们的手，比如说背后一把刀，把刀抽出来，旋转身体，这就好像一个湿毛巾，湿毛巾里面很脏，那你要把它洗干净，请问你，你怎么把这个脏水去掉？扭干对不对。你有没有看到一个家伙在那里折毛巾？这个白痴啊，那既然你知道把里面脏水排出来，你就要扭毛巾，所以你身体是不是也应该扭，这才是扭的动作。那她们跳土蜂舞跳的很乐啊，但都是直线的，姿势很好有形没有神，是在劳动。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-b8g7r0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-b8g7r0z","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们想帮她，她不见得听我的，对不对？所以人性很好玩，一定要等到她找你，你才有办法让她听你的。不然我走到平遥，那个人在那边走（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"应该说的是前面一个大承气汤证的路人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），我说你是大承气汤症，他会把我当神经病啊，我想救他还不能救，你这样了解我意思吧？他不知道我是谁啊，但我只能看到他，唉呀，叹个气，只能这样做。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-gjdp0uc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-gjdp0uc","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们有易筋经的动作，所以我们在针灸里面有讲易筋经，我们十二经络有十二个动作，手太阴肺经有拉肺经的方式，心包经，怎么样拉心包经...你们感受过气的力量没有？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-vc61xfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-vc61xfx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"心包经气感受动作20240508_145645"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/心包经气感受动作20240508_145645-20240508145722-71jebf3.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-dtk6cyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-dtk6cyn","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心包经气的力量，心包经是不是到手指头尖，是不是经过劳宫到手指头尖？你手这样子，先平摆，你们可以起立平摆，然后缩肩，提起来，然后把肩膀放松，有没有感觉气跑到中指头去，是不是气跑到中指头去了？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-yolnadb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-yolnadb","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我们只要做一个动作，就可以把气运送到那条经络上去，这样你懂不懂我意思？可是我不告诉你你就不知道，是不是？那要气到手指头上面，手旁边上去，怎么上去？很简单。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-8ybah7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-8ybah7b","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"感受气20240508_145942"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/感受气20240508_145942-20240508150014-mac3eoq.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-auuc760","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-auuc760","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你说有没有气，我马上可以让你摸到气！你手这样子放，两个肩膀上下放松，有没有感觉到指头旁边有很多气，有没有？那就是气！马上就到手指头上去了。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-tjqi7cx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-tjqi7cx","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中国的功夫很好玩哦，好不好玩？我们有五术叫‘山、医、命、相、卜’，前面几天跟大家介绍的都是‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"医"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"’，刚介绍的就是‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"山"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"’，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"山"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是打坐练气呀练功夫这些动作。所以真的厉害的功夫家，我们气要到大拇指就到大拇指，气要到中指就到中指，利用动作就可以过去，这就是我们经络的来源。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-rzwa6t8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-rzwa6t8","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那因为我们很了解经络是怎么来的，所以我们知道什么动作可以把气挤压过去，这样了解我意思吧？因为了解经络，所以我们会把功夫推演出来是这样子，所以实际上源头是一样 的，好不好，好玩吗？好，谢谢。"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-0oezh46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-0oezh46","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你们可以回家练习撞墙，你相信我，撞完你会感觉好舒服啊，每天撞一次，你每天早上撞，比如你撞的爽撞到三十次一百次都没有关系，撞完你看看，哇，神清气爽， 鼻子进来的空气，哇，走路轻飘飘的，为什么？全身干干净净， 浊物都排出去了，那只是一个呵的动作，我们还有‘嘘’肝，‘呵’心火，有没有？‘呼’脾、‘吹’肾！"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-esqcydz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-esqcydz","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果尿毒症病人呢，所以如果我开诊所，很好玩，早上我一票尿毒的病人，我告诉他们跟着我做，然后肝病人也跟我一起做，然后开始吃饭，我们有食物上的控制，然后病人习惯改变，怎么会不好呢？可是很累啊，我一个人能带多少人？所以说我们要很多东西要贡献出来，我们要全心全意把它做好，把人们救回来！希望你们学到了要比我好，一定要，应该要比我好，因为我通通告诉你啦，通通告诉你还不比我好，那就是你的错，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-ne82im2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-ne82im2","updated":"20240828171612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚刚这些动作诸位做起来，包括你们周围的亲人学到这些动作，我保证大家呢，绝对不会发心脏病，心脏病猝死对我来说是笑话一则，啊，你怎么死掉了，如果是敌人，不要教给敌人，好不好？"}]},{"ID":"20240828171608-zlrecnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828171608-zlrecnr","updated":"20240828171608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像你在急诊室待过，你就知道我讲的很重要，谢谢大家，谢谢大家！"}]}]}